         "653":["","There are four tribes around here: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid and Kivi.","","Pos verás, p\'aquí hay cuatro tribus: los Lintu, los Drekar, los Pullid y los Kivi.","Hay cuatro tribus por aquí: los Lintu, los Drekar, los Pullid y los Kivi.","Il y a quatre tribus par ici : les Lintu, les Drekar, les Pullid et les Kivi.","","Existem quatro tribos ao redor: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid e Kivi.","Es gibt vier Stämme in der Umgebung: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid und Kivi.","","Există patru triburi în zonă: Lintu,Drekar,Pullid şi Kivi.","Są cztery plemiona wokół mnie: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid i Kivi.","Burada dört kabile bulunuyor. Lintular, Drekarlar, Pullidler ve Kiviler","Er zijn vier stammen hier: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid en Kivi.","Здесь 4 племени: Линта, Дрекар, Пуллид и Киви.","Ada empat puak dekat sini: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid, dan Kivi.","","Lähistöllä on neljä heimoa: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid ja Kivi.","","附近有四個部族：林途鳥族，德瑞卡龍族，普力得牛族，以及崎億石族。","","Υπάρχουν τέσσερις φυλές εδώ γύρω. Λίντου, Ντρέκαρ, Πούλιντ και Κίβι."
         ,"Det er fire stammer i dette området: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid og Kivi.","Čia yra keturios gentys: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid ir Kivi.","","","","","Mayroong apat na tribo nandito: Lintu,Drekar,Pullid at Kivi","","","Ci sono quattro tribù qui intorno: Lintu, Drekar, Pullid e Kivi.","","Négy törzs van a környéken: a Lintu, a Drekar, a Pullid és a Kivi.","","","","","","","","","","Per ací hi han quatre de tribus: los Lintu, los Drekar, los Pullid i los Kivi.","บริเวณรอบๆนี้มีชนเผ่าตั้งรกรากอยู่สี่เผ่า : ลินตู,เดรคาร์,ปูลิต และกีวี่","Sou tu kolem čtyry kmeny: Lintu, Drekar, Pulid a Kivi."],
         "654":["","Can you tell me more about them?","","¿Puede decirme algo más sobre ellos?","¿Me puede decir algo más sobre ellos?","Pouvez-vous m\'en dire plus à leur sujet?","","Pode me falar mais sobre eles?","Kannst Du mir mehr über sie erzählen?","","Poţi să-mi spui mai multe despre ei?","Czy możesz mi o nich więcej powiedzieć?","Bana onlardan daha fazla bahsedebilir misin?","Kun je mij meer over ze vertellen?","Можешь рассказать мне о них поподробнее?","Boleh beritahu lebih pasal mereka?","Har du mere information omkring dem?","Voisitko kertoa enemmän heistä?","","你可以跟我談談他們嗎？","그들에 대해 더 말씀해주실 수 있으신가요?","Μπορείς να μου πεις περισσότερα για αυτούς?","Kan du fortelle meg mer om dem?","Gal gali papasakoti apie juos daugiau?","Kan du berätta mer om dem?","","","","Puwede muba sabihin ang tungkol sakanila?","","彼らについてもっと話してくれないかな？","Puoi dirmi di più sul loro conto?","Bisa beritahu lagi tentang mereka?","Tudsz róluk mesélni?","kas sa saaksid mulle nendest rohkem rääkida?","<Можеш/Moжетe> ли ми рећи више о њима?"
         ,"","","Be interested in hearin\' more, Matey.","","","Can ya tell me moor bout em?","","Podríeu dir-me alguna cosa més sobre ells?","ช่วยเล่าเกี่ยวกับพวกเขาหน่อย","Můžeš mi o nich říct víc?"],
         "655":["","Yup. What do you want to know?","Yup. What do you wanna know?","Pos claro. ¿Lo cuálo quieres saber?","Sip. ¿Qué quieres saber?","Ouaip. Qu\'est-ce que tu veux savoir ?","","Uhum. O que você quer saber?","Jooo... was will so <ein junger Kerl/\'n hübsches Ding> denn wissen?","","Da. Ce vrei să ştii?","Ta. Co chcesz wiedzieć?","Evet. Ne bilmek istiyorsun?","Yup. Wat wil je weten?","Да. Что ты хочешь знать?","Ya. Apa yang kamu nak tahu?","","Jep. Mitä haluat tietää?","","嗯哼？那你想知道甚麼。","","Ναι. Τι θες να μάθεις?","Jepp. Hva er det du vil vite?","Taip. Ką tu nori sužinoti?","","","","","Oo. anong gusto mong malaman?","","ああ、何を知りたいのだ？","Già. Cosa vuoi sapere?","","Ja. Mit akarsz tudni?","","","","","","","","","","Prou que sí. Què vols saber?","<นาย/เธอ>อยากจะรู้อะไรล่ะ?","Jasně. Co chceš vědět?"],
         "656":["","Please tell me about Lintu.","","Por favor, hábleme de los Lintu.","Por favor, hábleme de los Lintu.","S\'il vous plait, parlez moi des Lintu.","","Por favor, me fale mais sobre os Lintu.","Erzähl mir bitte mehr über die Lintu.","","Te rog, spune-mi despre Lintu.","Proszę, opowiedz mi o Lintu.","Lintu hakkinda bana bilgi verebilir misiniz?","Vertel mij alsjeblieft over Lintu.","Расскажи, пожалуйста, о Линту.","Saya nak tahu lebih pasal Lintu","Hvad ved du om Lintu","Voisitko kertoa minulle Lintu-tiedustelijoista?","","請告訴我關於林途鳥族的事。","린투에 대해서 더 말해주세요.","Σε παρακαλώ, πες μου για την Λίντου.","Vær snill å fortell meg om Lintu.","Prašau papasakok man apie Lintu.","Var snäll och berätta mer om Lintu.","","","","Pakiusap magsabi ka sa akin ng tungkol sa Lintu.","","","Per favore, raccontami di più su Lintu.","Beritahu saya tentang Lintu.","Kérlek, mesélj a Lintu törzsről!","palun räägi mulle Lintu\'st.","Молим те, испричај ми о Линту.","","","","","","Pleez tell\'m bout Lintu.","","Si us plau, parli\'m dels Lintu."
