         "733":["","Delicious!","","Mmmm... delicioso.","¡Delicioso!","Délicieux !","","Delicioso!","Köstlich!","","Delicios!","Pyszne!","Nefis!","Heerlijk!","Великолепно!","Sedap!","Lækkert!","Herkullista!","","好吃！","맛있네요!","Υπέροχο!","Nydelig!","Skanumėlis!","Utsökt!","","","","Malinamnam","","美味しい！","Delizioso!","Enak!","Ízletes!","","","","","","","","","","Boníssim!","","Výtečná!"],
         "734":["","OK. I expected it to taste worse.","","Bueno. No está mal, creía que sabrían bastante peor.","OK. Pensé que tendría peor sabor.","Ça va. Je m\'attendais à pire.","","Certo. Eu esperava um gosto pior.","Ok. Ich dachte es würde schlechter schmecken.","","OK. Mă așteptam să aibă un gust mai rău.","Okej. <Myślałem/Myślałam>, że będzie gorzej smakowało.","Tamam. Tadının daha kötü olacağını bekliyordum.","OK. Ik had verwacht dat het slechter zou smaken.","Ну, могло быть и хуже...","OK. Saya ingat ia lagi teruk.","OK. Jeg forventede at det smagte værre.","Okei, odotin että se maistuisi pahemmalta.","","好。最好是有更難吃的東西。","좋아요. 맛이 좋을거라곤 생각 안했어요.","ΟΚ. Περίμενα να έχει χειρότερη γεύση.","OK. Jeg forventet at det ville smake verre.","Neblogai. Maniau skonis bus blogesnis.","Ok. Jag trodde det skulle smaka värre.","","","","Sige. Nasaahan ko na hindi gaanong pangit ang lasa.","","","Ok. Credevo che avesse un sapore peggiore.","Ok. Kirain rasanya tidak enak.","Na jó. Azt hittem rosszabb lesz."
