         "1125":["","Please tell me more about Drekar.","","Explíqueme más cosas acerca de los Drekar, por favor.","","S\'il vous plaît, dites m\'en plus sur les Drekar.","","Por favor, fale mais sobre os Drekar.","Bitte erzähle mir mehr über die Drekar.","","Te rog, spune-mi mai multe despre Drekar.","Opowiedz mi proszę o Drekar.","Lütfen bana Drekar hakkında daha fazla bahset.","Vertel me meer over Drekar, alsjeblieft.","Пожалуйста, расскажи мне поподробнее о Дрекар.","Saya nak tahu lebih pasal Drekar.","Fortæl mig venligst mere om Drekar.","Voisitko kertoa lisää Drekareista?","","請告訴我關於德瑞卡龍族的事。","드레카에 대해서 더 말해주세요.","Σε παρακαλώ πες μου για τον Drekar.","Vær snill å fortell meg mer om Drekar.","","","","","","Pakiusap sabihan mo pa ako ng tungkol sa Drekar.","","","Dimmi di più su Drekar.","Tolongberitahu saya tentang Drekar.","Kérlek mondd el, amit a drekarokról tudsz.","palun räägi mulle veel Dreakari kohta","","","","","","","","","Si us plau, parli\'m més dels Drekar.","ช่วยบอกเกี่ยวกับเดรการ์หน่อย"
