         "1128":["","I\'m Kukul, the leader of this tribe. What brings you here, @yourname@?","","Yo soy Kukul, jefe de la tribu. ¿Qué te trae por aquí, @yourname@?","","Je suis Kukul, le chef de cette tribu. Qu\'est-ce qui t’amène ici, @yourname@ ?","","Eu sou Kukul, o líder desta tribo. O que te traz aqui, @yourname@?","Ich bin Kukul der Führer meines Stammes. Was bringt dich hierher, @yourname@?","","Eu sunt Kukul, liderul acestui trib. Ce te aduce aici, @yourname@?","Jestem Kukul, przywódca tego plemienia. Co cię tu sprowadza, @yourname@?","Ben Kukul, bu kabilenin lideriyim, seni buraya getiren nedir @yourname@?","Ik ben Kukul, de leider van deze stam. Wat brengt je hier, @yourname@?","Я Кукул, лидер этого племени. Что тебя сюда привело, @yourname@?","Saya Kukul, ketua puak ini. Kenapa kamu datang ke sini, @yourname@?","","Olen Kukul, tämän heimon johtaja. Mikä tuo sinut tänne, @yourname@?","","我是庫庫爾，這個部族的領導者。有何貴幹，@yourname@？","","","Jeg er Kukul, leder av denne stammen. Hva bringer deg hit, @yourname@?"
