         "1611":["","OK. It\'s time for me to leave. Bye.","OK. It\'s time for me to leave.","Bien. Debo irme. Adiós.","OK. Me tengo que ir. Adiós.","Bien, je dois vous laisser. Au revoir.","","Está certo. É hora de eu ir embora. Tchau.","Ok. Es ist Zeit für mich zu gehen. Tschüss.","","OK. E timpul să plec. Pa.","Okej. Czas już na mnie. Pa.","Tamam gitme zamanı. Bye","Ok. Het is tijd om te gaan. Dag","Ладно. Мне пора идти. Пока.","OK. Saya perlu bergerak sekarang. Bye.","","OK. Minun on aika lähteä. Näkemiin.","","好。我該走了，再會。","","ΟΚ. Είναι ώρα να φύγω. Γεια.","OK. Det er på tide at jeg drar. Adjø.","Gerai. Dabar yra laikas man išeiti. Ate.","","","","","Sige, oras na para ako\'y umalis. paalam.","","","Va bene, è l\'ora di andarmene. Arrivederci.","","OK. Most mennem kell. Csá.","","","","","","","","","","Molt bé. Me n\'haig d\'anar. Adéu.","โอเค มันได้เวลาที่<ผม/ฉัน> จะต้องไปแล้วล่ะ ลาก่อน","Dobře, je čas abych vyrazil. Zatím."],
         "1612":["","I\'ve got a couple of questions.","","Tengo algunas preguntas que hacerle.","Tengo unas cuantas preguntas.","J\'ai des questions.","","Eu tenho algumas perguntas.","Mh... ich habe da ein paar Fragen.","","Am câteva întrebări.","Mam kilka pytań.","Bir kaç sorum vardı.","Ik heb een aantal vragen.","У меня есть пара вопросов","Saya ada beberapa soalan","","Minulla olisi muutama kysymys","","我有一堆疑問。","","Έχω μερικές ερωτήσεις.","Jeg har et par spørsmål","Aš turiu keletą klausimų","","","","","Mayroong akong mga tanong","","","Ho qualche domanda","","Szeretnék feltenni pár kérdést.","","","","","","","","","","Tinc un parell de preguntes per fer-li.","<ผม/ฉัน> มีคำถาม","Mám několik otázek."],
