         "1799":["","Great! Remember that we still need @amount1@ cleavers and @amount2@ bolts.","","¡De kryptonita madre! Pero aún faltan @amount1@ hachuelas y @amount2@ flechas.","¡Genial! Pero aún faltan @amount1@ cuchillas y @amount2@ dardos.","Trés bien! Souviens toi qu\'il nous faut encore @amount1@ hachoirs et @amount2@ carreaux.","","Ótimo! Lembre-se que ainda precisamos de @amount1@ cutelos e @amount2@ dardos.","Großartig! Denk dran dass wir immer noch @amount1@ Hackbeile und @amount2@ Bolzen brauchen.","","Minunat! Reține că avem nevoie de încă @amount1@ satâre, iar de săgeți, încă @amount2@.","Świetnie! Pamiętaj, że wciąż potrzebujemy @amount1@ tasaków i @amount2@ bełtów.","Unutma hala @amount1@ bıçağa ve @amount2@ oka ihtiyacımız var.","Geweldig! Denk eraan dat we nog steeds @amount1@ koksbijlen en  @amount2@ kruisboogpijlen nodig hebben.","Отлично! Помните, что нам еще нужны @amount1@ тесак и @amount2@ болт.","Hebat! Kami masih memerlukan @amount1@ parang dan @amount2@ baut.","","",""
