         "1802":["","You really did it, huh?","","Al final lo has conseguío, ¿eh?","Al final lo conseguiste, ¿eh?","Vous l\'avez vraiment fait, hein ?","","Você realmente fez isso, né?","Du hast es wirlich geschafft, huh?","","Chiar ai reuşit, nu-i aşa?","Naprawdę to <zrobiłeś/zrobiłaś>, huh?","Gerçekten yaptın mı?","Je hebt het echt gedaan, he?","Вы действительно сделали это, да?","Kau betul-betul melakukannya, huh?","","","","你真的做到了啊？","","","Du klarte det virkelig, sant?","","","","","","","","","Lo hai fatto davvero, uh?","","","","","","","","","","","","Ho has aconseguit, eh?","","Tys to vážně <udělal/udělala>, co?"],
