         "2218":["","I need a book about Kivi religion. Do you have one?","","Necesito un libro acerca la religión Kivi. ¿Tienes alguno?","","J\'ai besoin d\'un livre au sujet de la religion des Kivi. En avez-vous un ?","","Eu preciso de um livro sobre a religião dos Kivi. Você tem algum?","Ich brauche ein Buch über die Religion der Kivi. Hättest du eines?","","Am nevoie de o carte despre religia Kivilor. Ai vreuna?","Potrzebuję książki o religi Kivi. Masz jedną?","Kivi inancı hakkında kitaba ihtiyacım var. Elinde hiç var mı?","Ik heb een boek nodig over Kivi religie. Heb jij er één?","Мне нужна книга о религии Киви, у тебя есть?","Saya perlukan satu buku tentang agama Kivi. Kamu ada tak?","","","","我需要一本關於崎億石族宗教的書。你有嗎？","","","Jeg trenger en bok om Kivi-religionen. Har du en?","","","","","","","","","Mi serve un libro a proposito della religione dei Kivi. Ne hai uno?","","","","","","","","","","","","Necessito un llibre sobre la religió dels Kivi. Què en tens cap?","","Potřebuji knihu o víře Kivi. Nemáš jednu?"],
         "2219":["","It takes you too much time to reach Drekar Camp. If you don\'t get there in the next two days, Kukul\'s man will leave your caravan.","You\'re taking too much time to reach the Drekar Camp. If you don\'t get there in the next two days, Kukul\'s man will leave your caravan.","Ha pasado mucho tiempo y aún no has llegado al campamento Drekar. Si no lo haces antes de dos días, el hombre de Kukul abandonará la caravana.","","Cela vous prend trop de temps pour atteindre le camp des Drekar. Si vous n\'y arrivez pas dans les 2 prochains jours, l\'homme de Kukul va quitter votre caravane.","","Leva muito tempo para chegar ao Acampamento Drekar. Se você não chegar lá nos próximos dois dias, o homem de Kukul deixará sua caravana.","Es dauert zu lange um das Drekarlager zu erreichen. Wenn du nicht innerhalb der nächsten zwei Tage dort ankommst, werden Kukuls Männer deine Karawane verlassen.","","Îţi ia prea mult timp pentru a ajunge la tabăra Drekar. Dacă nu vei ajunge acolo în următoarele două zile, omul lui Kukul va părăsi caravana."
         ,"Zajmuję ci za dużo czasu dotarcie do Obozu Drekarów. Jeśli nie dotrzesz tam w przeciągu dwóch dni, to człowiek Kukula opuści twoją karawanę.","Drekar Kampına ulaşmak çok uzun zaman sürdü. Eğer 2 hafta içinde gidemezsen, Kukul\'ın adamları karavanını terk edecek.","Het kost je teveel tijd om het Drekar kamp te bereiken. Als je daar niet komt in 2 dagen zal Kukuls man je karavaan verlaten.","У вас уходит много времени чтоб добраться до лагеря Дрекара. Если вы не доберётесь туда через 2 дня, человек Кукула покинет ваш караван.","Anda telah mengambil terlalu banyak masa untuk sampai ke Kem Drekar. Kalau anda tidak sampai ke sana dalam tempoh dua hari, penolong Kukul akan keluar dari karavan anda.","","Drekarin leiriin pääseminen kestää sinulta liian kauan. Jos et pääse sinne seuraavassa kahdessa päivässä, Kukulin mies jättää karavaanisi.","","抵達德瑞卡營地時間緊迫。如果你未能在兩天內抵達，庫庫爾的人馬會離開你的商旅。","","Σου παίρνει πολύ ώρα να φτάσεις στον καταυλισμό των Ντρέκαρ. Αν δε φτάσεις στις επόμενες δύο μέρες, ο άνθρωπος του Kukul θα εγκαταλήψει το καραβάνι σου."
         ,"Det tar dere for lang tid å nå Drekar Leir. Hvis dere ikke ankommer i løpet av de to neste dagene vil Kukuls mann forlate karavanen din.","","","","","","Masyadong natatagalan ka upang abutin ang Kampo ng Drekar. Kapag hindi ka nakarating doon sa saloob ng dalawang araw, Ang kasama ni Kukul ay aalis sa iyong karawan.","","","Ci vuole troppo tempo per raggiungere l\'Accampamento Drekar. Se non riesci a raggiungerlo nei prossimi due giorni, l\'uomo di Kukul lascerà la tua carovana.","","Túl régóta úton vagy a drekar tábor felé. Ha nem érsz oda két napon belül, Kukul embere el fog menni.","","","","","","","","","","Ha passat molt de temps i encara no heu arribat al campament dels Drekar. Si no hi arribeu en els propers dos dies, l\'home d\'en Kukul abandonarà la caravana.","","Trvá ti příliš dlouho dostat se k táboru Drekarů. Pokud se tam nedostaneš do dvou dnů, Kukulův člověk tě opustí."],
         "2220":["","Kukul\'s man has left your caravan.","","El hombre de Kukul deja la caravana.","","L\'homme de Kukul a quitté votre caravane.","","O homem de Kukul saíra de sua caravana.","Kukuls Leute haben deine Karawane verlassen.","","Omul lui Kukul ţi-a părăsit caravana.","Człowiek Kukula opuścił twoją karawanę.","Kukul\'un adamları karavanını bıraktı.","Kukuls man heeft je karavaan verlaten.","Человек Кукула покинул ваш караван.","Penolong Kukul telah tinggalkan karavan anda.","","Kukulin mies jätti karavaanisi.","","庫庫爾的人馬已經離開商旅。","","Ο άνθρωπας του Kukul εγκατέλειψε το καραβάνι σου.","Kukuls mann har forlatt karavanen din.","","","","","","Umalis na ang kasama ni Kukul sa iyong karawan.","","","L\'uomo di Kukul ha lasciato la tua carovana.","","Kukul embere elhagyta a karavánodat.","","","","","","","","","","L\'home d\'en Kukul deixa la caravana.","","Kukulův čověk opustil tvou karavanu."],
