         "2236":["","50,000 is all I have.","","50,000 es tóo lo que tengo.","50,000 es todo lo que tengo.","Tout ce que j\'ai c\'est 50,000.","","50,000 é tudo que eu tenho.","50.000 ist alles was ich hab.","","50.000 e tot ce am.","50,000 to wszystko co mam.","","50.000 is alles wat ik heb.","50,000 это всё, что у меня есть.","50,000 adalah semua yang saya ada.","","","","我只有 50000。","","","50,000 er alt jeg har.","","","","","","","","","50.000 è tutto quello che ho.","","","","","","","","","","","","50,000 és tolo que tinc.","","50 000 je vše co mám."],
         "2237":["","OK. 50 is enough. Give them to me.","","Hmmm... De acuerdo 50. Dámelos.","","Ok. 50, c\'est assez. Donne les moi.","","Tá. 50 é suficiente. Me de eles.","Ok. 50 werden reichen. Gib her.","","Bine. 50 este suficient. Dă-mi-i.","Okej. 50 wystarczy. Dawaj.","","Ok. 50 is genoeg. Geef ze me.","Окей. 50 достаточно. Дай их мне.","OK. 50 cukup. Baginya kepada saya.","","","","好。5萬夠了。拿給我。","","","OK. 50 er nok. Gi meg dem.","","","","","","","","","Ok. 50 è abbastanza. Dalli a me.","","","","","","","","","","","","Hmmm... D\'acord, 50. Dóna-me\'ls.","","Dobře. 50 stačí. Dej mi je."],
         "2238":["","OK. Let\'s do it.","","De acuerdo. Trato hecho.","","Ok. Faisons cela.","","Beleza. Vamos fazer isso.","Ok. Lass es uns tun.","","Bine. Să o facem.","Okej. Zróbmy to.","","OK. Laten we het doen.","Окей. По рукам.","OK. Jom.","","","","好。我幹！","","","OK. La oss gjøre det.","","","","","","","","","Ok. Facciamolo.","","","","","","","","","","","","D\'acord. Fet.","","Dobře. Pojďme na to."],
