         "2808":["","I need more healing, please. [do healing]","","Necesito algo más de sanación. [realizar cura]","","J\'ai besoin de plus de soin, s\'il vous plaît. [se faire soigner]","","Eu preciso de mais cura, por favor. [curar-se]","Bitte, ich brauche heilung. [heilen lassen]","","Mai am nevoie de vindecare, te rog. [efectuează vindecarea]","Potrzebuję więcej leczenia, proszę. [przeprowadź leczenie]","","Ik heb meer genezing nodig, alsjeblieft. [doe genezing]","","Saya perlukan rawatan lagi. [Buat rawatan]","","","","我需要治療，拜託了。[接受治療]","","","Jeg trenger mer helbredelseer du snill. [bli helbredet]","","Jag behöver mer healing, snälla. [utför healing]","","","","","","","","","","","","Još liječenja, molim. [izliječi]","","","","","","","","",""],
