         "2943":["","No. Thanks. I don\'t need your help. I\'ll manage by myself.","","No, gracias. No necesito tu ayuda. Ya me las apañaré yo <solo/sola>.","","","","Não. <Obrigado/Obrigada>. Eu não preciso de sua ajuda. Eu dou conta.","Nein, danke. Ich brauche deine Hilfe nicht. Ich bekomme das selber auf die Reihe!","","Nu, mulțumesc. N-am nevoie de ajutorul tău. Mă descurc.","Nie. Dzięki. Nie potrzebuję twojej pomocy. Poradzę sobie <sam/sama>.","","Nee. Dank je. Ik heb je hulp niet nodig. Ik zal het zelf wel regelen.","Нет, спасибо. Мне не нужна твоя помощь, разберусь <сам/сама>.","Tak. Terima kasih. Saya tak perlu pertolongan kamu. Saya akan menguruskannya.","","","","不，感謝。我不需要你幫忙。我有辦法自己處理。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "2944":["","I knew that you\'ll be back.","","Sabía que volverías.","","","","Eu sabia que você iria voltar.","Ich wusste, dass Du zurückkommen wirst.","","Știam că te vei întoarce.","Wiedziałem, że wrócisz.","","Ik wist dat je terug zou komen.","Я знаю, что ты вернешься.","Jangkaan saya betul, kamu memang akan kembali ke sini.","","","","我知道你會回來的。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "2945":["","Can you help me find out where Olaf is?","","¿Puedes ayudarme a encontrar a Olaf?","","","","Pode me ajudar a encontrar Olaf?","Kannst Du mir helfen, herauszufinden wo Olaf ist?","","Mă poți ajuta să aflu unde-i Olaf?","Czy możesz pomóc mi odkryć, gdzie jest Olaf?","","Kun je me helpen uit te zoeken waar Olaf is?","Можешь помочь мне найти Олафа?","Bolehkah kamu tolong saya cari Olaf?","","","","你能告訴我歐拉夫在哪裡嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "2946":["","Eh... I don\'t really want anything. See you later. [leave]","","Esto... No, nada. Hasta luego. [marcharse]","","","","Eh... Eu realmente não quero nada. Até logo. [sair]","Ähh... Ich wollte nichts bestimmtes. Bis später. [gehen]","","Eh ... Nu vreau nimic. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Ech... Nie bardzo chcę cokolwiek. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Eh. Ik wil eigenlijk niets. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","Эх... На самом деле я не хочу ничего. Увидимся. [уйти]","Eh... Saya tak nak apa-apa. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","呃... 我不需要你的幫忙。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "2947":["","How\'s the progress?","","¿Cómo va eso?","","","","Como está o progresso?","Wie geht\'s voran?","","Cum merge treaba?","Jak idzie postęp?","","Hoe is de voortgang?","Ну, как успехи?","Bagaimana progres?","","","","進展如何了？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "2948":["","Nothing new. I\'ll talk to you later. [leave]","","No, nada nuevo. Luego hablamos. [marcharse]","","","","Nada de novo. Eu vou falar com você mais tarde. [sair]","Nichts neues. Ich rede später mit dir. [gehen]","","Nimic nou. Vorbim mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nic nowego. Zagadam do ciebie później. [odejdź]","","Niets nieuws. Ik spreek je later. [vertrekken]","Пока никаких новостей. Мы поговорим позже. [уйти]","Tiada apa yang baru. Saya akan bercakap dengan kamu nanti. [Tinggal]","","","","一樣。我會再回來跟你談。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
