         "3141":["","I don\'t want your money. I just want to get out of here.","","No quiero tu dinero. Sólo quiero irme de aquí.","","","","Eu não quero seu dinheiro. Eu só quero sair daqui.","Ich will Dein Geld nicht. Ich willl nur raus von hier.","","Nu-ţi vreau banii. Vreau doar să plec de aici.","Nie chcę twoich pieniędzy. Po prostu chcę się stąd wynieść.","","Ik wil je geld niet. Ik wil alleen hier weg.","Мне не нужны твои деньги. Я просто хочу убраться отсюда.","Saya tak nak wang kamu, saya hanya nak tinggalkan sini.","","","","我不要你的錢。我只是想要你離開這裡。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
