         "3170":["","Well. OK. I need your help, so I\'ll work for you. What do we do about Kevin now?","","Bueno. Verás, necesito tu ayuda, así que estoy dispuesto a ayudarte. ¿Qué quieres que hagamos con Kevin ahora?","","","","Bem. Tudo bem. Preciso de sua ajuda, por isso vou trabalhar para você. O que vamos fazer a respeito de Kevin agora?","Nagut, okay. Ich brauche Deine Hilfe, also arbeite ich für Dich. Was machen wir jetzt mit Kevin?","","Bine. Am nevoie de ajutorul tău, așa că voi lucra pentru tine. Ce facem cu Kevin acum?","No. Okej. Potrzebuję twojej pomocy, więc będę dla ciebie <pracował/pracowała>. Co zrobimy teraz z Kevinem?","","Wel. OK. Ik heb je hulp nodig, dus ik zal voor je werken. Wat gaan we nu met Kevin doen?","","Mmm. OK. Saya memerlukan bantuan kamu, jadi saya akan bekerja untuk kamu. Apa yang harus kita buat tentang Kevin sekarang?","","","","這個。好。我們互取所需。現在我們該怎麼處理凱文？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
