         "3907":["","[shouts to his people] This person is a criminal. Arrest <him/her> immediately.","","[llamando a sus hombres] ¡Atención! Arresten a <este hombre/esta mujer> inmediatamente. Es <un/una> criminal.","","","","[grita para o seus homens] <Esse cara/Essa gata> é <um criminoso/uma criminosa>. <Prendam-no/Prendam-na> imediatamente.","[er ruft seine Leute] Diese Person ist ein Verbrecher! Sofort verhaften.","","[strigă la oamenii lui] <Arestați-l imediat. Este un infractor./Arestați-o imediat. Este o infractoare.>","[krzyczy do swoich ludzi] To <przestępca/przestępczyni>! Aresztować natychmiast!","","[roept naar zijn mensen] Deze persoon is een crimineel. Arresteer <hem/haar> onmiddelijk.","","[Jerit kepada orang dia] Orang ini adalah penjahat. Tahan dia dengan segera.","","","","[對其他人大喊]這個人是罪犯，馬上逮捕他。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
