         "3917":["","Hello, <sir/madam>. What can I do for you?","","Muy buenas, <caballero/señora>. Dígame, ¿qué puedo hacer por usted?","","","","Olá, <senhor/senhora>. Como posso ajudar?","Hallo <mein Herr/meine Dame>. Was kann ich für dich tun?","","Bună ziua, <domnule/doamnă>. Ce pot face pentru dumneavoastră?","Dzień dobry, <panu/pani>. Co mogę dla <pana/pani> zrobić?","","Hallo, <meneer/mevrouw>. Hoe kan ik u helpen?","","Hello, <tuan/puan>. Apa yang boleh saya buat untuk kamu?","","","","你好，<先生/女士>。有甚麼需要幫忙的嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "3918":["","Nothing today. Thank you. [leave]","","Ahora mismo, nada. Gracias. [marcharse]","","","","Nada por hoje. <Obrigado/Obrigada>. [sair]","Heute nichts mehr. Danke. [gehen]","","Nimic azi. Mulțumesc. [pleacă]","Dzisiaj nic. Dziękuje. [odejdź]","","Niks vandaag. Dank je. [vertrekken]","","Tiada apa hari ini. Terima kasih. [Tinggal]","","","","現在沒有。感謝你。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
