         "4060":["","Is it true that you are a demon hunter?","","¿Es verdad que eres un cazademonios?","","","","Você realmente é um caçador de demônios?","Ist es war, dass Du ein Dämonenjäger bist?","","Este adevărat că sunteţi un vânător de demoni?","Czy to prawda, że jesteś łowcą demonów?","","Is het waar dat je een demonenjager bent?","Это правда, что ты охотник на демонов?","Adakah ia benar bahawa kamu adalah seorang pemburu syaitan?","","","","你真的是惡魔獵人嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","それはあなたが鬼狩人であるのは事実でしょうか？","","","","","","","You really demon hunter?","","","","","","És cert que ets un caça-dimonis?","",""],
         "4061":["","Hey! I want that girl that you have with you [points at Lois]. How much do you want for her?","","¡Eh, tú! Quiero a esa piba que va contigo. [señala a Lois] ¿Cuánto quieres por ella?","¡Eh, tú! Quiero a esa chica que va contigo. [señala a Lois] ¿Cuánto quieres por ella?","","","Hey! Eu quero aquela garota que você tem aí [aponta para Lois]. Quanto quer por ela?","Hey! Ich will das Mädchen, das mit dir unterwegs ist. [er zeigt auf Lois] Wieviel willst Du für sie?","","Hei! Vreau fata aia pe care o ai cu tine [arată spre Lois]. Cât vrei pentru ea?","Hej! Chcę tę dziewczynę, którą masz przy sobie [wskazuje na Lois]. Ile chcesz za nią?","","Hé! Ik wil dat meisje dat je daar bij je hebt [wijst naar Lois]. Hoeveel wil je voor haar?","","Hei! Aku nak perempuan yang ko ada sekarang. [tunjuk pada Lois]. Berapa ko nak untuk dia?","","","","嘿！我要你身旁的那個女人[指向露薏絲]。你覺得要多少可以換她？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "4062":["","Oh! Great! Not only have you done all the work for me. You have even delivered the main prize right to my doorstep. What a great job!","","¡Vaya, vaya! No sólo has hecho el trabajo por mí, sino q\'amasamás t\'has traío el premio gordo hasta aquí. ¡Te lo has currao!","¡Vaya, vaya! No sólo has hecho el trabajo por mí, sino que además trajiste el premio gordo hasta aquí. ¡Buen trabajo!","","","Ah certo! Você não só fez todo o trabalho para mim, mas ainda por cima, me entregou o prêmio na porta de minha casa. Bom trabalho!","Oh! Großartig! Du hast nicht nur die ganze Arbeit für mich gemacht, sondern Du hast auch den Hauptpreis für mich mitgebracht. Das hast Du echt fantastisch gemacht!","","Oh! Minunat! Nu numai că ai făcut toata munca pentru mine, dar şi livrezi comoara la ușa mea. Ce treabă grozavă!","Och. Zarąbiście! Nie tylko <wykonałeś/wykonałaś> całą pracę za mnie. <Dostarczyłeś/Dostarczyłaś> nawet główną nagrodę wprost pod moje drzwi. Cóż za przepiękna robota!","","Oh! Geweldig! Niet alleen heb je al het werk voor me gedaan. Je hebt zelfs de hoofdprijs bij mijn deur bezorgd. Wat een geweldig werk!"
         ,"","Oh! Hebat! Ko bukan saja habis buat semua kerja untuk aku, ko juga telah membawa hadiah utama kepada aku. Kerja yang hebat!","","","","噢！太好了！你不只幫我做完所有的事。你還把大獎送到我的門外。真是太好了！","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "4063":["","She\'s not for sale.","","Ella no está en venta.","","","","Ela não esta a venda.","Sie steht nicht zum Verkauf.","","Nu e de vânzare.","Nie jest na sprzedaż.","","Ze is niet te koop.","","Dia bukan untuk jualan.","","","","她是非賣品。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
