         "4977":["","Is there more work?","","¿Tenéis más trabajo para mí?","","","","Há mais trabalho?","Gibt es noch Arbeit?","","Mai e de lucru?","Jest więcej roboty?","","Is er meer werk?","","Ada lagi tak kerja?","","","","有適合我的工作嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "4978":["","See you later, Huli. [leave]","","Ya nos veremos, Huli. [marcharse]","","","","Até mais, Huli. [sair]","Bis später, Huli. [gehen]","","Ne vedem mai târziu, Huli. [pleacă]","Do zobaczenia później, Huli. [odejdź]","","Ik zie je later, Huli. [vertrekken]","","Jumpa lagi, Huli. [Tinggal]","","","","晚點見，胡莉。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
