         "5007":["","You\'re welcome. See you later. [leave]","","De nada. Hasta la vista. [marcharse]","","","","De nada. Até logo. [sair]","Keine Ursache. Bis bald. [gehen]","","Cu plăcere. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nie ma za co. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Graag gedaan. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Sama-sama. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","不客氣。晚點再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5008":["","I have delivered the package.","","Ya entregué el paquete.","","","","Eu entreguei o pacote.","Ich habe das Paket abgeliefert.","","Am livrat pachetul.","<Dostarczyłem/Dostarczyłam> pakunek.","","Ik heb het pakje bezorgd.","","Saya telah hantar pakej itu.","","","","我已經遞送包裹了。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5009":["","Great. Give me just a second to calculate your reward.","","Muy bien. Dame un minuto que calculo la recompensa.","","","","Ótimo. Me dê um segundo para calcular sua recompensa.","Großartig. Gib mir einen Augenblick um deine Belohnung auszurechnen.","","Grozav. Dă-mi doar o secundă pentru a calcula recompensa.","Słodko. Daj mi sekundę na kalkulację twojej nagrody.","","Geweldig. Geef me een momentje om je beloning te berekenen.","","Hebat. Beri saya sementara untuk mengira ganjaran kamu.","","","","太好了。給我一點時間計算獎賞。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
