         "5018":["","I bring a parcel from Workforce Merchants for you.","","Le traigo un paquete de parte de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra.","","","","Eu trago um pacote dos Comerciantes de Mão de Obra para você.","Ich bringe ein Paket von den Arbeitskraft-Händlern für Sie.","","Am adus un pachet de la CFM pentru dvs.","Przynoszę przesyłkę od Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą dla ciebie.","","Ik heb een pakje van de Werkkracht Handelaren voor u.","","Saya bawa satu pakej dari Workforce Merchants untuk kamu.","","","","我從商賈公會那裏帶了封桶郵包給你。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
