         "5290":["","I\'m so sorry, but the man you sent to help with the plantation died. There was no way to save him.","","Lo siento muchísimo, pero el hombre que mandaste para ayudarnos ha muerto. No hubo manera de salvarlo.","","","","Sinto muito, mas o homem que você enviou para ajudar na plantação morreu. Não havia nenhuma maneira de salvá-lo.","Es tut mir so Leid, aber der Mann, den du mir mitgegeben hast um die Planatge aufzubauen, ist gestorben. Es gab keine Chance um ihn zu retten.","","Îmi pare rău, dar omul pe care l-ai trimis pentru a ne ajuta cu plantația, a murit. N-am putut să-l salvăm.","Jest mi tak przykro, ale mężczyzna, którego wysłałeś do pomocy przy plantacji umarł. Nie było sposobu, aby go uratować.","","Het spijt me erg, maar de man die je gestuurd hebt om te helpen met de plantage is overleden. Er was geen manier om hem te redden.","","Saya minta maaf, tapi orang yang kamu telah hantar untuk bekerja di perladangan telah mati. Saya tak dapat menyelamatkan dia.","","","","抱歉，你派來幫我們種植的人死了。我沒辦法救他。"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Јако ми је жао, али човек ког си послао да помогне око плантаже је мртав. Није било шансе да га спасемо.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5291":["","What? Died? No! Why?!!","","¡¿Qué?! ¿Morir? ¡¡No!! ¿Cómo?","","Quoi? <Mort/Morte>? Non! Pourquoi?!!","","O quê? Morreu? Não! Por quê?!!","Was? Gestorben? Nein! Warum?!!","","Ce? A murit? Nu! De ce?!","Co? Umarł? Nie! Czemu?!!","","Wat? Gestorven? Nee! Waarom?!!","","Apa? Mati? Tidak! Kenapa?!!","","","","甚麼？死了？不！為什麼？！","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Шта? Умро? Не! Зашто!?","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5292":["","Sorry, it was an accident.","","Lo siento, ha sido un accidente.","","","","Desculpe, isso foi um acidente.","Es tut mir Leid, es war ein Unfall.","","Îmi pare rău, a fost un accident.","Przykro mi, to był wypadek.","","Sorry, het was een ongeluk.","","Minta maaf, ia adalah satu kemalangan.","","","","抱歉，發生了意外。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Извини, то је несрећан случај.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5293":["","A good man he is.","","Él buen hombre.","","Un bon homme il est.","","Ele é um bom homem.","Er ist ein guter Mann.","","A fost un om bun.","Dobry mężczyzna on jest.","","Een goede man is hij.","","Dia adalah orang yang baik.","","","","他是一個好人。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Добар је он човек.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5294":["","Yes. He was. Sorry again... Do you mind sending somebody else to help with the plantation business?","","Cierto, lo era. Lo siento muchísimo, de veras. Esto... ¿Te importaría enviar a otro hombre a ayudarnos con la plantación?","","","","Sim. Ele era. Desculpe-me novamente... Você se importa de mandar outra pessoa comigo para ajudar com o negócio da plantação?","Ja, das war er. Es tut mir wirklich Leid... Könntest du vielleicht noch jemanden schicken um bei dem Pflanzengeschäft zu helfen?","","Da. Era. Îmi pare rău... Te superi dacă trimiți pe altcineva pentru a ne ajuta cu plantația?","Tak. Był nim. Przepraszam znowu... Nie miałbyś coś przeciwko wysłaniu kogoś innego do pomocy z plantacjowym biznesem?","","Ja. Dat was hij. Nogmaals sorry... Vind je het erg om iemand anders te sturen om te helpen met de zaak van de plantage?","","Ya. Minta maaf lagi... Bolehkah kamu hantar seseorang lagi untuk menolong dalam bisnes perladangan?","","","","對。是一個好人。再次抱歉... 你能再派一個人來幫我們種植嗎？","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","Да. Био је. Извини опет... Хоћеш ли послати неког другог да помогне око плантажног посла?","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5295":["","You want to kill all my men?","","¿Tú quieres matar todos hombres de mí?","","","","Você quer matar todos os meus homens?","Willst du denn alle meine Leute umbringen?","","Vrei să-mi omori toți oamenii?","Chcieć zabić wszystkich moich ziomów?","","Jij al mijn mannen willen doden?","","Kamu nak membunuh semua orang saya?","","","","你打算把我們都弄死嗎？","","Θέλεις να σκοτώσεις όλους τους άνδρες μου;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Желиш да убијеш све моје људе?","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5296":["","I didn\'t kill him. I swear. I did my best to save him.","","Yo no lo maté, lo juro. Hice todo lo que pude por salvarle.","","","","Eu não o matei. Eu juro. Eu fiz o possível para salvá-lo.","Ich habe ihn nicht umgebracht, ich schwöre es. Ich habe mein Bestes gegeben um ihn zu retten.","","Nu l-am ucis. Jur. Am făcut tot ce-am putut ca să-l salvez.","Nie <zabiłem/zabiłam> go. Przysięgam. <Zrobiłem/Zrobiłam> wszystko , aby go ocalić.","","Ik heb hem niet gedood. Ik zweer het. Ik heb mijn best gedaan om hem te redden.","","Saya bukan yang membunuh dia. Saya bersumpah. Saya telah berusaha untuk menyelamatkan dia.","","","","那不是我殺的，我發誓。我已經盡力救他了。","","Δεν τον σκότωσα στ\'  ορκίζομαι. Έκανα ότι καλύτερο μπορούσα για να τον σώσω.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Нисам га убио. Кунем се. Учинио сам све да га спасем.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5297":["","I give you another man, but if he dies, forget about me helping you.","","Yo da otro hombre, pero si él muere también, yo no ayuda más.","","","","Eu vou te dar outro homem, mas se ele morrer esqueça minha ajuda.","Ich gebe dir noch einen Mann mit, aber wenn er stirbt, kannst du meine Hilfe vergessen.","","Eu îți dau un alt om, dar dacă moare și el, uită de ajutorul meu.","Ja dać ci kolejnego zioma, ale jeśli on umrzeć, to zapomnij o mnie pomagającym tobie.","","Ik jou andere man geven, maar als hij sterft, vergeet dan mijn hulp.","","Saya akan bagi kamu seorang lagi, tapi kalau dia mati, jangan suruh saya tolong kamu lagi.","","","","我派給你另一個人，但是假如他死了，我們的生意就到此為止。","","Θα σου δώσω έναν ακόμη άνδρα αλλά αν πεθάνει ξέχνα τη βοήθεια από μέρους μου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Даћу ти још једног човека, али ако умре, заборави на моју помоћ.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5298":["","OK. It\'s a deal.","","De acuerdo. Trato hecho.","","","","OK. Isso é um acordo.","Ok. Das ist abgemacht.","","OK. Te-am înțeles.","Okej. Stoi.","","OK. Het is een deal.","","OK. Boleh.","","","","好。一言為定。","","ΟΚ. σύμφωνοι.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Уреду. Договорили смо се.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5299":["","He join you when you leave.","","Él une a ti cuando te vas.","","","","Ele se junta a você quando você sair.","Er wird sich dir anschließen, wenn du uns verlässt.","","Ți se va alătura când pleci.","On dołączyć do ciebie, kiedy ty odchodzić.","","Hij zich bij jou voegen als jij vertrekken.","","Dia akan menyertai kamu apabila kamu berlepas.","","","","當你離開的時候他會加入你。","","Θα σε ακολουθήσει μόλις φύγεις.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Придружиће ти се кад одеш.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5300":["","Thanks! See you later. [leave]","","¡Muchas gracias! Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","<Obrigado/Obrigada>! Vejo você depois. [sair]","Danke! Bis später. [gehen]","","Mulțumesc! Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Dzięki! Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Bedankt. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Terima kasih! Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","感謝！再見。[離開]","","Ευχαριστώ! Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Хвала! Видимо се после.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5301":["","I don\'t know how to tell you, but the second men you sent to help me died too.","","Esto... No sé ni cómo decírtelo... pero el segundo hombre que enviaste para ayudarnos también ha muerto.","","","","Eu não sei como te contar, mas o segundo homem que você mandou para me ajudar morreu também.","Ich weiß nicht, wie ich es dir sagen soll, aber auch der zweite Mann, den du zu meiner Hilfe mitgeschickt hast, ist gestorben.","","Nu știu cum să-ți spun, dar al doilea om, pe care l-ai trimis să mă ajute, a murit de asemenea.","Nie wiem jak ci to powiedzieć, ale drugi człowiek, którego wysłałeś, by mi pomógł umarł również.","","Ik weet niet hoe ik het je moet vertellen, maar de tweede man de je gestuurd hebt om me te helpen is ook gestorven.","","Saya tidak tahu bagaimana untuk beritahu kamu, tapi orang kedua yang kamu hantar untuk tolong saya telah mati juga.","","","","我不知如何啟口，但是你派來協助的第二位成員也死了。","","Δεν ξέρω πως να στο πω αλλά και ο δεύτερος άνθρωπος που μου έστειλες πέθανε.","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","Не знам како да ти кажем, али и други човек ког си ми послао у помоћ је исто умро.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5302":["","What?!! It\'s a joke. Right?","","¡Nah! Tú broma, ¡¿verdad?!","","","","O quê?!! É uma brincadeira né?","Was?!! Das ist ein Scherz, oder?....Oder?","","Ce?! Asta-i o glumă proastă, nu?","Co?!! To żart. Prawda?","","Wat?!!! Het grap zijn. Toch?","","Apa?!! Ia satu gurauan saja kan?","","","","甚麼？！你是在開玩笑對吧？","","Πως;!! Πρόκειται για αστειο. Σωστά;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Шта!? То је шала. Зар не?","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5303":["","No. Sorry. It\'s true.","","No... Lo siento, no es ninguna broma.","","","","Não. Desculpe. Isso é verdade.","Nein, Es ist leider die Wahrheit.","","Nu. Îmi pare rău, dar e adevărul.","Nie. Przykro mi. To prawda.","","Nee. Sorry. Het is waar.","","Tidak. Minta maaf. Ia benar.","","","","不。很遺憾。這是真的。","","Όχι. Λυπάμαι. Εϊανι αλήθεια.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Не. Извини. То је истина.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5304":["","I not give you another man. Forget about it!","","¡No! Yo no da más hombres a ti. ¡No más!","","","","Eu não vou te dar outro homem. Esqueça isso!","Ich gebe dir niemanden mehr. Das kannst du vergessen!","","Eu nu vă  mai dau un alt om. Uită de asta!","Ja ci nie dać kolejnego zioma. Zapomnij o tym!","","Ik jou niet andere man geven. Jij het vergeten!","","Saya tidak akan beri kamu satu lagi orang. Lupakannya saja!","","","","我不會再派人給你。到此為止！","","Δε σπυ δίνω άλλο άνδρα. Ξέχνα το!","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Нећу ти дати још једног човека. Заборави!","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5305":["","Pretty please.","","Porfaaa...","","","","Por favorzinho.","Ach bitte, bitte.","","Te rog frumos.","Ślicznie proszę.","","Heel alsjeblieft.","","Ayuhlah.","","","","拜託啦。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Молим лепо.","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5306":["","Get out before you kill more men.","","Tú fuera, tú no matas a más hombres.","","Casse-toi avant de tuer plus d\'hommes.","","Sai daqui antes que mate mais homens.","Hau ab, bevor du noch mehr Menschen umbringst.","","Cară-te, înainte de-a-mi ucide mai mulți oameni.","Wynoś się, zanim zabijesz więcej ziomów.","","Jij weggaan voor jij meer mannen vermoorden.","","Tinggalkan sini sebelum kamu membunuh lebih orang.","","","","在你把我們殺光之前快給我滾。","","Φύγε από δω πριν σκοτώσεις περισσότερο κόσμο.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Излаз напоље, док не убијеш још људи.","","","","","","","","","",""],
