         "5312":["","Sorry, but I failed the mission. Eliah won\'t help us anymore.","","Lo siento, pero no pude cumplir con la misión. Eliah no quiere ayudarnos...","","","","Desculpe-me, eu falhei na missão. Eliah não irá mais nos ajudar.","Es tut mir leid, aber ich bin an der Mission gescheitert. Eliah wird uns nicht mehr helfen.","","Îmi pare rău, dar nu am reușit misiunea. Eliah nu ne va mai ajuta.","Przykro mi, ale <spaprałem/spaprałam> misję. Elliah już nam więcej nie pomoże.","","Sorry, maar ik heb gefaald in de missie. Eliah zal ons niet meer helpen.","","Minta maaf, tapi saya telah gagal dalam misi tersebut. Eliah tidak akan tolong kita lagi.","","","","抱歉，我搞砸了任務。伊萊不再協助我們了。","","Συγγνώμη απέτυχα στην αποστολή. Ο Eliah δεν θα μας βοηθήσει πλέον.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5313":["","What happened?","","¿Y eso? ¿Qué diablos ha pasado?","","","","O que houve?","Was ist passiert?","","Ce s-a întâmplat?","Co się stało?","","Wat is er gebeurd?","","Apa yang terjadi?","","","","發生了甚麼事？","","Τι συνέβη;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5314":["","He gave me two men and both died. Now he\'s mad at me.","","Envió a un par de sus hombres para que me acompañaran, pero ambos han muerto. Y ahora no quiere verme ni en pintura.","","","","Ele me deu dois homens e ambos morreram. Agora ele está louco comigo.","Er hat mir zwei seiner Männer mitgegeben und beide sind gestorben. Jetzt ist er sauer auf mich.","","Mi-a dat doi oameni care au murit. Acum e supărat pe mine.","Dał mi dwóch ludzi i obaj umarli. Teraz jest na mnie wściekły.","","Hij gaf me twee mannen en ze zijn allebei gestorven. Nu is hij kwaad op me.","","Dia telah beri dua orang dan mereka telah mati. Sekarang dia sangat marah dengan saya.","","","","他借我兩個人，然後兩個都死了。現在他怪罪於我。","","Μου έδωσε δύο άνδρες κι οι δυο πέθαναν. Τώρα είναι έξαλος μαζί μου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5315":["","This is bad. This is really bad. I guess we\'ll have to abandon our textile production plans... at least for now.","","¡Qué mal! Vaya, es terrible. Supongo que tendremos que abandonar nuestros planes de producción textil... Al menos por el momento.","","","","Isso é ruim. Muito ruim. Eu acho que teremos de abandonar nossos planos de produção têxtil... pelo menos por enquanto.","Das ist schlecht. Wirklich schlecht. Ich schätze, dass wir unser Pläne einer Textilproduktion verwerfen können.... zumindest vorerst.","","Asta-i rău. Asta-i foarte rău. Cred că va trebui să renunțăm la planurile noastre de producție de textile ... cel puțin pentru moment.","Jest źle. Jest naprawdę źle. Zgaduję, że będziemy musieli porzucić nasze plany produkcji tkaniny... przynajmniej na razie.","","Dat is slecht. Dat is heel slecht. Ik vermoed dat we onze plannen over textielproductie nu moeten laten varen... voorlopig althans.","","Ini sangat buruk. Betul-betul buruk. Saya rasa kita akan perlu mengetepikan pelan-pelan produksi tekstil kita... sekurang-kurangnya untuk sementara."
         ,"","","","真糟糕，那是真的不妙。看來我們要廢棄這個布料製作的計畫了... 恐怕現在只能這樣。","","Αυτό είναι κακό. Είναι πραγματικά κακό. Φαντάζομαι ότι πρέπει να εγκαταλείψουμε τα σχέδιά μας για παραγωγή υφάσματος... τουλάχιστον για τώρα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5316":["","Can I still keep working for you?","","¿Puedo seguir trabajando para vosotros?","","","","Posso continuar trabalhando para você?","Kann ich weiterhin für Dich arbeiten?","","Pot să continui să lucrez pentru tine?","Czy mogę wciąż dla was pracować?","","Kan ik nog steeds voor je blijven werken?","","Bolehkah saya teruskan bekerja untuk kamu?","","","","我可以繼續在這工作嗎？","","Μπορώ να συνεχίσω να δουλεύω για σένα;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5317":["","Yeah. You can. Go rest a bit and come back a bit later for your next mission.","","Sí, sí que puedes. Anda, ve a descansar un rato y vuelve más tarde. Ya te explicaré en qué consiste tu nueva misión.","","","","É. Você pode. Vá descansar um pouco e volte logo depois para sua próxima missão.","Yeah. Du kannst. Ruh dich erstmal aus und komme später für deine nächste Mission zurück.","","Da. Poți. Du-te un pic și odihnește-te și revino un pic mai târziu, pentru următoarea misiune.","Ano. Możesz. Idź odpocznij trochę i wróć trochę później, po swoją następną misję.","","Ja. Dat kan je. Rust een beetje uit en kom later terug voor je volgende missie.","","Ya. Kamu boleh. Pergi berehat dulu dan balik nanti untuk misi seterusnya kamu.","","","","對。當然可以。去休息一下，然後回來我告訴你下一個任務。","","Ναι μπορείς. Πήγαινε ξεκουράσου λιγάκι και έλα πίσω λίγο αργότερα για επόμενη αποστολή σου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5318":["","Thank you. See you later. [leave]","","Gracias. Hasta luego, pues. [marcharse]","","","","<Obrigado/Obrigada>. Até mais tarde. [sair]","Danke dir. Bis später. [gehen]","","Mulțumesc. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Dziękuje. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Dank je. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Terima kasih. Jumpa kamu nanti. [Tinggal]","","","","感謝。等一會見。[離開]","","Ευχαριστώ. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","Grazie. A piu\' tardi. [esci]","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5319":["","Eliah gave me a man who will help us start a plantation.","","Eliah ha enviado a una persona que se encargará de ayudarnos con la plantación.","","","","Eliah me deu um homem que pode nos ajudar a começar a plantação.","Eliah hat mir einen Mann mitgegeben, der uns bei Start der Plantage hilft.","","Eliah mi-a dat un om care ne va ajuta să începem o plantație.","Elliah dał mi człowieka, który pomoże nam rozpocząć plantację.","","Eliah heeft me een man gegeven die ons zal helpen een plantage op te starten.","","Eliah telah beri saya seorang lelaki yang akan tolong kita memulakan sebuah perladangan.","","","","伊萊給我一個人來協助我們開啟種植事業。","","ο Eliah μου έδωσε έναν άνδρα που θα μας βοηθούσε να ξεκινήσουμε μία φυτεία.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5320":["","Great. Where does he recommend to start it?","","Perfecto. ¿Alguna sugerencia de dónde deberíamos situar la plantación?","","","","Ótimo. Onde ele nos recomenda começar?","Großartig. Wo empfiehlt er es aufzubauen?","","Grozav. Unde ne recomandă să începem?","Cukierkowo. Gdzie rekomenduję ją rozpocząć?","","Geweldig. Waar raadt hij aan om het te beginnen?","","Hebat. Di mana dia mencadangkan untuk memulakannya?","","","","太好了。他建議我們從何處開始？","","Ωραία. Που πρότεινε να την ξεκινήσεις;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5321":["","In the place where Winchester Clan leaders used to live. It\'s empty now.","","Sí, en el que fue el asentamiento de los líderes del Clan Winchester. Ahora está vacío.","","","","No lugar em que o Clã Winchester vivia. Está vazio agora.","An dem Ort, wo die Anführer des Winchester Clans gelebt haben. Dort ist jetzt nichts mehr.","","În locul în care liderii Clanului Winchester trăiau. Acum e gol.","W miejscu, gdzie przywódcy Klanu Winchester zwykli żyć. Teraz jest puste.","","Op de plek waar de Winchester Clan woonde. Het is nu leeg.","","Di tempat yang ketua-ketua Winchester Clan tinggal. Ia kosong sekarang.","","","","就在溫徹斯特家族領袖以前住的地方。現在是閒置了。","","Στο μέρος που συνήθιζαν να μένουν οι ηγέτες της φυλής Winchester. Είναι άδειο τώρα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5322":["","Sounds good.","","Hmmm... Buena idea.","","","","Parece bom.","Klingt gut.","","Sună bine.","Brzmi dobrze.","","Klinkt goed.","","Boleh juga.","","","","聽起來不錯。","","Ακούγεται καλά.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5323":["","He says that you should send your workers there.","","Dice que deberíais enviar a vuestros trabajadores hasta allí.","","","","Ele disse que você deve mandar seus trabalhadores para lá.","Er sagt, dass du deine Arbeiter dorthin schicken sollst.","","Zice că ar trebui să-ți trimiți muncitorii acolo.","On stwierdził, że powinieneś wysłać tam więcej pracowników.","","Hij zegt dat je je werkers daar naartoe zou moeten sturen.","","Dia kata bahawa kamu harus hantar pekerja-pekerja kamu ke sana.","","","","他叫你派你的工人到那裏去。","","Λέει ότι θα έπρεπε να στείλετε και τους δικούς σας εργάτες εκεί.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5324":["","Yes. Of course. Do you mind escorting them?","","Por supuesto. ¿Te importaría escoltarlos?","","","","Sim. É claro. Você se importa de escoltar eles?","Ja, klar. Könntest du sie dorthin eskortieren?","","Da. Desigur. Te superi dacă-i însoțești?","Tak. Oczywiście. Masz coś przeciw eskortowaniu ich?","","Ja. Natuurlijk. Vind je het erg om hen te escorteren?","","Ya. Sudah tentu. Bolehkah kamu mengiringi mereka?","","","","好。當然。你可以護送他們嗎？","","Ναι. Φυσικά. Σε πειράζει να τους συνοδεύεις;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5325":["","Not at all. I\'ll take them with me.","","Claro que no. Los acompañaré hasta allí.","","","","Não me importo. Eu vou leva-los comigo.","Kein Problem. Ich nehme sie mit mir.","","Nicidecum. O să-i iau cu mine.","Ależ w ogóle. Wezmę ich ze sobą.","","Helemaal niet. Ik zal ze met me mee nemen.","","Boleh. Saya akan membawa mereka bersama saya.","","","","沒問題。我會帶上他們。","","Καθόλου. Θα τους πάρω μαζί μου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5326":["","Please make sure that they get there alive. These are the only men we have available and we need them all to have a large enough plantation.","","Por favor, asegúrate que llegan todos hasta allí sanos y salvos. Son nuestros únicos hombres disponibles y necesitamos que lleguen todos hasta allí si queremos que la plantación sea lo suficientemente grande.","","","","Por favor, se certifique de que todos cheguem lá vivos. Esses são os únicos homens que nós temos disponíveis e precisamos de todos eles para obter uma plantação grande o suficiente.","Bitte kümemre dich darum, dass sie alle gesund ankommen. Das sind die einzigen Leute die ich dafür entbehren kann und wir brauchen sie alle, damit die Produktion groß genug ist.","","Te rog, asigură-te că ajung cu toții, în viață. Aceștia sunt singurii oameni pe care-i avem la dispoziție și avem nevoie de toți, pentru o plantație suficient de mare.","Proszę upewnij się, że dotrą oni tam żywi. To są jedyni dostępni nam ludzie i potrzebujemy ich wszystkich, do posiadania wystarczająco wielkiej plantacji."
         ,"","Zorg er alsjeblieft voor dat ze daar levend aankomen. Dit zijn de enige mannen die we beschikbaar hebben en we hebben ze allemaal nodig om een plantage te hebben die groot genoeg is.","","Sila pastikan bahawa mereka sampai ke sana. Mereka hanyalah orang yang kita ada buat sementara dan kita memerlukan mereka semua untuk menguruskan perladangan yang cukup besar.","","","","請確保他們平安到達。他們是我僅有能用的人力了，我需要他們種植一大片的土地。","","Σε παρακαλώ σιγουρέψου ότι θα φτάσουν εκεί ζωντανοί. Αυτοί είναι οι μόνοι άνδρες διαθέσιμοι και τους χρειαζόμαστε όλους για να κάνουμε μία μεγάλη φυτεία.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5327":["","I\'ll do my best.","","Haré todo lo que pueda.","","","","Eu farei o meu melhor.","Ich werde mein Bestes geben.","","Voi face tot posibilul.","Dam z siebie wszystko.","","Ik zal mijn best doen.","","Saya akan berusaha.","","","","我會盡我所能。","","Θα κάνω ότι μπορώ.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5328":["","Well. They\'ll join you outside the headquarters... By the way, the Ozbet government liked our idea. We\'re now working on the details. By the time you\'ll get back here we\'ll probably have it all arranged.","","Bien. Se unirán a ti a la salida del cuartel. Por cierto, al gobierno de Ozbet les gusta nuestra idea. Estamos ultimando los detalles. Espero que a tu regreso, ya hayamos podido cerrar las negociaciones.","","","","Bem. Eles se juntarão a você fora do quartel-general... Falando nisso, o governo de Ozbet gostou da nossa ideia. Estamos trabalhando nos detalhes agora. Na hora que você voltar provavelmente tudo já estará pronto.","Gut. Ich schließen sich dir aushalb des Hauptquartiers an.... Ach und nebenbei, der Regierung von Ozbet gefällt deine Idee. Wir arbeiten jetzt an den Details. Wenn du mal wieder vorbei kommst, werden wir dafür alles geregelt haben.","","Bine. Ți se vor alătura în fața sediului ... Apropo, celor din guvernul Ozbet le-a plăcut ideea noastră. Lucrăm la detalii, acum. Până te întorci, vom avea, probabil, totul aranjat."
         ,"No. Dołączą do ciebie na zewnątrz kwatery głównej... Tak swoją drogą, rząd Ozbet polubił nas pomysł. Pracujemy teraz nad szczegółami. Kiedy wrócisz, prawdopodobnie wszystko będzie już załatwione.","","Wel ze zullen zich bij je voegen buiten het hoofdkwartier... Trouwens, de regering vond ons idee goed. We werken nu aan de details. Tegen de tijd dat je terug bent, zullen we het waarschijnlijk allemaal geregeld hebben.","","Bagus. Mereka akan sertai kamu di luar ibu pejabat. Untuk maklumat kamu, kerajaan Ozbet suka pada idea kita. Kami sedang menguruskan semuanya sekarang. Bila kamu balik ke sini kami kemungkinan sudah mengaturnya semua.","","","","這個嘛。他們會在總部外加入你... 除此之外，歐茲別政府也支持我們的計畫。我們已開始談相關細節。等到你回來的時候，就差不多安排好了。","","Εντάξει. Θα σε συναντήσουν έξω από το αρχηγείο. Επίσης το σχέδιό σου άρεσε στην κυβέρνηση του Ozbet. Τώρα δουλεύουμε τις λεπτομέρειες. Πιθανόν μέχρι να γυρίσεις πίσω να τα έχουμε κανονίσει όλα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5329":["","Great. I\'m glad to hear it.","","Genial. Me alegra oír eso.","","","","Ótimo. Eu fico feliz em ouvir isso.","Großartig. Ich bin froh das zu hören!","","Grozav. Mă bucur să aud asta.","Odlot. Cieszę się, że to słyszę.","","Geweldig. Ik ben blij dat te horen.","","Hebat. Saya gembira mendengar tentangnya.","","","","太好了。很高興聽到這件事。","","Άψογα. Είμαι <χαρούμενος/χαρούμενη> που το ακούω.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5330":["","Thanks for your help.","","Gracias por ayudarnos.","","","","Obrigado pela sua ajuda.","Danke für deine Hilfe.","","Mulțumesc pentru ajutor.","Dzięki za twoją pomoc.","","Bedankt voor je hulp.","","Terima kasih atas pertolongan kamu.","","","","感謝你的幫忙。","","Ευχαριστώ για τη βοήθειά σου","","","","","","","Salamat sa tulong mo.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5331":["","You\'re welcome. See you later. [leave]","","De nada. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","De nada. Até mais. [sair]","Gern geschehe. Bis später. [gehen]","","Cu plăcere. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nie ma za co. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Graag gedaan. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Sama-sama. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","不客氣。再見。[離開]","","Δεν κάνει τίποτε. Τα λέμε αργότερα [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5332":["","Hempton","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Hempton","","","","","","","","","","","Konopiště"],
         "5333":["","Sorry, but some of the workers I was supposed to escort to work on the cannabis plantation died.","","Lo siento, pero no he conseguido que todos los trabajadores que me pediste que escoltara llegaran con vida hasta la plantación.","","","","Me desculpe, mas alguns dos trabalhadores que eu devia escoltar até a plantação de maconha morreram.","Entschuldige, aber einige der Arbeiter, die ich zum Dienst auf der Cannabis-Plantage eskortieren sollte, sind gestorben.","","Îmi pare rău, dar unii dintre muncitorii pe care trebuia să-i escortez pâna la plantația de canabis, au murit.","Przykro mi, ale część twoich pracowników, których <miałem/miałam> eskortować do pracy na plantacji marihuany umarła.","","Sorry, maar sommige van de werkers die ik naar de plantage moest begeleiden naar de cannabisplantage, zijn overleden.","","Minta maaf, tapi beberapa orang yang saya sepatutnya mengiringi untuk bekerja di perladangan kanabis telah mati.","","","","抱歉，一些工人在護送到大麻種植地點的途中死了。","","Λυπάμαι αλλά μερικοί από τους εργάτες που θα συνόδευα για δουλειά στη φυτεία κάναβης πέθαναν."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5334":["","It\'s a shame, but I understand that things of this kind happen. Luckily, some new people became available recently. Please take them to the plantation to replace those who died on the road.","","Es una verdadera lástima. Pero ya me temía que algo así pudiera llegar a pasar. Afortunadamente, hemos podido liberar algunos hombres de otras obligaciones y están disponibles para ir a trabajar a la plantación. Te ruego que los acompañes hasta la plantación para reemplazar a los que se perdieron por el camino.","","","","É uma pena, mas eu entendo que coisas assim acontecem. Por sorte, temos um pessoal novo que está disponível agora. Por favor leve-os até a plantação para substituírem os que morreram no caminho.","Es sit eine Schande, aber ich verstehe, dass so etwas passieren kann. Zum Glück habe ich jetzt wieder ein paar neue Leute verfügbar. Bitte bring sie zur Plantage, um die Verstorbenen zu ersetzen.","","Ce păcat, dar înțeleg că lucrurile astea, se mai întâmplă. Din fericire, niște oameni noi, au devenit recent, disponibili. Te rog să-i duci pe plantație, pentru a-i înlocui pe cei care au murit pe drum."
         ,"Szkoda, ale rozumiem, że rzeczy tego rodzaju się zdarzają. Na szczęście, jacyś nowi ludzi stali się ostatnio dostępni. Proszę zabierz ich na plantację, aby zastąpili tych, którzy zginęli na drodze.","","Het is jammer, maar ik begrijp dat dit soort dingen gebeurt. Gelukkig zijn er recent wat nieuwe mensen beschikbaar gekomen. Neem ze alsjeblieft mee naar de plantage om hen te vervangen die onderweg gestorven zijn.","","Malangnya, tapi saya faham bahawa perkara-perkara macam ini boleh berlaku. Mujurnya terdapat beberapa orang baru yang boleh diupah. Sila bawa mereka ke perladangan untuk mengganti yang telah mati dalam perjalanan.","","","","真是難堪，但是我預料到這種情形，幸運地，我們最近有新加入的成員。把他們帶到種植場去填補那些陣亡的弟兄。","","Είναι κρίμα αλλά καταλαβαίνω ότι τέτοια πράγματα συμβαίνουν. Ευτυχώς είναι διαθέσιμο καινούργιο προσωπικό, Σε παρακαλώ να τους πας στη φυτεία για να αντικαταστήσουν αυτούς που πέθαναν στη διαδρομή.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5335":["","OK. I will do it now. See you later. [leave]","","De acuerdo. Lo haré. Hasta la vista. [marcharse]","","","","OK. Eu farei isso agora. Até mais tarde. [sair]","Ok, das mache ich. Tschüss. [gehen]","","OK. O voi face. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Zrobię to teraz. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","OK. Ik zal het nu doen. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya akan melakukannya sekarang. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。我馬上進行。再見了。[離開]","","ΟΚ. Θα το κάνω τώρα. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5336":["","I\'m really sorry, but I\'ve had more problems escorting your people. There were more deaths.","","De verdad que lo siento, pero de nuevo han surgido problemas mientras escoltaba a tu gente hasta la plantación. No hemos podido evitar sufrir alguna baja.","","","","Eu sinto muito mesmo, mas eu tive mais problemas escoltando suas pessoas. Houveram mais mortes.","Es tut mir sehr leid, aber ich hatte doch mehr Probleme beim Eskort Deiner Leute als erwartet. Es gab mehr Tote.","","Îmi pare foarte rău, dar am avut probleme însoțindu-ți oamenii. Au fost mai multe decese.","Jest mi naprawdę przykro, ale <miałem/miałam> więcej problemów eskortując twoich ludzi. Było więcej śmierci.","","Het spijt me echt, maar ik heb meer problemen gehad met het escorteren van je mensen. Er waren meer doden.","","Saya minta maaf, tapi saya telah menghadapi masalah ketika mengiringi orang kamu. Berlaku lagi kematian.","","","","真的很抱歉，但是我護送你的人的時候出了一些問題。又死了。","","Λυπάμαι ειλικρινά αλλά είχα κι άλλα προβλήματα συνοδεύοντας τους ανθρώπους σου. Υπήρξαν κι άλλοι θάνατοι."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5337":["","Hmm... It\'s not good... We really needed a larger plantation. I guess there\'s nothing we can do about it right now, but to work with what we have.","","Hmmm... Vaya, eso supone un serio contratiempo... Necesitábamos que fuera una plantación verdaderamente grande. En fin, supongo que tendremos que apañarnos con lo que tenemos. Ahora mismo no hay nada más que podamos hacer.","","","","Hmm... Isso não é bom... Nós realmente precisávamos de uma plantação maior. Acho que não há nada que possamos fazer agora além de trabalhar com o que temos.","Hmmm... das ist nicht gut... Wir brauchen wirklich eine große Plantage. Ich schätze, es gibt nichts, was wir jetzt daran ändern können, außer mit denen zu arbeiten, die wir noch haben.","","Hmm ... Nu e bine ... Chiar avem nevoie de-o plantație mare. Cred că nu-i nimic ce-am putea face acum, decât să lucrăm cu ceea ce avem.","Hmm... Nie jest dobrze... Naprawdę potrzebowaliśmy większej plantacji. Zgaduję, że nie ma nic, co możemy z tym teraz zrobić, oprócz pracy z tym co mamy."
         ,"","Hmm... Dat is niet goed... We hadden echt een grotere plantage nodig. Ik denk dat we er niets aan kunnen nu, dan werken met wat we hebben.","","Hmm... Ia tidak baik... Kita betul-betul memerlukan perladangan yang lebih besar. Saya rasa tiada apa yang kita boleh buat tentangnya sekarang, tapi untuk bekerja dengan apa yang kita ada sekarang.","","","","恩... 這下不好... 我們真的需要一個很大的種植區域。但我猜現在我們沒辦法再做些甚麼了，只好靠著現有的人進行。","","Χ... δεν είναι καλό... Πραγματικά χρειαζόμασταν μεγαλύτερη φυτεία. Υποθέτω ότι δεν υπάρχει τίποτε να κάνουμε τώρα εκτός από το να δουλέψουμε με αυτούς που έχουμε.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5338":["","Sorry for failing you.","","Siento haberos fallado.","","","","Me desculpe por falhar com você.","Entschuldige bitte mein Versagen.","","Îmi pare rău că te-am dezamăgit.","Przepraszam, że cię <zawiodłem/zawiodłam>.","","Sorry dat ik gefaald heb.","","Minta maaf atas kegagalan saya.","","","","抱歉讓你失望了。","","Λυπάμαι που σε απογοήτευσα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5339":["","Don\'t worry. To err is human. Go rest a bit. We\'ll give you another mission later. I\'m sure that you\'ll do better next time.","","No te preocupes. Errar es humano. Ve a descansar. Te daré nuevas instrucciones para tu siguiente misión más adelante. Estoy seguro de que tendrás más éxito la próxima vez.","","","","Não se preocupe. Errar é humano. Vá descansar um pouco, nós lhe daremos outra missão mais tarde. Eu tenho certeza que você vai se sair melhor na próxima.","Keine Sorgen. Fehler sind menschlich. Ruh dich erstmal aus. Wir haben später noch eine Mission für dich. Ich bin sicher, dass du es nächstes Mal besser machst.","","Nu-ți face griji. A greși e omenește. Du-te și odihnește-te. Îți vom da o altă misiune mai târziu. Sunt sigur că o vei face mai bine data viitoare.","Nie martw się. Błądzenie jest ludzkie. Idź odpocznij trochę. Damy ci kolejną misję później. Jestem pewien, że uda ci się lepiej następnym razem.","","Maak je geen zorgen. FOuten maken is menselijk. Ga wat rusten. We zullen je later een andere missie geven. Ik weet zeker dat je het de volgende keer beter zal doen."
         ,"","Jangan risau. Kita adalah manusia; melakukan kesilapan adalah biasa. Pergi rehat dulu. Kami akan beri kamu misi yang lain nanti. Saya pasti bahawa kamu akan melaksanakannya dengan baik.","","","","別擔心。人總是會犯錯的。去休息一會兒。我們會給你其他的任務。我相信你會做得更好。","","Μην ανησυχείς. Τα λάθη είναι ανθρώπινα. Πήγαινε ξεκουράσου λίγο. Θα σου δώσουμε άλλη αποστολή αργότερα. Είμαι σίγουρος θα πας καλύτερα την επόμενη φορά.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5340":["","OK. I\'ll see you later then. [leave]","","De acuerdo. Nos vemos después. [marcharse]","","","","OK. Eu te vejo mais tarde então. [sair]","Ok. Dann bis später. [gehen]","","OK. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Zobaczę cię więc później. [odejdź]","","OK. Ik zie je later dan. [vertrekken]","","OK. Kalau begitu saya akan berjumpa dengan kamu nanti. [Tinggal]","","","","好。那麼等一會兒見。[離開]","","ΟΚ. Θα σε δω αργότερα λοιπόν. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5341":["","All workers arrived to their destination.","","Todos los trabajadores han llegado a su destino.","","","","Todos os trabalhadores chegaram ao seu destino.","Alle Arbeiter sind an ihrem Bestimmungsort angelangt.","","Toți lucrătorii au ajuns la destinație.","Wszyscy pracownicy dotarli do celu przeznaczenia.","","Alle werkers zijn op hun bestemming gearriveerd.","","Semua pekerja telah sampai ke destinasi mereka.","","","","全部的工人都抵達目的地了。","","Όλοι οι εργαζόμενοι έφτασαν στον προορισμό τους.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5342":["","Great! Thanks for the excellent job!","","¡Genial! ¡Un trabajo excelente! ¡Muchas gracias!","","","","Ótimo! Obrigado pelo excelente trabalho!","Super! Danke für die exzellente Arbeit!","","Grozav! Mulțumesc pentru treaba excelentă pe care ai făcut-o!","Bosko! Dzięki za wyśmienitą robotę!","","Geweldig! Dank je voor het exellente werk.","","Hebat! Terima kasih atas kerja baik kamu!","","","","太好了！你做的事讓人欽佩！","","Ωραία! Σ\' ευχαριστώ για την άψογη δουλειά,","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5343":["","It\'s my pleasure.","","Ha sido un placer.","","","","É um prazer.","Es ist mir ein Vergnügen!","","Plăcerea a fost de partea mea.","To była przyjemność.","","Het was me een genoegen.","","Sama-sama.","","","","那是我的榮幸。","","Ευχαρίστησή μου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Ha estat un plaer.","",""],
         "5344":["","We also solved the cannabis ban problem. The government refused to lift the ban in Ozbet, but they did in Toowoomba and we have already put up a small textile factory there. With the supplies from our own plantation and from Murray Hill we\'ll soon be able to produce textile without depending on Workforce Merchants... Besides, Toowoomba suddenly became a place worth spending a weekend at. [winks]","","También hemos podido resolver el problema de la prohibición. Aunque el Gobierno ha rechazado retirar la prohibición del cannabis en Ozbet, sí que han aceptado su legalización en Toowoomba y ya hemos podido instalar una pequeña factoría textil allí. Con el cáñamo que nos proporcionará nuestra plantación, sumado a la producción de Colina Murray, pronto seremos capaces de producir tejidos sin depender del algodón de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra... Además, de paso, Toowoomba se ha convertido, de repente, en un buen lugar en el que pasar el fin de semana. [te guiña un ojo]","",""
         ,"","Nós também resolvemos o problema com a proibição da maconha. O governo se recusou a suspender a proibição em Ozbet, mas suspenderam em Toowoomba e nós já abrimos uma pequena fábrica têxtil lá. Com o fornecimento da nossa plantação e da Colina Murray, em breve nós poderemos produzir tecido sem depender dos Comerciantes de Mão de Obra... Além disso, Toowoomba se tornou um lugar que vale a pena ir passar o fim de semana. [piscada de olho]","Wir haben   auch das Problem mit dem Cannabisverbot gelöst. Die Regierung hat zwar die Aufhebung des Verbots in Ozbet abgelehnt, aber dafür in Towoomba gestattet. Dort haben wir schon eine kleine Textilfabrik aufgebaut. Mit den Lieferungen von   unserer eigenen Plantage und aus Murray Hill werden wir bald in der Lage sein Stoffe herzustellen und sind da nicht mehr von den Arbeitskraft-Händlern abhängig... Nebenbei, Towoomba ist plötzlich auch zu einem Ort geworden, an dem es sich lohnt mal ein Wochenende zu verbringen. [zwinker]","","Am rezolvat și problema interdicției de canabis. Guvernul a refuzat să ridice interdicția în Ozbet, dar a făcut-o în Toowoomba și am implementat deja o mică fabrică de textile acolo. Cu livrările din propria noastră plantație și din Murray Hill, vom putea în curând să producem textile fără a depinde de Comercianții Forței de Muncă ... În plus, Toowoomba a devenit brusc un loc frumos pentru a petrece un week-end. [face cu ochiul]"
         ,"Rozwiązaliśmy również problem banu marihuanowego. Rząd odmówił zniesienia banu w Ozbet, ale dokonali tego w Towoombie i postawiliśmy już tam małą fabryczkę tekstylną. Z zapasami z naszej własnej plantacji oraz Murray Hill, będziemy wkrótce w stanie produkować tkaniny bez zależenia od Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą... Poza tym, Toowoomba nagle stała się miejscem, gdzie warto spędzić weekend. [mruga]","","We hebben ook het cannabisverbod probleem opgelost. De regering weigerde om de ban op te heffen in Ozbet, maar ze hebben het gedaan in Toowoomba en we hebben al een kleine textielfabriek opgezet daar. Met de voorraden van onze eigen plantage en van Murray Hill zullen we snel in staat zijn textiel te produceren zonder afhankelijk te zijn van Werkkracht Handelaren... Daarnaast werd Toowoomba opeens een plek die het waard is het weekend door te brengen. [knipoogt]","","Kami juga telah menyelesaikan masalah kanabis. Kerajaan tidak mahu menarik balik sekatan di Ozbet, tapi mereka telah membuat demikian di Toowoomba dan kami telah mendirikan satu kilang tekstil di sana. Dengan bekalan-bekalan dari perladangan kami dan dari Murray Hill kami akan dapat menghasilkan tekstil tanpa bergantung kepada Workforce Merchants tidak lama lagi... Di samping itu, Toowoomba tiba-tiba telah jadi satu tempat yang baik untuk meluangkan masa hujung minggu kamu. [Mengenyit]"
         ,"","","","我們已經解決種植大麻禁令的問題了。政府反對在歐茲別區域解禁，但是可以在圖翁巴開放，因此我們已經在那裏開設了一個布料廠。只要從我們默里山種植場來的補給抵達，就可以開始製作布料，不需依賴商賈公會的原料... 更好的是，圖翁巴鎮突然轉型為值得在旅途中停留的城鎮了。[眨眼]","","Επίσης λύσαμε το πρόβλημα του περιορισμού των κανιβάλων. Η κυβέρνηση αρνήθηκε να άρει τους περιορισμούς στην Obzet, αλλά το έκανε στην Towoomba και ήδη τοποθετήσαμε εκεί ένα μικρό εργοστάσιο υφασμάτων. Με την πρώτη ύλη από τη φυτεία μας και από το Murray Hill σύντομα θα παράγουμε ύφασμα χωρίς να εξαρτόμαστε από τους Εμπόρους Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας. Εξάλλου η Towoomba ξαφνικά έγινε μέρος που αξίζει να περάσεις ένα Σαββατοκύριακο.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5345":["","I\'m glad that I could help.","","Me alegra haber sido de ayuda.","","","","Eu fico feliz por ter ajudado.","Ich freue mich, dass ich helfen konnte.","","Mă bucur că am putut ajuta.","Cieszę się, że <mogłem/mogłam> pomóc.","","Ik ben blij dat ik kon helpen.","","Saya gembira kerana dapat tolong.","","","","很高興我幫得上忙。","","Ευχαρίστησή μου που βοήθησα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5346":["","I hope you will keep working for us.","","Espero que sigas trabajando para nosotros.","","","","Eu espero que você continue trabalhando para nós.","Ich hoffe, Du wirst weiterhin für uns arbeiten.","","Sper că vei continua să lucrezi pentru noi.","Mam nadzieję, że wciąż będziesz dla nas <pracował/pracowała>.","","Ik hoop dat je voor ons blijft werken.","","Saya harap bahawa kamu akan terus bekerja untuk kami.","","","","我希望你能繼續幫我們做事。","","Ελπίζω να συνεχίσεις να δουλεύεις για μας.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5347":["","I will.","","Yo también lo espero.","","","","Eu vou.","Werde ich.","","Sigur că da.","Będę.","","Dat zal ik doen.","","Saya akan.","","","","當然。","","Θα το κάνω.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Jo també.","",""],
         "5348":["","Excellent. Come back here whenever you like and we\'ll give you more work.","","Perfecto, entonces. Vuelve cuando quieras y te asignaré una nueva misión.","","","","Excelente. Volte aqui quando quiser e te daremos mais trabalho.","Perfekt. Komm zurück, wann immer du möchtest und wir geben dir noch mehr Arbeit.","","Excelent. Vino înapoi, ori de câte ori dorești și-ți vom da mai mult de lucru.","Wyśmienicie. Wróć tu, kiedykolwiek będziesz <chciał/chciała>, a damy ci więcej pracy.","","Fantastisch. Kom terug wanneer je wil en we zullen je meer werk geven.","","Hebat. Balik ke sini bila-bila saja dan kami akan beri kamu lebih kerja.","","","","太好了。甚麼時候再回來這裡，我就派給你更多任務。","","Άψογα. Έλα όποτε θέλεις και θα σου δώσουμε περισσότερη δουλειά.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5349":["","Will do. See you later. [leave]","","Lo haré. Hasta pronto. [marcharse]","","","","Farei isso. Até mais. [sair]","Das werde ich. Tschüss. [gehen]","","Bine. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Tak zrobię. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Dat zal ik doen. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Saya akan. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","會的。再見。[離開]","","Θα το κάνω. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Ho faré. Fins aviat. [marxar]","",""],
         "5350":["","Let\'s see. You\'ve done a really great job expelling Workforce Merchants from Alkubra, but since then some new problems appeared there. The church, that is basically the most influential institution there, is unhappy. They start saying that Workforce Merchants would have solved it, that it was better with them and bla bla bla... You probably know that our organization is not exactly the best friend of the church, but these talks are very dangerous and we need to do our best to make them stop. That\'s why we are asking you to go back to Alkubra and help the church with one of their problems.","","Vamos a ver. Hiciste un excelente trabajo al terminar con las actividades de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra en la región de Alkubra. Sin embargo, por lo visto, desde entonces han surgido algunos problemas en la región. La Iglesia, que como sabes es la institución más influyente en la zona, está descontenta. Están empezando a decir que les iba mejor con los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra, que ellos habrían resuelto el problema, y que si bla, bla, bla... Como habrás imaginado, nuestra organización no es precisamente santo de devoción de la Iglesia, nunca mejor dicho, pero lo cierto es que ese tipo de rumores son realmente peligrosos y tenemos que hacer todo lo que esté en nuestras manos para acallarlos. Por eso mismo, queremos que vuelvas a Alkubra y ayudes a la Iglesia a resolver esos problemas."
         ,"","","","Vamos ver. Você fez um ótimo trabalho expulsando os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra de Alkubra, mas desde então apareceram alguns problemas novos lá. A igreja, que é basicamente a mais influente instituição lá, está insatisfeita. Eles começaram a dizer que os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra teriam solucionado isso, que seria melhor com eles e blá blá blá... Você possivelmente sabe que nossa organização não é exatamente a melhor amiga da igreja, mas essas conversas são muito perigosas e nós precisamos fazer o nosso melhor para fazê-los parar. Esse é o porquê de estarmos pedindo para você voltar a Alkubra e ajudar a igreja com um de seus problemas.","Na sieh mal an. Du hast sehr gute Arbeit geleistet, als du die Arbeitskraft-Händler aus Alkubra vertrieben hast, aber seitdem sind dort wieder neue Probleme aufgetaucht. Die Kirche, die dort im wesentlichen die einflussreichste Einrichtung ist, ist unzufrieden. Sie fangen an zu erzählen, dass die Arbeitskraft-Händler diese Sachen schon längst geklärt hätten und dass es besser war als sie noch dort waren und soweiter... Du weißt wahrscheinlich, dass unsere Organisation nicht die besten Freunde der Kirche sind, aber diese Reden sind sehr gefährlich und wir müssen ihre Ausbreitung so gut wie möglich stoppen. Darum bitte ich dich, dass du zurück nach Alkubra gehst und der Kirche bei der Beseitigung von einem Problem hilfst."
         ,"","Stai să vedem. Ai făcut o treabă minunată expulzând CFM-ul din Alkubra, dar de atunci, au apărut acolo niște probleme. Biserica, instituția cea mai influentă de acolo, este nemulțumită. Vor începe să spună cum că CFM le-ar fi rezolvat, că era mai bine cu ei ș.a.m.d.... Probabil știi că organizația noastră nu este chiar cea mai prietenoasă cu biserica, dar aceste discuții sunt foarte periculoase și trebuie să facem tot posibilul să le oprim. De aceea îți cerem să te întorci în Alkubra și să ajuți biserica cu una din problemele lor.","Zobaczmy. <Wykonałeś/Wykonałaś> naprawdę inspirującą robotę, wypędzając Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą z Alkubry, ale od tamtej pory nowe problemy się tam pojawiły. Kościół, który jest tam zasadniczo najbardziej wpływową instytucją, jest nieszczęśliwy. Zaczynają mówić, że Handlarze Siłą Roboczą by to rozwiązali, że było lepiej z nimi i bla bla bla... Zapewne wiesz, że nasza organizacja nie jest dokładnie najlepszym przyjacielem kościoła, ale takie gadanie jest bardzo niebezpieczne i potrzebujemy zrobić co w naszej mocy, aby je powstrzymać. Dlatego prosimy cię, byś <udał/udała> się z powrotem do Alkubry i <pomógł/pomogła> im z jednym z ich problemów."
         ,"","Eens kijken. Je hebt heel goed werk gedaan de Werkkracht Handelaren ui Alkubra te bannen, maar sindsdien zijn er nieuwe problemen verschenen daar. De kerk, dat is in principe het meest invloedrijke instituut daar, is niet gelukkig. Ze beginnen te zeggen dat de Werkkracht Handelaren het opgelost zouden hebben, dat het met hen beter was en bla bla bla... Je weet waarschijnlijk dat onze organisatie niet precies de beste vriend is van de kerk, maar die praatjes zijn erg gevaarlijk en we moeten onze best doen ze te stoppen. Daarom vragen we je om terug te gaan naar Alkubra en de kerk te helpen met een van hun problemen.","","Hmm. Kamu telah melakukan kerja yang hebat mengusir Workforce Merchants dari Alkubra, tapi sejak itu masalah-masalah yang baru telah muncul di situ. Gereja, yang pada asasnya adalah institusi yang paling berpengaruh di situ, tak gembira. Mereka kata bahawa Workforce Merchants akan menyelesaikannya, bahawa ia lebih baik dengan mereka dan bla bla bla... Kamu kemungkinan tahu bahawa organisasi kami bukan sahabat terbaik gereja, tapi kata-kata ini adalah sangat berbahaya dan kita akan perlu berusaha untuk menghentikan mereka. Itulah sebab kami minta kamu untuk balik ke Alkubra dan menolong gereja itu dengan salah satu masalah mereka."
         ,"","","","聽著，你之前已經把商賈公會成功地逐出阿庫布拉區域，但是那裡出現了一些新問題。教會，也就是那個區域主要的影響力，有些不高興。他們又希望找商賈公會來解決問題。說跟他們做事情比較好諸如此類的... 你可能已經知道我們的組織並非教會的好朋友，所以我們必須盡力阻止他們又走向商賈公會。這是為什麼我們希望你回去阿庫布拉區域幫助教會解決問題的原因。","","Για να δούμε. Έκανες πραγματικά καλή δουλειά πετώντας έξω από την Alkubra τους εμπόρους Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας, αλλά από τότε εμφανίστηκαν κάμποσα νέα προβλήματα εδώ. Η εκκλησία, αυτή είναι βασικά η οργάνωση με την περισσότερη επιρροή εκεί, είναι δυσαρεστημένη. Αρχίσαν να λένε ότι οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας θα το είχαν λύσει και ότι ήταν καλύτερα μαζί τους και διάφορα άλλα. Προφανώς γνωρίζεις ότι η οργάνωσή μας και η εκκλησία δεν είναι ακριβώς οι καλύτεροι φίλοι, αλλά αυτές οι κουβέντες είναι επικίνδυνες και πρέπει να βάλουμε τα δυνατά μας να τις σταματήσουμε. Γιαυτό σου ζητάω να πας πίσω στην Alkubra και να βοηθήσεις την Εκκλησία με ένα από τα προβλήματά της.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5351":["","What exactly is the problem?","","¿Problemas? ¿A qué problemas nos estamos refiriendo exactamente?","","","","Qual é exatamente o problema?","Wo genau liegt das Problem?","","Care anume este problema?","Co dokładnie jest problemem?","","Wat is precies het probleem?","","Apakah masalah sebenarnya?","","","","精確來講是甚麼問題？","","Ποιο ακριβώς είναι το πρόβλημα;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5352":["","There\'s a religious community called Confusion in the south-west of Alkubra. Their people started disappearing not long ago. Apparently they saw some mysterious people around and they are all very scared. If you speak with a man called Jacob Fulier who\'s in charge of the place, he will give you more details.","","Existe una comunidad religiosa llamada Confusión al sudoeste de Alkubra. Por lo visto, varios de sus miembros han desaparecido recientemente. Según cuentan, han detectado la presencia de alguna especie de tribu misteriosa por los alrededores y están realmente asustados. Si hablas con un tal Jacob Fulier, que dirige el lugar, él te dará más detalles.","","","","Há uma comunidade religiosa chamada Confusão no sudeste de Alkubra. Suas pessoas começaram a desaparecer há pouco tempo. Aparentemente eles veem algumas pessoas misteriosas ao redor e estão bem assustados. Se você falar com um homem chamado Jacob Fulier, que está encarregado do lugar, ele lhe dará mais detalhes."
         ,"Da gibt es eine religiöse Gemeinde namens Confusion, die im Südwesten Alkubras liegt. Es ist nicht lange her, dass ihre Leute begannen zu verschwinden. Anscheinend haben sie einige mysteriöse Personen in ihrer näheren Umgebung gesehen, jedenfalls sind sie alle ziemlich verängstigt. Wenn Du mit einem Mann mit dem Namen Jacob Fuller, der dort das Sagen hat, redest, wird er Dir mehr Details geben.","","Există o comunitate religioasă numită Confuzie în partea de sud-vest a Alkubrei. Nu cu mult timp în urmă, oamenii lor au început să dispară. Se pare că au văzut niște oameni misterioși în preajmă și sunt foarte speriați. Vorbește cu un om pe nume Jacob Fulier, șeful comunității, îți va da mai multe detalii.","Jest religijna społeczność zwana Dezorientacja na południowym zachodzie Alkubry. Jej ludzie zaczęli znikać niezbyt dawno temu. Podobno widzieli jakiś tajemniczych ludzi wokół i wszyscy oni są bardzo przerażeni. Jeśli porozmawiasz z człowiekiem zwanym Jacob Fuller, który szefuje temu miejscu, to da tobie więcej szczegółów."
         ,"","Het is een religieuze gemeenschap genaamd Verwarring in het zuidwesten van Alkubra. Hun mensen begonnen niet zo lang geleden te verdwijnen. Schijnbaar hebben ze wat misterieuze mensen gezien en ze zijn allemaal erg bang. Als je met een man genaamd Jacob Fulier spreekt, zal hij je meer details geven.","","Terdapat satu komuniti yang beragama yang dipanggil Confusion di arah barat daya dari Alkubra. Orang mereka bermula hilang tidak lama dahulu. Didapati bahawa mereka telah nampak orang-orang yang pelik di sekeliling dan mereka semua sangat takut. Kalau kamu bercakap dengan seseorang lelaki yang bernama Jacob Fulier yang mengetuai kawasan tersebut, dia akan beri kamu lebih info.","","","","在阿庫布拉區域的西南有一個宗教團體殖民地自稱叫渾沌鎮。他們的居民不久之前開始失蹤。顯然他們在附近目擊到一些神秘的民族，他們被嚇壞了。去那邊見一個叫做雅各布‧富勒的人，他會給你更多資訊。","","Υπάρχει μία θρησκευτική κοινότητα που ονομάζεται Confusion στα νοτιοδυτικά της Alkubra. Οι άνθρωποί της άρχισαν να εξαφανίζονται πριν από λίγο καιρό. Φαίνεται ότι είδαν κάποιους μυστηριώδεις ανθρώπους τριγύρω και είναι όλοι πολύ φοβισμένοι. Αν μιλήσεις με τον υπεύθυνο του μέρους, κάποιον Jacob Fulier, θα σου δώσει περισσότερες λεπτομέρειες."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
