         "5359":["","Hi, I\'m here to solve the problem with the disappearing people.","","Hola. He venido a ayudaros a resolver el problema de las desapariciones.","","","","Olá, eu estou aqui para resolver o problema com as pessoas desaparecidas.","Hallo, ich bin hier um das Problem mit den verschwundenen Leuten zu klären.","","Salut, sunt aici pentru a rezolva problema cu oamenii care dispar.","Cześć, jestem tu rozwiązać problem ze znikającymi ludźmi.","","Hoi. Ik ben hier om het probleem van de verdwijnende mensen op te lossen.","","Hi, saya di sini untuk menyelesaikan masalah kehilangan orang.","","","","嗨！我到這裡來解決失蹤人口的問題。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5360":["","I\'ve been sent here to help you with your missing people problem.","","Me envían para ayudaros a resolver el problema de las desapariciones.","","","","Eu fui mandado aqui para resolver o seu problema com as pessoas desaparecidas.","Ich wurde hierher geschickt, um dir bei dem Problem mit den verschwundenen Leuten zu helfen.","","Am fost trimis aici pentru a vă ajuta cu problema oamenilor dispăruți.","<Zostałem/Zostałam> tu <przysłany/przesłana>, aby pomóc wam z waszym problemem zaginionych ludzi.","","Ik ben hier naartoe gestuurd om je te helpen met je probleem van de vermiste mensen.","","Saya telah dihantar ke sini untuk tolong kamu dengan masalah kehilangan orang kamu.","","","","我被派到這裡來幫你解決你的失蹤人口的問題。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5361":["","Who sent you?","","¿Ah, sí? ¿Quién te envía?","","","","Quem mandou você?","Wer hat dich geschickt?","","Cine te-a trimis?","Kto cię przysłał?","","Wie heeft je gestuurd?","","Siapa yang telah hantar kamu?","","","","誰派你來的？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5362":["","The Liberation Army.","","El Ejército de Liberación.","","","","O Exército da Libertação.","Die Befreiungsarmee.","","Armata Eliberării.","Armia Wyzwolenia.","","Het Bevrijdingsleger.","","Liberation Army.","","","","就是自由武裝。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5363":["","I prefer not to tell.","","Prefiero no decírtelo.","","","","Eu prefiro não falar.","Das sage ich lieber nicht.","","Prefer să nu spun.","Wole nie powiedzieć.","","Ik geef er de voorkeur aan dat niet te vertellen.","","Saya lebih suka kalau tak beritahu.","","","","我希望不說。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5364":["","Well. As long as you help, it doesn\'t really matter.","","De acuerdo. Mientras vengas a ayudar, eso no importa.","","","","Bem. Contanto que você ajude, isso não importa.","Nagut, solange du uns hilfst, ist es ja egal.","","Bine. Atâta timp cât ne ajuți, nu contează cu adevărat.","No. Tak długo jak nam pomagasz, to właściwie nie ma znaczenia.","","Wel. Zolang je ons helpt, maakt het niet echt uit.","","Mmm. Asalkan kamu menolong kami, ia tidak penting.","","","","這個嘛。既然你幫了忙，那其實並不重要。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5365":["","Can you explain me what the problem is?","","¿Puedes explicarme cuál es el problema?","","","","Você pode me explicar qual é o problema?","Kannst du mir erklären, um was es bei dem Problem geht?","","Poți să-mi explici care este problema?","Czy możesz mi wytłumaczyć czym jest problem?","","Kun je me uitleggen wat het probleem is?","","Bolehkah kamu menjelaskan kepada saya apa masalahnya?","","","","你能對我解釋問題在哪裡嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5366":["","How ironic. I thought they were against the church.","","¡Vaya! ¡Qué ironía! Pensaba que estaban en contra de la Iglesia.","","","","Que irônico. Eu achava que eles eram contra a igreja.","Wie paradox. Ich dachte, sie wären gegen die Kirche.","","Cât de ironic. Am crezut că sunt împotriva bisericii.","Jak ironicznie. Sądziłem, że są przeciwko kościołowi.","","Hoe ironisch. Ik dacht dat ze tegen de kerk waren.","","Agak ironic. Saya ingat bahawa mereka menentang gereja.","","","","真諷刺，我以為他們站在對抗教堂的那一邊。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5367":["","And they are, but they are interested in keeping you happy.","","Y lo están. Pero les interesa teneros contentos.","","","","E eles são, mas estão interessados em mantê-los felizes.","Und dass sind sie auch noch, aber sie sind daran interessiert, dass du glücklich bist.","","Da, dar sunt interesați de fericirea voastră.","I są, ale są zainteresowani utrzymaniem cię szczęśliwym.","","En dat zijn ze, maar ze zijn er in geïntresseerd om jullie gelukkig te houden.","","Mereka memang menentang, tapi mereka berminat dalam memastikan kegembiraan kamu.","","","","他們是這樣沒錯。但是他們也想取悅你。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5368":["","I see... The truth is that I actually like these guys. I even used to help them once or twice when I was younger. I\'d be happy if they helped us resolve the problem, but you know what, don\'t tell the High Priest about it, Kay? I\'ll tell him myself, in a delicate way.","","Ya veo... Lo cierto es que me cae bien esa gente. Incluso les presté ayuda un par de veces durante mi juventud. Estoy encantado que sean ellos los que nos ayuden a resolver este asunto. Pero, sabes qué, es mejor que el Sumo Sacerdote no lo sepa. Ya me encargaré yo de decírselo de una manera delicada, ya me entiendes.","","","","Entendo... A verdade é que eu gosto deles. Eu até os ajudei uma ou duas vezes quando era mais jovem. Eu ficaria feliz se eles nos ajudassem a resolver o problema, mas sabe o que, não fale nada ao Sumo Sacerdote sobre isso, pode ser? Eu vou contar a ele, de uma maneira delicada.","Aha... Die Wahrheit ist, dass ich diese Typen eigentlich mag. Ich habe ihnen sogar ein oder zweimal geholfen, als ich jünger war. Ich würde mich freuen, wenn sie bei der Lösung dieses Problems helfen. Aber bitte erzähl dem Hohen Priester nichts davon, ja? Ich werde es ihm selber auf eine feinfühlige Art sagen."
         ,"","Înțeleg... Adevărul este că îmi plac tipii ăștia. Chiar i-am ajutat o dată, sau de două ori, când eram mai tânăr. Aș fi fericit dacă ne-ar ajuta să rezolvăm problema, dar știi ce, nu-i spune Marelui Preot despre asta, bine? O să-i spun eu, într-un mod mai delicat.","Rozumiem... Prawda jest taka, że właściwie lubię tych gości. Nawet zwykłem im pomagać raz czy dwa, kiedy byłem młodszy. Byłbym szczęśliwy, gdyby pomogli nam rozwiązać problem, ale wiesz co, nie mów o tym Wysokiemu Kapłanowi, kej? Sam mu powiem, w delikatny sposób.","","Ik snap het... De waarheid is dat ik die kerels eigenljk wel mag. Ik heb ze zelfs wel eens geholpen toen ik jonger was. Ik zou blij zijn als ze ons hielpen om het probleem op te lossen, maar weet je wat, vertel het niet aan de hogepriester, OK? Ik zal het hem zelf vertellen op een delicate manier.","","Ah... Kebenarannya adalah bahawa saya sebenarnya suka mereka. Saya juga pernah tolong mereka sekali atau dua semasa saya masih muda. Saya akan gembira kalau mereka tolong kami menyelesaikan masalah ini, tapi tahu apa, jangan beritahu Imam Besar tentangnya, Kay? Saya akan beritahu dia, dalam cara yang halus."
         ,"","","","我了解了... 事實是我其實蠻喜歡他們的。我年輕時甚至曾經幫助他們一兩次。假如他們幫我解決問題，我會很高興，但是你知道的，不要告訴最高祭司這件事，好嗎？我會自行對他報告，用一種有技巧的方法。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5369":["","Why? He doesn\'t like the Army?","","¿Qué pasa? ¿Es que acaso tiene él algo en contra del Ejército de Liberación?","","","","Por quê? Ele não gosta do Exército?","Warum? Mag er die Armee nicht?","","De ce? Nu-i place Armata?","Dlaczego? Nie lubi Armii?","","Waarom? Houdt hij niet van het Leger?","","Kenapa? Dia tak suka mereka?","","","","為什麼？你為什麼喜歡這支部隊？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5370":["","Not really, but if you succeed in helping us, I\'ll make sure that his opinion about you improves.","","Digamos que no son santo de su devoción. Pero si nos ayudáis a resolver este asunto, estoy seguro que su opinión acerca de ellos cambiará.","","","","Não muito, mas se você tiver êxito em nos ajudar, eu farei com que a opinião dele sobre você melhore.","Nicht wirklich, aber wenn du erfolgreich bist, kümmere ich mich darum, dass sich sein Meinung über euch verbessert.","","Nu prea, dar dacă ai reuși să ne ajuți, o să mă asigur că opinia sa despre voi se va îmbunătăți.","Nie bardzo, ale jeśli uda ci się nam pomóc, to upewnię się, że jego opinia o was się polepszy.","","Niet echt, maar als je er in slaagt om ons te helpen, zal ik er voor zorgen dat zijn mening over jullie verbetert.","","Bukan begitu, tapi kalau kamu berjaya menolong kami, saya akan pastikan bahawa pandangan dia terhadap kamu bertambah baik.","","","","並沒有，但假如你成功的幫助我們，我確定他對於你的評價會提升。","","","","","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5371":["","That would be great. So, tell me how exactly can I solve this problem.","","Eso estaría bien. Entonces dime, ¿cómo puedo ayudaros exactamente a resolver este asunto?","","","","Isso seria muito bom. Então, me conte como exatamente eu posso resolver esse problema.","Das wäre großartig. Also, sag mir genau, wie ich dieses Problem lösen kann.","","Asta ar fi grozav. Deci, spune-mi, mai exact, cum pot rezolva această problemă.","Byłoby świetnie. Więc, rzeknij mi, jak dokładnie mogę rozwiązać ten problem.","","Dat zou geweldig zijn. Dus, vertel me precies hoe ik dit probleem kan oplossen.","","Bagus kalau begitu. Jadi, beritahu saya bagaimana saya boleh selesaikan masalah ini.","","","","那就太好了。那麼。告訴我精確地該怎麼解決這個問題。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5372":["","I found out what was the problem and solved it.","","Encontré cuál era el problema y pude resolverlo.","","","","Eu descobri qual era o problema e o resolvi.","Ich habe herausgefunden, was das Problem war und es gelöst.","","Am aflat care era problema și am rezolvat-o.","<Odkryłem/Odkryłam> czym był problem i <rozwiązałem/rozwiązałam> go.","","Ik heb ontdekt wat het probleem was en het opgelost.","","Saya telah mendapat tahu masalahnya dan telah menyelesaikannya.","","","","我知道問題在哪裡，而且已經解決了。","","Βρήκα ποιο ήταν το πρόβλημα και το έλυσα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5373":["","But have you told Jacob Fulier about it?","","Ya... ¿Pero Jacob Fulier lo sabe?","","","","Mas você falou com Jacob Fulier sobre isso?","Hast du auch Jacob Fuller davon erzählt?","","Dar i-ai spus lui Jacob Fulier despre asta?","Ale czy <powiedziałeś/powiedziałaś> Jacobowi Fullerowi o tym?","","Maar heb je Jacob Fulier erover verteld?","","Tapi sudahkah kamu beritahu Jacob Fulier tentangnya?","","","","但你是否有跟雅各布‧富勒談過？","","Ναι αλλά ενημέρωσες τον Jacob Fulier γιαυτό;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5374":["","Eh... No.","","Esto... Pues no.","","Eh... Non.","","É... Não.","Ähm... Nein.","","Of... nu.","Ech... Nie.","","Eh... Nee.","","Eh... Belum.","","","","呃... 沒有。","","Εεεε... όχι.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","D\'això... Doncs no.","",""],
         "5375":["","It was the whole point... I\'m afraid that you\'ll need to go back to Confusion and tell him.","","Pero es que ahí está el quid de la cuestión... Me temo que tendrás regresar a Confusión y hacer que él lo sepa.","","","","Essa é a questão... Receio que você precisará voltar para Confusão e contar a ele.","Das war der Grund der ganzen Sache... Ich befürchte, dass du nochmal zurück nach Verwirrung gehen und es ihm sagen musst.","","Asta era ideea ... Mi-e teamă că va trebui să te întorci în Confuzie și să le spui.","Przecież to był cały cel... Obawiam się, że będziesz <potrzebował/potrzebowała> wrócić do Dezorientacji i powiedzieć mu.","","Dat was het hele punt... Ik ben bang dat je terug moet gaan naar Verwarring en het hem vertellen.","","Ia adalah tujuan sebenarnya... Malangnya kamu perlu balik ke Confusion dan beritahu dia.","","","","那是關鍵點... 恐怕你要再回去渾沌鎮跟他談談。","","Αυτό ήταν όλο το θέμα... Φοβάμαι ότι θα χρειαστείς να πας πίσω στην Confusion και να του το πεις.","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5376":["","Damn. Sorry. I\'ll go now. See you. [leave]","","¡Rayos! Lo siento. Voy para allá. Hasta luego. [marcharse]","","Mince. Désolé. Je dois y aller. Au revoir. [quitter]","","Droga. Desculpe. Eu irei agora. Até mais. [sair]","Verdammt, es tut mir Leid. Ich gehe sofort hin. Bis später. [gehen]","","Jaf. Scuze. Mă duc acum. Ne mai vedem. [pleacă]","Szlag. Przepraszam. Pójdę już. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","","Verdraaid. Sorry. Ik ga nu. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","","Sial. Minta maaf. Saya akan pergi sekarang. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","該死。抱歉。我馬上去。再見。[離開]","","Φτού! Συγγνώμη. Φεύγω. Τα λέμε. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5377":["","OK. I solved the problem and Jacob Fulier seemed to be happy about it.","","Muy bien. Ahora sí. He resuelto el problema y Jacob Fulier se mostró plenamente satisfecho por ello.","","","","OK. Eu resolvi o problema e Jacob Fulier pareceu estar contente com isso.","Ok. Ich habe das Problem gelöst und Jacob Fuller schein froh darüber zu sein.","","OK. Am rezolvat problema, iar Jacob Fulier părea să fie mulțumit.","Okej. <Rozwiązałem/Rozwiązałam> problem, a Jacob Fuller wydawał się szczęśliwy z tego powodu.","","OK. Ik heb het probleem opgelost en Jacob Fulier leek er blij mee te zijn.","","OK. Saya telah menyelesaikan masalah itu dan Jacob Fulier nampaknya gembira tentangnya.","","","","好。我解決了問題。而且雅各布‧富勒似乎很滿意。","","ΟΚ. έλυσα το πρόβλημα και ο Jacob Fuller έδειξε χαρούμενος γιαυτό.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5378":["","Excellent. What was it about?","","Excelente... ¿Y cuál era el problema?","","","","Excelente. O que era?","Hervorragend! Um was ging es denn?","","Excelent. Despre ce era vorba?","Wyśmienicie. O co w tym chodziło?","","Geweldig. Wat was er aan de hand?","","Hebat. Apakah masalahnya?","","","","太好了。事情究竟如何？","","Περίφημα! Τι αφορούσε;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5379":["","There were some tribals who had a lot of human meat in their camp. I killed them all.","","Había un poblado de salvajes que tenían grandes cantidades de carne humana. Tuve que matarlos a todos.","","","","Havia alguns tribais com um monte de carne humana em seu acampamento. Eu matei todos.","Dort war so ein Stamm, der haufenweise Menschfleisch in seinem Lager hatte. Ich habe sie alle umgebracht.","","Erau niște triburi, care aveau o mulțime de carne de om în tabăra lor. I-am ucis pe toți.","Było trochę plemieńców, którzy mieli mnóstwo ludzkiego mięsa w swoim obozie. Wszystkich ich <pozabijałem/pozabijałam>.","","Er waren wat stamleden die een hoop mensenvlees in hun kamp hadden. Ik heb ze allemaal gedood.","","Terdapat beberapa puak yang simpan daging manusia yang banyak di kem mereka. Saya telah bunuh mereka semua.","","","","有一些部族，在他們的營地我找到很多人肉。我已經殺光了他們。","","Υπήρχαν μέλη της φυλής που είχαν ένα σωρό ανθρώπινο κρέας στην κατασκήνωσή τους. Τους σκότωσα όλους.","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5380":["","Cannibals?!! Really?!! That\'s where they were hiding! Cannibalism is an old problem in Alkubra. Apart from the tribals that you have killed there\'s a secret society that practices cannibal rituals. Very illustrious people are involved...","","¡¡¿Caníbales?!! ¡¡¿De veras?!! ¡Por eso se escondían! El canibalismo constituye un problema muy arraigado en Alkubra. Según parece, además de esos salvajes que mataste, existe una sociedad secreta que practica rituales de canibalismo. Entre sus miembros se encuentra alguno de los personajes más influyentes de la región...","","Des cannibales ?!! Vraiment ?!! C\'est ici qu\'ils étaient cachés ! Le cannibalisme est un vieux problème en Alkubra. En plus des tribus que vous avez tuées, il y a une société secrète qui pratiquent des rituels cannibales. Des personnes très célèbres sont impliquées...","","Canibais?!! Sério?!! Era isso que estavam escondendo! Canibalismo é um velho problema em Alkubra. Além dos tribais que você matou há uma sociedade secreta que pratica rituais canibalistas. Pessoas muito ilustres estão envolvidas..."
         ,"Kanibalen?!! Wirklich?!! Das war es wo sie sich versteckt haben! Der Kannibalismus ist ein altes Problem von Alkubra. Getrennt von diesem Stamm, den du umgebracht hast, gibt es dort noch eine geheime Gesellschaft, die noch kannibalische Rituale vollziehen. Dort sind auch sehr bekannte Persönlichkeiten beteiligt...","","Canibali?! Serios?! D-aia se ascundeau! Canibalismul este o problemă veche în Alkubra. În afară de tribul pe care l-ai eliminat, există o societate secretă care practică ritualuri canibale. Oameni foarte iluștri sunt implicați...","Kanibale?!! Naprawdę! Tam więc się ukrywali! Kanibalizm jest starym problemem w Alkubrze. Poza plemieńcami, których <zabiłeś/zabiłaś>, jest jeszcze sekretne stowarzyszenie, które praktykuję rytuały kanibalistyczne. Bardzo znakomici ludzie są wmieszani...","","Kannibalen?!! Echt?!! Dus daar verschuilden ze zich. Kannibalisme is een oud probleem in Alkubra. Behalve de stamleden die je gedood hebt is er een geheim genootschap dat kannibalistische rituelen beoefend. Heel illustere mensen zijn erbij betrokken..."
         ,"","Kanibal?!! Benar?!! Itulah lokasi mereka sedang bersembunyi! Kanibalisme adalah masalah yang lama di Alkubra. Selain daripada puak yang kamu telah bunuh, terdapat satu masyarakat berahsia yang mengamalkan ritual-ritual kanibal. Orang-orang yang sangat terkenal terlibat.","","","","食人族？！真的嗎？！那就是他們的藏身處！食人族是一個阿庫布拉區域的老問題了。加上你殺掉的食人族部落，還有一個神秘社團吃人。甚至有鄉里耆老參與其中...","","Κανίβαλοι;!! Αλήθεια;!! Γιαυτό κρύβονταν! Ο κανιβαλισμός είναι παλιό πρόβλημα στην Alkubra. Εκτός από τα μέλη της φυλής που σκότωσες υπάρχει μία μυστική αδελφότητα που ασκεί κανιβαλικές πρακτικές. Εμπλέκονται πολύ διάσημα πρόσωπα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5381":["","Take a look at this paper I found in their camp. Do you think you could read it?","","Échale un vistazo a este documento que encontré en el poblado. ¿Crees que serías capaz de descifrar su contenido?","","","","Dê uma olhada nesse papel que achei no acampamento deles. Você acha que consegue ler isso?","Schau mal auf diesen Zettel, den habe ich in ihrem Lager gefunden. Denkst du, dass du ihn lesen kannst?","","Aruncă o privire pe acest document, pe care l-am găsit în tabăra lor. Crezi că l-ai putea descifra?","Rzuć okiem na tą kartkę, którą <znalazłem/znalazłam> w ich obozie. Jak myślisz, czy potrafiłbyś to przeczytać?","","Kijk eens naar dit papier dat ik in hun kamp gevonden heb. Denk je dat jij het kan lezen?","","Sila tengok kertas ini yang saya telah cari di kem mereka. Adakah kamu rasa kamu boleh membacanya?","","","","看看這張我在他們營地找到的紙。你認為你看得懂嗎？","","Ρίξε μια ματιά σ\'  αυτό το χαρτί που βρήκα στο στρατόπεδό τους. Πιστεύεις ότι μπορείς να το διαβάσεις;","","","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5382":["","Interesting.","","Hmmm... Interesante...","","Interessant","","Interessante.","Interessant.","","Interesant.","Interesujące.","","Interessant.","","Agak menarik.","","","","很有趣的故事。","","Ενδιαφέρον.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Hmmm... Interessant...","",""],
         "5383":["","Well. Thanks for taking care of this mission.","","Perfecto. Gracias por cumplir con la misión.","","Très bien. Merci de vous soucier de cette mission.","","Bem. Obrigado por tomar conta dessa missão.","Gut. Vielen Dank, dass du dich um diese Mission gekümmert hast.","","Bine. Mulțumesc că ai avut grijă de această misiune.","Cóż. Dzięki za załatwienie tej misji.","","Wel. Dank je voor het volbrengen van deze missie.","","Mmm. Terima kasih kerana menguruskan misi ini.","","","","這個嘛。感謝你解決這個任務。","","Λοιπόν. Ευχαριστώ που ανέλαβες την αποστολή.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5384":["","You\'re welcome. See you later. [leave]","","De nada. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","De rien. A plus tard ! [sortir]","","De nada. Te vejo depois. [sair]","Gern geschehen. Bis später. [gehen]","","Cu plăcere. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nie ma za co. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Graag gedaan. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Sama-sama. Jumpa nanti. [Tinggal]","","","","不客氣。再見。[離開]","","Να σαι καλά. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5385":["","Let me see... Oh... yes... This is how cannibals encrypt their writings. I can decrypt it. Just give me a couple of minutes.","","Déjame ver... ¡Oh, sí! Conozco ese código. Es la forma en que los caníbales encriptan sus mensajes. Puedo descifrarlo, pero necesitaré un par de minutos.","","Laissez moi voir ... Oh ... Oui... C\'est comme ça que les cannibales codent leurs messages. Je peux le décoder, laissez moi juste quelques minutes.","","Deixe-me ver... Ah... sim... Essa é a forma com que os canibais codificam seus escritos. Eu posso decodificar isso. Apenas me dê uns dois minutos.","Zeig mal her... Oh... Ja... So verschlüssen die Kannibalen ihre Schriften. Ivh kann es entschlüsseln. Gib mir mal ein paar Minuten dafür.","","Stai să văd... Oh... da... Canibalii își codificau scrierile în felul ăsta. Pot să-l decriptez. Doar dă-mi câteva minute.","Niech zerknę... Och... tak... Tak właśnie kanibale kodują swoje pisma. Mogę ją rozszyfrować. Po prostu daj mi parę minut.","","Laat me eens kijken... Oh... Ja... Dit is hoe de kannibalen hun schrift coderen. Ik kan het ontcijferen. Geef me een paar minuten."
         ,"","Bagi saya tengok... Oh... ya... Inilah cara kanibal menyulitkan tulisan mereka. Saya boleh mendekripsinya. Beri saya beberapa minit.","","","","讓我看看... 噢... 對了... 這已經被食人族加密過了。我可以解密。給我一點時間。","","Άσε με να το δώ... χμμμ... μάλιστα... Έτσι κρυπτογραφούν τα γραπτά τους οι κανίβαλοι. Μπορώ να το αποκρυπτογραφήσω. Δώσ\' μου μόνο δυο λεπτά.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5386":["","Sure. [wait]","","Por supuesto. [esperar]","","","","Certo. [esperar]","Na klar. [warte]","","Sigur. [așteaptă]","Pewnie. [czekaj]","","Zeker. [wacht]","","Pasti. [Tunggu]","","","","沒問題。[等待]","","Σίγουρα [αναμονή]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5387":["","Ha! It\'s a list with names, locations and numbers. I\'m pretty sure that these numbers are kilograms of human meat these people ordered.","","¡Ajá! Es un listado. Una lista de nombres, lugares y números. Y estoy convencido de que esos números indican precisamente los kilogramos de carne humana encargada por esas personas.","","Ha ! C\'est une liste de noms, lieux et nombres. Je suis quasiment certain que ces chiffres correspondent au kilo de viande humaine que ces gens ont commandés.","","Ha! Isso é uma lista com nomes, lugares e números. Estou quase certo de que esses números são quilos de carne humana que esse pessoal encomendou.","Ha! Das ist eine Liste mit Namen, Orten und Nummern. Ich bin mir ziemlich sicher, dass diese Nummern für das Gewicht an Menschenfleisch steht, das diese Leute bestellt haben.","","Ha! E o listă cu nume, locații și numere. Sunt destul de sigur că aceste numere sunt kilogramele de carne de om pe care acești oameni le-au comandat.","Ha! To jest lista z imionami, miejscami i liczbami. Jestem całkiem pewny, że te liczby to kilogramy ludzkiego mięsa, które ci ludzie zamówili."
         ,"","Ha! Het is een lijst met namen, locaties en nummers. Ik ben er vrij zeker van dat die nummers kilos mensenvlees zijn die die mensen bestelden.","","Ha! Ia adalah satu senarai dengan nama-nama, lokasi-lokasi dan nombor-nombor. Saya sangat pasti bahawa nombor-nombor ini adalah daging manusia dalam kilogram yang mereka telah pesan.","","","","哈！這是一個上面寫著名字，地點，數量的清單，我確信這是那些人預定的人肉公斤數。","","Χα! Είναι μια λίστα με ονόματα τοποθεσίες και αριθμούς. Είμαι σχεδόν σχεδόν σίγουρος ότι οι αριθμοί είναι κιλά ανθρώπινου κρέατος που παραγγείλανε αυτοί οι άνθρωποι.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5388":["","Anyone I know?","","¿Ah, sí? ¿Y hay alguien al que yo pueda conocer?","","","","Alguém que eu conheça?","Jemand den ich kenne?","","Cineva cunoscut?","Ktokolwiek mi znany?","","Iemand die ik ken?","","Adakah terdapat sesiapa yang saya tahu?","","","","其中有我認識的人嗎？","","Κάποιος που να ξέρω;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5389":["","Maybe... Sapoboi Rodrigues. Ever heard about him? He\'s the owner of Lago ranch, quite a famous person around here. According to this list he ordered 3 kg of meat.","","Puede que sí... ¿Conoces a Sapoboi Rodrigues? Es el propietario del rancho de Lago. Es bastante conocido en la región. Según esto, encargó 3 kg de carne humana.","","","","Quem sabe... Sapoboi Rodrigues. Já ouviu falar dele? Ele é dono da fazenda Lago, até é famoso por aqui. De acordo com essa lista ele encomendou 3kg de carne.","Vielleicht... Sapoboi Rodrigues. Schonmal von ihm gehört? Er besitzt die Lago Ranch, ein ziemlich berühmter Mann in dieser Gegend. Entsprechend dieser Liste hat er 3 kg Fleisch bestellt.","","Poate ... Sapoboi Rodrigues. Ai auzit vreodată de el? E proprietarul fermei Lago, o persoană destul de celebră pe aici. În conformitate cu această listă, a ordonat trei kilograme de carne.","Może... Sapoboi Rodrigues. <Słyszałeś/Słyszałaś> kiedyś o nim? Jest właścicielem rancha Lago, dość sławna osoba w okolicy. Według tej listy, zamówił 3 Kg mięsa."
         ,"","Misschien... Sapoboi Rodrigues. Ooit van hem gehoord? Hij de de eigenaar van Lago ranch, een nogal bekende persoon hier. Volgens de lijst heeft hij 3 kilo vlees besteld.","","Mungkin... Sapoboi Rodrigues. Pernahkah kamu dengar tentang dia? Dia adalah pemilik ladang Lago, agak terkenal di sini juga. Mengikut senarai ini dia telah memesan sebanyak 3 Kg daging.","","","","有可能... 有聽過薩波博依‧羅德里格斯這個名字嗎？他是辣狗鎮牧場的主人，在附近很有名。根據這個清單他訂了三公斤的肉。","","Πιθανόν.. Sapoboi Rodrigez. Έχεις ακούσει γιαυτόν; Είναι ο ιδιοκτήτης του ράντσου Lago, αρκετά διάσημος τριγύρω. Σύμφωνα με τη λίστα έχει παραγγείλει 3 Kg κρέας.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5390":["","Amazing.","","Increíble.","","","","Incrível.","Erstaunlich.","","Nemaipomenit.","Niesamowite.","","Verbazingwekkend.","","Menakjubkan.","","","","太驚人了。","","Θαυμάσια.","","","","","","","","","","Incredibile.","","","","","","","","","","","","Increïble.","",""],
         "5391":["","Do you mind if I keep this list? It could help us put some pressure on these people if the need arises.","","¿Te importa si me quedo con la lista? Puede que nos sea de utilidad para presionar a esta gente en caso de necesidad.","¿Te importa si me quedo con el documento? Puede que nos sea de utilidad para presionar a estas personas en caso de necesidad.","","","Você se importa se eu ficar com essa lista? Ela pode nos ajudar a pôr alguma pressão nessas pessoas se houver necessidade.","Darf ich diese Liste behalten? Es könnte uns helfen, gegen diese Leute Druck auszuüben, wenn es notwendig wird.","","Te superi dacă păstrez această listă? Ne-ar putea ajuta să punem presiune pe acești oameni, dacă va fi nevoie.","Miałbyś coś przeciw, gdybym zatrzymał tą listę? Mogłoby pomóc nam to nałożyć trochę nacisku na tych ludzi, jeśli taka potrzeba powstanie.","","Vind je het erg als ik deze lijst houd? Het zou ons kunnen helpen om wat druk te zetten op die mensen als er noodzaak voor komt."
         ,"","Bolehkah saya simpan senarai ini? Ia mungkin boleh tolong kita memberi tekanan kepada orang-orang ini kalau diperlukan.","","","","你介意我把這清單留著嗎？假如有一天需要的話我可以去威脅這些人。","","Σε πειράζει αν κρατήσω τη λίστα; Θα μπορούσε να μας βοηθήσει να πιέσουμε αυτούς τους ανθρώπους αν υπάρξει ανάγκη.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5392":["","Sure. You can keep it.","","Claro. Puedes quedártela.","Claro, puedes quedártelo.","","","É claro. Pode ficar com ela.","Sicher. Du kannst sie behalten.","","Sigur. Poți s-o păstrezi.","Jasne. Możesz ją zatrzymać.","","Zeker. Je kan hem houden.","","Pasti. Kamu boleh menyimpannya.","","","","沒問題。你可以留著。","","Αμέ! μπορείς να το κρατήσεις.","","","","","","","Oo naman. Sa iyo na iyan.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5393":["","Thanks.","","Gracias.","","","","Obrigado.","Danke.","","Mulțumesc.","Dzięki.","","Bedankt.","","Terima kasih.","","","","感謝。","","Ευχαριστώ.","","","","","","","Salamat.","","","Grazie.","","","","","","","","","","","","Gràcies.","",""],
         "5394":["","You\'re welcome. See you later. [leave]","","De nada. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","De nada, nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","De nada. Até depois. [sair]","Gern geschehen. bis später. [gehen]","","Cu plăcere. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nie ma za co. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Graag gedaan. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Sama-sama. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","不客氣。再見。[離開]","","Δεν κάνει τίποτε. Θα σε δω αργότερα [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Walang anuman. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","No es mereixen. Ja ens veurem. Adéu. [marxar]","",""],
         "5395":["","Eh... I would prefer if you gave it back to me. I may need it myself.","","Esto... Preferiría que me la devolvieras. Podría necesitarla.","Esto... Preferiría que me lo devolvieras. Quizá podría necesitarlo.","","","É... eu preferiria que você me devolvesse. Eu posso precisar dela.","Ähm... ich würde es gerne wiederhaben. Ich brauche es für mich selbst.","","Eh ... Aș prefera dacă mi-ai da-o înapoi. S-ar putea să am nevoie de ea, chiar eu.","Ech...<Preferowałbym/Preferowałabym>, gdybyś oddał mi to z powrotem. Mogę potrzebować tego <sam/sama>.","","Eh... Ik zou er de voorkeur aan geven als je me hem teruggaf. Ik zou hem zelf nodig kunnen hebben.","","Eh... Lebih baik kalau kamu memulangkannya kepada saya. Saya sendiri mungkin akan memerlukannya.","","","","呃... 我希望你把清單還我。我自己可能用得到。","","Εμ.. Θα προτιμούσα να μου το επέστρεφες. Μπορεί να το χρειαστώ κι εγώ.","","","","","","","Um... Kung maaari lamang ay ibalik mo sa akin. Marahil ay kailanganin ko iyan.","","","","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","",""],
         "5396":["","Kay... I already copied it anyway. It could be nice to have a physical evidence, but, actually, I don\'t think we\'ll need it. Thanks for showing this list to me.","","Entiendo... Bueno, de todas formas ya hice una copia. Sería mejor tener el documento original, pero, de hecho, no creo que lo vayamos a necesitar. Gracias por habérmelo enseñado.","OK... De todos modos ya la copié. Podría ser bueno tener una evidencia física, pero, de hecho, no creo que la necesitemos. Gracias por mostrarme esta lista.","","","Tudo bem... De qualquer forma, já a copiei. Seria bom termos uma evidência física, mas, na verdade, não acho que precisaremos disso. Obrigado por mostrar esta lista para mim.","Kay... Ich habe mir trotzdem schon eine Kopie gemacht. Es wäre schön einen fassbaren Beweis zu haben, aber eigentlich, denke ich nicht, dass wir ihn brauchen werden. Danke, dass du mir diese List gezeigt hast.","","Kay... Oricum, am copiat-o deja. Ar fi frumos să avem o dovadă fizică, dar, de fapt, nu cred că va fi nevoie. Mulțumesc că mi-ai arătat această listă."
         ,"Kej... I tak to już skopiowałem. Byłoby miło mieć fizyczny dowód, ale, właściwie, nie sądzę byśmy go potrzebowali. Dzięki za pokazanie mi tej listy.","","OK... Ik had hem toch al gekopiëerd. Het zou mooi zijn om fysiek bewijs te hebben, maar, eigenlijk, denk ik niet dat we het nodig hebben. Bedankt dat je me deze lijst hebt getoond.","","Kay... Bagaimanapun saya sudah membuat salinan. Ia lebih baik kalau ada bukti fizikal, tapi, sebenarnya, saya rasa kita tidak akan memerlukannya. Terima kasih kerana menunjuk senarai ini kepada saya.","","","","好... 我已經複製一張。有直接的證據是很好，但是，事實上，我想我們不需要。感謝你把清單給我看。","","\'Ντάξει. Έτσι κι αλλιώς ήδη το αντέγραψα. Θα \'ταν καλό να έχουμε φυσικά αποδεικτικά στοιχεία αλλά δε νομίζω ότι θα χρειαστεί. Σ\'  ευχαριστώ που μου έδειξες τη λίστα.","","","","","","","Sige... Nakopya ko na naman ito. Mabuti na ring may kongkretong ebidensya, pero, sa totoo lang, tingin ko hindi na namin kakailanganin ito. Salamat sa pagpapakita ng listahan sa akin.","","","","","","",""
