         "5397":["","OK then. See you later. [leave]","","Bien, pues. Nos vemos luego. [marcharse]","Bien. Nos vemos después. [marcharse]","","","Certo então. Até depois. [sair]","Dann Ok. Ich muss weiter. Tschüss. [gehen]","","Bine atunci. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej więc. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","OK dan. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Kalau begitu, OK. Jumpa nanti. [Tinggal]","","","","那敢情好。再見。[離開]","","Εντάξει λοιπόν. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5398":["","Look, I found this piece of paper in the cannibals camp. Any chance you could read what\'s written on it?","","Mira, encontré este trozo de papel en el poblado caníbal. ¿Crees que serías capaz de leer lo que pone?","Mira, encontré este pedazo de papel en el campamento de los caníbales. ¿Existe la posibilidad de que puedas leer lo que dice?","","","Veja, achei esse pedaço de papel no acampamento dos canibais. Alguma chance de você conseguir ler o que está escrito nele?","Schau mal, ich habe dieses Stück Papier im Lager der Kannibalen gefunden. Besteht die Möglichkeit, dass du lesen kannst, was dort drauf steht?","","Uite, am găsit această bucată de hârtie în tabăra canibalilor. E vreo șansă de a descifra ce scrie pe ea?","Słuchaj, <znalazłem/znalazłam> ten kawałek papieru w obozie kanibali. Jakaś szansa, że możesz odczytać co jest na nim zapisane?","","Kijk, ik heb dit stuk papier gevonden in het kannibalenkamt. Enige kans dat jij zou kunnen lezen wat er op geschreven staat?"
         ,"","Tengok, saya terjumpa kertas ini di kem kanibal. Adakah kamu dapat membaca apa yang tertulis padanya?","","","","看，我在食人族營地找到這張紙。你有沒有辦法讀懂上面寫些甚麼？","","Κοίτα, βρήκα ένα κομμάτι χαρτί στο στρατόπεδο των κανιβάλων. Υπάρχει περίπτωση να διαβάσεις τι γράφει;","","","","","","","Tngnan mo, may nakita akong piraso ng papel sa kampo ng mga kanibal. Kaya mo ba itong basahin?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5399":["","Your next mission is an important one. There\'s a rebellion going on in Mikaze. Workforce Merchants claim to have purchased an oil drilling company, but it\'s not true. It\'s been proved that the committee that signed the contract was payed by Workforce Merchants and all its recent actions have been canceled by the legitimate owners of the company who are its workers. Unfortunately, we all know that Workforce Merchants has the entire Janubi in its pocket and if the case goes to the tribunal, it\'ll be resolved in Workforce Merchants\' favor. That\'s why the workers had no other choice, but to start a rebellion. They expelled the Workforce Merchants\' representatives and don\'t let any of them get close to Mikaze.","","Tu próxima misión es  de vital importancia. Hay una rebelión en marcha en la ciudad de Mikaze. Los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra afirman haber comprado la compañía petrolífera local, pero no es así. Se ha demostrado que el comité que firmó el contrato de cesión fue comprado por los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra y todas sus decisiones han sido anuladas por los verdaderos dueños de la compañía que no son otros que los propios trabajadores. Desgraciadamente, sabemos que las autoridades de Janubi siguen los dictados de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra y que si el caso llega a los tribunales, se resolverá en favor de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra. Por eso a los trabajadores no les ha quedado otra opción que rebelarse. Expulsaron a los representantes de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra y no les dejan ni acercarse de nuevo a Mikaze."
         ,"","","","Sua próxima missão é importante. Há uma rebelião acontecendo em Mikaze. Os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra afirmam ter comprado uma companhia de perfuração petrolífera. Está provado que o comitê que assinou o contrato foi pago pelos Comerciantes de Mão de Obra e que todas suas ações recentes foram canceladas pelos donos legítimos da companhia, que são seus trabalhadores. Infelizmente, nós todos sabemos que os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra tem toda Janubi no bolso e se o caso for ao tribunal, será decidido em favor deles. Esse é o porquê de os trabalhadores não terem outra escolha além de começar uma rebelião. Eles expulsaram os representantes dos Comerciantes de Mão de Obra e não deixam nenhum deles se aproximar de Mikaze.","Deine nächste Mission ist wichtig. Es gibt läuft ein Aufstand in Mikaze. Die Arbeitskraft-Händler bestehen darauf, dass sie die Erdöl-Gesellschaft gekauft haben, aber es stimmt nicht. Es ist bewiesen, dass sie das Kommittee, das die Verträge unterschrieben hat, bestochen haben. Deswegen haben die rechtmäßigen Besitzer der Firma, die Arbeiter, das Kommittee enthoben und ihre letzten Entscheidungen rückgängig gemacht. Unglücklicherweise, wissen wir alle, dass die Arbeitskraft-Händler die gesamt Regierung von Janubi in der Tasche haben und wenn der Fall vor Gericht geht, es zu gunsten der Arbeitskraft-Händler entschieden wird. Darum hatten die Arbeiter keine andere Möglichkeit, als einen Aufstand zu starten. Sie haben dir Vertreter der Arbeitskraft-Händler rausgeworfen und lassen keinen von ihen in die Nähe von Mikaze kommen."
         ,"","Următoarea ta misiune este una importantă. O rebeliune se întâmplă chiar acum, în Mikaze. Comercianții pretind că au cumpărat o companie de foraj petrolier, dar nu e adevărat. S-a demonstrat că, comisia care a semnat contractul, a fost plătită de către CFM și toate acțiunile lor recente au fost anulate de către proprietarii legitimi ai companiei, care sunt muncitorii săi. Din păcate, știm cu toții că acești Comercianți au întregul Janubi în buzunar și dacă vor merge la tribunal, cazul va fi soluționat în favoarea lor. De aceea, muncitorii n-au avut altă opțiune, decât să  înceapă o rebeliune. I-au expulzat pe reprezentanții CFM și nu-i mai lasă să se apropie de Mikaze.","Twoja kolejna misja jest tą ważną. Jest rebelia w Mikaze. Handlarze Siłą Roboczą twierdzą, że zakupili ropo wiercącą kompanię, ale to nie prawda. Zostało udowodnione, że komitet, który podpisał kontrakt, został opłacony przez Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą i wszystkie jego ostatnie czyny zostały anulowane przez legalnych właścicieli kompani, którymi są jej robotnicy. Niestety, my wszyscy wiemy, że Handlarze Siłą Roboczą mają całą Janubi w swojej kieszeni i jeśli sprawa trafi do trybunału, to zostanie rozwiązana na korzyść Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą. Dlatego też, robotnicy nie mieli innego wyboru, niż rozpocząć rebelię. Wyrzucili reprezentację Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą i nie pozwalają żadnemu z nich zbliżyć się do Mikaze."
         ,"","Je volgende missie is een belangrijke. Er is een opstand aan de gang in Mikaze. Werkkracht Handelaren claimen dat ze een olieboormaatschappij hebben gekocht, maar dat is niet waar. Het is bewezen dat het commitee dat het contracht getekend heeft, betaald werd door Werkkrachthandelaren en al hun recente acties zijn geannuleerd door de wettige eigenaren van het bedrijf, dat zijn de werknemers. Jammer genoeg weten we allemaal dat de Werkkracht Handelaren heel Janubi in hun zak hebben en als de zaak naar het tribunaal gaat, wordt het opgelost in het voordeel van de Werkkracht Handelaren. Daarom hadden de werknemers geen andere keus dan een opstand beginnen. Ze hebben de vertegenwoordigers van de Werkkracht Handelaren verbannen en laten ze niet dicht bij Mikaze komen.","","Misi kamu seterusnya adalah penting. Terdapat satu pemberontakan yang sedang berlaku di Mikaze. Workforce Merchants mendakwa bahawa mereka telah membeli sebuah syarikat penggerudian minyak, tapi ia tidak benar. Ia telah dibuktikan bahawa jawatankuasa yang telah menandatangani kontrak dibayar oleh Workforce Merchants dan semua tindakan olehnya baru-baru ini telah dibatalkan oleh pemilik sah syarikat tersebut yang juga adalah pekerjanya. Malangnya, kita tahu semua tahu bahawa Workforce Merchants mengawal seluruh Janubi dan kalau kes tersebut sampai ke tribunal, ia akan menyebelahi Workforce Merchants. Itulah sebab pekerja-pekerja syarikat itu tiada pilihan tapi untuk memulakan pemberontakan. Mereka telah mengusir wakil-wakil Workforce Merchants dan tidak membenarkan mana-mana daripada mereka mendekati Mikaze."
         ,"","","","你的下一個任務很重要。美風鎮將會發生暴動。商賈公會聲稱已經買下了石油鑽探公司，但是事實並非如此。簽下合約的董事會成員都是被賄賂的。而且最近的決策已經被被那間公司的合法擁有者，也就是工人，推翻的。不幸地，我們都知道整個賈努比區域都是商賈公會的囊中物，所以假如走上法院，一定偏袒商賈公會那邊。這是為甚麼工人們沒有選擇，只好暴動。他們驅逐了商賈公會的代表權，然後不讓他們靠近美風鎮。","","Η επόμενη αποστολή σου είναι σημαντική. Στο Mikaze έχει ξεσπάσει εξέγερση. Οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας ισχυρίζονται ότι αγόρασαν μία εταιρεία εξόρυξης πετρελαίου, αλλά δεν είναι αλήθεια. Έχει αποδειχτεί ότι η επιτροπή που υπέγραψε το συμφωνητικό είχε πληρωθεί από τους Εμπόρους Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας και όλες οι πρόσφατες αποφάσεις της έχουν ακυρωθεί από τους νόμιμους ιδιοκτήτες που είναι οι εργαζόμενοι της εταιρείας. Δυστυχώς οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας έχουν ολόκληρο το Janubi στο τσεπάκι τους και η υπόθεση πάει στο δικαστήριο όπου θα επιλυθεί υπέρ τους. Γιαυτό οι εργαζόμενοι δεν είχαν άλλη επιλογή παρά να ξεκινήσουν εξέγερση. έδιωξαν τους εκπροσώπους των Εμπόρων Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας και δεν αφήνουν κανένα τους να πλησιάσει στο Mikaze.","","","","","","","Ang iyong susunod na misyon ay mahalaga. may rebelyong nagaganap sa Mikaze. Sinasabi ng Workforce Merchants na nakabili sila ng kumpanya ukol sa oil-drilling, ngunit hindi ito totoo. Napatunayan na ang kumite na pumirma sa kontrata ay binayaran ng Workforce Merchants at ang lahat ng mga kasalukuyang aksyon nito ay ipinatigil ng mga tunay na may-ari ng kumpanya na siya ring mga trabahador. Sa kasamaang-palad, alam natin na hawak ng Workforce Merchants ang buong Janubi at kung maidala ang kasong ito sa husgado, mareresolba ito sa kanilang kagustuhan. Kaya nga walang magagawa ang mga trabahador kundi ang magsimula ng rebelyon. Tinanggal ng Workforce merchants ang kanilang mga kinatawan at hindi nila hinahayaang makalapit ang mga manggagawa sa Mikaze."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5400":["","What do I need to do about it?","","¿Y cuál sería mi papel en todo este asunto?","","","","O que preciso fazer sobre isso?","Was soll ich deswegen unternehmen?","","Ce trebuie să fac?","Co trzeba, bym z tym <zrobił/zrobiła>?","","Wat moet ik er aan doen?","","Apa yang perlu saya buat tentangnya?","","","","我應該做甚麼？","","Τι πρέπει να κάνω σχετικά;","","","","","","","Ano ang kailangan kong gawin?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5401":["","The rebels need our help. They are severely outnumbered. The police has not taken any actions to suppress the rebellion yet, but they will soon. Unfortunately we cannot risk to provoke Janubi directly. That\'s why we chose you for this mission. You are the newest member of our organization and we hope that the police still doesn\'t know that you\'re with us. If it\'s so, you can pretend to be just another rebel and not provoke any government-scale conflict. For this reason I cannot give you any people this time. You will need to hire some neutral mercenaries... When you are ready, go to Mikaze and speak with Samantha in Mikaze Oil headquarters. She\'ll tell you what needs to be done next.","","Verás, lo rebeldes necesitan nuestra ayuda. Se ven ampliamente superados en número. Aunque la Policía no se ha decidido a acabar con la rebelión aún, pronto lo harán. Desgraciadamente, no estamos en disposición de desafiar al gobierno de Janubi directamente. Por eso te homos escogido a ti para llevar a cabo esta misión. Eres el miembro más reciente de nuestra organización y creemos que la Policía todavía no debe ser capaz de relacionarte con nosotros. Por tanto, debes fingir ser un rebelde más, y así evitar provocar un conflicto a gran escala que implique a los gobiernos de Janubi y Ozbet directamente. Por ello, me temo que en esta ocasión no podré proporcionarte a ninguno de mis hombres para que te ayude en esta misión. Deberías contratar a algunos mercenarios neutrales. Cuando hayas terminado con los preparativos, tendrás que dirigirte a Mikaze y hablar con una tal Samantha en el cuartel general de la Mikaze Oil. Una vez allí, ella te dará nuevas instrucciones."
         ,"","","","Os rebeldes precisam da nossa ajuda. Eles estão em séria desvantagem numérica. A polícia não tomou nenhuma atitude para suprimir a rebelião ainda, mas o farão em breve. Infelizmente não podemos arriscar provocar Janubi diretamente. Esse é o porquê de escolhermos você para essa missão. Você é o membro mais novo da nossa organização e nós acreditamos que a polícia ainda não sabe com quem você está. Se for assim, você pode fingir ser apenas outro rebelde e não provocar qualquer conflito de escala governamental. Por essa razão, não posso lhe dar pessoal dessa vez. Você precisa contratar alguns mercenários neutros... Quando estiver pronto, vá a Mikaze e fale com Samanta na Sede de Petróleo de Mikaze. Ela lhe dirá o que precisa ser feito a seguir.","Die Rebellen brauchen deine Hilfe. Sie sind klar in der Unterzahl. Die Polizei hat noch nichts unternommen um den Aufstand niederzuschlagen, aber das wird bald der Fall sein. Darum haben wir dich für diese Mission ausgewählt.Du bist das neuste Mitglied in unsere Organisation und wir hoffen, dass die Polizei noch nicht weiß, dass du zu uns gehörst. Wenn das des Fall ist, kannst du behaupten, dass du auch nur ein weiterer Rebell bist und damit kein großer Regierungsskandal ausgelöst wird. Aus diesem Grund kann ich dir diesmal keine Unterstützung mitgeben. Du solltest dir ein paar freischaffende Söldner anheuern... Wenn du fertig bist, geh nach Mikaze und sprich dort mit Samantha im Mikaze Oil Hauptquartier. Sie sagt dir, was als nächstes zutun ist."
         ,"","Rebelii au nevoie de ajutorul nostru, deoarece sunt depășiți numeric. Poliția nu a luat încă, nici o măsură pentru a suprima revolta, dar o vor face în curând. Din păcate, nu putem risca să provocăm Janubiul direct. De aceea te-am ales pe tine, pentru această misiune. Tu ești <cel mai nou membru al/cea mai nouă membră a> organizației noastre și sperăm că poliția încă nu știe că ești cu noi. Dacă e așa, poți pretinde a fi doar <un alt rebel/o altă rebelă>, fără să provoci vreun conflict la scară guvernamentală. Din acest motiv, nu-ți pot da oameni de data asta. Va trebui să angajezi niște mercenari... Când ești gata, du-te în Mikaze și vorbește cu Samantha din sediul Mikaze-Petrol. O să-ți spună ce trebuie făcut în continuare.","Rebelianci potrzebują naszej pomocy. Jest ich znacznie mniej. Policja nie powzięła jeszcze żadnych akcji w celu stłumienia rebelii, ale wkrótce podejmą. Niestety, nie możemy ryzykować bezpośredniego prowokowania Janubi. Dlatego też, wybraliśmy ciebie do tej misji. Jesteś <najnowszym członkiem/najnowszą członkinią> naszej organizacji i mamy nadzieję, że policja wciąż nie wie, że jesteś z nami. Jeśli tak jest, możesz udawać, że jesteś tylko <kolejnym rebeliantem/kolejną rebeliantką> i nie prowokować jakiś konfliktów na skalę rządową. Z tego powodu, nie mogę dać ci jakichkolwiek ludzi tym razem. Będziesz <potrzebował/potrzebowała> wynająć jakiś neutralnych najemników... Kiedy będziesz <gotowy/gotowa>, udaj się do Mikaze i porozmawiaj z Samanthą w kwaterze głównej Ropy Mikaze. Powie ci, co trzeba dalej zrobić."
         ,"","De rebellen hebben onze hulp nodig. Ze zijn zwaar in de minderheid. De politie heeft nog geen actie ondernomen om de rebellie te onderdrukken, maar dat zullen ze snel doen. Jammer genoeg kunnen we het niet riskeren om Janubi rechtstreeks te provoceren. Daarom hebben we jou gekozen voor deze missie. Jij bent het nieuwste lid van onze organisatie en we hopen dat de politie nog niet weet dat je bij ons hoort. Als dat zo is, kun je doen alsof je gewoon een rebel bent en geen conflict op de schaal van regeringen provoceren. Om deze reden kan ik je deze keer geen mensen geven. Je zult wat neutrale huurlingen moeten huren... Als je klaar bent, ga dan naar Mikaze en praat met Samantha in het Mikaze Olie hoofdkwartier. Zij zal je vertellen wat er daarna gedaan moet worden.","","Kumpulan rebels memerlukan pertolongan kita. Mereka kekurangan orang. Polis masih belum mengambil tindakan untuk menghentikan pemberotakan lagi, tapi mereka akan tidak lama lagi. Malangnya kita tidak boleh memprovokasi Janubi secara terus. Itulah sebab kami telah pilih kamu untuk misi ini. Kamu adalah ahli yang paling baru organisasi kami dan kami berharap bahawa polis masih tak tahu bahawa kamu bersepakat dengan kami. Kalau memang macam ini, kamu boleh berpura sebagai salah satu pemberontak dan tidak mengakibatkan apa-apa konflik yang melibatkan kerajaan. Disebabkan ini, saya tak dapat bagi kamu pertolongan buat sementara. Kamu perlu mengupah askar upahan yang neutral... Bila kamu sudah bersedia, pergi ke Mikaze dan berumpa dengan Samantha di ibu pejabat Mikaze Oil. Dia akan beritahu kamu apa yang perlu dibuat."
         ,"","","","這場暴動需要我們的幫忙。他們嚴重的寡不敵眾。警察還沒有採取行動鎮壓這場暴動，但是可能很快了。不幸地我們不能冒險直接惹上賈努比政府。所以這次的任務需要你。你是我們組織內最新的成員，希望警方還沒有認識你。你可以偽裝成暴動的成員之一，不會把問題提升到政府層級。也因為這個原因，這次我無法派人幫你。你必須自己雇用一些中立的傭兵... 你準備好之後，就到美風鎮去到美風石油公司總部找薩曼莎。他會告訴你該怎麼做。","","Οι εξεγερμένοι χρειάζονται τη βοήθεια μας. Είναι σημαντικά λιγότεροι. Η αστυνομία δεν ανέλαβε ακόμη δράση για να καταστείλει την εξέγερση, αλλά θα το κάνει σύντομα. Δυστυχώς δε μπορούμε να ρισκάρουμε να προκαλέσουμε ευθέως τoυς Janubi. Γιαυτό σε διαλέξαμε για την αποστολή, Είσαι το νεότερο μέλος της οργάνωσής μας και ελπίζουμε ότι η αστυνομία δε γνωρίζει ακόμη ότι είσαι με το μέρος μας. Αν είναι έτσι μπορείς να παραστήσεις ότι είσαι άλλος ένας εξεγερμένος και να μην προξενήσεις αντιπαράθεση κυβερνητικού μεγέθους. Γιαυτό το λόγο δε μπορούμε να σου δώσουμε κανέναν αυτή τη φορά. Θα πρέπει να προσλάβεις ουδέτερους μισθοφόρους. Όταν είσαι <έτοιμος/έτοιμη> πήγαινε στο Mikaze και μίλα με τη Samantha στα κεντρικά της Mikaza Oil. Θα σου πει τι χρειάζεται να γίνει ύστερα.","","","",""
         ,"","","Kailangan ng mga rebelde ang ating tulong. Sila ay lubhang nalalaluan. Wala pang ginagawa ang mga pulis ukol rito, pero aaksyon na rin sila. Sa kasamaang palad ay hindi kami maaaring sumugal na kayagin ang Janubi nang deretsahan. Kaya nga pinili ka namin sa misyong ito. Ikaw ang pinakabagong miyembro ng aming organisasyon at sana ay hindi pa alam ng kapulisan na kasamahan ka namin. Kung magkagayon ay maaari kang magpanggap na isa ka ring rebelde at huwag pumukaw ng malakihang kaguluhan. Sa kadahilanang iyon ay hindi ako maaaring makapagbigay ng mga tauhan sa ngayon. Kinakailangan mong kumasundo ng mga tauhan. Kung handa ka na, magtungo ka sa Mikaze at kausapin mo si Samantha ng Mikaze Oil headquarters. Sasabihin niya ang susunod mong gagawin.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5402":["","OK. I\'ll go talk with her. See you later. [leave]","","De acuerdo. Iré a hablar con ella. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","OK. Je lui parlerai. A plus tard. [partir]","","OK. Vou falar com ela. Vejo você depois. [sair]","Ok. Dann werde ich mit ihr reden. Bis später. [gehen]","","OK. Mă duc să vorbesc cu ea. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Wyruszam pomówić z nią. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","OK. Ik zal met haar gaan praten. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya akan pergi berjumpa dengan dia. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。我會跟她談談。再見。[離開]","","Οκ πήγαινε και μίλα της. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Kakausapin ko siya. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","D\'acord. Aniré a parlar amb ella. Adéu. [marxar]","",""],
         "5403":["","Help Mikaze Oil rebels defend themselves against the police.","","Ayuda a los Rebeldes de la Mikaze Oil a defenderse de la Policía.","Ayuda a los rebeldes de la Mikaze Oil a defenderse de los policías.","","","Ajude os rebeldes de Petróleo de Mikaze a se defender da polícia.","Hilf den Mikaze Oil Rebellen bei der Verteidigung gegen die Polizei.","","Ajută-i pe rebelii Mikaze-Petrol să se apere de poliție.","Pomóż rebeliantom Ropy Mikaze obronić się przed policją.","","Help de Mikaze Olie rebellen zich te verdedigen tegen de politie","","Tolong Mikaze Oil rebels melindungi diri daripada polis.","","","","協助美風石油公司反抗軍防禦警方的進攻。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Aita Mikaze Õli mässajatel kaitsta ennast politsei eest.","","","","","","","","","Ajuda als rebels de la Mikaze Oil a defensar-se de la Policia.","","Pomoz rebelům Mikaze Oil ubránit se před policií."],
         "5404":["","I\'m @yourname@. Nikuban told me to talk to you.","","Hola. Soy @yourname@. Nikuban me ha dicho que tengo que hablar contigo.","","","","Sou @yourname@. Nikuban me disse pra falar com você.","Ich bin @yourname@. Nikuban hat mir gesagt, dass ich mit dir reden soll.","","Eu sunt  @yourname@. Nikuban mi-a spus să vorbesc cu tine.","Jestem @yourname@. Nikuban rzekł mi, bym z tobą <porozmawiał/porozmawiała>.","","Ik ben @yourname@. Nikuban zei dat ik met jou moest praten.","","Saya @yourname@. Nikuban telah beritahu saya untuk bercakap dengan kamu.","","","","我叫做 @yourname@。二句班叫我來找你。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5405":["","Oh, yes. Of course. Welcome, friend. You come just in time. I heard that they are sending several police squads here.","","¡Oh, sí! Por supuesto. <Bienvenido/Bienvenida> a Mikaze, <amigo/amiga>. ¡Tu ayuda nos viene de perlas! Me han dicho que han enviado unos cuantos escuadrones de Policía hacia aquí.","","","","Oh, sim. Claro. Seja bem <vindo/vinda>, <amigo/amiga>. Você chegou bem na hora. Fiquei sabendo que eles estão mandando muitas viaturas da polícia até aqui.","Oh, ja. Natürlich. Sei willkommen mein Freund. Du kommst gerade rechtzeitig. Ich habe gehört, dass sie einige Polzieitruppen hierher schicken.","","Oh, da. Bineînțeles. Bine ai venit, prietene. Ai venit tocmai la timp. Am auzit că vor trimite mai multe echipe de poliție, peste noi.","Och, tak. Oczywiście. Witaj, <przyjacielu/przyjaciółko>. <Nadszedłeś/Nadeszłaś> w samą porę. Słyszałam, że wysyłają tu kilka policyjnych drużyn.","","Oh, ja. Natuurlijk. Welkom <vriend/vriendin>. Je bent net op tijd. Ik heb gehoord dat ze verschillende politie-eskaders hierheen sturen."
         ,"","Oh, ya. Sudah tentu. Selamat datang, kawan. Kamu sampai tepat pada masa. Saya dengar bahawa mereka sedang menghantar beberapa skuad polis ke sini.","","","","噢對，沒錯。歡迎，我的朋友。你抵達的正是時候。我聽說他們已經派來了幾組警察人員。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5406":["","How many are you?","","¿Cuántos sois?","","","","Quantos vocês são?","Wie viele seid ihr?","","Câți sunteți?","Jak wielu was jest?","","Met hoeveel zijn jullie?","","Berapa besar kumpulan kamu?","","","","你們有多少人？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5407":["","Those who can fight, about 30. Our equipment is not very good. Without your help we will lose.","","Que estemos en condiciones de luchar, unos 30. Pero nuestro equipo no es muy bueno que digamos. Necesitamos ayuda, o no tendremos ninguna posibilidad de vencer.","","","","Os que conseguem lutar são cerca de 30. Nosso equipamento não é muito bom. Vamos perder sem sua ajuda.","Diejenigen, die kämpfen können, sind etwa 30. Unsere Ausrüstung ist aber nicht sehr gut. Ohne deine Hilfe sind wir verloren.","","Cei care pot lupta, aproximativ 30. Echipamentul nostru nu este foarte bun. Fără ajutorul tău, vom pierde.","Ci, którzy mogą walczyć, koło 30. Nasz ekwipunek nie jest bardzo dobry. Bez twojej pomocy przegramy.","","Degenen die kunnen vechten, ongeveer 30. Onze uitrusting is niet erg goed. Zonder jouw hulp zullen we verliezen.","","Mereka yang boleh melawan, kira-kira 30. Alat-alat kami tak berapa bagus. Tanpa bantuan kamu kami akan kalah.","","","","可以作戰的大概三十個。我們的裝備並不精良。沒有你的幫忙，我們會被擊敗。"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5408":["","That\'s why I\'m here.","","Por eso mismo estoy yo aquí.","","","","É por isso que estou aqui.","Deswegen bin ich hier.","","De asta sunt aici.","Po to tu jestem.","","Daarom ben ik hier.","","Itu sebab saya di sini.","","","","這就是我來的目的。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5409":["","Great! Let\'s kick some tail then!","","¡Perfecto! ¡Vamos a patear unos cuantos culos!","","","","É isso aí! Vamos detonar o traseiro deles!","Großartig! Dann können wir sie ja fertig machen!","","Grozav! Atunci, hai să rupem capete!","Czadersko! Skopmy więc trochę ogonów!","","Geweldig. Laten we dan op wat staarten trappen!","","Hebat! Mari kita belasah mereka!","","","","太好了！讓我們去捅幾個屁眼吧！","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5410":["","Let\'s do it! [leave]","","¡A por ellos! [marcharse]","","","","Vamos lá! [sair]","Das machen wir jetzt! [gehen]","","Haide! [pleacă]","Zróbmy to! [odejdź]","","Laten we het doen. [vertrekken]","","Mari kita lakukannya! [Tinggal]","","","","幹吧！[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5411":["","Yoo-hoo! We did it! Thanks for helping us!","","¡Yeeee-jaaa! ¡Lo hemos conseguido! ¡Muchas gracias por tu ayuda!","","","","Uhuu! Conseguimos! Obrigada por nos ajudar!","Yoo-hoo! Wir haben es geschafft! Danke für deine Hilfe!","","Yoo-hoo! Am reușit! Mulțumim pentru ajutor!","Jaa-hoo! Udało nam się. Dzięki, że nam <pomogłeś/pomogłaś>.","","Yoo-hoo! Het is gelukt! Bedankt dat je ons geholpen hebt!","","Yoo-hoo! Kita berjaya! Terima kasih kerana menolong kami!","","","","耶呼！我們辦到了！感謝你幫助我們！","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5412":["","It was a pleasure fighting by your side, Samantha.","","Ha sido un auténtico placer luchar a vuestro lado, Samantha.","","","","Foi um prazer lutar ao seu lado, Samantha.","Es war mir eine Ehre, an deiner Seite zu kämpfen, Samantha.","","A fost o plăcere să lupt de partea ta, Samantha.","To była przyjemność walczyć u twojego boku, Samantho.","","Hetwas een genoegen aan je zijde te vechten, Samantha.","","Saya gembira kerana dapat melawan untuk kamu, Samantha.","","","","很榮幸與你一起作戰，薩曼莎。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5413":["","I don\'t know. I hope that they realize that we\'re serious and will tell Workforce Merchants to leave us alone.","","No sé... Espero que se haya dado cuenta de que vamos en serio y que les digan a esos malditos Comerciantes de Mano de Obra que nos dejen en paz a partir de ahora.","","","","Não sei. Espero que eles percebam que nós não estamos de brincadeira e digam para os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra para deixar-nos em paz.","Ich weiß es nicht. Ich hoffe, dass sie kapiert haben, dass wir es ernst meinen und sie den Arbeitskraft-Händlern sagen, dass sie uns allein lassen sollen.","","Nu știu. Sper că își vor da seama că suntem serioși și le vor spune Comercianților să ne lase în pace.","Nie wiem. Mam nadzieję, że połapią się, że jesteśmy bezwzględnie poważni i rzekną Handlarzom Siłą Roboczą, by nas zostawili w spokoju.","","Ik weet het niet. Ik hoop dat ze realizeren dat we serieus zijn en de Werkkracht Handelaren zeggen ons met rust te laten.","","Saya tidak tahu. Saya berharap bahawa mereka sedar bahawa kami adalah serius dan akan beritahu Workforce Merchants untuk berhenti kacau kami."
         ,"","","","我不知道。我希望他們已經知道我們是認真的，而且告訴商賈公會不要再來惹我們。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5414":["","I hope so too.","","Ojalá...","","","","Também espero.","Das hoffe ich auch.","","Asta sper și eu.","Też mam taką nadzieję.","","Ik hoop het ook.","","Saya berharap begitu juga.","","","","希望如此。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5415":["","But if they send more police, fine with me. I enjoyed kicking their butts.","","Eso sí... Si envían a más policías, estaré encantada de recibirlos. ¡Me lo he pasado genial pateándoles el culo!","","","","Mas se eles mandarem mais policiais, por mim tudo bem. Adorei chutar os traseiros deles.","Aber wenn sie noch mehr Polizei schicken, fände ich es auch gut. Es hat mir gefallen, in ihre Ärsche zu treten.","","Dar dacă mai trimit polițiști, nu-i problemă. Le-am rupt capul, cu plăcere.","Ale jeśli wyślą więcej policji, to nawet mi to opowiada. Radowałam się kopiąc ich tyłki.","","Maar als ze meer politie sturen, vind ik het best. Ik vond het leuk om ze te verslaan.","","Tapi kalau mereka hantar lebih polis, boleh juga. Saya suka belasah mereka.","","","","他們派再多警察來，我也沒問題。我很樂意捅他們的菊花。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5416":["","Well. Good luck with that. I\'ll go report back to Nikuban. See you. [leave]","","Muy bien. Bueno, mucha suerte. Tengo que explicárselo todo a Nikuban. Hasta la vista. [marcharse]","","","","Certo. Boa sorte. Tenho que contar o que aconteceu a Nikuban. Até mais. [sair]","Schön. Ich wünsche dir viel Erfolg damit. Ich werde jetzt bei Nikuban Bericht erstatten. Bis später. [gehen]","","Bine. Succes! Mă duc să-i raportez lui Nikuban. Ne mai vedem. [pleacă]","No. Powodzenia z tym. Wracam z raportem do Nikubana. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","","Wel. Veel geluk ermee. Ik ga verslag uitbrengen aan Nikuban. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","","Mmm. Semoga berjaya dengannya. Saya akan pergi berjumpa dengan Nikuban. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","這個嘛。祝你好運。我回去報告二句班了。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5417":["","Hey! How\'ya doing?","","¡Hey! ¿Qué tal estás?","","","","E aí! Como vai?","Hey! Wie läuft\'s?","","Salut! Ce mai faci?","Hej! Jak się miewasz?","","Hey! Hoe is het?","","Hey! Apa khabar?","","","","嗨！近來如何？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5418":["","I\'m fine. Just passing by. See you later. [leave]","","Estoy bien. Sólo pasaba por aquí. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","","","Estou bem. Só dando uma passadinha. Até logo. [sair]","Mir geht\'s gut. Ich wollte nur mal wieder vorbeischauen. Bis später. [gehen]","","Sunt bine. Eram în trecere. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Dobrze. Po postu <przechodziłem/przechodziłam> obok. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Het gaat goed. Ik kom alleen maar langs. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Saya OK. Hanya melalui sini. Jumpa kamu lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","很好。只是經過。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","I\'m good, Just passin through, see ya later. [leave]","","","",""],
         "5419":["","Can I ask you something?","","¿Puedo preguntarte algo?","","","","Posso te perguntar uma coisa?","Kann ich dich etwas fragen?","","Pot să te întreb ceva?","Czy mogę cię o coś zapytać?","","Mag ik je iets vragen?","","Bolehkah saya tanya kamu sesuatu?","","","","我能問你一些事嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5420":["","Can I ask you a couple of questions?","","¿Puedo hacerte un par de preguntas?","","","","Posso te fazer algumas perguntas?","Kann ich dir noch ein paar Fragen stellen?","","Pot să-ți pun câteva întrebări?","Czy mogę zadać ci parę pytań?","","Mag ik je wat vragen stellen?","","Bolehkah saya tanya kamu beberapa soalan?","","","","我能問你一些問題嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5421":["","Shoot.","","Dispara.","Adelante.","","","Pode perguntar.","Schießen.","","Zi!","Wal.","","Vraag maar raak.","","Tanya.","","","","甚麼問題？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5422":["","Call me Sam.","","Llámame Sam.","","","","Me chame de Sam.","Nenn mich Sam.","","Spune-mi Sam.","Zwij mnie Sam.","","Noem me maar Sam.","","Panggil saya Sam.","","","","你可以叫我 Sam。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5423":["","OK, Sam... So... What will happen now? Won\'t they send more police?","","Está bien, Sam... ¿Qué crees que pasará ahora? ¿No crees que enviarán a más policías?","","","","OK, Sam... Mas... O que vai acontecer agora? Eles não mandarão mais polícia?","Ok, Sam... Also.. Wie ghet es jetzt weiter? Sie werden doch nicht noch mehr Polizei schicken?","","Bine, Sam ... Deci ... Ce se va întâmpla acum? Nu vor trimite și mai mulți polițiști?","Okej, Sam... Więc... Co się teraz stanie? Nie wyślą oni więcej policji?","","OK. Sam... Dus... Wat zal er nu gebeuren? Zullen ze niet meer politie sturen?","","OK, Sam... Jadi... Apa yang akan berlaku sekarang? Mereka akan hantar lebih pihak polis kan?","","","","好，Sam... 那麼... 後續情形如何？難道他們不會派更多警察來嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5424":["","What do you think will happen now?","","¿Qué crees que pasará ahora?","","","","O que você acha que acontecerá agora?","Was denkst du, was jetzt passiert?","","Ce crezi că se va întâmpla acum?","Jak sądzisz, co się teraz stanie?","","Wat denk je dat er nu gaat gebeuren?","","Apa yang kamu rasa akan berlaku sekarang?","","","","你認為後續會怎麼發展？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5425":["","I don\'t think I get it. Who owns Mikaze Oil?","","Creo que no acabo de entenderlo bien. ¿A quién pertenece la Mikaze Oil?","Creo que no acabo de entenderlo bien. ¿Quién es el propietario de la Mikaze Oil?","","","Acho que não entendi. A quem pertence a Petróleo de Mikaze?","Ich denke nicht, dass ich es begriffen habe. Wer besitzt jetzt Mikaze Oil?","","Nu cred că m-am prins. Cine deține Mikaze-Petrol?","Nie sądzę, bym to <łapał/łapała>. Kto posiada Ropę Mikaze?","","Ik geloof niet dat ik het snap. Wie is de eigenaar van Mikaze Olie?","","Saya rasa saya tidak faham. Siapakah yang memiliki Mikaze Oil?","","","","我不認為我們已經成功。你認為誰實際擁有美風石油公司？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5426":["","Everybody who works here. We share the benefits. There are no owners.","","A todos y cada uno de los que trabajamos aquí. Compartimos los beneficios. A la vez, todos y ninguno de nosotros somos propietarios.","Todo el que trabaja aquí. Compartimos los beneficios. No hay propietarios.","","","Todo mundo que trabalha aqui. Nós dividimos o lucro. Não há proprietário.","Jeder der hier arbeitet. Wir teilen die Gewinne. Es gibt nicht den einen Besitzer.","","Toți cei care lucrează aici, împart beneficiile. Nu există proprietari.","Wszyscy, którzy tu pracują. Dzielimy się korzyściami. Nie ma żadnych właścicieli.","","Iedereen die hier werkt. We delen de opbrengsten. Er zijn geen eigenaren.","","Semua orang yang bekerja di sini. Kami berkongsi manfaat. Tiada pemilik.","","","","在這裡工作的人。我們分享利潤。沒有所謂的擁有者。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5427":["","But somebody needs to decide what to do. You can\'t do it all together, right?","","Pero alguien tiene que tomar las decisiones. No podéis hacerlo todos a la vez, ¿cierto?","Pero alguien tiene que tomar las decisiones. No se puede hacer todos juntos, ¿verdad?","","","Mas alguém precisa decidir o que fazer. Vocês todos não podem fazer isso juntos, certo?","Aber irgendjemand muss doch die Entscheidungen treffen? Dass könnt ihr doch nicht alle zusammen machen, oder?","","Dar cineva trebuie să ia decizii. Nu le puteți lua pe toate împreună, corect?","Ale ktoś potrzebuję decydować, co robić. Nie możecie tego robić wszyscy, prawda?","","Maar iemand moet beslissen wat er moet gebeuren. Dat kunnen jullie niet allemaal doen, toch?","","Tapi seseorang perlu membuat keputusan tentang apa yang perlu dibuat. Kamu tidak boleh melakukan semuanya sendiri kan?","","","","但是一定有人來決定該做甚麼。總不能任何事都投票吧？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5428":["","There\'s a committee formed by the most experienced workers. They take some of the decisions, but then, if there\'s something big and not too urgent, we can also decide it through voting.","","Claro que no. Nombramos un comité formado por los trabajadores más veteranos. Ellos toman la mayoría de las decisiones... Pero si hay que decidir sobre algo importante y que no sea demasiado urgente, también podemos decidir a través del voto.","Te explico. Hay un comité formado por los trabajadores más experimentados. Ellos toman la mayoría de las decisiones. Pero luego, si hay algo importante y no demasiado urgente, también podemos decidir a través del voto.","","","Há uma liderança formada pelos trabalhadores mais experientes. Eles tomam algumas das decisões, mas se há algo grande e não muito urgente, podemos decidir através de votação.","Dazu haben wir ein Kommittee aus den erfahrensten Arbeitern gebildet. Sie kümmern sich um einige Entscheidungen, aber wenn es großes und nicht so dringendes gibt, entscheiden wir durch eine Wahl."
         ,"","Există un comitet format din muncitorii cei mai experimentați. Ei iau unele decizii, dar dacă există ceva important și nu foarte urgent, putem, de asemenea, să decidem prin vot.","Jest komitet złożony z najbardziej doświadczonych robotników. Podejmują część decyzji, jednakże, jeśli jest coś dużego, a niezbyt pilnego, to my również możemy zadecydować poprzez głosowanie.","","Er is een commitee dat gevormd wordt door de meest ervaren werkers. Zij nemen sommige beslissingen, maar als er iets groots en niet urgents is, kunnen we ook beslissen door te stemmen.","","Terdapat satu jawatankuasa yang ditubuhkan oleh pekerja-pekerja yang paling berpengalaman. Mereka yang membuat kuputusan bagi beberapa perkara, tapi kalau terdapat sesuatu yang besar dan tidak penting, kami juga boleh membuat keputusan melalui pengundian.","","","","資深的成員成立了一個委員會。他們有時負責做出決策，但是對於那些重要且不緊急的事情我們也常透過投票解決。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5429":["","I see. Can I ask something else?","","Ya veo. ¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","Ya veo. ¿Puedo preguntar algo más?","","","Entendo. Posso te perguntar outra coisa?","Ich verstehe. Kann ich noch was fragen?","","Înțeleg. Pot să te întreb altceva?","Rozumiem. Czy mogę zapytać o coś innego?","","Ik snap het. Mag ik je iets anders vragen?","","Saya faham. Bolehkah saya tanya sesuatu yang lain?","","","","我懂了。我能問其他的事嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5430":["","In fact, there\'s nothing else I want to know right now. See you later. [leave]","","De hecho, no tengo más preguntas ahora mismo. Hasta luego. [marcharse]","De hecho, no hay nada más que quiera saber ahora mismo. Hasta luego. [marcharse]","","","De fato, não há nada mais que eu queira saber agora. Até logo. [sair]","Nun, ich habe im Moment keine Fragen mehr. Bis später. [gehen]","","De fapt, nu mai e nimic altceva ce-aș vrea să știu acum. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Właściwie, nie ma już nic innego, co bym <chciał/chciała> wiedzieć. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Eigenlijk is er verder niets wat ik nu wil weten. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Sebenarnya, tiada apa yang saya nak tahu buat sekarang. Jumpa kamu nanti. [Tinggal]","","","","事實上，我目前沒有甚麼想要知道的。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5431":["","What exactly happened with Workforce Merchants?","","¿Y qué pasó exactamente con los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra?","¿Qué pasó exactamente con los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra?","","","O que exatamente aconteceu com os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra?","Was ist genau mit den Arbeitskraft-Händlern passiert?","","Ce anume s-a întâmplat cu CFM?","Co się dokładnie wydarzyło z Handlarzami Siłą Roboczą?","","Wat is er precies gebeurd met de Werkkracht Handelaren?","","Apa sebenarnya yang terjadi dengan Workforce Merchants?","","","","你們與商賈公會之間到底發生了甚麼事？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","What exactly happened with them Workforce Merchants?","","","",""],
         "5432":["","Didn\'t Nikuban tell you? They bribed our committee and made them sign a sale contract. Weirdly enough there was nothing in the company regulations that prohibited it. We changed the regulations already and we also dismissed the committee and canceled all its recent decisions, but Workforce Merchants don\'t care. They have the contract and they have the entire Janubi government on their side, so we had no other choice, but to rebel.","","¿Nikuban no te lo ha contado? Pues verás, sobornaron a nuestro comité y les hicieron firmar un contrato de venta. Desgraciadamente, no había nada en los estatutos de la compañía que lo prohibiera. Ya hemos cambiado los estatutos, despedimos al comité y anulamos todas sus últimas decisiones. Pero eso a los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra no les importa. Ellos tienen el contrato firmado y tienen a todo el gobierno de Janubi de su parte, así que no tenemos más opción que rebelarnos y luchar por lo que es nuestro.","¿Nikuban no te lo dijo? Sobornaron a nuestro comité y les hicieron firmar un contrato de venta. Extrañamente no había nada en los reglamentos de la empresa que lo prohibiera. Ya hemos cambiado los reglamentos, también hemos despedido al comité y cancelado todas sus recientes decisiones, pero a los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra no les importa. Ellos tienen el contrato y tienen a todo el gobierno de Janubi de su lado, así que no tuvimos otra opción, más que rebelarnos."
         ,"","","Nikuban não te contou? Eles subornaram nossa liderança e a fizeram assinar um contrato de venda. Por mais estranho que pareça, não havia nada no regulamento da companhia proibindo isso. Nós já mudamos o regulamento, destituímos a antiga liderança e cancelamos todas as decisões recentes, mas os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra não se importam. Eles têm o contrato e o governo Janubi ao lado deles, então não tivemos outra opção senão a rebelião.","Hat Nikuban dir nichts erzählt? Sie haben unser Kommittee bestochen und sie einen Verkaufsvertrag unterzeichnen lassen. Komischer Weise gab es in dem Firmenvorschriften nichts, was es verboten hätte. Wir haben auch schon die Vorschriften geändert und das alte Kommittee entlassen und ihre letzten Entscheidungen annuliert. Aber das kümmert die Arbeitskraft-Händler nicht. Sie haben den Vertrag und die Regierung von Janubi auf ihrer Seite, also haben wir keine andere Wahl als zu rebellieren.","","Nu ți-a spus Nikuban? Au mituit comisia noastră și i-au făcut să semneze un contract de vânzare. Destul de ciudat că nu era nimic în regulamentele companiei să le interzică asta. Am schimbat regulamentele deja, am demis, de asemenea, comisia și le-am anulat toate deciziile recente, dar CFM-ului nu le pasă. Ei au contractul și au întregul guvern Janubi de partea lor, așa că n-am avut de ales, decât să ne revoltăm."
         ,"Nikuban ci nie mówił? Przekupili nasz komitet i nakłonili do podpisania sprzedażowego kontraktu. Wystarczająco dziwnym było, że nie było nic w regulaminie kompani zakazujących tego. Zmieniliśmy już regulamin i również zdymisjonowaliśmy komitet i wszystkie jego ostatnie decyzje, ale Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą to nie obchodzi. Mają kontrakt i cały rząd Janubi po swojej stronie, więc nie mieliśmy innego wyboru, jak wszcząć rebelię.","","Heeft Nikuban dat je niet verteld? Ze hebben ons commitee omgekocht en hen een verkoopcontract laten tekenen. Vreemd genoeg was er niets in de bedrijfsreglementen dat dat verbood. We hebben de reglementen al gewijzigd en we hebben ook het commitee ontbonden en al hun recente beslissingen geannuleerd, maar dat maakt de Werkkracht Handelaren niet uit. Ze hebben het contract en ze hebben de hele regering van Janubi aan hun kant, dus hadden we geen andere keus dan in opstand te komen.","","Nikuban tidak beritahu kamu? Mereka telah menyogok jawatankuasa kami dan paksa mereka menandatangani satu kontrak penjualan. Perkara yang pelik adalah tiada apa dalam peraturan syarikat yang melarangnya. Kami telah mengubah peraturan-peraturan dan juga memecat jawatankuasa dan membatalkan tindakan-tindakannya, tapi Workforce Merchants tidak peduli. Mereka mempunyai kontrak dan mereka mempunyai seluruh kerajaan Janubi pada sisi mereka, jadi kami tiada pilihan, tapi untuk memberontak."
         ,"","","","二句班沒告訴你嗎？他們賄絡了董事會然後逼他們簽了一張販賣的合約。奇怪的是這公司竟然沒有規則可以阻止這件事。我們已經修改了規章，解散了董事會，推翻了最近的決議，但是商賈工會不承認我們。他們拿著合約所以賈努比政府站在他們那邊，所以我們別無選擇，只有反抗。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5433":["","And why does the Liberation Army support you?","","¿Y por qué el Ejército de Liberación os apoya?","¿Y por qué el Ejército de Liberación los apoya?","","","E por que o Exército da Libertação apoia vocês?","Und warum unterstützt euch die Befreiungsarmee?","","Și de ce vă susține Armata Eliberării?","A czemu Armia Wyzwolenia was wspiera?","","En waarom steunt het Bevrijdingsleger jullie?","","Dan kenapa Liberation Army menyokong kamu?","","","","為什麼自由武裝幫你們？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5434":["","We have always been friends with them, but now they are even more interested in us because we\'re fighting their eternal enemy.","","Siempre hemos sido amigos, pero más aún ahora que estamos luchando contra su archienemigo.","Siempre hemos sido sus amigos, pero ahora están más interesados en nosotros porque estamos peleando contra su archienemigo.","","","Sempre fomos amigos deles, mas agora eles estão ainda mais interessados em nós pois estamos lutando contra o arqui-inimigo deles.","Wir waren schon immer mit ihnen befreundet, aber jetzt sind sie wollen sie uns noch mehr unterstützen, weil wir gegen ihre Erzfeinde kämpfen.","","Am fost mereu prieteni cu ei, dar acum sunt și mai interesați de noi, pentru că ne luptăm cu dușmanul lor de moarte.","Zawsze byliśmy z nimi przyjaciółmi, ale teraz są nami jeszcze bardziej zainteresowani, ponieważ zwalczamy ich odwiecznego wroga.","","We zijn altijd bevriend met ze geweest, maar nu zijn ze nog meer geïnteresseerd in ons omdat we strijden met hun eeuwige vijand."
         ,"","Kami sudah jadi kawan mereka untuk masa yang lama, tapi sekarang mereka mempunyai lebih minat dalam kami kerana kami sedang melawan musuh abadi mereka.","","","","我們以前只是朋友，但是現在他們對我們更加感興趣，因為我們正在對抗他們的敵人。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5435":["","OK. Can you answer more questions?","","Entiendo. ¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","Está bien. ¿Te puedo preguntar algo más?","","","OK. Pode me responder mais algumas questões?","Ok. Kannst du mir noch mehr Fragen beantworten?","","OK. Poți să răspunzi la câteva întrebări?","Okej. Czy możesz odpowiedzieć na więcej pytań?","","OK. Kun je nog meer vragen beantwoorden?","","OK. Bolehkah kamu menjawab lebih soalan?","","","","好。你可以回答我其他問題嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5436":["","What is your task here?","","¿Y en qué consiste exactamente tu trabajo aquí?","¿Cuál es tu trabajo aquí?","","","Qual é sua tarefa aqui?","Was ist hier deine Aufgabe?","","Care este sarcina ta aici?","Co jest tutaj twoim zadaniem?","","Wat is jouw taak hier?","","Apakah kerja kamu di sini?","","","","你在這裡做甚麼？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Argh! What ye be doing here?","","","","","","",""],
         "5437":["","I used to be a mechanic at the pumps, but since we dismissed our old committee we needed someone to take the immediate decisions that are especially important now when we need to fight. I was chosen for the job. It\'s temporary, until the emergency situation passes. Then we\'ll elect a new committee.","","Solía trabajar de mecánica en los pozos de petróleo. Pero en el momento en que despedimos al antiguo comité, necesitábamos a alguien que fuera capaz de tomar decisiones rápidas, especialmente ahora que tenemos que luchar. Y yo fui la elegida para el cargo. Es algo temporal, cuando todo esto se acabe, elegiremos un nuevo comité.","Solía trabajar de mecánica en los pozos de petróleo, pero desde que despedimos a nuestro viejo comité, necesitamos que alguien que tome decisiones inmediatas que son especialmente importantes ahora que debemos pelear. Yo fui la elegida para el trabajo. Es temporal, hasta que la emergencia pase. Luego elegiremos un nuevo comité.","","","Eu costumava ser uma mecânica nas bombas, mas desde que destituímos nossa antiga liderança nós precisávamos de alguém para tomar as decisões importantes, principalmente agora quando precisamos lutar. Eu fui escolhida para ocupar essa posição. É temporária, até que a situação de emergência passe. Quando isso acontecer, elegeremos uma nova liderança."
         ,"Ich war für ein Mechaniker abei den Pumpen, aber seitdem wir das alte Kommittee entlassen haben, brauchten wir jemand der schnelle Entscheidungen trifft, die gerade jetzt wo wir im kämpfen, wichtig sind. Ich wurde für diesen Job ausgewählt. Nur auf Zeit bis dieser Notfall vorbei ist. Dann wählen wir wieder ein neues Kommittee.","","Lucram ca mecanic la pompe, dar de când am demis comisia, e nevoie de cineva pentru a lua decizii imediate, care sunt deosebit de importante acum, când trebuie să luptăm. Am fost aleasă ca reprezentantă, temporar, până când situația de urgență trece. Apoi vom alege un nou comitet.","Zwykłam być mechanikiem przy pompach, ale odkąd zdymisjonowaliśmy nasz stary komitet, potrzebowaliśmy kogoś, kto podejmowałby natychmiastowe decyzje, które są szczególnie ważne teraz, kiedy potrzebujemy walczyć. Zostałam wybrana do tego zadania. Jest to tymczasowe, dopóki awaryjna sytuacja nie przeminie. Wtedy wybiorą nowy komitet.","","Ik was een monteur bij de pompen, maar sinds we ons oude commitee opgeheven hebben, hadden we iemand nodig om de directe beslissingen te nemen die vooral nu heel belangrijk zijn, nu we moeten vechten. Ik werd voor het werk gekozen. Het is tijdelijk, totdat de noodsituatie voorbij is. Dan zullen we een nieuw commitee kiezen."
         ,"","Sebelum ini saya adalah seorang mekanik dekat bahagian pam, tapi sejak kami memecat jawatankuasa lama kami kami perlu seseorang untuk membuat keputusan segera yang agak penting sekarang semasa kami perlu melawan. Saya telah dipilih untuk kerja tersebut. Ia hanya buat sementara, sehingga situasi kecemasan melalui. Selepas itu kami akan memilih jawatankuasa yang baru.","","","","我以前是馬達的機械工，但自從我們解散了董事會之後，我們需要有人在緊急的情形下做決策。我就被選來做這件事了。這是暫時的，直到緊急情形結束為止。到時候他們就會選出新的董事會。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5438":["","Do you plan to form part of it?","","¿Y piensas presentarte para formar parte de ese nuevo comité?","¿Planeas formar parte de ese nuevo comité?","","","Você pensa em fazer parte disso?","Plannst du, dich daran zu beteiligen?","","Ai de gând să faci parte din el?","Czy planujesz być jego częścią?","","Ben je van plan er lid van te worden?","","Adakah kamu merancang untuk menjadi sebahagian daripadanya?","","","","你想要參與董事會嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5439":["","I don\'t think so. Some say that I make a good leader, but I find it quite boring to lead a company when nothing special is going on. I may even leave the company when it\'ll be over. Maybe I\'ll start a caravan. I like traveling.","","No lo creo. Muchos dicen que yo sería una buena líder, pero creo que me veo dirigiendo esta compañía cuando todo esto pase. Dudo que hubiera que tomar decisiones importantes, y me aburriría. De hecho, incluso me estoy planteando si cambiar de trabajo y dejar la empresa. Puede que hasta decida montar mi propia caravana, quién sabe. Me gusta viajar.","No lo creo. Algunos dicen que sería una buena líder, pero me parece algo aburrido dirigir una compañía cuando no hay nada interesante que hacer. Quizá hasta abandone la compañía cuando todo se acabe. Tal vez comience mi propia caravana, me gusta viajar.","","","Creio que não. Alguns dizem que eu sou uma boa líder, mas eu acho muito entediante liderar uma companhia sem nada de especial. Talvez eu até abandone a companhia quando isso acabar. Talvez eu crie uma caravana. Eu curto viajar."
         ,"Ich denke nicht. Viel sagen ich wäre ein guter Anführer, aber ich finde es ziemlich langweilig eine Firma zu führen, bei der nichts besonderes passiert. Ich werde die Firma verlassen, wenn alles vorbei ist. Vielleicht starte ich eine Karawane. Ich liebe das Reisen.","","Nu cred. Unii spun că aș fi un lider bun, dar mi se pare destul de plictisitor să conduci o companie, atunci când nu se întâmplă nimic special. Aș putea chiar pleca din companie, atunci când totul se va termina. Poate că voi pune bazele unei caravane. Îmi place să călătoresc.","Nie sądzę. Niektórzy mówią, że byłabym dobrą przywódczynią, ale odnajduję dość nudnym prowadzenie kompani, kiedy nic specjalnego się nie dzieje. Może nawet opuszczę kompanię, kiedy to się skończy. Może rozpocznę karawanę. Lubię podróżować.","","Ik denk het niet. Sommigen zeggen dat ik een goede leider zou zijn, maar ik vind het vrij vervelend om een bedrijf te leiden als er niets bijzonders aan de hand is. Ik zou zelfs het bedrijf kunnen verlaten als het voorbij is. Misschien begin ik een karavaan. Ik hou van reizen."
         ,"","Saya rasa tidak. Ada yang kata saya adalah ketua yang baik, tapi saya tiada minat untuk memimpin sebuah syarikat kalau tiada perkara spesial yang sedang berlaku. Saya juga mungkin akan tinggalkan syarikat selepas ia tamat. Mungkin saya akan memulakan satu karavan. Saya suka mengembara.","","","","我還沒這樣想，有些人說我是一個好的領導人，但是我覺得領導一間公司有點無聊，尤其是沒有特別的事情發生的時候。事情結束後，我希望離開這間公司。也許會做起商旅的生意。我喜歡旅遊。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5440":["","Can I ask you something else?","","¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","¿Te puedo preguntar algo más?","","","Posso te pedir outra coisa?","Kann ich dich noch etwas fragen?","","Pot să te întreb ceva?","Czy mogę zapytać cię o coś innego?","","Mag ik je iets anders vragen?","","Bolehkah saya tanya kamu sesuatu yang lain?","","","","我可以問你其他東西嗎？","","Μπορώ να σε ρωτήσω κάτι άλλο;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5441":["","How about joining me? We could continue this fight together.","","¿Y por qué no te unes a mi caravana? Tendrías la oportunidad de seguir luchando junto a mí.","","","","Que tal juntar-se a mim? Poderíamos continuar essa luta <juntos/juntas>.","Was hältst du davon, wenn du dich mir anzuschließt? Wir könnten weiter Seite an Seite kämpfen.","","Ce zici dacă ai veni cu mine? Am putea continua această luptă împreună.","Co powiesz na dołączenie do mnie? Moglibyśmy kontynuować tę walkę razem.","","Wat denk je ervan om je bij mij te voegen? We zouden samen dit gevecht voort kunnen zetten.","","Bagaimana dengan menyertai saya? Kita boleh meneruskan perjuangan ini bersama-sama.","","","","加入我如何？我們可以一起繼續這場戰鬥。","","Τι θα \'λεγες να ερχόσουν μαζί μου; Θα μπορούσαμε να συνεχίσουμε μαζί τον αγώνα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5442":["","Do you want to join me to fight Workforce Merchants and their allies together?","","¿Quieres unirte a mi caravana y luchar junto a mí en contra los Comerciantes de Caravana y sus socios?","¿Quieres unirte a mí para pelear contra los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra y sus aliados juntos?","","","Você quer se juntar a mim para combater os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra e os aliados deles?","Willst du dich mir anschließen um gemeinsam gegen die Arbeitskraft-Händler und ihre Verbündeten zu kämpfen?","","Vrei să vii cu mine, să luptăm împreună, împotriva CFM-ului și a aliaților săi?","Czy chcesz przyłączyć się do mnie, by walczyć razem przeciwko Handlarzom Siłą Roboczą i ich sojusznikami?","","Wil je dat ik meedoe om samen tegen de Werkkracht Handelaren en hun bondgenoten te vechten?","","Adakah kamu nak menyertai saya untuk melawan Workforce Merchants dan kumpulan sekutu mereka?","","","","你想要加入我們一起對抗商賈公會跟他們的同夥嗎？","","Θα ήθελες να έρθεις μαζί μου για να αγωνιστούμε εναντίον των Εμπόρων Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας και των συμμάχων τους;"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Do yall wanna join me to fight them Workforce Merchants and their friends together?","","","",""],
         "5443":["","It would be really great, but, you know, I have an important task here.","","Molaría... Pero entiéndeme, aquí todavía me necesitan.","Sería realmente grandioso, pero, ya sabes, tengo una labor muy importante aquí.","","","Seria muito legal, mas, você sabe, tenho uma tarefa importante aqui.","Es wäre wirklich großartig, aber weißt du, ich habe hier eine wichtige Aufgabe.","","Ar fi cu adevărat minunat, dar, știi, am o sarcină importantă aici.","Byłoby naprawdę wspaniale, ale <sam/sama> wiesz, mam tutaj ważne zadanie.","","Het zou echt geweldig zijn, maar, weet je, ik heb een belangrijke taak hier.","","Bagus juga kalau begitu, tapi, kamu tahu, saya mempunyai kerja yang penting di sini.","Det ville være virkelig fedt, men, du ved, jeg har en vigtig opgave her.","","","那一定很棒，但是我這裡還有重要的工作要做。","","Θα ήταν υπέροχο, αλλά ξέρεις, έχω μία σοβαρή αποστολή εδώ.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5444":["","I understand. Well. Can I ask you something else then?","","Lo entiendo. Bueno, ¿puedo preguntarte algo más?","Lo entiendo. Bueno, ¿podría preguntarte algo más?","","","Entendo. Bem. Posso te pedir outra coisa então?","Ich verstehe. Kann ich dich noch etwas fragen?","","Am înțeles. Bine. Pot să te întreb altceva atunci?","Rozumiem. No nic. Czy mogę zapytać cię o coś innego?","","Ik begrijp het. Wel. Mag ik je dan wat anders vragen?","","Saya faham. Mmm. Bolehkah saya tanya kamu sesuatu yang lain kalau begitu?","Jeg forstår. Nå. Må jeg spørger dig om noget andet?","","","我了解了。這個嘛。我能問你一些其他事嗎？","","Καταλαβαίνω. Έχει καλώς. Μπορώ να σε ρωτήσω όμως κάτι άλλο;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5445":["","Come on. I\'m sure they will find somebody to substitute you.","","¡Vamos, hombre! Estoy <seguro/segura> de que encontrarán a alguien que te sustituya.","¡Vamos! Estoy <seguro/segura> que encontrarán a alguien que pueda reemplazarte.","","","Vamos. Tenho certeza que eles encontrarão alguém para substituir você.","Komm schon. Ich bin mir sicher, dass es jemanden gibt der dich ersetzen kann.","","Haide. Sunt sigur că vor găsi pe cineva să te înlocuiască.","No dalej. Jestem <pewny/pewna>, że znajdą oni kogoś do zastąpienia ciebie.","","Kom op. Ik weet zeker dat ze iemand zullen vinden om je te vervangen.","","Ayuhlah. Saya pasti bahawa mereka akan cari seseorang untuk mengganti kamu.","Kom nu. Jeg er sikker på at de nok skal finde en som kan erstatte dig.","","","來嘛。我很確信他們能找到人代替你。","","Έλα λοιπόν, Είμαι <σίγουρος/σίγουρη> ότι θα βρουν κάποιον να σε αντικαταστήσουν.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5446":["","Are you serious?","","¿Lo dices en serio?","¿Hablas en serio?","","","Fala sério?","Ist das Dein Ernst?","","Vorbești serios?","Jesteś serio?","","Ben je serieus?","","Adakah kamu serius?","Mener du det?","","","你是認真的嗎？","","Είσαι <σοβαρός/σοβαρή>","","","","","","","Seryoso ka?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5447":["","Absolutely.","","","Por supuesto.","","","Com certeza.","Absolut.","","Categoric.","Absolutnie.","","Absoluut.","","Sudah tentu.","Bestemt.","","","當然。","","Απόλυτα.","","","","","","","Oo naman.","","","","","","","","","","Aye.","","","","","I tant que sí!","",""],
         "5448":["","Wow! That would be really awesome... Let me think... Yeah... There might be a way. Wait here a second.","","¡Guau! Estaría genial... Déjame pensar... Sí... Creo que podría funcionar. Espera aquí un segundo.","¡Wow! Eso sería realmente asombroso... Déjame pensar... Ajá... Quizá haya una manera. Espera aquí un segundo.","","","Uau! Isso seria muito legal... Deixe-me pensar... Sim... Deve haver um jeito. Aguarde aqui um instante.","Wow! Das wäre wirklich grandios... Lass mich überlegen... Yeah... Da gibt es eine Möglichkeit. Warte mal einen Moment.","","Wow! Asta ar fi cu adevărat minunat ... Stai să mă gândesc ... Da ... Ar putea fi o cale. Așteaptă aici o secundă.","Łoł! Byłoby naprawdę zarąbiście... Pozwól mi pomyśleć... Ano... Może jest sposób. Czekaj tu sekundę.","","Wow! Dat zou echt fantastisch zijn... Laat me denken... Ja... Er zou een manier kunnen zijn. Wacht hier een moment.","","Wow! Baguslah kalau begitu... Bagi saya fikir... Ya... Mungkin terdapat cara. Bagi saya sekejap."
         ,"Wow! Det ville være rigtig fedt... Lad mig tænke over det... Ja... Der er muligvis en måde. Vent her.","","","哇！那真驚人... 讓我想想... 好... 那也是一種做法。在這等我一下。","","Αα! Αυτό θα ήταν καταπληκτικό... Άσε με να σκεφτώ... Ναι... Ίσως υπάρχει τρόπος. Περίμενε εδώ ένα λεπτό.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5449":["","[wait]","","[esperar]","[esperar]","","","[esperar]","[warten]","","[așteaptă]","[czekaj]","","[wacht]","","[Tunggu]","[Vent]","","","[等待]","","[αναμονή]","","","","","","","[hintay]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5450":["","Kay. I already arranged my substitution. I\'m ready to go.","","¡Hecho! He conseguido arreglar lo de mi sustituto. Cuando quieras partimos, estoy lista.","Está bien. Ya ordené a mi reemplazo. Estoy lista para ir.","","","OK. Já consegui alguém para me substituir. Estou pronta para ir.","Kay. Ich habe jetzt einen Ersatz organisiert. Ich bin bereit um zu gehen.","","OK. Am aranjat deja cu înlocuitorul meu. Sunt gata de plecare.","Kej. Zaaranżowałam już moje zastępstwo. Jestem gotowa do pójścia.","","OK. Ik heb mijn vervanging al geregeld. Ik ben klaar om te gaan.","","Kay. Saya sudah mengaturkan pengganti saya. Saya bersedia untuk berlepas.","Ok. Jeg har allerede klaret min erstatning. Jeg er klar til at gå","","","好。我安排好我的代理人。我準備好出發了。","","\'Ντάξει. Κανόνισα ήδη την αντικατάστασή μου. Είμαι έτοιμη να ξεκινήσουμε.","","","","","","","Ayos. Inasikaso ko na ang aking kapalit. Handa na akong umalis","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5451":["","Great! Let\'s go then. [leave]","","¡Perfecto! En marcha, pues. [marcharse]","¡Bien! Vámonos pues. [marcharse]","","","Legal! Vamos nessa então. [sair]","Großartig! Auf geht\'s. [gehen]","","Grozav! Să mergem atunci. [pleacă]","Słodko! Ruszajmy więc. [odejdź]","","Geweldig! Laten we gaan dan. [vertrekken]","","Bagus! Kalau begitu mari kita pergi. [Tinggal]","Godt! Så lad os gå. [gå]","","","太好了！那麼我們出發吧。[離開]","","Άψογα. Πάμε λοιπόν. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Avast! Set sail then. [leave]","","","","","","",""],
         "5452":["","You did a really great job helping the rebels! Thanks a lot!","","¡Has hecho un excelente trabajo apoyando a los rebeldes! ¡Muchas gracias!","¡Hiciste un gran trabajo ayudando a los rebeldes! ¡Muchas gracias!","","","Você realmente fez um bom trabalho ajudando aos rebeldes! Muito obrigado!","Du hast sehr gute Arbeit bei der Unterstützung der Rebellen geleistet. Hab vielen Dank!","","Ai făcut o treabă grozavă ajutând rebelii! Mulțumesc mult!","<Wykonałeś/Wykonałaś> naprawdę wspaniałą robotę pomagając rebeliantom! Dzięki bardzo!","","Je hebt heel goed werk gedaan door de rebellen te helpen! Heel erg bedankt!","","Kamu telah melakukan kerja yang baik menolong kumpulan rebels! Ribuan terima kasih!","","","","你在幫助反叛軍上做得很好！非常感謝你！","","Έκανες πραγματικά καλή δουλειά βοηθώντας τους εξεγερμένους. Σ\' ευχαριστώ.","","","","","","","Mahusay ang ginawa mo! Maraming salamat!","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5453":["","They all died. The rebellion has been suppressed and Workforce Merchants own the company now.","","Los han matado a todos. La rebelión ha sido aplastada y los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra se han hecho con el control de la compañía.","","","","Todos morreram. A rebelião foi suprimida e os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra possuem a companhia agora.","Sie sind alle gestorben. Der Aufstand wurde niedergeschlagen und die Arbeitskraft-Händler besitzen jetzt die Firma.","","Au murit cu toții. Rebeliunea a fost suprimată, iar acum, CFM deține compania.","Wszyscy zginęli. Rebelia została stłumiona, a Handlarze Siłą Roboczą posiadają teraz kompanię.","","Ze zijn allemaal dood. De opstand is onderdrukt en de Werkkracht Handelaren bezitten het bedrijf nu.","","Mereka semua telah mati. Pemberontakan telah dihentikan dan Workforce Merchants memiliki syarikat tersebut sekarang.","","","","他們都死了。反抗軍被鎮壓然後現在商賈公會擁有了那間公司。","","Όλοι πέθαναν. Η εξέγερση καταπνίγηκε και οι εταιρεία είναι στα χέρια των Εμπόρων Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας."
         ,"","","","","","","Patay na silang lahat. Napigilan ang rebelyon at pagmamay-ari na ng Workforce Merchants ang kumpanya.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5454":["","Rebels won. It\'s a pity that Sam didn\'t live to see the victory.","","La rebelión ha triunfado. Qué pena que Sam no haya sobrevivido para poder verlo.","","","","Os rebeldes venceram. É uma pena que Sam não viveu para ver a vitória.","Die Rebellen haben gewonnen. Es ist schade, dass Sam nicht mehr lebt um den Sieg zu sehen.","","Rebelii au câștigat. Păcat că Sam nu a trăit să vadă victoria.","Rebelianci wygrali. Niestety, Sam nie przeżyła, aby zobaczyć zwycięstwo.","","De rebellen hebben gewonnen. Het is jammer dat Sam niet lang genoeg geleefd heeft om de overwinning te zien.","","Kumpulan rebels telah menang. Malangnya Sam telah mati dan tak dapat tengok kemenangan mereka.","","","","反叛軍贏了。很遺憾 Sam 沒有活著看到這場勝利。","","Οι εξεγερμένοι νίκησαν. Κρίμα που ο Sam δεν έζησε για να το δεί.","","","","","","","Nanalo ang mga rebelde. Sayang at hindi na nakita ni Sam ang pagkapanalo.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5455":["","I\'m glad I had a chance to support a good cause.","","Ha sido un auténtico placer haber apoyado una causa justa como la suya.","","","","Sou grato pela chance de ajudar em uma boa causa.","Ich bin froh, dass ich für eine gute Sache kämpfen konnte.","","Mă bucur că am avut șansa de a susține o cauză bună.","Cieszę się, że <miałem/miałam> szansę wesprzeć dobrą sprawę.","","Ik ben blij dat ik de kans had om een goed doel te steunen.","","Saya gembira kerana saya dapat peluang untuk menyokong satu tujuan yang baik.","","","","我很高興有這機會支持這次行動。","","Χαίρομαι που είχα την ευκαιρία να υποστηρίξω ένα καλό σκοπό","","","","","","","Masaya ako na makatulong sa mabuting bagay.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5456":["","Sorry about it. What do I do now?","","Pues sí, una verdadera lástima. ¿Y ahora yo qué debo hacer?","","","","Desculpe-me por isso. O que faço agora?","Das tut mir Leid. Was soll ich jetzt machen?","","Îmi pare rău pentru asta. Acum ce fac?","Przykro mi z tego powodu. Co mam robić teraz?","","Sorry daarvoor. Wat moet ik nu doen?","","Minta maaf atasnya. Apa yang harus saya buat sekarang?","","","","抱歉。我現在怎麼辦？","","Λυπάμαι γιαυτό. Τι κάνω τώρα;","","","","","","","Ikunalulungkot ko ang nangyari. Ano na ang gagawin ko ngayon?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5457":["","She was a brave woman.","","Era una mujer muy valiente.","","","","Ela foi uma mulher guerreira.","Sie war eine mutige Frau.","","A fost o femeie curajoasă.","Była odważną kobietą.","","Ze was een dappere vrouw.","","Dia adalah wanita yang berani.","","","","她是一個勇敢的女性。","","Ήταν γενναία γυναίκα.","","","","","","","siya ay matapang na babae","","","Lei era una donna coraggiosa.","","","","","","","","","","","","Era una dona molt valenta.","",""],
         "5458":["","You are probably asking yourself what\'s next, right? We can\'t be totally sure. The police may send more people to attack the rebels or they may take other actions. In any case, our struggle is far from being over. The situation is more tense than ever, but it\'s a good thing. It\'s better than the frustrating calmness we had here before.","","Supongo que te preguntarás qué pasará ahora, ¿no? Pues no podemos estar seguros del todo. Puede que la Policía mande a más hombres o que emprenda otro tipo de acciones en contra de los rebeldes. En cualquier caso nuestra lucha está lejos de haberse terminado. De hecho, la situación está más tensa que nunca... Pero eso no es malo del todo. Al menos es mejor que la frustrante calma que teníamos antes.","","","","Você está provavelmente se perguntando o que vem a seguir, não é? Nós não estamos totalmente certos. A polícia pode mandar mais gente atacar os rebeldes ou tomar outras ações. De qualquer modo, nossa luta está longe de acabar. A situação é mais tensa do que nunca, mas é algo bom. É melhor do que a calmaria frustrante que tínhamos antes."
         ,"Du fragst dich vielleicht selbst, was als Nächstes passiert, oder? Wir sind nicht ganz sicher. Vielleicht schickt die Polizei noch mehr Leute um die Rebelllen anzugreifen oder sie ergreifen ganz andere Maßnahmen. Auf jeden Fall sind unsere Streitigkeiten noch lange nicht vorbei. Die Situation ist noch angespannter als bisher, aber das ist Gut. Es ist besser als dieser beklemmende Frieden, den wir bis jetzt hatten.","","Probabil te întrebi ce urmează acum, corect? Nu putem fi foarte siguri. Poliția poate trimite mai mulți oameni pentru a ataca rebelii sau vor lua alte măsuri. În orice caz, lupta noastră e departe de a fi terminată. Situația este mult mai tensionată decât oricând, dar asta-i bine. E mai bine decât calmul frustrant, pe care-l aveam înainte.","Zapewne pytasz siebie, co będzie dalej, prawda? Nie możemy być totalnie pewni. Policja może wysłać więcej ludzi do zaatakowania rebeliantów lub może przedsięwziąć inne akcję. W każdym razie, nasza batalia jest daleko od zakończenia. Sytuacja jest bardziej napięta niż kiedykolwiek, ale to dobrze. Lepsze to niż frustrujący spokój, który mieliśmy wcześniej."
         ,"","Je vraagt je waarschijnlijk af wat er nu komt, toch? We kunnen er niet helemaal zeker van zijn. De politie zou meer mensen kunnen sturen om de rebellen aan te vallen of ze kunnen andere acties ondernemen. In ieder geval is onze strijd nog lang niet voorbij. De situatie is meer gespannen dan ooit, maar dat is goed. Het is beter dan de frustrerende kalmte die we hier eerder hadden.","","Kamu kemungkinan sedang tanya sendiri apa berikutnya, kan? Kita memang takkan tahu. Polis mungkin akan menghantar lebih orang untuk menyerang kumpulan rebels atau mereka mungkin mengambil tindakan yang lain. Dalam sebarang kes, perjuangan kita masih jauh daripada tamat. Situasi sekarang lebih cemas berbanding dulu, tapi mujurlah ia lebih baik daripada ketenangan kami pernah ada di sini dulu yang mengecewakan.","","","","你是問你自己接下來要做甚麼對吧？我們還沒確定。警方會派更多人來攻擊反叛軍，然後他們可能會採取其他行動。不管是甚麼情形，我們的掙扎都只能是拖延時間。情況已經比之前更險峻，但是現在的情形比起之前的僵局好多了。","","Μάλλον ρωτάς τον εαυτό σου τι υπάρχει για μετά, σωστά; Δεν μπορούμε να \'μαστε απόλυτα σίγουροι. Η αστυνομία μπορεί να στείλει ανθρώπους να επιτεθούν στους επαναστάτες ή μπορεί να πάρουν άλλα μέτρα. Σε κάθε περίπτωση η αντιπαράθεσή μας απέχει πολύ από το τέλος. Η κατάσταση είναι πιο ευαίσθητη από ποτέ, αλλά ένα καλό είναι ότι είναι προτιμότερη από την απογοητευτική ηρεμία που είχαμε πριν."
         ,"","","","","","","Marahil tinatanong mo ang sarili mo kung ano na ang mangyayaring kasunod, tama? Hindi pa natin alam sa ngayon. Marahil magpadala ang kapulisan ng mas maraming tao upang labanan ang mga rebelde o gumawa ng ibang mga bagay. Kahit ano pa iyon ay hindi pa tapos ang lahat. Mas matindi ang sitwasyon ngayon, pero ito ay makabubuti. Mas maganda na ito kaysa nakakapanlumong katahimikan na nararanasan natin dati.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5459":["","What will be my role in the struggle?","","¿Y cuál será mi papel en esta nueva fase de la lucha?","","","","Qual será o meu papel nessa luta?","Was wird meine Rolle in diesem Konflikt sein?","","Care va fi rolul meu în lupta asta.","Jaka będzie moja rola w zmaganiu?","","Wat zal mijn rol zijn in de strijd?","","Apakah peranan saya dalam perjuangan tersebut?","","","","在這場爭鬥之中我的角色是甚麼？","","Ποιός θα είναι ο ρόλος μου στην αντιπαράθεση;","","","","","","","Ano ang magiging papel ko sa pakikibakang ito?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5460":["","After helping the rebels you became pretty famous around here, and when I say famous, I mean that the police knows you very well. They\'ll be after you, which means after us too. One day we\'ll be ready for an open confrontation and that day we\'ll need you on our side, but for as long as we\'re fighting a clandestine war, it\'d be better for everyone if you disappeared for a while, until the things calm down a bit. I suggest you to go north, to the Qubba region. Their government is friendly towards us, and you can be sure that you\'ll not be persecuted there.","","Después de haber ayudado a los rebeldes has ganado cierta fama y, cuando digo fama, me refiero a que la Policía te conoce demasiado bien. Irán detrás de ti, lo que significa que también irán a por nosotros. Puede que algún día estemos preparados para hacerles frente abiertamente, y ese día esperamos contar contigo a nuestro lado. Pero hasta ese día, nuestra lucha seguirá siendo clandestina y por eso, ahora mismo, lo mejor para todos será que te mantengas en un segundo plano durante algún tiempo, por lo menos hasta que las cosas se hayan calmado un poco. Te sugiero que te dirijas al Norte, a la región de Qubba. Tenemos una alianza con el gobierno de Qubba y puedes estar <seguro/segura> de que no se atreverán a seguirte hasta allí."
         ,"","","","Depois de ajudar os rebeldes você ficou muito famoso por aqui, e quando digo famoso, quero dizer que a polícia lhe conhece bem. Eles ficarão atrás de você, o que significa atrás de nós também. Um dia nós estaremos prontos para um confronto aberto e nesse dia precisaremos de você do nosso lado, mas enquanto estivermos lutando uma guerra clandestina, seria melhor para todo mundo se você desaparecesse por um tempo, até as coisas se acalmarem um pouco. Eu sugiro que você vá para o norte, para a região de Qubba. O governo é amigável conosco, e você pode ter certeza de que não será perseguido lá.","Nachdem du den Rebellen geholfen hast, bist du hier ziemlich berühmt und wenn ich sage berühmt, meine ich, dass die Polizei dich sehr genau kennt. Sie werden hinter dir her sein und somit auch hinter uns. Eines Tages werden wir bereit für einen offenen Kampf sein und dann brauchen wir dich auf unserer Seite. Aber bis dahin kämpfen wir noch im verborgenen gegen sie und es wäre gut wenn du deswegen für eine Weile von hier verschwinden könntest, bis sich die Wogen geglättet haben. Ich rate dir, nach Norden in Richtung Qubba zu gehen. Ihre Regierung steht auf unserer Seite und du kannst dir sicher sein, dass sie dich dort nicht verurteilen werden."
         ,"","Dupa ce-ai ajutat rebelii, ai devenit destul de <faimos/faimoasă> pe aici, și când spun <faimos/faimoasă>, vreau să spun că poliția te cunoaște foarte bine. Vor fi pe urmele tale și pe ale noastre. Într-o zi vom fi gata pentru o confruntare deschisă, iar în acea zi vom avea nevoie să fi de partea noastră, dar atâta timp cât suntem  într-un război clandestin, ar fi mai bine pentru toată lumea dacă ai dispărea pentru o vreme, până când lucrurile se calmează un pic. Îți sugerez să te duci în nord, în regiunea Qubba. Guvernul lor este prietenos cu noi și poți fi <sigur/sigură> că nu vei fi <persecutat/persecutată> acolo.","Po tym jak <pomogłeś/pomogłaś> rebeliantom, <stałeś/stałaś> się mocno <sławny/sławna> w tej okolicy, a kiedy mówię <sławny/sławna>, mam na myśli, że policja zna cię bardzo dobrze. Będą cię ścigać, co oznacza, że będą ścigać też nas. Pewnego dnia będziemy gotowi na otwartą konfrontację i tego dnia będziemy cię potrzebować po naszej stronie, jednakże tak długo jak toczymy potajemną wojnę, byłoby lepiej dla wszystkich, gdybyś <zniknął/zniknęła> na trochę, dopóki sprawy się trochę nie uspokoją. Sugeruje byś <ruszył/ruszyła> na północ, do regionu Qubba. Ich rząd jest nam przyjazny, a więc możesz być <pewny/pewna>, że nie będziesz tam <prześladowany/prześladowana>."
         ,"","Nadat je de rebellen geholpen hebt, ben je behoorlijk beroemd geworden hier, en als ik beroemd zeg, bedoel ik dat de politie je heel goed kent. Ze zullen achter je aan zitten, wat betekent ook achter ons. Op een dag zullen we klaar zijn voor een openlijke confrontatie en die dag zullen we je nodig hebben aan onze zijde, maar zolang we een clandestiene oorlog voeren, zou het beter zijn voor iedereen als je een tijdje zou verdwijnen tot de dingen wat kalmeren. Ik raad je aan om naar het noorden te gaan, naar de regio van Qubba. Hun regering is vriendelijk naar ons en je kunt er zeker van dat je daar niet vervolgd wordt.","","Selepas menolong kumpulan rebels, kamu telah menjadi agak terkenal di kawasan ini, dan bila saya kata terkenal, saya maksudkan bahawa polis kenal kamu secara mendalam. Mereka akan kejar kamu, dan ia bermaksud kami juga. Suatu hari nanti kami akan bersedia untuk satu konfrontasi terbuka dan pada hari tersebut kami akan memerlukan pertolongan kamu juga, tapi selagi kita masih berperang secara rahsia, ia lebih baik untuk kita semua kalau kamu menghilangkan diri buat sementara, sehingga keadaan bertenang. Saya mencadangkan supaya kamu pergi ke kawasan utara, ke kawasan Qubba. Kerajaan mereka adalah sekutu kami, dan kamu pasti tidak akan dianiaya di situ."
         ,"","","","幫助了反叛軍你已經變得很有名了，意思是警方已經認識你，他們會追擊你，同時也追擊我們。有一天我們必須公開回擊，我希望那天來到的時候你站在我們這邊的。但是只要我們目前繼續打游擊戰，你最好躲一陣子，直到熱潮消退一點。我建議你去北方，庫巴區域。那邊的政府軍對我們很友善，我相信你在那邊不會受到迫害。","","Αφού βοήθησες τους επαναστάτες έγινες αρκετά <διάσημος/διάσημη> εδώ γύρω και όταν λέω <διάσημος/διάσημη>, εννοώ ότι η αστυνομία σε ξέρει πολύ καλά. Θα σε παρακολουθούν που σημαίνει ότι θα παρακολουθούν κι εμάς επίσης. Μια μέρα θα \'μαστε έτοιμοι για ανοιχτή αντιπαράθεση και εκείνη τη μέρα θα σε χρειαστούμε δίπλα μας, αλλά για όσο πολεμάμε μυστικά θα \'ταν καλύτερα για όλους να εξαφανιστείς για λίγο, μέχρι να ηρεμήσουν τα πράγματα λιγάκι. Προτείνω να πας βόρεια στην επαρχία της Qubba. Η κυβέρνηση είναι φιλική απέναντί μας και μπορείς να είσαι σίγουρος ότι δεν θα προσαχθείς εκεί.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5461":["","OK. I understand.","","Ajá. Entiendo.","","","","OK. Eu entendo.","Okay. Ich verstehe.","","OK. Am înțeles.","Okej. Rozumiem.","","Ok. Ik begrijp het.","","OK. Saya faham.","","","","好。我了解了。","","ΟΚ. Καταλαβαίνω.","","","","","","","Naintindihan ko.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5462":["","You\'ve done really excellent work for us. We\'re short on money and all we can give you is 10,000, which is not enough for what you\'ve done, but we simply don\'t have more. I\'d also like to give you a little present from my part. It\'s a rare revolver. They say that it\'s the most powerful one you can possibly find. It\'s good against armor. I\'ll give you all the ammo I have for it, but I don\'t know where to find more. Maybe some stores in the north have it.","","Mira, has hecho un excelente trabajo para nosotros. Andamos algo escasos de presupuesto y por eso sólo puedo darte 10,000 € de recompensa. Entiendo que es mucho menos de lo que mereces, pero es que no puedo darte más. Sin embargo, quisiera que aceptaras este pequeño obsequio de mi parte. Es un revólver, pero no uno cualquiera. Dicen que es el revólver más poderoso que existe. Y es capaz de atravesar blindajes. Te daré toda la munición que tengo para que puedas usarlo. Se puede conseguir más, pero no en esta región. Tendrás que buscarla en alguna de las tiendas del norte."
         ,"","","","Você fez um trabalho realmente excelente para nós. Nós estamos vazios de dinheiro e tudo que podemos lhe dar é 10,000, o que não é o suficiente pelo que você fez, mas nós simplesmente não temos mais. Eu gostaria também de lhe dar um pequeno presente de minha parte. É um revólver raro. Dizem que é o mais poderoso que você pode achar. É bom contra armaduras. Eu lhe darei toda a munição que tenho para ele, mas eu não sei onde achar mais. Talvez algumas lojas ao norte possuam.","Du hast für uns wirklich hervorragende Arbeit geleistet. Aber wir sind knapp bei Kasse und können dir nur 10.000 geben. Es ist zwar nicht genug für das was du getan hast, aber wir haben einfach nicht mehr. Ich möchte dir auch noch ein kleines Geschenk von mir geben. Es ist ein seltener Revolver. Es heißt, er ist der Stärkste, den du finden kannst. Er ist gut gegen Panzerung und ich geb dir alle Munition, die ich für ihn habe, aber ich weiß nicht, wo man noch mehr davon finden kann. Vielleicht gibt es im Norden Läden, die noch solche Munition haben."
         ,"","Ai făcut un lucru cu adevărat extraordinar, pentru noi. N-avem mulți bani și tot ce-ți pot oferi este 10.000, ceea ce nu este suficient pentru ceea ce ai făcut, dar pur și simplu nu avem mai mult. Aș dori, de asemenea, să-ți dau un mic cadou din partea mea. Este un revolver rar. Se spune că este cel mai puternic pe care-l poți găsi. E superb împotriva armurii. Îți voi da toată muniția pe care o am, dar nu știu unde poți găsi mai mult. Poate că unele magazine din nord au așa ceva.","<Wykonałeś/Wykonałaś> kawał wyśmienitej roboty dla nas. Brakuję nam pieniędzy i wszystko, co możemy tobie dać to 10,000, co nie wystarcza za wszystko, co <zrobiłeś/zrobiłaś>, ale zwyczajnie nie mamy więcej. Chciałbym również dać mały prezent z mojej strony. To rzadki rewolwer. Mówią, że to najpotężniejszy jaki można znaleźć. Jest dobry przeciwko zbroi. Dam ci do niego całą amunicję jaką mam, ale nie wiem, gdzie znaleźć więcej. Może sklepy na północy będą miały.","","Je hebt heel goed werk voor ons gedaan. We hebben weinig geld en al wat je je kunnen geven is 10.000, wat niet genoeg is voor wat je gedaan hebt, maar we hebben gewoon niet meer. Ik zou je ook een kadootje willen geven namens mezelf. Het is een zeldzame revolver. Ze zeggen dat het de meest krachtige is die je kan vinden. Hij is goed tegen bepantsering. Ik zal je alle munitie geven die ik er voor heb, maar ik weet niet waar je meer kan vinden. Misschien hebben sommige winkels in het noorden het."
         ,"","Kamu telah melakukan kerja yang hebat untuk kami. Wang kami tak banyak dan kami hanya boleh bagi kamu 10,000. Ia memang tak cukup untuk apa yang kamu telah mencapai, tapi ini saja yang kami ada. Saya juga nak memberi kepada kamu satu hadiah. Ia adalah revolver yang susah dicari. Orang kata bahawa ia adalah revolver yang paling berkuasa yang kamu boleh dapat. Ia berkesan terhadap perisai. Saya akan beri kamu semua amunisi yang saya ada, tapi saya tak pasti di mana kamu boleh mencari lebih. Mungkin kedai-kedai di kawasan utara menjualkannya.","","","","你達成了這件傑出的任務。但我們資金有點短缺，所以我們只能給你10000，當然，那比起你的付出不值一哂，但是我們真的沒辦法再多給。我私底下可以再給你一個獎勵。這是一把稀有的左輪手槍。這可能是你能找到威力最大的左輪了，甚至能對付裝甲。我給你我這裡的所有彈藥。但是我不知道到哪裡可以找到其他的。也許北方的商店會有存貨。","","Έκανες άψογη δουλειά για μας. Είμαστε στενεμένοι οικονομικά και όλα όσα μπορούμε να σου δώσουμε είναι 10.000, που δεν είναι αρκετά για ότι έκανες, απλά δεν έχουμε άλλα. Θα \'θελα επίσης να σου δώσω ένα μικρό προσωπικό δώρο. Είναι ένα σπάνιο περίστροφο. Λένε ότι είναι το ισχυρότερο που μπορείς να βρείς. Είναι καλό εναντίον πανοπλίας. Θα σου δώσω ότι πυρομαχικά έχω, αλλά δεν ξέρω που μπορεί να βρείς κι άλλα. Μπορεί κάποια μαγαζιά στα βόρεια να έχουν."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5463":["","You worked hard for us and we\'d like to reward your effort. Unfortunately, we don\'t have much money. We can only give you 10,000, which is not much, but it can cover your travel expenses if you want to get away from Janubi.","","Has trabajado duro y queremos recompensarte por ello. Desgraciadamente, no tenemos mucho dinero. Sólo podemos darte 10,000 €, que no es mucho, pero al menos cubrirán los gastos de abandonar la región.","","","","Você trabalhou duro para a nossa companhia e nós gostaríamos de recompensar o seu esforço. Infelizmente, nós não temos muito dinheiro. Nós podemos lhe dar apenas 10,000, o que não é muito, mas pode cobrir as suas despesas de viagem se você quiser fugir para Janubi.","Du hast schwer für uns gearbeitet und wir würden gerne deinen Aufwand belohnen. Leider haben wir nicht viel Geld. Wir können dir nur 10.000 geben, es ist nicht viel, aber vielleicht kannst du damit deine Reisekosten abdecken, wenn du von Janubi weggehen willst.","","Ai muncit din greu pentru organizația noastră și am dori să te recompensăm pentru efortul tău. Din păcate, nu avem mulți bani. Îți putem da doar 10.000, ceea ce nu este foarte mult, dar îți poate acoperi cheltuielile de călătorie, dacă dorești să pleci departe de Janubi."
         ,"<Pracowałeś/Pracowałaś> ciężko dla nas i chcielibyśmy wynagrodzić twoje wysiłki. Niestety, nie mamy wiele pieniędzy. Możemy dać ledwie 10 000, co jest niewiele, ale może pokryć koszty podróży, jeśli chcesz odejść z Janubi.","","He hebt heel hard voor ons gewerkt en we zouden je graag belonen voor je inspanning. Jammer henoeg hebben we niet veel geld. We kunnen je maar 10.000 geven, wat niet veel is, maar het kan je reiskosten dekken als je weg wilt uit Janubi.","","Kamu telah berusaha kuat untuk kami dan kami mahu bagi satu ganjaran. Malangnya, wang kami tak banyak. Kami hanya boleh bagi kamu 10,000. Ia bukan jumlah yang besar, tapi ia boleh tolong kamu menanggung kos mengembara kalau kamu nak keluar dari Janubi.","","","","你辛苦為我們工作，我希望能夠獎勵你的付出。不幸地，我們沒有足夠的錢。我們只能給你10000，不是很多，但是可以補償你一些旅費，假如你要離開賈努比區域的話。","","Δούλεψες σκληρά για μας και θα θέλαμε να ανταμείψουμε τις προσπάθειές σου. Δυστυχώς, δεν έχουμε πολλά λεφτά. Μπορούμε μόνο να σου δώσουμε 10.000, δεν είναι πολλά, αλλά μπορούν να καλύψουν τα έξοδα του ταξιδιού σου αν θελήσεις να φύγεις από το Janubi"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5464":["","We thank you for your intention to help us. We wish you all the best wherever you\'re going next.","","Gracias por haber hecho todo lo posible por ayudarnos. Esperemos que tengas suerte allá dónde vayas.","","","","Nós agradecemos a sua intenção de nos ajudar. Desejamos a você tudo de bom aonde quer que você vá a seguir.","Wir danken dir für deine Abscht uns zu helfen. Wir wünschen dir für deine weiteren Reisen nur das Beste.","","Îți mulțumim pentru intenția de a ne ajuta. Îți dorim toate cele bune, oriunde te vei duce.","Dziękujemy ci, za twoje intencje pomożenia nam. Życzymy ci wszystkiego najlepszego, gdziekolwiek zamierzasz się dalej udać.","","We danken je voor je intentie om ons te helpen. We wensen je het beste waar je ook heen gaat nu.","","Kami berterima kasih kepada kamu atas niat kamu menolong kami. Semoga berjaya kepada kamu di mana sahaja kamu akan pergi.","","","","我們感激你幫助我們舉動。不管你接下來要做甚麼，我們都祝你順利。","","Σε ευχαριστούμε για την πρόθεσή σου να βοηθήσεις. Σου ευχόμαστε τα καλύτερα όπου κι αν συνεχίσεις."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5465":["","Thanks.","","Gracias.","","","","<Obrigado/Obrigada>.","Danke.","","Mulțumesc.","Dzięki.","","Bedankt.","","Terima kasih.","","","","謝謝。","","Ευχαριστώ.","","","","","","","","","","Grazie.","","","","","","","","","","","","Gràcies.","",""],
         "5466":["","It\'s OK. I wasn\'t doing it for money anyway.","","Tranquilo, está bien. Al fin y al cabo, si lo he hecho no ha sido por el dinero.","","","","Está certo. Eu não estava fazendo isso por dinheiro mesmo.","Es ist Ok. Ich habe es nicht wegen dem Geld gemacht.","","E în regulă. Nu am făcut-o pentru bani, oricum.","Jest okej. I tak tego nie <robiłem/robiłam> dla pieniędzy.","","Het is goed. Ik deed het toch niet voor het geld.","","Tak apa. Saya tidak melakukannya untuk wang.","","","","沒關係。我不是為了錢做事。","","Είναι καλά. Εξάλλου δεν το ΄κανα για τα λεφτά.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5467":["","Thank you.","","Gracias.","","Merci.","","<Obrigado/Obrigada>.","Danke.","","Mulțumesc.","Dziękuje.","","Dank je.","","Terima kasih.","","","","謝謝你。","","Ευχαριστώ.","","","","","","","","","","Grazie.","","","","","","","","","","","","Gràcies.","",""],
         "5468":["","Farewell, comrade.","","Adiós, camarada.","","Adieu, camarade.","","Adeus, camarada.","Lebewohl, Genosse.","","Adio, <tovarășe/tovarășă>.","Dobrze się miewaj, towarzyszu broni.","","Vaarwel, kameraad.","","Selamat tinggal, komrad.","","","","再會了，同志。","","Στο καλό σύντροφε.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5469":["","Goodbye. [leave]","","Adiós. [marcharse]","","","","Tchau. [sair]","Auf Wiedersehen! [gehen]","","La revedere. [pleacă]","Żegnaj. [odejdź]","","Vaarwel. [vertrekken]","","Selamat tinggal. [Tinggal]","","","","再見。[離開]","","Γεια χαρά. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","Arrivederci. [esci]","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5470":["","Wait. I wanted to ask you something.","","Espera. Me gustaría preguntarte algo.","","","","Espere. Eu quero lhe perguntar uma coisa.","Warte. Ich wollte Dich etwas fragen.","","Așteaptă. Vreau să te întreb ceva.","Czekaj. <Chciałem/Chciałam> cię o coś zapytać.","","Wacht. Ik wilde je wat vragen.","","Tunggu. Saya hendak tanya kamu tentang sesuatu.","","","","等等。我想要問你一些事情。","","Περίμενε. Ήθελα να σε ρωτήσω κάτι.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5471":["","I\'ve heard that Workforce Merchants were looking for enriched uranium. Any idea what they needed it for?","","He oído que los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra estaban buscando uranio enriquecido. ¿Alguna idea de para qué lo debían querer?","","J\'ai entendu dire que les Workforce Merchants recherchaient de l\'uranium enrichi. Une idée de ce pourquoi ils en avaient besoin ?","","Eu ouvi falar que os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra estavam buscando urânio enriquecido. Tem ideia de para quê eles querem isso?","Ich habe gehört, dass die Arbeitskraft-Händler nach angereichertem Uran gesucht haben. Weißt du, für was sie es gebraucht haben?","","Am auzit că CFM era în căutare de uraniu îmbogățit. Ai idee pentru ce aveau nevoie?","<Słyszałem/Słyszałam>, że Handlarze Siłą Roboczą poszukiwali wzbogaconego uranu. Jakiś pomysł, do czego go potrzebowali?","","Ik heb gehoord dat de Werkkracht handelaren op zoek waren naar verrijkt uranium. Enig idee waar ze het voor nodig hadden?","","Saya telah dengar bahawa Workforce Merchants sedang mencari uranium yang diperkayakan. Adakah kamu ada idea pasal kenapa mereka sedang mencarinya?"
         ,"","","","我聽說商賈公會再找濃縮鈾。你知道他們要做甚麼嗎？","","Άκουσα ότι οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας έψαχναν για εμπλουτισμένο Ουράνιο. Καμιά ιδέα γιατί το χρειαζόντουσαν;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5472":["","Uranium, huh? I read about it in chemistry textbooks, but I don\'t think I have ever heard it mentioned elsewhere, definitely not as something related to Workforce Merchants.","","¿Uranio? ¡Vaya! He leído sobre él en los libros de química, pero nunca oí a nadie que lo mencionara. Y menos aún en relación con los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra.","","Uranium, huh ? J\'ai lu des choses à ce sujet dans des livres de chimie, mais je ne pense pas que j\'ai déjà entendu cela autre part, surement pas à propos des Workforce Merchants.","","Urânio, é? Eu li sobre isso em livros de química, mas eu acho que nunca ouvi isso ser mencionando em lugar algum, definitivamente não como algo relacionado aos Comerciantes de Mão de Obra.","Uran, hmmm?... Ich habe davon in Chemiebüchern gelesen, aber ich habe noch nie irgendwo anders davon gehört, schon garnicht in Bezug auf die Arbeitskraft-Händler.","","Uraniu? Am citit despre asta în manualele de chimie, dar nu cred că am mai auzit vreodată altundeva, și cu siguranță nu legat de CFM."
         ,"Uran, huh? Czytałem o nim w podręcznikach do chemii, ale nie sądzę, bym kiedykolwiek słyszał wzmianki o tym gdzieś indziej, na pewno nie jako coś związanego z Handlarzami Siłą Roboczą.","","Uranium, he? Ik heb erover gelezen in boeken over scheikunde, maar ik denk niet dat ik er verder ooit iets over gehoord heb, helemaal niet als iets gerelateerd aan Werkkracht Handelaren.","","Uranium, huh? Saya pernah membaca tentangnya dalam buku-buku kimia, tapi saya rasa saya tak pernah dengar tentangnya di tempat lain, pasti bukan sesuatu yang berkaitan dengan Workforce Merchants.","","","","鈾，啊？我只有從化學課本中讀到這東西。但我從沒在現實中聽說過它，肯定跟商賈公會不相干。","","Ουράνιο ε; Έχω διαβάσει  γιαυτό σε βιβλία χημείας αλλά δεν είχα ακούσει να αναφέρεται αλλού κυρίως σαν κάτι που να σχετίζεται με τους Εμπόρους Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5473":["","OK. Can I ask you something else?","","Entiendo... ¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","","OK. Puis-je vous demander quelque chose d\'autre ?","","OK. Posso lhe perguntar mais uma coisa?","Ok. Kann ich Dich etwas anderes fragen?","","OK. Pot să te întreb altceva?","Okej. Czy mogę zapytać cię o coś innego?","","OK. Mag ik je iets anders vragen?","","OK. Bolehkah saya tanya kamu sesuatu yang lain?","","","","好。我能談談其他事情嗎？","","ΟΚ. Μπορώ να σε ρωτήσω κάτι άλλο;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5474":["","I have a serious problem. My entire community has disappeared and I believe that Workforce Merchants have something to do with it.","","Tengo problemas serios. Mi comunidad entera ha desaparecido, y tengo la sospecha de que los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra están implicados de alguna forma.","","","","Eu tenho um sério problema. Minha comunidade inteira desapareceu e eu acredito que os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra tem algo a ver com isso.","Ich habe ein erhebliches Problem. Meine komplette Gemeinde ist verschwunden und ich glaube, dass die Arbeitskraft-Händler etwas damit zu tun haben.","","Am o problemă serioasă. Întreaga mea comunitate a dispărut și cred că CFM e la mijloc.","Mam poważny problem. Moja cała społeczność zniknęła i wierzę, że Handlarze Siłą Roboczą mają coś z tym wspólnego.","","Ik heb een serieus probleem. Mijn hele gemeenschap is verdwenen en ik geloof dat de Werkkracht Handelaren er iets mee te maken hebben.","","Saya ada masalah yang sangat serius. Seluruh komuniti saya telah hilang dan saya percaya bahawa Workforce Merchants terlibat dalam kehilangan mereka."
         ,"","","","我有一個很重要的問題。我的整個社區失蹤了，而我相信商賈公會牽涉其中。","","Έχω ένα σοβαρό πρόβλημα. Όλη η κοινότητά μου έχει εξαφανιστεί και πιστεύω ότι οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας έχει σχέση μ΄ αυτό.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5475":["","Tell me more.","","Vaya... Explícamelo todo.","","Dites m\'en plus.","","Conte mais.","Erzähl mir mehr.","","Spune-mi mai multe.","Powiedz mi więcej.","","Vertel me meer.","","Beritahu saya lebih.","","","","繼續講。","","Πες μου κι άλλα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5476":["","Workforce Merchants were looking for enriched uranium and my people offered to sell it to them. Now both the the people and the uranium are missing.","","Verás, los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra estaban interesados en comprar uranio enriquecido y mi gente se ofreció para vendérselo. Pero resulta que tanto mi gente como el uranio han desaparecido.","","","","Os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra estavam procurando por urânio enriquecido e o meu pessoal se ofereceu para vendê-lo. Agora tanto o pessoal quanto o urânio estão desaparecidos.","Die Arbeitskraft-Händler haben nach angereichertem Uran gesucht und meine Leute haben ihnen etwas zu Verkauf angeboten. Und jetzt fehlt beides, meine Leute und das Uran.","","CFM-ul era în căutarea de uraniu îmbogățit, iar oamenii mei s-au oferit să vândă. Acum, atât oamenii cât și uraniul lipsesc.","Handlarze Siłą Roboczą poszukiwali wzbogaconego uranu, a moi pobratymcy zaoferowali się go im sprzedać. Teraz zarówno uran jak i ludzie zniknęli.","","Werkkracht Handelaren zochten verrijkt uranium en mijn volk bood aan om het te verkopen. Nu zijn zowel het volk als het uranium vermist."
         ,"","Workforce Merchants sedang mencari uranium yang telah diperkayakan dan orang saya telah membuat tawaran untuk menjualkannya kepada mereka. Sekarang kedua-dua orang dan uranium pun hilang.","","","","商賈公會之前在找濃縮鈾，然後我的人打算要賣。現在鈾跟人都失蹤了。","","Οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας έψαχναν για εμπλουτισμένο Ουράνιο και ο λαός μου προσφέρθηκε να πουλήσει σ\'  αυτούς. Τώρα και ο λαός μου και το Ουράνιο έχουν εξαφανιστεί.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5477":["","Hmm. What would they need uranium for?","","Hmmm... ¿Y para qué querrían el uranio?","","","","Hum. Para quê eles precisam de urânio?","Hmm. Wofür bräuchten sie denn Uranium?","","Hmm. De ce-ar avea nevoie de uraniu?","Hmm. Do czego potrzebowaliby uran?","","Hmm. Waar zouden ze uranium voor nodig hebben?","","Hmm. Apa yang mereka mungkin buat dengan uranium?","","","","恩。他們需要鈾礦做甚麼？","","Χμμ... Τι το χρειαζόντουσαν το Ουράνιο;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5478":["","To make a bomb, maybe.","","Para fabricar una bomba atómica, ¿quizás?","","Pour faire une bombe, peut être.","","Para fazer uma bomba, quem sabe.","Vielleicht, um eine Bombe zu bauen.","","Poate pentru a face o bombă.","Do stworzenia bomby, może.","","Om een bom te maken, misschien.","","Mungkin untuk menghasilkan bom.","","","","我猜要用來做炸彈。","","Πιθανόν για να φτιάξουν μία βόμβα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5479":["","Right... I read about it somewhere. They used to make ultra destructive bombs using those metals, but I really doubt that Workforce Merchants would know how to make such bomb. They are not very interested in old world technologies, as far as I know.","","Cierto... He leído algo sobre eso en alguna parte. Los antiguos utilizaban ese tipo de minerales para fabricar bombas de destrucción masiva... Pero no creo que los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra fuesen capaces de crear algo así. Que yo sepa, no están muy interesados en las tecnologías del mundo antiguo.","","","","Certo... Eu li sobre isso em algum lugar. Eles costumam fazer bombas ultra-destrutivas usando aqueles metais, mas eu realmente duvido que os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra saberiam como fazer tais bombas. Eles não estão muito interessados em tecnologias do velho mundo, pelo que eu sei.","Stimmt... darüber habe ich mal etwas gelesen. Sie haben versucht mit diesem Metal extrem zerstörerische Bomben zu bauen, aber ich bezweifle, dass die Arbeitskraft-Händler wissen wie man so eine Bombe baut. Soweit ich weiß, sind sie an den Technologien der alten Welt nicht sehr interessiert."
         ,"","Corect ... Am citit despre asta undeva. Făceau bombe extrem de distructive, cu ajutorul acestor metale, dar mă îndoiesc, că CFM știe cum să facă o astfel de bombă. Din câte știu, ei nu sunt foarte interesați de tehnologiile din Lumea Veche.","Prawda... Czytałem o tym gdzieś. Kiedyś robili ultra destruktywne bomby używając tych metali, ale naprawdę wątpię, by Handlarze Siłą Roboczą wiedzieli jak stworzyć taką bombę. Nie są bardzo zainteresowani technologiami starego świata, tak wynika przynajmniej z mojej wiedzy.","","Klopt... Ik heb er ergens over gelezen. Ze maakten ultradestructieve bommen met die metalen, maar ik twijfel er echt aan dat de Werkkracht Handelaren zouden weten hoe je zo´n bom maakt. Ze zijn niet echt geinteresseerd in technologieën van de oude wereld, voor zover ik weet.","","Ya... Saya pernah membaca tentangnya. Mereka dulu menghasilkan bom-bom yang sangat kuat dengan logam-logam itu, tapi saya betul-betul tak percaya bahawa Workforce Merchants tahu bagaimana untuk menghasilkan bom tersebut. Mereka tak berminat dalam teknologi-teknologi dunia lama, setakat mana saya tahu."
         ,"","","","沒錯... 我在某地方讀過。他們以前用這些金屬來做毀滅性的炸彈，但是我質疑商賈公會知道怎麼製造。他們並不是這麼關心舊時代的科技，至少就我所知。","","Σωστά. Διάβασα κάπου γιαυτό. Έφτιαχναν σούπερ καταστροφικές βόμβες χρησιμοποιώντας τέτοια υλικά, αλλά πραγματικά αμφιβάλλω ότι οι Εμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας γνωρίζουν πως να κατασκευάσουν μία τέτοια βόμβα. Απ΄ όσο γνωρίζω δεν ενδιαφέρονται ιδιαίτερα για τεχνολογίες του παλιού κόσμου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5480":["","But I\'m sure that they were the ones who ordered to look for it.","","Pero estoy <seguro/segura> de que eran ellos los que buscaban el uranio.","","","","Mas estou certo de que eles eram os únicos que procuravam por isso.","Aber ich bin mir sicher, dass sie diejenigen waren, die befohlen haben danach zu suchen.","","Dar sunt <sigur/sigură> că ei au fost cei care au ordonat căutarea uraniului.","Ale jestem <pewny/pewna>, że to oni nakazali szukać tego.","","Maar ik weet zeker dat zij degenen waren die de opdracht gaven om er naar te zoeken.","","Tapi saya pasti bahawa mereka yang memberi perintah untuk mencarinya.","","","","但我確信他們就是幕後主使人。","","Αλλά είμαι σίγουρος ότι αυτοί έδωσαν τη διαταγή να αναζητηθεί.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5481":["","It sounds like very bad news to me... We should urgently investigate this case.","","Mal asunto... Tendremos que investigar más sobre el tema urgentemente.","","","","Isso me soa como péssimas notícias... Nós deveríamos investigar urgentemente esse caso.","Das klingt für mich nach wirklich schlechten Nachrichten... Wir sollten den Fall dringend untersuchen.","","Sună ca o veste foarte proastă... Trebuie să investigăm cazul, de urgență.","Brzmi jak złe wieści dla mnie... Powinniśmy pilnie zbadać tą sprawę.","","Dat klinkt als heel slecht nieuws voor mij... We zouden deze zaak dringend moeten onderzoeken.","","Dengar macam berita yang sangat buruk... Kita harus bermula menyiasat kes ini dengan segera.","","","","聽起來那不是好事... 我們應該盡快地調查這個案子。","","Ακούγονται σε μένα σαν πολύ κακά νέα... Πρέπει να ερευνήσουμε το θέμα κατεπειγόντως.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5482":["","What should we do?","","","¿Qué deberíamos hacer?","","","O que devemos fazer?","Was sollen wir tun?","","Ce ar trebui să facem?","Co powinniśmy zrobić?","","Wat zouden we moeten doen?","","Apa yang harus kita buat?","","","","我們應該怎麼做？","","Τι πρέπει να κάνουμε;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5483":["","I imagine that Workforce Merchants won\'t reveal this kind of information just to anyone. We need someone inside their organization... Someone whom they really trust.","","Supongo que los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra no revelarán ese tipo de información a cualquiera. Necesitamos a alguien de dentro... Alguien en quien confíen plenamente...","","","","Eu imagino que os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra não irão revelar esse tipo de informação a qualquer um. Nós precisamos de alguém dentro da organização deles... Alguém em quem eles realmente confiem.","Ich glaube das Arbeiterhändler diese Art von Information nicht einfach irgendjemand anvertrauen. Wir brauchen jemand innerhalb ihrer Organisation...jemanden dem sie wirklich vertrauen.","","Îmi imaginez că CFM nu vor dezvălui astfel de informații oricui. Avem nevoie de cineva din interiorul organizației lor ... Cineva în care au încredere.","Wyobrażam sobie, że Handlarze Siłą Roboczą nie ujawnią tego rodzaju informacji komuś prosto z ulicy. Potrzebujemy kogoś w środku ich organizacji... Kogoś komu naprawdę ufają."
         ,"","Ik neem aan dat de Werkkracht Handelaren dit soort informatie niet zomaar aan iedereen geven. We hebben iemand nodig binnen hun organisatie... Iemand die ze echt vertrouwen.","","Saya bayangkan bahawa Workforce Merchants takkan mendedahkan info jenis ini kepada sesiapa sahaja. Kita memerlukan seseorang dalam organisasi mereka... Seseorang yang mereka sangat percaya.","","","","我想商賈公會一定沒有透露情報給任何人知道。因此我們需要商賈工會內部的人... 他們真的相信的人。","","Φαντάζομαι ότι οι Έμποροι Ανθρώπινης Εργασίας δεν θα αποκαλύψουν τέτοια πληροφορία στον καθένα. Χρειαζόμαστε κάποιον μέσα από την οργάνωσή τους. Κάποιον που να εμπιστεύονται αληθινά.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5484":["","Do you think I could try to infiltrate into their company?","","¿Crees que yo podría infiltrarme en su organización?","","","","Você acha que eu posso tentar me infiltrar na companhia deles?","Glaubst Du, ich kann ihre Firma unterwandern?","","Crezi că aș putea încerca să mă infiltrez în compania lor?","Jak sądzisz, czy <mógłbym/mogłabym> spróbować przeniknąć do ich spółki?","","Denk je dat ik zou moeten infiltreren in hun bedrijf?","","Adakah kamu rasa saya boleh cuba menyusup ke dalam syarikat mereka?","","","","你認為我有辦法滲透他們公司嗎？","","Πιστεύεις ότι πρέπει να δοκιμάσουμε να διεισδύσουμε στην εταιρεία τους;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5485":["","Oh no. If they still don\'t know that you are with us, they\'ll find out as soon as you start working for them. I\'m sure that they investigate their new people\'s past very well. Besides, even if you succeed, it would take years for them to trust you with their dirty secrets... I don\'t think we have years.","","¡Oh, no! Es probable que los Comerciantes ya sepan que trabajas con nosotros, pero lo que es seguro es que si empezaras a trabajar para ellos, encargarían una investigación sobre tu pasado y pronto lo averiguarían. Por lo que tengo entendido, se cuidan muy mucho de investigar el pasado de todos los que trabajan para ellos. Y aunque consiguieras que te contrataran, tardarías años en ganarte su confianza y en compartir sus secretos... Y no creo que dispongamos de tanto tiempo.","","","","Ah não. Se eles ainda não sabem que você está com a gente, eles irão descobrir assim que você começar a trabalhar para eles. Eu estou certo de que eles investigam o passado dos seus novatos muito bem. E mesmo assim, se você prosseguir, irá demorar anos para eles lhe confiarem seus segredos sujos...  Eu não acho que temos anos."
         ,"Oh nein. Wenn sie immernoch nicht wissen das du zu uns gehörst, finden sie es raus sobald du anfängst für sie zu arbeiten. Ich bin mir sicher, dass sie die Vergangenheit ihrer neuen Leute sehr gründlich durchleuchten. Außerdem, selbst wenn du erfolgreich bist, würde es Jahre dauern bis sie dir ihre dreckigen Geheimnisse anvertrauen... Ich glaube nicht das wir Jahre haben.","","Oh, nu. În cazul în care încă nu știu că ești cu noi, vor afla de îndată ce vei începe să lucrezi pentru ei. Sunt sigur că investighează trecutul oamenilor noi în detaliu. În plus, chiar dacă ai reuși, ar fi nevoie de ani pentru ca să aibă încredere în tine cu secretele lor murdare ... Nu cred că avem atâta timp.","Och nie. Jeśli wciąż nie wiedzą, że jesteś z nami, to odkryją to, jak tylko zaczniesz dla nich pracować. Jestem pewny, że badają bardzo dobrze przeszłość swoich nowych ludzi. Poza tym, nawet gdyby ci się udało, to zabrałoby to lata, zanim powierzyliby ci swoje brudne sekrety... Nie sądzę byśmy mieli lata."
         ,"","Oh nee. Als ze nog niet weten dat je bij ons bent, zullen ze dat ontdekken zo gauw je voor hen begint te werken. Ik weet zeker dat ze het verleden van hun nieuwe mensen heel goed onderzoeken. Trouwens, zelfs als je zou slagen, zou het jaren duren voor je ze vertouwen met hun vuile geheimen... Ik denk niet dat we jaren hebben.","","Oh, tak. Kalau mereka masih tak tahu bahawa kamu bekerjasama dengan kami, mereka akan tahu sebaik sahaja kamu bermula bekerja untuk mereka. Saya pasti bahawa mereka akan menyiasat sejarah pekerja-pekerja baru mereka secara mendalam. Bagaimanapun, walaupun kamu berjaya, ia akan mengambil beberapa tahun sebelum mereka akan berkongsi rahsia kotor mereka dengan kamu... Saya rasa masa yang kita ada tak sampai bertahun-tahun.","","","","噢不可能。即便他們不相信你是我們的一員，他們遲早也會知道你為我們工作。我很確信他們調查新人的背景很仔細。除此之外，假如你成功的話，會需要幾年進入他們骯髒事的信任圈... 我不認為我們可以等幾年。","","Όχι όχι. Αν δε γνωρίζουν ακόμη ότι είσαι μαζί μας, θα το μάθουν μόλις αρχίσεις να δουλεύεις γιαυτούς. Είμαι σίγουρος ότι ψάχνουν πολύ καλά το παρελθόν των ανθρώπων τους. Επίσης, ακόμη κι αν πετύχεις, θα \'παιρνε χρόνια για να σου εμπιστευτούν τα βρώμικα μυστικά τους... Δε νομίζω ότι διαθέτουμε τόσο χρόνο."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5486":["","What then?","","¿Y entonces qué?","","","","Quê faremos então?","Was dann?","","Atunci?","Co więc?","","Wat dan?","","Bagaimana kalau begitu?","","","","然後呢？","","Τι κάνουμε τότε;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5487":["","I\'ll tell you what I\'m thinking about... I already had this plan in mind, but never started implementing it. Now may be the good time. You see, their big boss, Dolland Truffle has a secretary, Huli Kitsune. She\'s not just a secretary, but also some sort of a public relations person and also his lover... well... I don\'t know how to call their relationship. He pretty much uses her the way he likes, and she accepts it... well... the case is that they trust her and I don\'t know her personally, but I have a feeling that maybe she is not very happy about her situation. Maybe if you try to speak with her delicately, you could convince her to work for us and tell us what we want to know...","","Te diré lo que estoy pensando... De hecho es algo que ya tenía en mente y todavía no lo había puesto en marcha. Pero creo que es un buen momento para hacerlo. Verás, Dolland Truffle, el presidente de la compañía tiene una secretaría, que se llama Huli Kitsune. Pues bien, ella es mucho más que una simple secretaría, es algo así como su ‘relaciones públicas’ y algo así como su \'amante\'... por llamarlo de alguna forma. Más bien él se aprovecha de ella, y ella lo consiente... En fin, el hecho es que confían en ella y, pese a que no la conozco personalmente, tengo la sensación de que no está muy contenta con su situación. Es posible que si te acercas a ella sutilmente, consigas convencerla para que trabaje para nosotros y nos diga lo que queremos saber."
         ,"","","","Eu vou dizer o que estou pensando... Eu sempre tive esse plano em mente, mas nunca comecei a implementá-lo. Agora pode ser uma boa hora. Você sabe, o chefão deles, Dolland Truffle, tem uma secretária, Huli Kitzune. Ela não é apenas uma secretária, mas também algum tipo de pessoa de relações públicas e também sua amada... bem... Eu não sei como chamar o relacionamento deles. Ele usa muito ela do jeito que quer, e ela aceita isso... bem... o caso é que eles confiam nela e eu não a conheço pessoalmente, mas sinto que talvez ela não é muito feliz sobre a própria situação. Talvez se você tentar conversar com ela delicadamente, você poderá convencê-la a trabalhar para nós e contar-nos o que queremos saber...","Ich sage dir worüber ich nachdenke.... Ich hatte diesen Plan schon im Kopf, aber nie angefangen in umzusetzen. Jetzt ist vieleicht die richtige Zeit. Du siehst, deren großer Anführer, hat eine Sekretärin, Huli Kitsune. Sie ist nicht nur eine Sekretärin, sondern auch eine Art Verantwortliche für Öffentlichkeitsarbeit und auch seine Geliebte...mhh..Ich weiß nicht wie ich ihre Beziehung beschreiben soll. Er benutzt sie so ziemlich wie es ihm gefällt, und sie akzeptiert das....naja...der Punkt ist das sie ihr vertrauen und ich sie nicht persönlich kenne, aber ich habe da so ein Gefühl, dass sie vieleicht nicht ganz glücklich mit ihrer Situation ist. Vieleicht, wenn du behutsam mit ihr sprichst, kannst du sie überzeugen für uns zu arbeiten und uns zu erzählen was wir wissen wollen..."
         ,"","O să-ți spun la ce mă gândesc... Aveam deja acest plan în minte, dar nu am început implementarea lui. Acum poate fi momentul potrivit. Vezi tu, șeful lor, Dolland Truffle are o secretară, Huli Kitzune. Ea nu e doar o secretară, ci, de asemenea, un fel de o persoană de relații publice și, de asemenea, iubita lui... Nu știu cum să numesc relația lor. Truffle o foloșeste cum vrea el, și ea acceptă... ei bine... faza e că au încredere în ea, dar eu, deși nu o cunosc personal, am un sentiment că poate nu este foarte fericită cu situația ei. Poate că dacă încerci să vorbești cu ea delicat, ai putea s-o convingi să lucreze pentru noi și să ne spună ce vrem să știm ...","Powiem ci o czym myślę... Miałem już ten plan w głowie, ale nigdy nie zacząłem wcielać go w życie. Teraz może być dobry czas. Bo widzisz, ich wielki szef, Dolland Truffle, ma sekretarkę, Huli Kitsune. Ona nie jest tylko sekretarką, ale również jakiegoś rodzaju osobą od public relations(Pr czyli dbanie o dobry wizerunek), a także jego kochanką.... no... Nie wiem jak nazwać ich związek. Po prostu używa ją jak chcę, a ona to akceptuje... cóż... sprawa jest taka, że jej ufają, a ja nie znam jej osobiście, ale mam przeczucie, że może ona nie jest bardzo szczęśliwa z powodu swojej sytuacji. Może jeśli spróbujesz z nią porozmawiać delikatnie, to <mógłbyś/mogłabyś> ją przekonać do pracy dla nas i powiedzenia nam, co chcemy wiedzieć."
         ,"","Ik zal je vertellen waar ik aan denk... Ik had dit plan al in gedachten, maar ben nooit begonnen om het uit te voeren. Nu zou het een goede tijd kunnen zijn. Weet je, hun grote baas, Dolland Truffle heeft een secretaresse, Huli Kitsune. Ze is niet alleen maar secretaresse, maar ook een soort public relations persoon en ook zijn geliefde... wel... ik weet niet hoe ik hun relatie moet noemen. Hij gebruikt haar zoals hij wil, en zij accepteert het... wel... het geval is dat ze haar vertrouwen en ik ken haar niet persoonlijk, maar ik heb het gevoel dat ze misschien niet zo blij is met haar situatie. Misschien als jij op een delicate manier probeert met haar te praten, je haar zou kunnen overtuigen om voor ons te werken en ons te vertellen wat we willen weten.","","Saya akan beritahu kamu apa yang saya sedang berfikir... Saya memang sudah ada pelan ini, tapi saya tak pernah melaksanakannya. Sekarang mungkin adalah masa yang betul. Sebenarnya, ketua mereka, Dolland Truffle ada seorang setiausaha, Huli Kitsune. Dia bukan hanya seorang setiausaha, tapi juga macam seorang pegawai perhubungan awam dan juga kekasihnya... mmm... Saya tak tahu bagaimana menggambarkan perhubungan mereka. Dolland mengguna dia sesuka hatinya, dan dia menerimanya juga... mmm... kesnya adalah mereka percaya dia dan saya tak kenal dia secara peribadi, tapi saya rasa bahawa dia mungkin tak berapa gembira pasal situasinya. Mungkin kalau kamu cuba bercakap dengan dia secara halus, kamu boleh menyakinkan dia untuk bekerja untuk kita dan beritahu apa yang kita nak tahu."
         ,"","","","我告訴你我在想甚麼... 我腦海中曾經有個計畫，但是還沒開始實行。現在可能是一個好時機。聽著，他們的老闆，都蘭‧圖若菲，有一個秘書叫做狐胡莉。他不只是一個秘書，實際上他算是某種公關人物，或是他的愛人... 這個嘛... 其實我不知道他們的關係該怎麼稱呼。他會用自己的方式利用她，然後胡莉也接受這種方式... 這個嘛... 只能說他們很相信她，我雖然不認識她，但是我有一個感覺，她可能並不是很滿意目前的工作。也許你可以試著跟她談談，說服她為我們工作，或是告訴我們一些重要情報...","","Θα σου πω τι σκέφτομαι... Είχα ήδη το σχέδιο στο μυαλό μου, αλλά ποτέ δεν ξεκίνησα να το εφαρμόσω. Τώρα μάλλον είναι η στιγμή. Βλέπεις το μεγάλο αφεντικό τους ο Dolland έχει μια γραμματέα τη Huli Kitsune. Δεν είναι μόνο γραμματέας αλλά και υπεύθυνη δημοσίων σχέσεων και επίσης ερωμένη του, δεν ξέρω λοιπόν πως να χαρακτηρίσω τη σχέση τους. Λίγο - πολύ τη χρησιμοποιεί με τον τρόπο που του αρέσει και αυτή το αποδέχεται. Λοιπόν, το θέμα είναι ότι την εμπιστεύονται και, χωρίς να γνωρίζω την προσωπικότητά της, έχω την αίσθηση ότι δεν πρέπει να είναι πολύ ευτυχισμένη με την κατάσταση. Ίσως αν προσπαθήσεις να της μιλήσεις με ευαισθησία, θα μπορούσες να την πείσεις να δουλέψει για μας και να μας πει όσα χρειαζόμαστε να μάθουμε.","","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5488":["","It sounds like a good plan. What exactly should I say to her?","","Hmmm... Parece un buen plan. ¿Y qué quieres que le diga exactamente?","","","","Parece um bom plano. O que exatamente devo dizer a ela?","Das klingt nach einem guten Plan. Was genau soll ich ihr sagen?","","Pare a fi un plan bun. Ce anume ar trebui să-i spun?","To brzmi jak dobry plan. Co dokładnie <powinienem/powinnam> jej rzec?","","Dat klinkt als een goed plan. Wat zou ik precies tegen haar moeten zeggen?","","Rasanya macam pelan yang baik. Apa yang harus saya kata kepada dia?","","","","聽起來是一個好計畫。精確來說我要怎麼跟她談？","","Ακούγεται σαν καλό σχέδιο. Τι ακριβώς πρέπει να της πω;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5489":["","Try to make her realize that they are using her and that by accepting it she only makes their system stronger. Tell her that we fight for a just world and that she can help us to save her and many others... you know... this kind of discourse...","","Intenta que ella misma tome conciencia de su situación, de que la están utilizando y de que consintiéndolo, ella no hace más que mantener ese sistema. Dile que nosotros luchamos por un mundo más justo y que ella puede ayudarnos a salvarse a sí misma y a muchos otros en su misma situación... Ya sabes... Algo así...","","","","Tente fazê-la perceber que eles estão usando ela e que aceitando isso ela apenas faz o sistema deles mais forte. Diga a ela que nós lutamos por um mundo justo e que ela pode nos ajudar a salvar a ela e a muitos outros... sabe... esse tipo de discurso...","Versuch sie davon zu überzeugen, dass sie von ihnen benutzt wird und sie damit das System nur noch bestärkt, wenn sie es akzeptiert. Erzähl ihr, dass wir für eine gerechte Welt kämpfen und sie uns helfen kann sich selbst und andere zu retten... du weißt... solche Argumente..."
         ,"","Încearcă s-o faci să-și deau seama că e folosită și că, prin cooperarea ei îi face tot mai puternici. Spune-i că noi luptăm pentru un lume dreaptă și că ne poate ajuta s-o salvăm, pe ea și pe mulți alții... știi tu... un discurs asemănător...","Spróbuj sprawić, że się połapię, że oni ją wykorzystują i że akceptując to, sprawia tylko, że ich system staje się silniejszy. Powiedz jej, że walczymy o sprawiedliwy świat i może nam pomóc uratować ją i wielu innych... no wiesz... ten rodzaj dyskursu.","","Probeer haar te laten realizeren dat ze haar gebruiken en door dat te accepteren ze alleen hun systeem sterker maakt. Vertel haar dat we voor een juiste wereld vechten en dat ze ons kan helpen om haar en vele anderen te redden... weet je... Dat soort redevoering.","","Cuba menyedarkan dia bahawa mereka sedang mengguna dia dan dengan menerimanya dia hanya mengukuhkan sistem mereka. Beritahu dia bahawa kita berjuang untuk dunia yang adil dan dia boleh tolong kita untuk menyelamatkan dia dan ramai lagi... jenis wacana ini..."
         ,"","","","試著讓她了解她是被利用的，然後情況只會越陷越深。告訴他我們可以一起改變世界，幫助他自己，也幫助其他人... 你知道的，講那些大義。","","Προσπάθησε να την κάνεις να συνειδητοποιήσει ότι την χρησιμοποιούν και ότι με το να το δέχεται κάνει το σύστημά τους ισχυρότερο. Πές της ότι παλεύουμε για ένα δίκαιο κόσμο και μπορεί να μας βοηθήσει να σώσουμε εκείνη και πολλούς άλλους... ξέρεις... τέτοιου είδους λόγια.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5490":["","OK. I\'ll try. Thanks for the suggestion. See you later. [leave]","","De acuerdo, lo intentaré. Muchas gracias. Ya te contaré. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","OK. Lo intentaré. Gracias por la sugerencia. Nos vemos después. [marcharse]","","","Certo. Eu vou tentar. <Obrigado/Obrigada> pela sugestão. Vejo você mais tarde. [sair]","Okay. Ich probiere es. Danke für den Vorschlag. bis später. [gehen]","","OK. Voi încerca. Mulțumesc pentru sugestie. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Spróbuję. Dzięki za sugestię. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","OK. Ik zal het proberen. Dank je voor de suggestie. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya akan cuba. Terima kasih atas cadangan kamu. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。我會試看看。感謝建議。再見。[離開]","","ΟΚ. Θα προσπαθήσω. Ευχαριστώ για την πρόταση. Θα σε δώ αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5491":["","Have you thought on what we spoke about?","","¿Has pensado en lo que hablamos?","","","","Você pensou sobre o que nós conversamos?","Hast Du nochmal über unser Gespräch von letztens nachgedacht?","","Te-ai gândit la ce-am discutat?","Czy myślałaś o czym rozmawialiśmy?","","Heb je nagedacht over wat we besproken hebben?","","Adakah kamu sudah fikir tentang apa yang kita telah berbincang tentang?","","","","你想過我們談過的事了嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5492":["","Sorry, but I can\'t help you. It\'s way too dangerous. I have a family I need to take care of. I can\'t take unnecessary risks.","","Lo siento. Pero no puedo ayudaros. Es demasiado peligroso. Tengo familia y tengo que pensar también por ello. No quiero correr riesgos innecesarios.","","","","Desculpe, mas eu não posso te ajudar. É muito perigoso. Eu tenho uma família que precisa de mim. Não posso correr riscos desnecessários.","Bitte entschuldige, aber ich kann Dir nicht helfen. Es sit zu gefährlich. Ich habe eine Familie um die ich mich kümmern muss. Ich kann unnötiges Risiko eingehen.","","Îmi pare rău, dar nu te pot ajuta. E mult prea periculos. Am o familie de care trebuie să am grijă. Nu-mi pot asuma riscuri inutile.","Przykro mi, ale nie mogę ci pomóc. To stanowczo zbyt niebezpieczne. Mam rodzinę o którą potrzebuje dbać. Nie mogę przyjmować niepotrzebnego ryzyka.","","Sorry, maar ik kan je niet helpen. Het is veel te gevaarlijk. Ik heb een familie waar ik voor moet zorgen. Ik kan geen onnodige risicos nemen."
         ,"","Minta maaf, tapi saya tak dapat tolong kamu. Ia terlalu bahaya. Saya ada keluarga yang saya perlu menjaga. Saya tak boleh mengambil risiko-risiko yang tidak diperlukan.","","","","抱歉，我沒辦法幫忙。那太危險了。我有家庭要照顧。我不能負擔額外的風險。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5493":["","I didn\'t have time for it yet.","","No. Aún no he tenido tiempo.","","","","Eu ainda não tive tempo pra isso.","Ich hatte noch keine Zeit dazu.","","Nu am avut timp, încă.","Nie miałam jeszcze na to czasu.","","Ik heb er nog geen tijd voor gehad.","","Saya masih tiada masa untuknya.","","","","我還沒有時間想。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5494":["","OK. I\'ll be back later. See you. [leave]","","De acuerdo. Ya volveré más adelante. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","OK. Eu volto em breve. Até mais. [sair]","Ok. Ich komme später nochmal vorbei. Bis dann. [gehen]","","OK. Mă întorc mai târziu. La revedere. [pleacă]","Okej. Będę później. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","","OK. Ik kom later terug. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya akan balik ke sini nanti. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。我會再回來。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5495":["","What if I told you that once you\'re done helping us, I\'ll take you and your family far away from here, and I\'ll give you enough money to live carelessly for the rest of your life?","","¿Y si te aseguro que una vez que nos hayas ayudado me aseguraré de poneros a salvo tanto a ti como a tu familia, y suficiente dinero como para aseguraros que no os faltará de nada el resto de vuestras vidas?","","","","E se eu te disser que quando você nos ajudar, eu vou levar você e a sua família para muito longe daqui, e vou te dar dinheiro o suficiente para você viver sem preocupações o resto da sua vida?","Was wäre wenn ich Dir sage, dass wenn Du mir dieses eine Mal hilfst, ich Dich und Deine Familie ganz weit wegbringen werde und Dir genügend Geld gebe, um den Rest deines Lebens sorglos zu verbringen.","","Dar dacă ți-aș spune că odată ce ai terminat cu ajutorul, o să te iau pe tine și pe familia ta, departe de aici, și o să-ți dau destui bani pentru a trăi fără griji pentru tot restul vieții voastre?"
         ,"Co jeśli powiem, że kiedy skończysz nam pomagać, to zabiorę ciebie i twoją rodzinę daleko stąd, a w dodatku dam wam wystarczająco pieniędzy, by żyć bez trosk przez resztę waszych żyć.","","Wat als ik vertelde dat als je ons geholpen hebt, ik jou en je familie meeneem ver hier vandaan, en ik je genoeg geld geef om de rest van je leven zonder zorgen te leven.","","Bagaimana kalau saya beritahu kamu bahawa selepas kamu sudah habis menolong kami, saya akan membawa kamu dan keluarga kamu jauh dari sini, dan saya akan bagi kamu wang yang mencukupi untuk hidup sesuka hati kamu untuk sepanjang hayat kamu?","","","","假如我告訴你一旦你幫助我們，我會把你跟你的家庭搬遷遠離這裡，給你足夠的金錢來度過餘生如何？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5496":["","I like the second part of your offer, but don\'t worry about taking us anywhere. I\'ve been organizing things for Workforce Merchants for quite a while. I can take care of this aspect myself.","","La primera parte no me preocupa. He estado organizando asuntos de los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra durante mucho tiempo, y sabría hacerme cargo de mi familia. Es la segunda parte de esa oferta la que más me interesa.","","","","Eu gosto da segunda parte da sua oferta, mas não se preocupe em nos levar pra lugar algum. Eu tenho organizado as coisas para os Comerciantes de Mão de Obra já há algum tempo. Eu mesma posso cuidar disso.","Ich mag den zweiten Teil Deines Angebotes, aber mach Dir keine Sorgen darum, uns von hier wegzubringen. Ich habe schon eine ganze Weile solche Sachen für die Arbeitskraft-Händler organisiert. Um diesen Teil kann ich mich selbst kümmern.","","Îmi place a doua parte a ofertei, dar nu-ți face griji, nu trebuie să ne duci nicăieri. Mă pot descurca.","Podoba mi się druga część twojej oferty, ale nie martw się zabieraniem nas gdziekolwiek. Organizowałam sprawy dla Handlarzy Siłą Roboczą już dość długo. Potrafię zadbać o ten aspekt sama."
         ,"","Ik vind het tweede deel van je aanbod beter, maar maak je geen zorgen om ons ergens heen te brengen. Ik heb een hele tijd dingen voor Werkkracht Handelaren geregeld. Ik kan zelf voor dit aspect zorgen.","","Saya suka bahagian kedua tawaran kamu, tapi jangan risau tentang membawa kami ke mana-mana. Saya telah mengatur banyak benda untuk Workforce Mechants untuk masa yang lama. Saya boleh sendiri menguruskan aspek ini.","","","","我喜歡你後面提到的那個部分，但別擔心搬走這件事，我已經在商賈公會工作一段時間了。我可以照顧我自己的部分。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5497":["","Great. How much do you want?","","Muy bien. ¿Cuánto quieres?","","","","Ótimo. Quanto você quer?","Großartig. Wieviel willst Du haben?","","Grozav. Cât de mult vrei?","Milutko. Jak dużo chcesz?","","Geweldig. Hoeveel wil je?","","Hebat. Berapa yang kamu mahu?","","","","太好了。你想要多少？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5498":["","Half a million.","","Medio millón de €.","","","","Meio milhão.","Eine halbe Million.","","Juma\' de milion.","Pół miliona.","","Een half miljoen.","","Setengah juta.","","","","五十萬。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5499":["","It\'s a lot of money!","","¡Buf! ¡Eso es muchísimo dinero!","","","","Isso é muito dinheiro!","Das ist eine Menge Geld!","","Un căcălău de bani!","To mnóstwo kasy!","","Dat is veel geld!","","Ia adalah wang yang banyak!","","","","這筆金額不小！","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5500":["","OK.","","De acuerdo.","","","","","Ok.","","","Okej.","","","","OK.","","","","沒問題。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5501":["","You said enough money for the rest of our lives. I plan to live a long life.","","Me dijiste dinero suficiente como para vivir el resto de nuestras vidas. Y yo espero vivir muchos años...","","","","Você disse dinheiro o suficiente pro resto de nossas vidas. Eu planejo ter uma vida longa.","Du hast gesagt, genug für den Rest meines Lebens. Und ich will lange leben.","","Ai spus că ne vei da destui bani pentru tot restul vieții noastre. Am de gând să trăiesc o viață lungă.","<Powiedziałeś/Powiedziałaś> wystarczająco pieniędzy na resztę naszych żyć. Planuję żyć długim życiem.","","Je zei genoeg geld voor de rest van ons leven. Ik ben van plan lang te leven.","","Kamu kata wang yang mencukupi untuk seluruh hidup kami. Saya bercadang untuk hidup untuk masa yang lama.","","","","你說足夠我度過餘生的金額。我計劃可以活很久。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5502":["","OK. I understand.","","OK, ya veo.","","","","OK. Eu entendo.","Ok. Das verstehe ich.","","Da, am înțeles.","Okej. Rozumiem.","","OK. Ik begrijp het.","","OK. Saya faham.","","","","好。我了解了。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5503":["","If you have the money we could start our collaboration right now.","","Si tuvieras el dinero, podríamos empezar nuestra colaboración ahora mismo.","","","","Se você tem o dinheiro nós podemos começar nossa colaboração agora mesmo.","Wenn Du das Geld hast, können wir mit unserer Zusammenarbeit beginnen.","","Dacă ai banii, am putea începe colaborarea noastră, chiar acum.","Jeśli masz pieniądze, to możemy rozpocząć naszą współpracę od razu.","","Als je het geld hebt, zouden we onze samenwerking nu gelijk kunnen beginnen.","","Kalau kamu mempunyai wang tersebut kita boleh bermula bekerjasama sekarang.","","","","假如你已經準備好錢，那麼我們就可以開始合作。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5504":["","Yes. I have it right here. [give Huli the money]","","Sí. Aquí lo tienes. [entregar el dinero a Huli]","","","","Sim. Eu tenho o dinheiro aqui. [dar o dinheiro para Huli]","Ja, ich habe es bei mir. [gib Huli das Geld]","","Da. Îi am chiar aici. [dă-i banii lui Huli]","Tak. Mam je właśnie tutaj. [Daj Huli pieniądze]","","Ja. Ik heb het hier. [geef Huli het geld]","","Ya. Saya mempunyainya. [Bagi Huli wang tersebut]","","","","對。我已經準備好了。[給胡莉錢]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5505":["","I think I\'m going to need some time.","","Necesitaré algo de tiempo para reunir tanto de dinero.","","","","Acho que eu vou precisar de um tempo.","Ich denke, ich brauche noch etwas Zeit.","","Cred că o să am nevoie de ceva timp.","Sądzę, że będę <potrzebował/potrzebowała> trochę czasu.","","Ik denk dat ik meer tijd nodig heb.","","Saya rasa bahawa saya akan perlu lebih masa.","","","","我想我需要一些時間準備。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5506":["","Sure. Come back whenever you have it.","","Por supuesto. Vuelve cuando tengas el dinero.","","","","Claro. Volte quando você tiver o dinheiro.","Sicher. Komm wieder, wenn Du es hast.","","Sigur. Vino înapoi când îi ai.","Jasne. Wróć kiedykolwiek będziesz <miał/miała>.","","Natuurlijk. Kom terug als je het hebt.","","Pasti. Balik sahaja bila kamu sudah mendapatkannya.","","","","當然。你準備好的時候再來。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5507":["","OK. See you. [leave]","","De acuerdo. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","OK. Até mais. [sair]","Ok. Bis dann. [gehen]","","Bine. Pa. [pleacă]","Okej. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","","OK. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","","OK. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5508":["","I have the money. [give Huli 500,000]","","Ya tengo tu dinero. [entregar los 500,000 € a Huli]","","","","Eu tenho o dinheiro. [entregar 500,000 para Huli]","Ich hab das Geld. [gib Huli 500.000]","","Am banii. [dă-i lui Huli 500.000]","Mam pieniądze. [przekaż Huli 500,000]","","Ik heb het geld. [geef Huli 500.000]","","Saya mempunyai wang tersebut. [Bagi Huli 500,000]","","","","我有足夠的錢了。[給胡莉 500000]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5509":["","Be careful. We don\'t want anyone to see us doing this.","","¡Cuidado! No querrás que nadie se entere de esto.","","","","Tome cuidado. Não queremos que ninguém nos veja fazendo isso.","Sei vorsichtig. Wir wollen nicht, dass uns jemand dabei sieht.","","Ai grijă. Nu vrem să ne vadă cineva făcând asta.","Bądź <ostrożny/ostrożna>. Nie chcemy, by ktoś nas zobaczył robiąc to.","","Wees voorzichting. We willen niet dat iemand ons dit ziet doen.","","Berhati-hati. Kita tidak mahu sesiapa pun yang nampak kita melakukan ini.","","","","小心。我們不希望其他人看到我們做這件事。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5510":["","Yes. Sorry. [hand the money more carefully]","","Por supuesto. Lo siento. [entregarle el dinero más discretamente]","","","","Sim. Desculpe. [entregar o dinheiro cautelosamente]","Ja, entschuldige. [gib ihr das Geld vorsichtiger]","","Da. Scuze. [ai grijă cu banii]","Tak. Przepraszam. [przekaż pieniądze bardziej ostrożnie]","","Ja. Sorry. [overhandig het geld voorzichtiger]","","Ya. Minta maaf. [Bagi wang kepada dia dengan lebih berhati-hati]","","","","對。抱歉。[把錢小心的交過去]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5511":["","Kay. So, what do you want to know first?","","Bueno. Vayamos por parte... ¿Qué quieres saber primero?","","","","Beleza. Então, o que você quer saber primeiro?","Kay. Was willst Du als Erstes wissen?","","Mda. Deci, ce vrei să știi mai întâi?","Kej. Więc, co chcesz wiedzieć na początek?","","OK. Dus, wat wil je eerst weten?","","Kay. Jadi, apa yang kamu nak tahu dulu?","","","","好。那麼你想要先知道甚麼？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5512":["","Workforce Merchants were going to buy uranium from some people in the north. Both the uranium and the people disappeared. I want to know where they went.","","Verás... Los Comerciantes de Mano de Obra tenían planeado comprar uranio a una gente del norte. Tanto el uranio como esa gente han desaparecido. Quiero saber dónde han ido a parar.","","","","Comerciantes de Mão de Obra iam comprar urânio de algumas pessoas ao Norte. Tanto o urânio quanto as pessoas desapareceram. Eu quero sabem para onde eles foram.","Die Arbeitskraft-Händler wollten von einigen Leuten im Norden Uran abkaufen. Beides, das Uran und die Leute sind verschwunden. Ich will wissen wohin.","","Comercianții Forței de Muncă aveau de gând să cumpere uraniu de la niște oameni din nord. Atât uraniul cât și oamenii, au dispărut. Vreau să știu unde s-au dus.","Handlarze Siłą Roboczą zamierzali kupić uran od ludzi na północy. Jednocześnie uran i ludzie zniknęli. Chcę wiedzieć, gdzie się udali.","","Werkkracht Handelaren zouden uranium kopen van mensen in het noorden. Zowel het uranium als de mensen zijn verdwenen. Ik wil weten waar ze heen zijn gegaan."
         ,"","Workforce Merchants nak membeli uranium dari beberapa orang dari kawasan utara sebelum ini. Kedua-dua uranium dan orangnya tersebut telah hilang. Saya nak tahu di mana mereka telah pergi.","","","","商股公會準備跟北方的人買鈾礦。但是兩者都失蹤了，我想要知道他們去哪裡了？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5513":["","I don\'t know what happen to the people. I\'m pretty sure that we had nothing to do with their disappearance. As for uranium, we were collecting it some time ago, but then we suddenly stopped doing it. I think the client canceled the request.","","No sé que ha sido de esa gente. Pero puedo asegurarte que nosotros no tenemos nada qué ver con su desaparición. En cuanto a uranio, es cierto que estuvimos comprando uranio durante algún tiempo, pero de pronto dejamos de hacerlo. Por lo que tengo entendido, el cliente canceló la comanda.","","","","Eu não sei o que aconteceu com as pessoas. Estou quase certa de que nós não tivemos nada a ver com o desaparecimento delas. Sobre o urânio, nós estávamos coletando há algum tempo, mas paramos de repente. Eu acho que o cliente cancelou o pedido.","Ich weiß nicht, was mit den Leuten passiert ist. Ich bin mir sicher, dass wir nichts mit ihrem Verschwinden zu tun haben. Und wegen dem Uran, wir haben vor einiger Zeit etwas gesammelt, aber dann ahben wir plötzlich damit aufgehört. Ich denke der Kunde hat die Anfrage zurückgezogen."
         ,"","Nu știu ce s-a întâmplat cu oamenii. Sunt destul de sigur că n-am avut de-a face cu dispariția lor. Cât despre uraniu, îl colectam de ceva timp, dar apoi, dintr-o dată, n-am mai facut-o. Cred că clientul a anulat cererea.","Nie wiem, co się stało z ludźmi. Jestem całkiem pewna, że nie mieliśmy nic wspólnego z ich zniknięciem. Zaś uran zbieraliśmy jakiś czas temu, ale nagle przestaliśmy to robić. Sądzę, że klient anulował zamówienie.","","Ik weet niet wat er gebeurd is met de mensen. Ik ben er vrij zeker van dat wij niets te maken hadden met hun verdwijning. Wat betreft uranium, we verzamelden het een tijdje, maar opeens stopten we ermee. Ik denk dat de cliënt het verzoek geannuleerd heeft.","","Saya tidak tahu apa yang telah berlaku pada mereka. Saya pasti bahawa kami tidak terlibat dengan kehilangan mereka. Bagi uranium pula, kami sedang mengumpulnya pada masa yang lalu, tapi kami tiba-tiba henti mengumpulkannya. Saya rasa bahawa pelanggan itu telah membatalkan permintaannya.","",""
         ,"","我不知道人發生了甚麼事。但我很確定我們跟失蹤沒關係。至於鈾礦，我們前些時候收集了他們，但是我們突然停止了行動。我想客戶可能取消了訂單。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5514":["","Who was the client?","","¿\'El cliente\'? ¿Y quién era ese cliente?","","Qui était le client?","","Quem era o cliente?","Wer war der Kunde?","","Cine era clientul?","Kim był klient?","","Wie was de client?","","Siapakah pelanggan itu?","","","","客戶是誰？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5515":["","I don\'t know. Dolland... I mean Mr. Truffle always dealt with him personally, which is quite unusual for him, by the way. I suppose that it was someone important.","","Pues no lo sé. Dolland... el Sr. Truffle, quiero decir, siempre trataba con él directamente. Aunque también puedo decirte que eso no es algo habitual. Supongo que debía tratarse de alguien importante.","","","","Eu não sei. Dolland... Quer dizer, Sr. Truffle sempre negociava com ele pessoalmente, o que aliás é incomum para ele. Eu suponho que era alguém importante.","Ich weiß es nicht. Dolland... Ich meine Herr Truffle hat immer mit ihm persönlich verhandelt, dass ist zudem ziemlich ungewöhnlich für ihn. Ich vermute, dass er ziemlich wichtig war.","","Nu știu. Dolland ... adică domnul Truffle, se ocupa mereu, personal, ceea ce este destul de neobișnuit pentru el. Presupun că era cineva important.","Nie wiem. Dolland... znaczy się, pan Truffle zawsze zajmował się nim osobiście, co jest dość niezwykłe dla niego, tak swoją drogą. Wydaje mi się, że był to ktoś ważny."
         ,"","Ik weet het niet. Dolland... Ik bedoel mr. Truffle heeft altijd zelf met hem gehandeld, wat vrij ongewoon is voor hem, trouwens. Ik vermoed dat het een belangrijk iemand was.","","Saya tidak tahu. Dolland... Uh, Mr Truffle selalu berurusan dengan dia secara peribadi, yang sebenarnya agak luar biasa bagi dia. Saya rasa bahawa ia adalah seseorang yang penting.","","","","我不知道。可能是都蘭... 我的意思是圖若菲先生總是親自跟他洽談，那很不尋常，我想他應該扮演重要的角色。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5516":["","I need you to find out who it was.","","Necesito que averigües de quién se trataba.","","","","Eu preciso que você descubra quem é.","Ich will, dass du herausfindest, wer das war.","","Am nevoie de tine pentru a afla cine a fost.","Potrzebuję ciebie, abyś odkryła kim on był.","","Ik wil dat je uitzoekt wie het was.","","Saya perlu kamu mendapat tahu siapa dia.","","","","我希望你能找出是誰。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5517":["","It\'s not going to be easy.","","¡Buf! Eso no va a ser fácil.","","","","Isso não vai ser fácil.","Das wird nicht einfach.","","Nu va fi ușor.","To nie będzie łatwe.","","Het zal niet makkelijk zijn.","","Ia bukan sesuatu yang senang.","","","","那不是很容易。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5518":["","Well. I\'ve just paid you half a million. You can do some effort. Can\'t you?","","Lo sé. Pero acabo de pagarte medio millón de €. Estoy <seguro/segura> que puedes hacer un esfuerzo, ¿verdad?","","","","Bem. Eu te paguei meio milhão. Você pode fazer algum esforço, não pode?","Nun, ich habe Dir gerade eine halbe Million gegeben. Du könntest sich ein etwas anstrengen. Nicht war?","","Ei bine. Tocmai ți-am plătit juma\' de milion. Poți să faci și tu un efort, nu?","Cóż. Właśnie <zapłaciłem/zapłaciłam> ci pół miliona. Możesz się trochę wysilić. Czyż nie?","","Wel. Ik heb je net een half miljoen betaald. Je kan wat moeite doen, of niet?","","Mmm. Saya baru bayar kamu setengah juta. Kamu boleh melakukan sesuatu kan?","","","","這個嘛。我才剛付你五十萬。你應該能發揮點作用吧？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5519":["","I can, but it may take some time.","","Sí que puedo, pero necesitaré tiempo.","","","","Eu posso, mas vai levar um tempo.","Kann ich, aber das dauert ein bisschen.","","Da, dar o să dureze...","Mogę, ale może to zabrać trochę czasu.","","Dat kan ik, maar het zou wat tijd kunnen kosten.","","Saya boleh, tapi ia mungkin mengambil masa.","","","","我可以做到，但是需要一些時間。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5520":["","OK. I\'ll wait.","","De acuerdo. Esperaré.","","","","OK. Eu espero.","Ok. Ich werde warten.","","OK. O să aștept.","Okej. Będę <czekał/czekała>.","","Ok. Ik zal wachten.","","OK. Saya akan tunggu.","","","","好。我期待著。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5521":["","Fine, and now get out and try not to come here too often or they may suspect something.","","Muy bien. Ahora es mejor que te vayas. Y procura no venir por aquí demasiado a menudo, así evitaremos levantar sospechas.","","","","Bom, agora vá embora e tente não vir aqui tanto ou eles podem suspeitar de alguma coisa.","Gut. Jetzt geh raus und versuche nicht so oft herzukommen oder sie vermuten noch etwas.","","Bine, și acum ieși și încearcă să nu vii aici prea des sau vor intra la bănuieli.","Niech będzie, a teraz wynoś się stąd i nie wracaj zbyt często, inaczej mogą coś podejrzewać.","","Goed, en ga nu weg en probeer hier niet te veel te komen of ze zouden iets kunnen vermoeden.","","Baik, dan sekarang pergi dan cuba jangan datang ke sini terlalu banyak atau mereka mungkin akan mengesyaki sesuatu.","","","","好。現在出去，試著不要太常來這裡，否則他們會起疑。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5522":["","OK. Bye. [leave]","","De acuerdo. Adiós. [marcharse]","","","","OK. Tchau. [sair]","Ok. Tschüss. [gehen]","","Bine. Pa. [pleacă]","Okej. Pa. [odejdź]","","OK. Dag. [vertrekken]","","OK. Selamat tinggal. [Tinggal]","","","","好。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5523":["","Do you have any news for me?","","¿Alguna novedad?","","","","Você tem alguma notícia para mim?","Hast du irgendwelche Neuigkeiten für mich?","","Ai vreo veste pentru mine?","Masz dla mnie jakieś wieści?","","Heb je nieuws voor me?","","Adakah kamu mempunyai apa-apa berita untuk saya?","","","","有甚麼新聞要告訴我嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5524":["","Yes. After the Mikaze events, Dolland was very upset. He said that the Liberation Army has crossed the line and there must be a war. A little later he received a letter and suddenly stopped talking about the war. I read the letter when he was away. It was from the president of the Federation. He was thanking Dolland for helping him with uranium and asking him to stop wasting resources on the war with Ozbet.","","Pues sí. Después de los que pasó en Mikaze, Dolland estaba realmente molesto. Creía que el Ejército de Liberación había traspasado la línea roja y que teníamos que declarar la guerra. Pero poco después, recibió una carta y de repente dejó de hablar sobre la guerra. Me las he apañado para acceder al contenido de esa carta. Era de parte del presidente de la Federación. Le daba las gracias a Dolland por ayudarle con el tema del uranio, pero también le instaba a dejar de dilapidar recursos en la guerra contra Ozbet.","","","","Sim. Depois dos eventos de Mikaze, Dolland ficou muito decepcionado. Ele disse que o Exército de Libertação passou dos limites e a guerra deveria acontecer. Um pouco mais tarde ele recebeu uma carta e parou de falar da guerra. Eu li a carta enquanto ele estava fora. Era do presidente da Federação. Ele estava agradecendo Dolland por ajudar com o urânio e pedindo a ele para parar de desperdiçar recursos na guerra com Ozbet."
         ,"Ja, nach den Ereignissen in Mikaze war Dolland sehr aufgebracht. Er sagte, dass die Befreiungsarmee eine Linie überschritten hätten und es einen Krieg geben muss. Eine Zeit später hat er dann einen Brief bekommen und seitdem nicht mehr von einem Krieg geredet. Ich habe den Brief gelesen als er weg war. Er kam vom Präsidenten der Föderation. Er hat Dolland für seine Hilfe mit dem Uran gedankt und gebeten, dass er mit der Verschwendung von Resourcen für einen Krieg gegen Ozbet aufhören soll.","","Da. După evenimentele din Mikaze, Dolland era foarte supărat. Zicea că Armata  Eliberării a depășit limita și războiul trebuie să înceapă. Un pic mai târziu, a primit o scrisoare și dintr-o dată n-a mai vorbit despre război. Am citit scrisoarea, atunci când era plecat. Era de la președintele Federației. Îi mulțumea lui Dolland pentru ajutorul cu uraniu, cerându-i să oprească irosirea resurselor pe războiul cu Ozbet.","Tak. Po wydarzeniach w Mikaze, Dolland był bardzo zdenerwowany. Powiedział, że Armia Wyzwolenia przegięła pałę i musi być wojna. Trochę później otrzymał list i nagle przestał mówić o wojnie. Przeczytałam list, kiedy go nie było. Był on od prezydenta Federacji. Dziękował w nim Dollandowi za pomoc z uranem i prosił go, by przestał marnować środki na wojnę z Ozbet."
         ,"","Ja. Na de gebeurtenissen in Mikaze was Dolland erg van streek. Hij zei dat het Bevrijdingsleger over de streep was gegaan en er een oorlog moet komen. Even later ontving hij een brief en stopte opeens te praten over de oorlog. Ik las de brief toen hij weg was. Hij was van de president van de Federatie. Hij bedankte Dolland voor zijn hulp met het uranium en vroeg hem te stoppen met het verspillen van middelen in de oorlog met Ozbet.","","Ya. Selepas kejadian-kejadian Mikaze, Dolland berasa sangat kecewa. Dia kata bahawa Liberation Army sudah melampau dan satu peperangan mestilah berlaku. Dia kemudian telah menerima satu surat dan tiba-tiba henti bercakap tentang peperangan. Saya telah membaca surat tersebut semasa dia keluar. Ia adalah dari presiden Federation. Dia berterima kasih kepada Dolland kerana menolong dia dengan uranium dan telah suruh dia untuk henti membazir sumber pada peperangan dengan Ozbet.","","","","對。在美風石油的事件後，都蘭非常不愉快。他說自由武裝超過了線，一定要開戰。稍後呢就收到一封信，突然停止談戰爭的事情。我等到他走了之後讀了信。信是聯邦的總統寫來的，信中感謝都蘭在鈾礦的事情上幫忙，並要求他停止浪費資源在與歐茲別政府的戰事上。"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5525":["","I searched all the related documents and tried to delicately ask Mr. Truffle, but there was no answer to your question. I\'ll be very attentive to all Dolland\'s communications, and if I see or hear something I\'ll let you know.","","He estado examinando todos los documentos al respecto e intentado sonsacarle algo al Sr. Truffle, pero no he podido averiguar nada. Aún así, sigo estando muy atenta a todos los contactos del Sr. Truffle. Si veo o escucho algo, te lo haré saber.","","","","Eu procurei todos os documentos relacionados e tentei perguntar gentilmente para o Sr. Truffle, mas não tive resposta para a sua pergunta. Eu ficarei atenta às comunicações do Dolland, e se eu vir ou escutar alguma coisa lhe contarei.","Ich habe alle damit verbundnen Dokumente gelesen und versuch Herrn Truffle direkt darauf anzusprechen, aber es gab keine Antwort für Dich. Ich bin allen Gesprächen von Dolland sehr aufmerksam und wenn ich etwas höre, sage ich Dir Bescheid.","","Am căutat toate documentele aferente și am încercat să-l întreb delicat pe domnul Truffle, dar nu am găsit nici un răspuns la întrebarea ta. Voi fi foarte atentă la toate comunicațiile lui Dolland, și dacă văd sau aud ceva, îți voi spune."
         ,"Przeszukałam wszystkie powiązane dokumenty i spróbowałam delikatnie wypytać pana Truffla, ale nie było żadnej odpowiedzi na twoje pytanie. Będę bardzo uważała na wszelką komunikację Dollanda, a jeśli zobaczę lub usłyszę coś, to dam ci znać.","","Ik heb alle gerelateerde documenten doorzocht en geprobeert het delicaat te vragen aan mr. Truffle, maar er was geen antwoord op je vraag. Ik zal heel oplettend zijn naar alle communicatie van Dolland en als ik iets zie of hoor, zal ik het je laten weten.","","Saya telah mencari semua dokumen yang berkaitan dan telah cuba tanya Mr Truffle secara lembut, tapi saya tak dapat jawapan kepada soalan kamu. Saya akan memberi perhatian kepada semua komunikasi Dolland, dan kalau saya lihat atau terdengar sesuatu saya akan bagi kamu tahu.","","","","我搜尋了相關的文件，有技巧的詢問圖若菲先生，但是都沒獲得你的想要的答案。我會注意關於圖若菲的訊息，假如我聽到甚麼我就會讓你知道。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5526":["","No. Nothing yet.","","Todavía no.","","","","Não. Nada ainda.","Nein, bis jetzt noch nichts.","","Nu, nimic încă.","Nie. Jeszcze nic.","","Nee. Nog niet.","","Tidak. Tiada apa-apa lagi.","","","","不。還沒。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Encara no.","",""],
