         "5528":["","OK. Thank you. I\'ll see you later then. [leave]","","OK. Gracias. Ya nos veremos más tarde, entonces. [marcharse]","","","","OK. <Obrigado/Obrigada>. Eu te vejo mais tarde então. [sair]","Ok. Dankeschön. Wir sehen uns dann später. [gehen]","","OK. Mulțumesc. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Dziękuje. Zobaczę cię więc później. [odejdź]","","OK. Dank je. Ik zie je later, dan. [vertrekken]","","OK. Terima kasih. Saya akan jumpa kamu nanti kalau begitu. [Tinggal]","","","","好。感謝。那麼再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5529":["","Why?","","¿Y eso?","","","","Por quê?","Warum?","","De ce?","Dlaczego?","","Waarom?","","Kenapa?","","","","為什麼？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5530":["","He said that soon there\'ll be no need for wars, that all weapons will become useless and that the Federation will bring peace to the whole world or something like that. I\'m not sure if I understood it correctly, but it sounded as if the Federation was going to invade Janubi. I think that you should warn your people about it.","","Pues decía en la carta que pronto no habría necesidad de más guerras, que pronto todas las armas serían inútiles y que la Federación traería la paz a todo el mundo... o algo así. No sé si lo entendí bien, pero daba la impresión de que la Federación estuviera planeando invadir Janubi. Creo que deberías advertir a tu gente sobre todo esto.","","","","Ele disse que logo não haverá a necessidade de guerras, que todas as armas serão inúteis e que a Federação vai trazer paz para o mundo ou alguma coisa assim. Eu não sei se entendi direito, mas parece que a Federação vai invadir Janubi. Eu acho que você deveria avisar o seu povo sobre isso.","Er hat gesagt, dass es bald keinen keinen Grunde für Kriege mehr geben wird und dass alle Waffen nutzlos werden. Und dass die Föderation der ganzen Welt den Frieden bringt oder so. Ich bin mir nicht sicher, ob ich es richtig verstanden habe, aber es klang so, als ob die Föderation in Janubi einmarschieren will. Ich denke, du solltest deine Leute deswegen warnen."
         ,"","A spus că în curând nu vor mai fi războaie, că toate armele vor deveni inutile și că Federația va aduce pace în întreaga lume, sau ceva de genul asta. Nu sunt sigură dacă am înțeles corect, dar sună de parcă Federația ar avea de gând să invadeze Janubi. Cred că ar trebui să-ți avertizezi oamenii.","Rzekł on, że wkrótce nie będzie już potrzeb dla wojen, że wszystkie bronie staną się bezużyteczne i że Federacja przywróci pokój na całym świecie lub coś w tym stylu. Nie jestem pewna, czy prawidłowo zrozumiałam, ale zabrzmiało to, jakby Federacja zamierzała dokonać inwazji na Janubię. Sądzę, że <powinieneś/powinnaś> ostrzec swoich towarzyszy o tym.","","Hij zei dat er snel geen noodzaak meer zal zijn voor oorlogen, dat alle wapens nutteloos zullen worden en dat de Federatie vrede zal brengen voor de hele wereld, of zoiets. Ik weet niet zeker of ik het goed begrepen heb, maar het klonk alsof de Federatie Janubi binnen zou gaan vallen. Ik denk dat je je mensen zou moeten waarschuwen.","","Dia kata bahawa kita tidak akan perlu berperang dah dalam masa terdekat, bahawa semua senjata akan jadi tidak berguna dan bahawa Federation akan bawa keamanan kepada seluruh dunia atau sesuatu macam itu. Saya tidak pasti kalau saya telah memahaminya dengan betul, tapi rasanya macam Federation akan menyerang Janubi. Saya rasa bahawa kamu harus memberi amaran kepada orang kamu tentangnya."
         ,"","","","他說最近呢不再需要作戰，全部的武器都沒有用了，聯邦會對整個世界帶來和平，諸如此類的。我不確定是否我理解的很正確，但是聽起來，聯邦打算攻進賈努比區域。我想你應該警告你的人們。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5531":["","Yes. I should do it as soon as possible. Thank you, Huli. Goodbye. [leave]","","Tienes razón. Tengo que informarles cuanto antes. Gracias, Huli. Adiós. [marcharse]","","","","Sim. Eu vou fazer isso o quanto antes. <Obrigado/Obrigada>, Huli. Adeus. [sair]","Ja, das sollte ich so schnell wie möglich machen. Danke, Huli. Tschüss. [gehen]","","Da. Ar trebui să fac asta cât mai curând posibil. Mulțumesc, Huli. La revedere. [pleacă]","Tak. <Powinienem/Powinnam> to zrobić tak szybko jak się da. Dziękuje, Huli. Żegnaj. [odejdź]","","Ja. Ik zou het zo snel mogelijk moeten doen. Dank je Huli. Vaarwel. [vertrekken]","","Ya. Saya harus melakukannya secepat mungkin. Terima kasih, Huli. Selamat tinggal. [Tinggal]","","","","對。我應該盡快進行。感謝，胡莉。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5532":["","What is the Federation?","","¿Qué es la Federación?","","","","O que é a Federação?","Worum handelt es sich bei der Föderation?","","Ce este Federația?","Co to jest Federacja?","","Wat is de Federatie?","","Apakah Federation?","","","","聯邦是甚麼？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5533":["","Some guys from north-east. You better ask your boss about them. He\'ll know better.","","Son gente del nordeste. Pero es mejor que le preguntes a tu jefe. Él sabrá explicártelo mejor que yo.","","","","Uns caras do nordeste. É melhor você perguntar ao seu chefe sobre eles. Ele saberá melhor.","Ein paar Leute aus dem Nordosten. Du solltest deswegen lieber deinen Boss fragen, der weiß besser bescheid.","","Niște oameni din nord-est. Ar fi mai bine să-l întrebi pe șeful tău, despre ei. Știe mai bine.","Jacyś goście z północnego wschodu. Lepiej zapytaj się swego szefa o nich. Będzie wiedział lepiej.","","Wat kerels uit het noordoosten. Je kunt beter je baas naar hen vragen. Hij zal het beter weten.","","Beberapa orang dari arah timur laut. Baik kamu tanya ketua kamu tentang mereka. Dia tahu lebih.","","","","他們在東北邊。你最好問問看你的老闆。他更清楚。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5534":["","OK. I will. Thanks for your help. [leave]","","Ya veo. De acuerdo, lo haré. Gracias por tu ayuda. [marcharse]","","","","Tudo bem. Eu vou. <Obrigado/Obrigada> pela sua ajuda. [sair]","Ok. Das mache ich. Danke für deine Hilfe. [gehen]","","OK. Așa voi face. Mulțumesc pentru ajutor. [pleacă]","Okej. Tak zrobię. Dzięki za twoją pomoc. [odejdź]","","OK. Dat zal ik doen. Dank je voor je hulp. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya akan. Terima kasih atas pertolongan kamu. [Tinggal]","","","","好。我會的。感謝你的幫忙。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5535":["","I tried to convince Huli to work for us, and she will do it if we pay her.","","He estado hablando con Huli para convencerla de que trabaje para nosotros. Está dispuesta a hacerlo, pero a cambio de dinero.","","","","Eu tentei convencer Huli a trabalhar para nós, e ela irá se pagarmos a ela.","Ich habe Huli davon überzeugt für uns zu arbeiten und wenn wir sie bezahlen, würde sie es machen.","","Am încercat s-o conving pe Huli să lucreze pentru noi, și o va face, dacă o plătim.","<Próbowałem/Próbowałam> przekonać Huli do pracy dla nas i jeśli jej zapłacimy, to będzie dla nas pracować.","","Ik heb geprobeerd Huli te overtuigen om voor ons te werken, en ze doet het als we haar betalen.","","Saya telah cuba menyakinkan Huli untuk bekerja untuk kita, dan dia akan buat demikian kalau kita bayar dia.","","","","我試著說服胡莉幫我們工作，但她希望我們付錢。","","Προσπάθησα να πείσω τη Huli να δουλέψει για μας και θα το κάνει αν την πληρώσουμε.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
         ,"","",""],
         "5536":["","How much?","","¿Dinero? ¿De cuánto dinero estaríamos hablando?","¿Cuánto?","","","Quanto?","Wie viel?","","Cât vrea?","Jak dużo?","","Hoeveel?","","Berapa?","","","","多少？","","Πόσα;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5537":["","500,000.","","","","","","","500.000.","","","500,000.","","500.000","","500,000.","","","","500000。","","500.000","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5538":["","What?!! It\'s a lot of money!","","¡¡¿Cuánto?!! ¡Buf! ¡Eso es muchísimo dinero!","","","","O quê?!! Isso é muito dinheiro!","Waas?!! Das ist sehr viel Geld!","","Ce?! O groază de bani!","Co?!! To mnóstwo pieniędzy!","","Wat?!!! Dat is een hoop geld!","","Apa?!! Ia adalah jumlah yang besar!","","","","甚麼？！這可是一大筆錢！","","Τι; Αυτά είναι πολλά λεφτά!","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5539":["","Can you give it to me?","","Pues sí... ¿Lo tenéis?","","","","Você pode me dá-lo?","Kannst du es mir geben?","","Poți să mi-i dai?","Czy możesz mi je dać?","","Kun je het me geven?","","Bolehkah kamu berikannya kepada saya?","","","","你有辦法給我嗎？","","Μπορείς να μου τα δώσεις;","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5540":["","Can you cover part of the expenses? I\'ll cover the other part myself.","","¿Podríais correr con parte de los gastos? Yo aportaría el resto.","","","","Você pode cobrir parte das despesas? Eu cobrirei a outra parte.","Kannst du einen Teil der Ausgaben decken? Denn Rest suche ich mir selbst zusammen.","","Poți să acoperi o parte din cheltuieli? Voi acoperi eu cealaltă parte.","Czy możesz pokryć część wydatków? Ja pokryję drugą część <sam/sama>.","","Kun je een deel van de uitgaven dekken? Ik zal zelf het andere deel dekken.","","Bolehkah kamu bayar setengah daripada perbelanjaan ini? Saya akan tanggung bakinya.","","","","你想要負擔部分的費用嗎？我可以自己出一些。","","Μπορείς να καλύψεις μέρος των εξόδων; Θα καλύψω τα υπόλοιπα <μόνος/μόνη> μου.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5541":["","Don\'t worry. I\'ll pay it myself.","","No te preocupes. Los pagaré de mi bolsillo.","","","","Não se preocupe. Eu pagarei <sozinho/sozinha>.","Keine Sorge. Ich bezahle es selber.","","Nu-ți face griji. O să plătesc eu.","Nie martw się. <Sam/Sama> to zapłacę.","","Maak je geen zorgen. Ik zal het zelf betalen.","","Jangan risau. Saya akan sendiri bayar.","","","","別擔心。我會自己籌錢。","","Μη ανησυχείς. Θα τα πληρώσω εγώ.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5542":["","Oh, no! Absolutely impossible. This sum is comparable to our whole yearly budget.","","¡Oh, no! ¡Eso es absolutamente imposible! Una suma como esa equivale a nuestro presupuesto anual.","","","","Ah, não! Totalmente impossível. Essa soma é comparável a todo o nosso orçamento anual.","Oh nein! Das ist absolut unmöglich. Diese Summe ist etwa genauso hoch wie unser ganzes Jahresbudget.","","Oh, nu! Absolut imposibil. Această sumă este comparabilă cu întregul nostru buget anual.","Och, nie. Absolutnie niemożliwe. Taka suma jest porównywalna z całym naszym rocznym budżetem.","","Oh, nee! Absoluut onmogelijk. Die som is vergelijkbaar met ons hele jaarbudget.","","Oh, tak! Sememangnya mustahil. Jumlah ini adalah setanding dengan bajet setahun kami.","","","","噢，不！絕對不可能。總數是我們全年的預算。","","Ω όχι! Απολύτως αδύνατον. Το ποσό είναι συγκρίσιμο με τον ετήσιο προϋπολογισμό μας.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5543":["","We have some money for unexpected expenses and I can give it all to you, but don\'t expect it to be much... wait, I\'ll check... Hmm... I can only give you 10,000. It doesn\'t help much. Does it?","","Tenemos un poco de dinero reservado para gastos inesperados. Podría dártelo, pero me temo que no es mucho... Déjame ver... Hmmm... 10,000 es todo lo que puedo darte. No es mucho, ¿verdad?","","","","Nós temos algum dinheiro para imprevistos e eu posso dá-lo todo a você, mas não pense ser muito... espere, vou checar... Hmm... Eu posso apenas lhe dar 10,000. Isso não ajuda muito. Ou ajuda?","Wir haben etwas Geld für unerwartete Ausgaben und ich kann dir alles davon geben, aber erwarte nicht, dass es viel ist.. warte, ich überprüf\'s... Hmm... Ich kann Dir nur 10000 geben. Das hilft nicht viel, oder?","","Avem niște bani pentru cheltuieli neprevăzute și pot să ți-i dau pe toți, dar nu te aștepta să fie mulți... stai un pic, voi verifica ... Hmm ... Pot să-ți dau doar 10.000. Nu te ajută prea mult. Nu-i așa?"
         ,"Mamy trochę pieniędzy na nieoczekiwane wydatki i mogę ci je wszystkie dać, ale nie oczekuj za wiele... czekaj, sprawdzę... Hmm... Mogę ci dać 10,000. To nie wiele pomaga. Czyż nie?","","We hebben wat geld voor onverwachte uitgaven en ik kan het je allemaal geven, maar verwacht niet dat het veel is... wacht, ik zal kijken... Hmm... Ik kan je maar 10.000 geven. Dat helpt niet veel, of wel?","","Kami mempunyai sejumlah wang untuk perbelanjaan yang tidak dijangka dan saya boleh bagi semuanya kepada anda, tapi jangan harapkan amaun yang besar... tunggu, bagi saya tengok... Hmm... Saya boleh bagi anda 10,000 saja. Ia tidak banyak, kan?","","","","我們有一些準備金，我可以給你，但是不要太過期待... 等等，我確認一下... 恩... 我可以給你10000。沒甚麼幫助對吧？","","Έχουμε κάποια λεφτά για έκτακτα έξοδα και μπορώ να στα δώσω αλλά μην περιμένεις να είναι πολλά... θα το τσεκάρω... χμ... θα μπορούσα να σου δώσω 10.000 δεν βοηθάνε πολύ. Έτσι δεν είναι;","","","","","","","May pera kami para sa mga di-inaasahang gastusin at kaya ko itong ibigay ito sa iyo. Pero di naman ito kalakihan... teka, tingnan ko... Hmm... Kaya kitang bigyan ng 10,000. Di ito masyadong makakatulong, diba?"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5544":["","It\'s really nice of you. Thanks!","","Es todo un detalle por tu parte.","","","","É muita bondade da sua parte. Obrigado!","Das ist sehr nett von dir. Danke!","","E foarte frumos din partea ta. Mulțumesc!","Bardzo miło z twojej strony. Dzięki!","","Dat is heel aardig van je. Bedankt!","","Baiknya hati kamu. Terima kasih!","","","","你人真是太好了。感謝！","","Είναι ευγενικό εκ μέρους σου. Ευχαριστώ.","","","","","","","Ang bait mo naman. Salamat!","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5545":["","Give me whatever you can. I\'ll gather the rest myself.","","Dame lo que puedas. Yo <mismo/misma> conseguiré el resto.","Dame lo que puedas. Conseguiré el resto yo <mismo/misma>.","","","Me dê o que você puder. O que faltar eu mesmo procuro.","Gib mir was du hast. Den Rest sammel ich mir selbst zusammen.","","Dă-mi tot ce poți. Voi aduna eu restul.","Daj mi cokolwiek możesz. <Sam/Sama> zbiorę resztę.","","Geef me wat je kunt. Ik zal de rest zelf bijeen brengen.","","Bagi saya apa saja yang kamu boleh bagi. Saya akan mencari bakinya.","","","","給我你能給我的。我會籌到其他的部分。","","Δώσε μου όσα μπορείς. Θα συγκεντρώσω τα υπόλοιπα <μόνος/μόνη> μου.","","","","","","","Ibigay mo ang iyong makakaya. Ako na bahala sa natitira.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5546":["","Don\'t worry. I\'ll find the money myself.","","No te preocupes. Ya encontraré el dinero por mi cuenta.","No te preocupes. Encontraré el dinero por mi cuenta.","","","Não se preocupe. O dinheiro eu acho.","Keine Sorgen, ich finde schon genug Geld.","","Nu-ți face griji. Voi găsi eu banii.","Nie martw się. <Sam/Sama> znajdę pieniądze.","","Maak je geen zorgen. Ik zal het geld zelf wel vinden.","","Jangan risau. Saya akan berusaha mendapatkan wang ini.","","","","別擔心。我會自己籌到錢。","","Μην ανησυχείς. Θα βρώ τα λεφτά <μόνος/μόνη> μου.","","","","","","","\'Wag kang mag-alala. Ako na bahala sa pera.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5547":["","Well. It\'s better than nothing.","","Bueno... Algo es algo.","","","","Bom, é melhor que nada.","Naja. Ist besser als nichts.","","Păi, e mai bine decât nimic.","Cóż. Lepsze to niż nic.","","Wel. Het is beter dan niets.","","Mmm. Ia lebih baik daripada tiada.","","","","這個嘛。總比沒有好。","","Λοιπόν. Καλύτερα απ΄ το τίποτα.","","","","","","","Mabuti na kaysa wala","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5548":["","It doesn\'t change anything. Leave it for your expenses. I\'ll gather the money myself.","","Pues no, no es mucho. Es mejor que te lo guardes por si lo necesitáis. Ya conseguiré el dinero yo <mismo/misma>.","","","","Isso não muda nada. Guarde para as suas despesas, eu junto o dinheiro.","Das ändern nichts. Behalte es für deine Unkosten. Ich suche mir das Geld selbst zusammen.","","Asta nu schimbă nimic. Păstrează-i pentru cheltuielile voastre. Voi strânge eu banii.","To niczego nie zmieni. Zostaw to na swoje wydatki. <Sam/Sama> zbiorę pieniądze.","","Dat verandert niets. Laat het voor je uitgaven. Ik zal het geld zelf verzamelen.","","Ia tak dapat tolong. Simpan saja untuk perbelanjaan kamu. Saya akan mengumpulkan duit.","","","","我不需要你的幫忙，我會自己籌這筆錢。","","Δεν αλλάζουν τίποτε. Κράτα τα για τα έξοδά σας. Θα συγκεντρώσω τα χρήματα <μόνος/μόνη> μου.","","","","","","","Hindi iyan makakapagpabago ng kahit ano. Panggastos mo na lang iyan. Ako na ang bahala sa pera.","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5549":["","Don\'t mention it. See you later. [leave]","","De nada. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","De nada. Até mais. [sair]","Vergiss es. Bis später. [gehen]","","Pentru puțin. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Proszę bardzo. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Vergeet het. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Sama-sama. Jumpa anda lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","不值一提。再見。[離開]","","Δεν κάνει τίποτε. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Walang anuman. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5550":["","Here [hands you the money]. Thanks for taking care of it.","","Ten. [te entrega el dinero] Gracias por hacerte cargo del resto.","","","","Aqui [entrega o dinheiro]. Obrigado por cuidar disso.","Hier.[er gibt dir das Geld] Danke, dass du dich darum gekümmert hast.","","Uite [îți dă banii]. Mulțumesc că te ocupi de asta.","Masz [przekazuje ci pieniądze]. Dzięki za załatwienie tego.","","Hier. [geeft je het geld]. Bedankt dat je het regelt.","","Sini [bagi anda wang]. Terima kasih kerana melaksanakannya.","","","","錢在這[給你錢]。感謝你進行此事。","","Ορίστε [παραδίνει τα χρήματα]. Ευχαριστώ που το φροντίζεις.","","","","","","","Heto [Iniabot ang pera]. Sana makatulong ito.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5551":["","You\'re welcome. See you. [leave]","","De nada. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","De nada. Até mais. [sair]","Gern geschehen. Bis dann. [gehen]","","Cu plăcere. Ne mai vedem. [pleacă]","Nie ma za co. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","","Graag gedaan. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","","Sama-sama. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","不客氣。再見。[離開]","","Να ΄σαι καλά. Θα τα πούμε. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5552":["","I found out where the uranium is.","","He averiguado dónde está el uranio.","","","","Eu descobri onde o urânio está.","Ich habe rausgefunden, wo das Uran ist.","","Am aflat unde e uraniul.","<Odkryłem/Odkryłam> gdzie jest uran.","","Ik heb ontdekt waar het uranium is.","","Saya sudah dapat tahu lokasi uranium.","","","","我找到鈾礦在哪裡了。","","Βρήκα που είναι το Ουράνιο.","","","","","","","Alam ko kung nasaan ang uranium.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5553":["","Where?","","","¿Ah, sí? ¿Dónde?","","","Onde?","Wo?","","Unde?","Gdzie?","","Waar?","","Mana?","","","","在哪裡？","","Που είναι;","","","","","","","Saan?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5554":["","According to Huli, the Federation has it.","","Según me ha dicho Huli, lo tiene la Federación.","","","","De acordo com Huli, a Federação o detém.","Laut Huli hat es die Föderation.","","Huli spune că Federația îl are.","Według Huli, Federacja go ma.","","Volgens Huli heeft de Federatie het.","","Mengikut apa yang Huli cakap, Federation tengah menyimpannya.","","","","根據胡莉的說法，聯邦拿走了。","","Σύμφωνα με τη Huli, το έχει η Ομοσπονδία.","","","","","","","Sabi ni Huli, hawak ito ng Pederasyon.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5555":["","It makes sense. If they make that bomb it\'ll allow them to defeat Qubba.","","Tiene sentido. Un arma así les permitiría derrotar a Qubba.","","","","Faz sentido. Se eles fizerem essa bomba eles poderão derrotar Qubba.","Das macht Sinn. Wenn sie soeine Bombe bauen, können sie damit Qubba besiegen.","","Are sens. Dacă vor face bomba, asta le va permite să învingă Qubba.","To ma sens. Jeśli zrobią tę bombę, to pozwoli im to pokonać Qubbe.","","Het is logisch. Als ze die bom maken zal het ze in staat stellen Qubba te verslaan.","","Ia masuk akal. Kalau mereka menghasilkan bom tersebut mereka dapat menghapuskan Qubba.","","","","有道理。假如他們成功做出炸彈，就可以打敗庫巴。","","Έχει λογική. Αν κατασκευάσουν τέτοια βόμβα θα τους επιτρέψει να νικήσουν τη Qubba.","","","","","","","Tama nga naman. Kung magagawa nila ang pasabog, matatalo nila ang Qubba.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5556":["","Not only Qubba. It seems like they\'re planning to invade Janubi too.","","Y no sólo derrotar a Qubba. Por lo que tengo entendido, también planean invadir Janubi.","","","","Não apenas Qubba. Parece que eles planejam invadir Janubi também.","Nicht nur Qubba. Es scheint, als wollten sie auch in Janubi einfallen.","","Nu numai Qubba. Se pare că aceștia intenționează să invadeze și regiunea Janubi.","Nie tylko Qubbe. Wygląda na to, że planują również inwazję na Janubi.","","Niet alleen Qubba. Het ziet er naar uit dat ze ook van plan zijn Janubi binnen te vallen.","","Bukan Qubba sahaja. Mereka juga merancang untuk menyerang Janubi juga.","","","","不只庫巴區域。似乎他們也計畫侵入賈努比區域。","","Όχι μόνο στη Qubba. Φαίνεται ότι σχεδιάζουν να εισβάλλουν επίσης στη Janubi.","","","","","","","Hindi lang ang Qubba. Mukhang plano nilang sakupin rin ang Janubi.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5557":["","Of course. Once they have Qubba out of their way, the rest will be easy for them to conquer.","","Por supuesto. Una vez que se deshicieran de Qubba, nada les impediría conquisar el resto.","","","","É claro. Uma vez que Qubba esteja fora do caminho deles, o resto será fácil de conquistar.","Natürlich. Sobald sie Qubba aus dem Weg geräumt haben, wird der Rest für sie leicht zu erobern sein.","","Bineînțeles. Odată ce-au eliminat Qubba, restul va fi ușor de cucerit.","Oczywiście. Kiedy tylko Qubba zejdzie im z drogi, reszta będzie dla nich łatwa do podbicia.","","Natuurlijk. Als ze Qubba uit de weg hebben, zal de rest makkelijker te veroveren zijn voor ze.","","Sudah tentu. Selepas Qubba dihapuskan, kerja merampas kawasan-kawasan lain akan menjadi senang untuk mereka.","","","","當然。一旦庫巴政府不再擋住他們的路，其他的部分都很容易征服。","","Φυσικά. Μόλις ξεμπερδέψουν με την Qubba, η κατάκτηση των υπολοίπων περιοχών θα είναι εύκολη γιαυτούς.","","","","","","","Oo naman. Kapag nakuha nila ang Qubba, madali na nilang masasakop ang iba."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5558":["","Who are they exactly?","","¿Quiénes son esa gente exactamente?","","","","Quem exatamente são eles?","Wer sind sie den wirklich?","","Cine sunt ei, mai exact?","Kim oni właściwie są?","","Wie zijn dat precies?","","Siapakah mereka sebenarnya?","","","","他們到底是誰？","","Ποιοι είναι ακριβώς;","","","","","","","Sino ba talaga sila?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5559":["","It used to be just one town in the far north, but then it started expanding capturing the surrounding areas, and now it\'s a huge empire that keeps growing continuously.","","Al principio era sólo una ciudad independiente del norte, pero poco a poco fueron extendiendo su poder, conquistando y controlando los pueblos y ciudades de su alrededor. Ahora mismo se ha convertido en un vasto imperio que no para de crecer.","","","","Era apenas uma cidade bem ao norte, mas então começou a se expandir capturando as áreas ao redor, e agora é um imenso império que cresce continuamente.","Es war am Anfang nur eine Stadt im entfernten Norden, aber dann sind sie expandiert und haben die umliegenden Gebiete eingenommen. Und jetzt ist es ein großes Reich, dass stetig wächst.","","Era doar un oraș în nordul îndepărtat, dar apoi a început extinderea și capturarea zonele înconjurătoare, iar acum este un imperiu imens, care continuă să crească în continuu.","Kiedyś było to jedno miasteczko na dalekiej północy, ale wtedy zaczęła się rozszerzać, przejmując sąsiadujące regiony, a teraz jest to ogromne imperium, które wciąż rośnie."
         ,"","Het was eerst maar een stad in het verre noorden, maar toen begon het uit te bereiden door de omringende gebieden te veroveren en nu is het een gigantisch imperium dat voortdurend blijft groeien.","","Dulu ia hanya sebuah kota di kawasan jauh utara, tapi mereka mula berkembang dengan merampas kawasan-kawasan yang berhampiran, dan sekarang mereka sudah menjadi satu empayar yang besar yang semakin hari semakin besar.","","","","以前只是非常北方的一個鎮，後來它開始拓展到鄰近的區域，現在已經是一個持續擴增的帝國了。","","Παλιά βρισκόντουσαν σε μία πόλη μακρυά στα Βόρεια, αλλά άρχισαν να επεκτείνονται καταλαμβάνοντας τις γύρω περιοχές, και τώρα είναι μία τεράστια αυτοκρατορία η οποία εξακολουθεί να επεκτείνεται συνεχώς.","","","","","","","Noon ay isang bayan lang iyon sa hilaga, pero nagsimula itong manakop ng mga nalalapit na lugar, at ngayon ay isa na itong malaking imperyo na palaki lang ng palaki.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5560":["","Are they bad guys?","","¿Y son mala gente?","","","","Eles são caras maus?","Sind das schlechte Typen?","","Sunt opresivi?","Czy są złymi ludźmi(bad guys)?","","Zijn het slechteriken?","","Adakah mereka orang jahat?","","","","他們是壞蛋嗎？","","Είναι κακοί;","","","","","","","Sila ba ay kaaway?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5561":["","Yes. They are. They say that they bring order, peace and prosperity, and they\'re right in a sense. They do reduce violence and improve economy in the regions they capture, but they take much more valuable things from them like their freedom and their dignity. They claim that everybody in the Federation loves being part of it... well, of course, because anyone who dares not to love it is immediately executed. The most terrifying thing, though is that many people sincerely believe that the Federation is the best place on Earth. Their leaders are real propaganda experts. They brainwash their people really well. If it was only the fear, there would be those who are brave enough to fight the regime and break it from the inside, but it\'s much worse. A mixture of fear and love for their country gives their leaders truly unlimited power, which is what they were looking for in the first place, of course. Believe it or not, but their supreme leader calls himself a president for a reason. He was democratically elected by the absolute majority of the people... Well... By the majority of those whom he decided to keep alive, of course."
         ,"","Pues sí, lo son. Ellos afirman traer el orden, la paz y la prosperidad a las regiones que conquistan, y en cierta manera es así. Es cierto que en las regiones que controlan se reduzcan los niveles de violencia y se vea aumentada la prosperidad económica, pero lo hacen a costa de las libertades y la dignidad del pueblo. Ellos proclaman que todo el mundo que forma parte de la Federación está feliz y contento... No es de extrañar si ellos mismos se encargan de eliminar a todos aquellos que se atreven a levantar la voz en su contra. Pero lo que es peor, es que muchos creen que la Federación es lo mejor que existe en la faz de la Tierra. Sus dirigentes son unos auténticos maestros de la propaganda. Son especialistas en lavarle el cerebro a la gente. Si solamente les tuvieran miedo, seguro que aquellos que fueran lo suficientemente valientes para vencer ese miedo se enfrentarían al régimen desde su interior. Pero es algo mucho peor. Existe entre la población de la Federación una mezcla de miedo al régimen y ardor nacionalista que otorga a sus líderes un poder ilimitado, que es precisamente lo que éstos buscan. Lo creas o no, su principal dirigente se hace llamar a sí mismo Presidente por una razón: fue elegido en unas elecciones ganadas con la inmensa mayoría de los votos... Es decir... por la inmensa mayoría de los votos de aquellos que ellos mismos decidieron que se mantuvieran con vida, claro..."
         ,"","","","Sim. Eles são. Eles dizem que conduzem à ordem, paz e prosperidade, e eles estão certos por um lado. Eles reduzem a violência e melhoram a economia das regiões que capturam, porém tomam para si coisas muito mais valiosas para elas, como a liberdade e a dignidade. Eles afirmam que todo mundo ama participar da Federação... bem, é claro, porque alguém que ouse não amar é imediatamente executado. A coisa mais terrível é que muita gente pensa que a Federação é o melhor lugar na Terra. Seus líderes são mestres da propaganda. Eles fazem lavagem cerebral no povo, de forma que ele não se aperceba disso. Se fosse apenas medo, haveriam aqueles que seriam bravos o suficiente para lutar contra o regime e quebrá-lo por dentro, mas é muito pior. Uma mistura de medo e amor pelo seu país dá aos seus líderes poder verdadeiramente ilimitado, que é o que eles procuram em primeiro lugar, sem dúvida. Acredite ou não, mas seu supremo líder proclama-se presidente por uma razão. Ele foi democraticamente eleito por maioria absoluta das pessoas... Bem... Pela maioria daqueles que ele decidiu manter vivos, é claro."
         ,"Ja, das sind sie. Sie sagen, dass sie von Ordnung, Frieden und Wohlstand bringen und auf ihre Weise haben sie Recht. Sie verringern die Gewalt und fördern die Wirtschaft in der Region, die sie einnehmen. Aber sie nehmen dafür noch wertvollere Dinge von den Leuten, wie zum Beispiel ihre Freiheit und ihre Würde. Sie behaupten, dass jeder es liebt ein Teil der Föderation zu sein... naja, dass ist klar, denn jeder der zugibt es nicht zu lieben, wird auf der Stelle umgebracht. Das Erschreckendste daran ist, dass viele Leute wirklich glauben, dass die Föderation der beste Platz der Welt ist. Ihre Führer sind wahrhafte Propagandaexperten. Sie schrecken noch nicht mal vor ihren eigenen Leuten zurück und unterziehen an ihnen Gehirnwäschen. Wenn es nur die Angst wäre, gäbe es bestimmt Leute die mutig genug wären um gegen dieses Regime zu kämpfen und es von innen heraus aufzubrechen. Aber es ist noch schlimmer. Der Mix aus Angst und Liebe für das Land gibt ihren Führern eine unbegrenzte Macht, was natürlich ihr Hauptanliegen ist. Du kannnst es glauben oder nicht, aber aus irgendeinem Grund nennet sich ihr Oberführer Präsident. Er wurde demokratisch von der absoluten Mehrheit der Bevölkerung gewählt... Naja... Bei der Mehrheit die am Leben bleiben wolllte."
         ,"","Da, sunt. Ei spun că au adus ordine, pace și prosperitate și au dreptate într-un fel. Au redus violența și au îmbunătățit economia în regiunile pe care le-au capturat, dar au luat lucruri mult mai valoroase de la cei cuceriți, cum ar fi libertatea și demnitatea lor. Ei susțin că toată lumea din Federație iubește să facă parte din ea... desigur, pentru că oricine îndrăznește să nu o iubească, este executat imediat. Cel mai terifiant lucru, este faptul că mulți oameni cred sincer că Federația este cel mai bun loc de pe Pământ. Liderii lor sunt experți în propagandă. Le spală foarte bine creierul oameniilor. Dacă ar fi fost doar frică,  ar fi cei care sunt suficient de curajoși pentru a lupta împotriva regimului și a-l rupe din interior, dar e mult mai rău . Un amestec de teamă și dragoste pentru țara lor, le dă liderilor putere cu adevărat nelimitată, ceea ce căutau dintotdeauna, desigur . Crezi sau nu, liderul lor suprem se numește președinte pentru un motiv: a fost ales în mod democratic de către majoritatea absolută a oamenilor... de majoritatea celor pe care a decis să-i păstreze în viață."
         ,"Tak. Są nimi. Twierdzą, że przynoszą porządek, pokój i dobrobyt i w pewnym sensie mają rację. Rzeczywiście redukują przemoc i polepszają ekonomię w regionach, które przejmują, ale zabierają o wiele cenniejsze rzeczy od nich, takie jak ich wolność i godność. Twierdzą, że wszyscy w Federacji kochają być jej częścią... cóż, to oczywiste, ponieważ ktokolwiek śmie nie kochać jest natychmiast tracony. Jednak najbardziej przerażającą sprawą jest, jak wiele ludzi szczerze wierzy, że Federacja jest najlepszym miejscem na Ziemi.  Ich przywódcy to prawdziwi eksperci od propagandy. Piorą mózgi swoich obywateli bardzo dobrze. Gdyby to był tylko strach, byliby tacy wystarczający odważni do walki z reżimem i połamania go od środka, ale jest znacznie gorzej. Mikstura strachu i miłości dla ich kraju daje ich przywódcom nie limitowaną potęgę, co jest tym, czego poszukiwali w pierwszym miejscu, to jasne. Wierz lub nie, ale ich naczelny przywódca zwie siebie prezydentem, bo ma powód. Został demokratycznie wybrany przez absolutną większość ludzi... No... Przez większość ludzi, których postanowił pozostawić przy życiu, oczywiście."
         ,"","Ja. Dat zijn ze. Ze zeggen dat ze orde, vrede en voorspoed brengen, en aan één kant hebben ze gelijk. Ze verminderen geweld en verbeteren de economie in de regios die ze veroveren, maar ze nemen ook veel waardevolle dingen zoals hun vijheid en hun waardigheid. Ze claimen dat iedereen in de Federatie er van houdt om er deel van uit  te maken... wel, natuurlijk, omdat iedereen die het waagt er niet van te houden, onmiddelijk geëxecuteerd wordt. Het meest angstaanjagende ding is echter dat veel mensen oprecht geloven dat de Federatie de beste plek op aarde is. Hun leiders zijn echte propaganda experts. Ze hersenspoelen hun mensen heel goed. Als het alleen angst was, zouden er mensen dapper genoeg zijn om het regime te bevechten en het van binnenuit kapot te maken, maar het is veel erger. Een mengsel van angst en liefde voor hun land geeft hun leiders echt ongelimiteerde macht, wat is waar ze naar zochten in de eerste plaats, natuurlijk. Geloof het of niet, maar hun hoogste leider noemt zich president om een reden. Hij was democratisch gekozen door de absolute meerderheid van het volk... wel... Door de meerderheid die hij besloot in leven te laten, natuurlijk."
         ,"","Ya. Mereka adalah jahat. Mereka kata bahawa mereka membawa ketenteraman, keamanan dan kemakmuran, dan ini boleh kira betul juga. Mereka dapat mengurangkan keganasan dan menambahbaik ekonomi di kawasan yang dirampas, tapi mereka juga mengambil lagi banyak benda yang bernilai macam kebebasan dan maruah. Mereka mendakwa bahawa semua orang yang berada bawah Federation gembira menjadi sebahagian daripadanya... mmm, sudah tentu, sebab sesiapa yang berani menentangnya dibunuh dengan segera. Bagaimanapun, perkara yang paling menakutkan adalah ramai yang percaya bahawa Federation adalah tempat yang paling bagus di dunia. Ketua-ketua mereka sangat pandai dalam penyebaran propaganda, dan mereka dapat mengindoktrinasi rakyat mereka dengan mendalam. Kalau ia hanya pasal ketakukan, memang akan ada orang yang cukup berani untuk menentang rejim ini dan menghancurkannya dari dalam, tapi ia lagi teruk. Kombinasi ketakutan dan cinta pada negara memberi kuasa yang tidak terhad kepada ketua-ketua mereka, dan sudah tentu ini adalah apa yang mereka nak pada mulanya. Percaya ke tidak, ada sebab ketua tertinggi mereka panggil diri dia sebagai presiden. Dia telah dipilih secara demokratik oleh majoriti mutlak rakyatnya... Mmm... Sudah tentu oleh majoriti yang dia bagi hidup."
         ,"","","","對。是壞蛋。他們說他們代表秩序，和平，與繁榮，從某個角度來說沒錯。他們真的減少了暴力行為，促進了他們佔領區域的經濟，但是他們從那些地方拿取了更寶貴的東西，像是自由與尊嚴。他們聲稱在聯邦的居民都愛聯邦，當然，因為那些敢說不愛的馬上就被處決了。最可怕的是，真的有很多人認為聯邦是地球上最棒的地方。他們的領袖絕對是宣傳戰的高手。洗腦的很成功。假如只有恐懼，總是會有那些勇敢的人會從內部抵抗。但他們的伎倆不只是如此。對國家充滿了恐懼與愛慕的這種藥方給了領導人無限制的權利。但是，信不信由你，那個領導人強調自己是總統，是有原因的。他是被大多數的人選出來... 這個嘛... 所謂的大多數指得是那些他決定可以活下來的那一群。","","Ναι είναι. Λένε ότι φέρνουν τάξη, ειρήνη και προκοπή και κατά κάποιο τρόπο έχουν δίκιο. Μειώνουν τη βία και βελτιώνουν την οικονομία στις περιοχές που καταλαμβάνουν, αλλά παίρνουν πολύ πιο πολύτιμα πράγματα από τους κατοίκους όπως την ελευθερία και την αξιοπρέπεια. Ισχυρίζονται ότι αρέσει σε όλους να είναι μέλη της Ομοσπονδίας... φυσικά, γιατί όποιος τολμήσει να μην του αρέσει εκτελείται αμέσως. Όμως το πιο τρομακτικό πράγμα είναι ότι πολλοί πιστεύουν σοβαρά ότι η Ομοσπονδία είναι το καλύτερο μέρος στη Γη. Οι ηγέτες της είναι πραγματικοί εξπέρ της προπαγάνδας. Κάνουν εξαιρετική πλύση εγκεφάλου στους ανθρώπους. Αν ήταν μόνο ο φόβος, θα έπρεπε να υπάρχουν αυτοί που θα πολεμούσαν και θα γκρεμίζανε το καθεστώς από μέσα αλλά είναι πολύ χειρότερα. Ένα μίγμα αγάπης - φόβου για τη χώρα τους δίνει στους ηγέτες τους απεριόριστη δύναμη, το οποίο ήταν το ζητούμενο από την  αρχή. Είτε το πιστεύεις είτε όχι ο ανώτατος ηγέτης τους αποκαλεί τον εαυτό του \"Πρόεδρο με σκοπό\". Έχει εκλεγεί δημοκρατικά από την απόλυτη πλειοψηφία του λαού... μάλλον... από την πλειοψηφία όσων αποφασίσανε να παραμείνουν ζωντανοί."
