         "5596":["","I really hope so... [leave]","","Eso espero... [marcharse]","","","","Eu realmente tenho esperança... [sair]","Das hoffe ich doch... [gehen]","","Chiar sper...[pleacă]","Naprawdę mam taką nadzieję... [odejdź]","","Dat hoop ik echt... [vertrekken]","","Saya betul-betul berharap begitu... [Tinggal]","","","","我也這樣期待。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5597":["","Oh. It\'s nice to see you again. Have you decided to buy it?","","¡Oh! Qué alegría volver a verle. ¿Ha decidido ya si le interesa comprarlo?","","","","Oh. É bom te ver de novo. Você decidiu comprar?","Oh. Es ist schön dich zu sehen. Willst du es jetzt kaufen?","","Oh. Îmi pare bine să te revăd. Te-ai decis să-l cumperi?","Och. Miło cię znowu widzieć. Czy <postanowiłeś/postanowiłaś> to kupić?","","Oh. Leuk je weer te zien. Heb je besloten om het te kopen?","","Oh. Saya gembira berjumpa dengan kamu lagi. Adakah kamu sudah membuat keputusan untuk membelinya?","","","","噢。再見到你真好。你決定要買了嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5598":["","No. Not really. I just wanted to see where you live. See you later. [leave]","","La verdad es que no. Tal sólo quería ver dónde vives. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","","","Não, na verdade não. Eu apenas quis ver onde você mora. Até logo. [sair]","Nein, nicht wirklich. Ich wollte nur schauen, wo du wohnst. Bis später. [gehen]","","Nu, nu chiar. Am vrut doar să văd unde locuiești. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nie. Nie bardzo. Po prostu <chciałem/chciałam> zobaczyć, gdzie mieszkasz. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Nee. Niet echt. Ik wilde alleen kijken waar je woont. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Tak. Belum lagi. Saya hanya nak tengok tempat tinggal kamu. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","不。還沒有。我只是想來看看你住哪裡。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5599":["","Yes. Here\'s the money. [give money to Lipas]","","Pues sí. Toma, el dinero que habíamos acordado. [entregar el dinero a Lipas]","","","","Sim. Aqui está o dinheiro. [dar dinheiro a Lipas]","Ja, hier ist dein Geld. [gib Lipas das Geld]","","Da. Uite banii. [dă-i banii lui Lipas]","Tak. Oto twoje pieniądze. [przekaż pieniądze Lipasowi]","","Ja. Hier is het geld. [geef geld aan Lipas]","","Ya. Duit di sini. [Bagi duit kepada Lipas]","","","","對。錢在這裡。[把錢給里巴斯]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5600":["","Have you ever heard about a book called nautical almanac?","","¿Conoces un libro llamado \'Almanaque de Navegación\'?","","","","Você já ouviu falar de um livro chamado Almanaque Náutico?","Hast du schon mal von einem Buch mit dem Namen Nautischer Almanach gehört?","","Ai auzit vreodată despre o carte numită almanah nautic?","Czy słyszałeś o książce zwanej marynarskie kalendarium?","","Heb je ooit gehoord over een boek genaamd nautische almanak?","","Pernahkah kamu dengar tentang satu buku yang dipanggil almanac nautikal?","","","","你有聽過一本書叫做航海曆嗎？","","Έχεις ακούσει ποτέ για ένα βιβλίο που αποκαλείται Ναυτικό Αλμανάκ;","","","","","","","Narinig mo na ba ang librong tinatawag na nautical almanac?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5601":["","We have quite many books here, but I don\'t think I\'ve ever heard about this one. What is it about?","","Tenemos bastantes libros aquí, pero no me suena haber oído nada parecido. ¿De qué trata el libro?","","","","Nós temos muitos livros aqui, mas eu não acho que tenha escutado sobre este. Do que se trata?","Wir haben hier ziemlich viele Bücher, aber ich denke nicht, dass ich es kenne. Um was geht es darin?","","Avem destul de multe cărți aici, dar nu cred că am auzit vreodată de asta. Despre ce e vorba?","Mamy tu całkiem sporo książek, ale nie sądzę, bym o takiej słyszał. O czym ona jest?","","We hebben vele boeken hier, maar ik denk niet dat ik ooit over deze gehoord heb. Waar gaat het over?","","Kami ada banyak buku di sini, tapi saya rasa saya tak pernah dengar tentang yang ini. Apakah kandungannya?","","","","我們這裡確實有很多書，但是我不認為有聽過你說的那本。那是怎樣的書？","","Έχουμε αρκετά βιβλία εδώ, αλλά δε νομίζω ότι έχω ακούσει ποτέ γιαυτό. Για τι γράφει;","","","","","","","Marami kaming libro rito, pero hindi ko alam ang isang iyon. Tungkol saan iyon?"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5602":["","It\'s a set of tables that allow you to calculate your coordinates.","","Es un conjunto de tablas que permiten calcular las coordenadas de tu posición.","","","","É um conjunto de tabelas que permite com que você calcule suas coordenadas.","Es ist eine Sammlung von Tabellen mit denen man seine Koordinaten berechnen kann.","","Este un set de tabele care-ți permite să calculezi coordonatele.","Jest to zestaw tabel, które pozwalają ci skalkulować swoje koordynaty.","","Het is een set tabellen die je je coördinaten laten berekenen.","","Ia adalah satu set jadual yang membolehkan kamu mengukur koordinat kamu.","","","","它裡面有一堆表格可以用來計算作標。","","Είναι ένα σετ πινάκων που σου επιτρέπει να υπολογίσεις τις συντεταγμένες σου.","","","","","","","Iyon ay mga table na hinahayaang kalkulahin ang iyong kinaroroonan.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5603":["","No. Sorry. We don\'t have any books of this kind.","","Pues no, lo siento. No tenemos ningún libro de ese tipo.","No. Lo siento. No tenemos ningún libro de ese tipo.","","","Não. Sinto muito. Não temos nenhum livro desse tipo.","Nein, tut mir leid. Solche Bücher haben wir nicht.","","Nu. Îmi pare rău. Nu avem nici o carte de acest gen.","Nie. Przykro mi. Nie mamy żadnych książek tego rodzaju.","","Nee. Sorry. We hebben geen boeken van dat soort.","","Tak. Minta maaf. Kami tiada buku-buku jenis ini.","","","","不。抱歉。我們沒有這種的書。","","Όχι. Συγγνώμη. Δεν έχουμε κανένα βιβλίο τέτοιου είδους.","","","","","","","Wala. Pasensya na. Wala kaming ganoong libro.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5604":["","Any ideas where I could find one of them?","","¿Y tienes alguna idea de dónde podría encontrar uno?","","T\'as pas idée où je pourrai en trouver un ?","","Alguma ideia de onde eu possa encontrar um?","Weißt du, wo ich eins finden könnte?","","Ai idee unde aș putea găsi așa ceva?","Jakieś pomysły, skąd <mógłbym/mogłabym> taką wziąć?","","Enig idee waar ik er een zou kunnen vinden?","","Adakah kamu tahu di mana saya boleh mendapatkan satu?","","","","知道我該到哪裡去找嗎？","","Καμμιά ιδέα που μπορώ να βρω κανένα απ΄ αυτά;","","","","","","","Alam mo ba kung saan maaaring makita ng ganoong libro?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5605":["","Hmm... No... Not really. Books have become very rare lately.","","¡Buf!... Pues no, la verdad. Últimamente los libros escasean bastante.","","","","Hmm... Não... Na verdade não. Livros se tornaram raros hoje em dia.","Hmmm.. nein... Nicht wirklich. Bücher sind in der letzten Zeit sehr selten geworden.","","Hmm .. Nu .. Nu chiar. Cărțile au devenit foarte rare în ultimul timp.","Hmm... Nie... Nie bardzo. Książki stały się ostatnio bardzo rzadkie.","","Hmm... Nee... Niet echt. Boeken zijn de laatste tijd heel zeldzaam geworden.","","Hmm... Tak... Memang susah nak dapatkan mana-mana buku baru-baru ini.","","","","恩... 不知道... 近幾年書籍是稀有商品。","","Χμμ... Όχι... Όχι πραγματικά. Τα βιβλία έχουν γίνει πολύ σπάνια τώρα τελευταία.","","","","","","","Hmm.. Wala... Wala talaga. Bihira na ang mga ganoong libro.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5606":["","OK. Thanks. Can I ask you something else?","","Muy bien. Gracias. ¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","OK. Gracias. ¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","Ok. Merci. Puis-je vous demander autre chose ?","","Ah tá. <Obrigado/Obrigada>. Eu posso te pedir mais uma coisa?","Okay. Danke. Darf ich Dich etwas anderes fragen?","","OK. Mulțumesc. Pot să te întreb altceva?","Okej. Dzięki. Czy może zapytać cię o coś innego?","","OK. bedankt. Mag ik je iets anders vragen?","","OK. Terima kasih. Bolehkah saya tanya kamu soalan lain?","","","","好。感謝。我能問你其他的事嗎？","","ΟΚ. Ευχαριστώ. Μπορώ να σε ρωτήσω κάτι άλλο;","","","","","","","Sige, salamat. Maaari ba akong magtanong ng ibang bagay?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5607":["","Do you know where Northway is?","","¿Conoces la ubicación exacta de la ciudad de Northway?","¿Sabes dónde está Northway?","","","Você sabe onde fica Northway?","Weißt Du zufällig, wo Northway ist?","","Știi unde-i Northway?","Czy wiesz gdzie jest Northway?","","Weet je waar Northway ligt?","","Adakah kamu tahu di mana Northway?","","","","你知道 Northway 鎮在哪裡嗎？","","Μήπως ξέρεις που είναι η Northway;","","","","","","","Alam mo ba kung saan ang Northway?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5608":["","Yes, of course. It\'s north-east of here. Give me your map. [shows you the location of Northway]","","Por supuesto. Está al nordeste de aquí. Déjame ver tu mapa. [te muestra la localización de Northway]","Sí, claro. Está al nordeste de aquí. Dame tu mapa. [te muestra la localización de Northway]","","","Sim, é claro. É a nordeste daqui. Me dê seu mapa. [mostra a localização de Northway a você]","Ja, natürlich. Es liegt nordöstlich von hier. Gib mir deine Karte. [zeigt dir die Lage von Northway]","","Da, desigur. Este la nord-est de aici. Dă-mi harta. [îți arată locația orașului Northway]","Tak, oczywiście. Jest na północnym-wschodzie stąd. Daj mi swoją mapę. [pokazuje ci lokację Northway]","","Ja, natuurlijk. Het ligt ten noordoosten van hier. Geef me je kaart. [toont je de locatie van Northway]","","Ya, sudah tentu. Ia di arah timur laut dari sini. Bagi peta kamu kepada saya. [Tunjuk kepada anda lokasi Northway]","","","","當然知道，他在這裡的遠東。給我你的地圖。[指示你 Northway 鎮的位置]","","Ναι, φυσικά είναι Βόρειο-Ανατολικά από εδώ. Δώσε μου το χάρτη σου [δείχνει την τοποθεσία της Northway]"
         ,"","","","","","","Oo naman. nasa hilagang silangan iyon mula rito. Ibigay mo sa akin ang iyong mapa. [ipinakita sa iyo ang lokasyon ng Northway]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5609":["","Great. Thanks! Let me ask you something else.","","Bien. Gracias. ¿Puedo preguntarte algo más?","Bien. ¡Gracias! Déjame preguntarte algo más.","","","Ótimo. <Obrigado/Obrigada>! Me deixe perguntar mais alguma coisa.","Toll. Danke! Lass mich Dich etwas anderes fragen.","","Grozav. Mulțumesc! Lasă-mă să te întreb ceva.","Odlotowo. Dzięki. Pozwól mi zapytać cię o coś innego.","Harika! Teşekkürler. Başka de şeyler sormak istiyorum","Geweldig. Bedankt! Laat me je wat anders vragen.","","Hebat. Terima kasih! Saya nak tanya kamu lagi soalan lain.","","","","太好了。感謝！我想問你其他的事。","","Ωραία, Ευχαριστώ! Κάτσε να σε ρωτήσω κάτι άλλο.","","","","","","","Magaling. Salamat! May itatanong pa ako sa iyo.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5610":["","What?!! You are a slaver?!! Get out of here!","","¡¿¿Qué?! ¡¿Eres <un/una> esclavista?! ¡¡Largo de aquí!!","¡¿¿Qué?! ¡¿Eres <un/una> esclavista?! ¡¡Sal de aquí!!","","","O quê?!! Você é um traficante de escravos?!! Saia logo daqui!","Was?!! Du bist ein Sklavenhändler?!! Raus hier!","","Ce?! Ești <un negustor/o negustoare> de sclavi?! Pleacă de aici!","Co?!! Jesteś <łowcą/łowczynią> niewolników?!! Wynoś się stąd!","Ne var?!! Köleci misin?!! Defol buradan!","Wat?!! Jij bent een slavenhandelaar?!! Ga hier vandaan!","","Apa?!! Kamu seorang penjual hamba?!! Keluar dari sini sekarang!","","","","甚麼？！你這個奴隸商？！快給我滾！","","Τι;!! Είσαι δουλέμπορος;!! Φεύγα από δώ!","","","","","","","Ano?!! Nang-aalipin ka?!! Umalis ka rito!","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
