         "5662":["","OK. Thank you, sir. I\'ll go there right now. See you later. [leave]","","¡Oh! Muchas gracias, Sr. Truffle. Ahora mismo voy para allá. Hasta la vista. [marcharse]","¡Oh! Muchas gracias, Sr. Truffle. Ya mismo voy para allá. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","Ok. Merci, monsieur. Je vais y aller maintenant. À plus tard. [quitter]","","OK. <Obrigado/Obrigada>, senhor. Eu irei até lá agora mesmo. Até mais. [sair]","Ok. Danke sehr. Ich werde mich sofort dorthin begeben. Bis später. [gehen]","","Bine. Vă mulțumesc, domnule. Mă duc acolo chiar acum. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Dziękuje, sir. Udam się tam teraz. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","Tamam. Teşekkürler bayım. Hemen oraya gidiyorum. Görüşmek üzere. [ayrıl]","OK. Dank u, meneer. Ik ga er meteen heen. Ik zie u later. [vertrekken]","","OK. Terima kasih, tuan. Saya akan pergi ke sana sekarang. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。感謝你，長官。我會立即出發。再見。[離開]","","ΟΚ σας ευχαριστώ. Πηγαίνω αμέσως. Τα λέμε αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","",""
