         "5681":["","You seem to have many old devices here. What are you doing with them?","","Por lo que veo, tienes un montón de aparatos electrónicos antiguos. ¿Qué haces con ellos?","","","","Você parece ter muitos aparelhos antigos aqui. O que está fazendo com eles?","Du hast aber viel alte Geräte hier rumliegen. Was machst Du den damit?","","Se pare că ai multe dispozitive vechi aici. Ce faci cu ele?","Wydajesz się mieć tutaj mnóstwo  starych urządzeń. Co z nimi robisz?","Pek çok eski alet var burada. Onlarla ne yapıyorsun?","Je lijkt hier een hoop oude apparaten te hebben. Wat doe je er mee?","","Kamu tengah simpan banyak peranti  yang lama di sini. Apa yang kamu buat dengan mereka?","","","","你這裡有一些老舊裝置，你是在做什麼的？","","Σαν να έχεις πολλές παλιές συσκευές. Τί θα τις κάνεις?","","","","","","","Mukhang marami kang mga makalumang gamit dito. Ano ang gagawin mo sa mga ito?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5682":["","Analyzing, trying to understand how they work, fixing, making copies, recovering old technologies.","","Pues me gusta examinarlos, averiguar cómo funcionan, arreglarlos, hacer copias, recuperar tecnologías antiguas...","","","","Analisando, tentando entender como funcionam, consertando, fazendo cópias, recuperando antigas tecnologias.","Analysieren, versuchen zu verstehen wie sie arbeiten, reparieren, nachbauen und alte Technologien wiederherstellen.","","Le analizez, încercând să înțeleg cum funcționează, le repar, fac copii și recuperez tehnologii vechi.","Analizuje, staram się zrozumieć jak one działają, naprawiam, tworzę kopię, odzyskuje stare technologię.","Analiz ediyor, nasıl çalıştıklarını anlamaya çalışıyor, tamir ediyor, kopya çıkarıyor, eski teknolojileri kurtarıyorum.","Analyseren, uitvogelen hoe ze werken, repareren, kopiëren, oude technologieën hervinden.","","Menganalisis, cuba memahami bagaimana mereka berfungsi, membaik, membuat salinan, mencari balik teknologi-teknologi lama."
         ,"","","","分解，我想試著找出它們運作的方式，修理他們，再複製一個，回復舊時代的科技。","","Αναλύω, προσπαθώ να καταλάβω πως λειτουργούν, επισκευάζω, αντιγράφω, ανακτώ παλιές τεχνολογίες.","","","","","","","Inaalam, inaaral kung pano gumagana, kinukumpuni, ginagawan ng kopya, kumakalap ng makalumang teknolohiya.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5683":["","Hmm. Interesting. What are you working on now?","","Hmmm... Suena interesante. ¿Y a qué te dedicas ahora mismo?","","","","Hmm. Interessante. No que você está trabalhando agora?","Aha, interessant. Woran arbeitest du grade?","","Hmm. Interesant. La ce lucrezi acum?","Hmm. Interesujące. Nad czym obecnie pracujesz?","Hmm. Enteresan. Şu anda ne üzerinde çalışıyorsun?","Hmm. Interessant. Wat ben je nu mee bezig?","","Hmmm. Menarik. Apa yang kamu sedang buat sekarang?","","","","恩，很有趣。那你現在在做甚麼？","","Χμμ, ενδιαφέρον. Σε τι δουλεύεις τώρα;","","","","","","","Hmm. Interesante. Anung bagay ang tinatrabaho mo ngayon?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5684":["","Many projects, but I\'m mostly centered on the subject of geolocation.","","Pues estoy llevando a cabo varios proyectos, la mayoría de ellos centrados en la geolocalización.","","","","Muitos projetos, mas estou mais focado no tópico da geolocalização.","An vielen Projekten, aber am meisten konzentriere ich mich auf die Standortbestimmung.","","La mai multe proiecte, dar sunt cocentrat pe tema geolocalizării.","Nad wieloma projektami, ale jestem głównie skoncentrowany na temacie geo lokalizacji.","Pek çok proje üzerinde, ama daha çok çoğrafi konum üzerine yoğunlaşmış durumdayım.","Een hoop projecten, maar ik ben het meest gecentreerd op het onderwerp van geolocatie.","","Banyak projek, tapi saya fokus paling banyak pada subjek geolokasi.","","","","現在有很多方向可以做，但是主要是專注在跟定位有關的主題。","","Πολλά σχέδια, αλλά κυρίως επικεντρώνομαι στο αντικείμενο του Γεωεντοπισμού.","","","","","","","Maraming mga proyekto. Pero nakasentro sa geolocation.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
         ,"",""],
         "5685":["","What is geolocation?","","¿\'Geolocalización\'? ¿Y eso qué es?","","Qu\'est ce que la géolocalisation?","","O que é geolocalização?","Was bedeutet Standortbestimmung?","","Ce este geolocalizarea?","Czym jest geo lokalizacja?","Coğrafi konum nedir?","Wat is geolocatie?","","Apakah geolokasi?","","","","定位是甚麼？","","Τι είναι ο Γεωεντοπισμός;","","","","","","","Anung geolocaton?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5686":["","Finding your geographic coordinates and knowing where you are exactly... You see, in the later years of the old civilization geolocation devices were in common use. I recovered quite a few of so called GPS navigation devices and analyzed them very thoroughly. It allowed me to learn some new technologies, but, of course, I couldn\'t make any of them work.","","Pues consiste en determinar las coordenadas geográficas de uno mismo para saber exactamente dónde te encuentras... Verás, los sistemas de geolocalización eran muy comunes en la civilización antigua. He podido recuperar varios de ellos, llamados GPS, para examinarlos a fondo. Y aunque no he podido hacer que volvieran a funcionar, me han permitido aprender mucho sobre la geolocalización.","","","","Encontrar suas coordenadas geográficas e descobrir exatamente onde você está... Veja, nos últimos anos da antiga civilização aparelhos de geolocalização eram de uso comum. Eu recuperei alguns dos chamados aparelhos de navegação por GPS e os analisei minuciosamente. Isso me permitiu aprender um pouco sobre novas tecnologias, mas é claro, não consegui fazer nenhum deles funcionar."
         ,"Man versucht die genauen geographischen Koordinaten herauszufinden und dadurch kann man seine exakt Position bestimmen...  Damals gegen Ende der alten Zivilisation wurden  solche Ortsbestimmungsgeräte überall genutzt. Ich konnte ein paar von den sogenannten GPS-Navigationsgeräten wiederfinden und sie sehr genau untersuchen. Ich konnte dadurch sogar einige neu Techniken erlernen, aber natürlich habe ich keins dieser Geräte zum Laufen bekommen.","","Este găsirea coordonatelor geografice și a ști exact unde te afli ... Vezi tu, în ultimii ani ai vechii civilizații, dispozitivele de geolocalizare erau de uz comun. Am recuperat câteva dintre așa-numitele dispozitive de navigare GPS și le-am analizat foarte bine. Asta m-a ajutat să învăț noi tehnologii, dar nu am putut face nici unul dintre dispozitive să funcționeze.","Znajdowaniem swojej geograficznej pozycji i wiedzeniem gdzie dokładnie jesteś... Bo widzisz, w późniejszych latach starej cywilizacji geo lokalizujące urządzenia były w powszechnym użyciu. Odzyskałem całkiem sporo tak zwanych urządzeń nawigacji GPS i przeanalizowałem je dokładnie. Pozwoliło mi to, na poznanie nowych technologi, ale, oczywiście, nie mogłem sprawić, by którekolwiek z nich zadziałały."
         ,"Coğrafik konumunu bulup kesin olarak nerede olduğunu bilmektir... Bildiğin üzere, eski uygarlığın son yıllarında coğrafi konum aygıtları genel kullanımda yer alıyordu. Birkaçını ele geçirip sözde GPS yer bulma aygıtlarını derinlemesine inceledim. Bazı yeni teknolojiler öğrenmeme yardımcı oldu ama tabi hiç birini çalıştırabilmiş değilim.","Je geografische coördinaten vinden en weten waar je precies bent... Weet je, in de latere jaren van de oude beschaving walen geolocatieapparaten algemeen in gebruik. Ik heb er behoorlijk wat zogenaamde gps navigatieapparaten herwonnen en ze grondig geanalizeerd. Het stelde me in staat om wat nieuwe technologieën te leren, maar, natuurlijk kon ik ze niet laten werken.","","Mencari koordinat geografik kamu dan mendapat lokasi sebenar kamu... Fahamkan, pada tahun-tahun kemudian tamadun yang lama, alat-alat geolokasi adalah diguna secara umum. Saya telah mendapatkan beberapa alat navigasi GPS dan telah menganalisis mereka secara teliti. Ia membolehkan saya belajar teknologi-teknologi yang baru, tapi sudah tentu saya tak dapat mengguna mereka."
         ,"","","","找到你的地理座標，精確地知道你現在在哪裡... 你知道嗎，在舊文明的最後時代，定位裝置是常見的工具。我復原了一些以前叫做 GPS 導航的裝置，徹底的搞懂了它們的運作。那讓我更了解了其他的工具，但是，當然，我還沒把其他工具也弄到正常運作。","","Η εύρεση των γεωγραφικών συντεταγμένων και το να γνωρίζεις που είσαι ακριβώς. Βλέπεις, τα τελευταία χρόνια του παλιού πολιτισμού οι συσκευές Γεωεντοπισμού ήταν σε κοινή χρήση. Απέκτησα αρκετές από τις αποκαλούμενες συσκευές πλοήγησης GPS και τις ανέλυσα με προσοχή, μου επέτρεψαν να μάθω γι αρκετές νέες τεχνολογίες, αλλά φυσικά δεν μπόρεσα να κάνω καμία από αυτές να δουλέψει.","","","","","","","Paghanap ng iyong lokasyon at pag-alam kung nasaan ka na mismo... Alam mo, noong araw ang mga geolocation devices ay madalas gamitin. May mga nakalap akong tinatawag na GPS na kagamitang pangnabigasyon at tinutuklas ko silang maigi. Natuto ako ng mga bagong teknolohiya, pero syempre, hindi ko sila mapagana.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5687":["","Why?","","¿Y por qué no has podido hacer que funcionen de nuevo?","","Pourquoi?","","Por quê?","Warum?","","De ce?","Czemu?","Neden?","Waarom?","","Kenapa?","","","","為什麼？","","Γιατί;","","","","","","","Bakit?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5688":["","Well, it\'s obvious... These devices used satellites to determine your coordinates, and I can\'t tell you what exactly happened to each one of the satellites. Some of them might have remained on their orbit. Others certainly fell onto the ground. The fact is that none of them send any radio signals anymore, and the entire GPS network has been down for many years. I knew about it since the very beginning and I never thought of GPS as a possible option, but studying it allowed me to understand geolocation a bit better. I hope that by combining the principles of GPS with other methods, I may finally develop a system that would actually work in our current conditions.","","Pues muy sencillo... Verás, esos dispositivos usaban satélites artificiales para el cálculo de posición. Y esos satélites hace tiempo que dejaron de funcionar. Muchos deben haber abandonado sus órbitas y colisionado contra la Tierra y los pocos que todavía sigan en órbita, hace tiempo que dejaron de enviar sus señales de radio. Así que la red GPS hace muchos años que dejó de funcionar. Desde el principio supe que restablecer un sistema de satélites como el GPS es imposible, pero el estudio de esos dispositivos me ha permitido comprender mejor los principios de la geolocalización. Creo que combinando la tecnología del GPS con otros métodos, podré desarrollar un nuevo sistema de geolocalización capaz de funcionar en las condiciones actuales."
         ,"","","","Bem, é óbvio... Esses aparelhos usavam satélites para determinar suas coordenadas, e não sei dizer o que exatamente aconteceu com cada satélite. Alguns dever ter permanecido em sua órbita. Outros certamente despencaram. O fato é que agora nenhum deles está enviando ondas de rádio, e toda a rede de GPS está desativada por muitos anos. Eu sabia disso desde o começo e nunca pensei no GPS como uma opção plausível, mas estudá-lo me permitiu entender um pouco mais a respeito de geolocalização, e eu espero que combinando o princípio do GPS com outros métodos, eu finalmente possa desenvolver um sistema que realmente funcionasse em nossas condições atuais.","Naja, das ist offensichtlich... Die Geräte haben Satelliten genutzt um die Koordinaten zu bestimmen und ich kann dir nicht sagen, was mit alldiesen Satelliten passiert ist. Vielleicht sind noch ein paar von ihnen in der Erdumlaufbahn. Viele sind sicher wieder auf die Erde heruntergefallen. Tatsache ist aber, dass keiner von ihnen noch Funksignale sendet und das gesamte GPS-Netzwerk ist seit Jahren außer Betrieb. Davon wusste ich schon ziemlich lange und ich habe das GPS-System nie als Möglichkeit gesehen. Jedoch hat mir die Analyse der Geräte ein besseres Verständnis darüber gegeben, wie die Standortbestimmung funktioniert. Meine Hoffnung besteht darin, dass ich die Prinzipen von GPS und anderen Methoden nutzen kann, um eine System zu entwickeln, dass bei unseren derzeitigen Bedingungen funktioniert."
         ,"","Păi, e evident ... Aceste dispozitive foloseau sateliți pentru a-ți determina coordonatele, iar eu nu pot să-ți spun ce s-a întâmplat cu fiecare dintre sateliții. Unii dintre ei s-ar putea să fii rămas pe orbită. Alții cu siguranță au căzut pe pământ. Adevărul este că nici unul nu mai transmite semnale radio, iar întreaga rețea GPS n-a mai funcționat de mulți ani. Știam despre asta de la bun început și nu m-am gândit la GPS ca la o opțiune posibilă, dar studiind, mi-a permis să înțeleg geolocalizarea un pic mai bine, și sper că prin combinarea principiilor GPS cu alte metode, aș putea dezvolta în cele din urmă un sistem care va funcționa în condițiile noastre actuale.","Cóż, to oczywiste... Te urządzenie używały satelity do określenia swoich pozycji, a ja nie potrafię stwierdzić, co się stało z każdym z satelitów. Część z nich mogła pozostać na swojej orbicie. Inne z pewnością spadły na ziemię. Faktem jest, że żaden z nich nie wysyła już żadnych radiowych sygnałów, a cała sieć GPS leży od wielu lat. Wiedziałem o tym od początku i nigdy nie myślałem o GPS jako o możliwym rozwiązaniu, ale studiowanie tego, pozwoliło mi na nieco lepsze zrozumienie geo lokalizacji, a dzięki temu, mam nadzieje, że łącząc reguły GPS z innymi metodami, może wreszcie skonstruuje system, który faktycznie będzie działał w naszych obecnych warunkach."
         ,"Belli... Bu cihazlar koordinatları belirlemek için uyduları kullanıyorlardı ve o uyduların herbirine kesin olarak ne olduğunu söyleyemem. Bazıları yörüngelerinde kalmış olabilir. Bazıları kesinlikle yeryüzüne düştüler. Kesin olan ise hiçbirinin artık radyo sinyalleri göndermediği ve tüm GPS ağının uzun yıllardır çöktüğüdür. En başından beri biliyordum ve hiçbir zaman GPS in uygun bir seçenek olduğunu düşünmedim. Ancak onu çalışmak coğrafi konumu daha iyi anlamama yardımcı oldu. Ve umarım ki GPS ilkelerini diğer metodlarla birleştirerek var olan koşullarımızda gerçekten çalışabilecek bir sistem geliştirebilirim.","Wel, dat is duidelijk... Die apparaten gebruikten satelieten om je coördinaten te bepalen en ik kan je niet precies vertellen wat er met al die satelieten gebeurd is. Sommigen zijn misschien in in hun baan gebleven. Anderen zijn zeker op de grond gevallen. Feit is dat geen van hen meer radiosignalen uitzend en het hele gps-netwerk is al jaren buiten gebruik. Ik wist er vanaf het begin van en ik heb nooit aan GPS gedacht als een mogelijke oplossing, maar door het bestuderen kon ik geolocatie een beetje beter begrijpen en ik hoop dat ik met het combineren van de principes van GPS met andere methoden, eindelijk een systeem kan ontwikkelen dat echt zou werken onder onze huidige omstandigheden."
         ,"","Mmm, ia agak jelas... Alat-alat ini menggunakan satelit-satelit untuk mengukur koordinat kamu, dan saya tak dapat beritahu kamu apa yang telah berlaku kepada satelit-satelit tersebut. Ada yang mungkin telah kekal di orbit mereka. Yang lain pasti telah jatuh ke tanah. Faktanya adalah mereka sekarang sudah henti memancarkan isyarat radio, dan seluruh rangkaian GPS sudah tak berfungsi untuk bertahun-tahun. Saya sudah tahu tentangnya sejak permulaan dan saya tak anggap GPS sebagai opsyen yang boleh dipakai, tapi dengan belajarnya saya dapat memahami geolokasi dengan lebih baik, dan saya berharap bahawa dengan menggabungkan prinsip-prinsip GPS dengan kaedah-kaedah yang lain, saya mungkin akhirnya dapat membangunkan sistem yang boleh berfungsi dalam keadaan dunia kita sekarang.","","","","這個嘛，顯然地... 這些裝置是透過衛星來決定你的座標，但是我分辨那些衛星準確的狀態。有些可能還在軌道上，其他可能墜毀了。實際上已經不發出電波了。整個 GPS 網絡已經有好幾年失效了。我一開始就知道這個情形，也從未把 GPS 當作有效的方案，但是研究它讓我更了解定位的原理，我希望能把這個原理整合到另一個方案，我想開發一種在我們現況也運作正常的系統。","","Λοιπόν είναι προφανές... Αυτές οι συσκευές χρησιμοποιούσαν δορυφόρους για να καθορίσουν τις συντεταγμένες σου και δεν μπορώ να σου πω τι συνέβη σε κάθε έναν από τους δορυφόρους. Κάποιοι μπορεί να έχουν παραμείνει στις τροχιές τους. Άλλοι προφανώς έπεσαν στο έδαφος. Το θέμα είναι ότι κανείς απ΄ αυτούς δε στέλνει σήματα πλέον και το συνολικό σύστημα GPS είναι χαλασμένο για χρόνια. Το γνώριζα από την αρχή και ποτέ δεν πίστεψα ότι το GPS θα ήταν μία πιθανή επιλογή, όμως μελετώντας το κατάλαβα κάπως καλύτερα το Γεωεντοπισμό και ελπίζω συνδιαζοντας τις αρχές του GPS με άλλες μεθόδους ίσως τελικά δημιούργησα ένα σύστημα που πραγματικά λειτουργεί στις τρέχουσες συνθήκες."
         ,"","","","","","","Eh, halata naman... Ang mga kagamitang ito ay gumagamit ng satellites upang matukoy ang iyong lokasyon, at hindi ako sigurado kung ano ang nangyari sa mga satellites. Siguro ang iba ay nasa orbit pa. Ang iba naman ay siguradong bumagsak dito sa lupa. Ang totoo ay wala na sa kanila ang nakakapagdala ng radio signals. Ang buong network ng GPS ay maraming taon nang di gumagana. Nalaman ko ito simula pa noong una at hindi ko naisip na isa sa posibleng opsyon ang GPS, pero ang pag-aaral nito ay nagpaintindi sa akin ng mas maigi sa geolocation, at sana ay ang pagsasama ng prinsipyo ng GPS at iba pang mga pamamaraan, ay maitulot namakagawa ako ng sistema na maaring gumana sa panahon ngayon.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5689":["","What other methods are there?","","¿Y cuáles son esos otros métodos?","","Quelles autres méthodes il y a?","","Que outros métodos são esses?","Was gibt es noch für Möglichkeiten?","","Ce alte metode există?","Jakie są inne metody?","Var olan diğer metodlar neler?","Welke andere methoden zijn er?","","Apakah kaedah-kaedah yang lain?","","","","你說的另一個方案是甚麼？","","Ποιές άλλες μέθοδοι υπάρχουν;","","","","","","","Ano pa ba ang iba pang mga pamamaraan?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5690":["","There are several ones. The one that looked most appealing to me due to its apparent simplicity was based on the anomalies of the planet\'s magnetic field. You probably know that our planet has a magnetic field. Right?","","Pues hay varios. Al principio los que me parecieron más adecuados, debido a su simplicidad, fueron los que se basaban en las variaciones que se producen en el campo magnético de la Tierra... Supongo que sabes que nuestro planeta tiene un campo magnético, ¿no?","","","","Existem vários. O que pareceu mais chamativo para mim dada sua aparente simplicidade se baseava em anomalias no campo magnético do planeta. Você provavelmente sabe que nossa planeta tem um campo magnético. Certo?","Da gibt es einige. Das was mir aufgrund seine Einfachheit am geeignetsten erscheint, basiert auf den Anomalien im Magnetfeld unseres Planeten. Vermutlich weißt Du, dass unser Planet ein Magnetfeld hat. Oder?","","Există mai multe. Cea mai atrăgătoare pentru mine, datorită simplității sale aparente se bazează pe anomaliile din câmpul magnetic al planetei. Probabil că știi deja, planeta noastră are un câmp magnetic, corect?"
         ,"Jest ich kilka. Ta, która wyglądała najbardziej dla mnie pociągająco z powodu jej jawnej prostoty, była oparta na anomaliach pola magnetycznego planety. Zapewne wiesz, że nasza planeta ma pole magnetyczne. Prawda?","Bir kaç tane var. Bana basitliği yönünden daha çekici gelen dünyanın manyetik alanındaki anormalliklere dayanan oldu. Gezegenimizin bir manyetik alanı olduğunu biliyorsundur herhalde. Değil mi?","Er zijn er verschillende. Degene die me het meest aantrekkelijk leek door zijn schijnbare eenvoud was gebaseerd op afwijkingen op het magnetische veld van de planeet. Je weet waarschijnlijk dat onze planeet een magnetisch veld heeft, toch?","","Terdapat beberapa. Kaedah yang paling menarik perhatian saya disebabkan keringkasannya adalah berasaskan anomali medan magnetik dunia. Kamu pasti tahu bahawa dunia kita mempunyai sebuah medan magnetik kan?","","","","有幾種方法。其中一種我特別有興趣，因為很簡單是基於這星球反常的磁力場。你可能知道我們星球是有磁力場的，對吧？","","Υπάρχουν αρκετές. Αυτή που μου φάνηκε πιο ελκυστική λόγω της προφανούς απλότητάς της βασίζεται στις ανωμαλίες του μαγνητικού πεδίο του πλανήτη. Προφανώς γνωρίζεις ότι ο πλανήτης μας έχει μαγνητικό πεδίο. Σωστά;"
         ,"","","","","","","May mga iilang pamamaraan. Ang isang mas kaaya-aya para salin dahil sa kasimplihan nito ay base sa hindi pangkaraniwang magnetic field ng planeta. Alam no na sigurong ang planeta natin ay may magnetic field, diba?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5691":["","Mhm.","","Hmmm...","","","","","Hhmm.","","","","","Hmm.","","Mhm.","","","","恩恩。","","Χμ","","","","","","","Oo naman.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5692":["","So, this magnetic field turns out to be somewhat uneven. Its variations create a pattern that can be used to determine your approximate coordinates. The beauty of this method is that it does not require any external devices. It just needs an electronic compass and some software. The problem, however, is that before it can be used, we would need to scan and store the magnetic map of the region where the device is meant to work. It\'s not a big deal if the region is small, but the purpose of this device is to help with long distance navigation, and creating large magnetic maps is very difficult because, first of all one needs to visit every physical location of the region to scan it and second, such map would require a lot of storage space, which could be a problem too, especially if we want to manufacture these devices ourselves, without using old world components.","","Pues bien, este campo magnético no es uniforme, tiene variaciones. Estas variaciones forman un patrón que puede usarse para determinar de forma aproximada las coordenadas de tu posición. Lo mejor de este sistema es que no necesita de otros dispositivos externos. Sólo se necesita una brújula electrónica y un sencillo software. El problema es que para poder usarlo se tiene que elaborar y registrar un mapa magnético de la región en la que uno quiera usar el dispositivo. Elaborarlo este mapa no resulta complicado en el caso de una región relativamente pequeña. Lo que pasa es que mi intención es usar estos dispositivos para la navegación de larga distancia, y elaborar un mapa magnético de ese tamaño resultaría muy complicado ya que, en primer lugar, uno tendría que desplazarse físicamente por toda la región para elaborarlo y, en segundo lugar, un mapa de ese tamaño necesitaría de mucho espacio de memoria, lo que supone un problema añadido si lo que queremos es fabricar esos dispositivos partiendo de cero, sin tener que usar tecnología de la civilización antigua."
         ,"","","","Então, esse campo magnético é um pouco desigual. Suas variações criam um padrão que pode ser usado para determinar suas coordenadas aproximadas. A beleza deste método é que ele não requer o uso de nenhum outro dispositivo externo. Ele só precisa de uma bússola eletrônica e um software. O problema, entretanto, é que antes que possa ser usado, nós precisaríamos examinar e armazenar o mapa magnético da região onde o aparelho deve funcionar. Isso não é grande coisa se a região for pequena, mas o propósito desse aparelho é ajudar na navegação em longas distancias, e criar um mapa magnético grande é muito difícil pois, primeiramente seria necessário visitar todas as localizações físicas da região para examinar o campo e segundo, tal mapa iria requirir muito espaço de armazenamento, o que também pode ser um problema, especialmente se quisermos manufaturar esses dispositivos nós mesmos, sem usar os componentes do mundo antigo.","Also, das Magnetfeld scheint etwas ungleichmäßig zu sein. Die Abweichungen erzeigen ein Muster mit dem man seine ungefähren Koordinaten bestimmen kann. Das schöne an dieser Methode ist, dass keine Externen geräte benötigt werden. Man braucht nur einen elektronischen Kompass und ein bisschen Software. Das Problem ist allerdings, man muss bevor man es nutzen kann, die für das Gerät bestimmte Region abgescannen und in eine magnetische Karte eintragen. Das ist keine große Sache, wenn die Region klein ist. Aber das Gerät soll bei einer Navigation über eine große Strecke helfen. Und das Erstellen von großen Karten ist äußerst schwierig, weil man zum Abscannen des Magnetfeldes jede einzelne Position physikalisch aufsuchen muss. Das nächste Problem ist, dass eine so große Karte einen rießigen Datenspeicher benötigt, denn wir mit unseren Möglichkeiten nicht herstellen können."
         ,"","Deci, acest câmp magnetic se dovedește a fi oarecum neuniform. Variațiile sale creează un model care poate fi utilizat pentru a determina coordonatele aproximative. Frumusețea acestei metode este că nu necesită dispozitivele externe. Este doar nevoie de o busolă electronică și un software. Problema, însă, este faptul că înainte de a putea fi utilizată, trebuie să scanăm și să stocăm harta magnetică a regiunii în care dispozitivul este destinat să lucreze. Nu e mare lucru dacă regiunea este mică, dar scopul acestui dispozitiv este de ne ajuta cu navigarea pe distanțe lungi, iar crearea de hărți magnetice mari este foarte dificilă, deoarece, în primul rând, este nevoie de a vizita fiecare locație fizică a regiunii pentru a o scana și în al doilea rând, o astfel de hartă ar necesita o mulțime de spațiu de stocare, care ar putea fi o problemă, mai ales dacă vrem să fabricăm aceste dispozitive noi înșine, fără a utiliza componente din Lumea Veche.","Więc, to magnetyczne pole okazało się jakieś nierówne. Jego wariacje tworzą wzór, który może zostać użyte do określenia twoich przybliżonych koordynatów. Pięknem tej metody, jest to, że nie potrzeba zewnętrznych urządzeń. Zwyczajnie potrzebuję ona elektroniczny kompas i trochę oprogramowania. Problemem, jednakże, jest to, iż zanim może zostać użyta, potrzebowalibyśmy zeskanować i zachomikować magnetyczną mapę regionu w którym urządzenie ma działać. To nie jest wielki problem, jeśli region jest mały, ale celem tego urządzenia jest pomóc w długo dystansowej nawigacji, a tworzenie wielkich magnetycznych map jest bardzo trudne, ponieważ po pierwsze, jednostka musi odwiedzić wszystkie fizyczne lokalizacje regionu, aby je zeskanować, a po drugie, taka mapa wymagałaby mnóstwo miejsca na dysku, co również mogłoby być problemem, szczególnie jeśli chcemy wytwarzać te urządzenia sami, bez używania komponentów ze starego świata."
         ,"Bu manyetik alan görece pürüzlü çıktı. Varyasyonlarının oluşturduğu şablon ile yaklaşık koordinatlar belirlenebilir. Bu metodun güzelliği hiç dış aletlere ihtiyaç duymaması. Tek ihtiyacı elektronik bir pusula ve yazılım. Problem ise ne yazık ki kullanmadan önce aletin kullanılacağı bölgenin manyetik haritalarını çıkarmak. Alan küçükse çok büyük bir sorun değil, ancak bu aletin amacı uzun yolculuklarda yön bulmaya yardımcı olmak. Büyük manyetik haritaların oluşturulması çok zor, çünkü; öncelikle her bir mekanın ziyaret edilip taranması gerekmekte. Böyle bir harita çok fazla depolama kapasitesi gerektirecek, ki bu da bir problem olabilir hele ki bu cihazları biz, eski dünya parçaları kullanmadan kendimiz üreteceksek.","Dus, dit magnetisch veld blijkt een beetje onregelmatig te zijn. De variaties creëren een patroon dat gebruikt kan worden om je benaderde coördinaten te bepalen. De schoonheid van deze methode is dat het geen externe apparaten nodig heeft. Het heeft alleen een electronisch kompas nodig en wat software. Het probleem echter, is dat voordat het gebruikt kan worden, we eerst de magnetische kaart van de regio waar het apparaat gebruikt zou moeten worden, moeten scannen en opslaan. Het is geen probleem als de regio klein is, maar het doel van dit apparaat is lange-afstandnavigatie, en het creëren van grote magnetische kaarten is heel moeilijk want, ten eerst moet iemand alle fysieke locaties van de regio bezoeken om te scannen en ten tweede zou zo´n kaart een hoop opslag nodig hebben, wat ook een probleem zou kunnen zijn, helemaal als we die apparaten zelf willen fabriceren, zonder het gebruik van componente uit de oude wereld."
         ,"","Jadi, medan magnetik ini adalah agak tidak sekata. Variasinya menghasilkan sebuah corak yang boleh diguna untuk menganggarkan koordinate kamu. Keindahan kaedah ini adalah bahawa ia tidak memerlukan apa-apa alat tambahan. Ia hanya perlu kompas elektronik dan sebuah software. Walaubagaimanapun, masalahnya adalah sebelum ia boleh diguna, kita perlu mengimbas dan menyimpan peta magnetik kawasan di mana alat tersebut akan diguna. Ia bukan masalah yang besar kalau kawasan itu adalah kecil, tapi tujuan alat ini adalah untuk membantu navigasi jarak jauh, dan penghasilan peta-peta magnetik yang besar adalah sangat sukar kerana pertama sekali, seseorang akan perlu melawat ke semua lokasi fizikal kawasan tersebut untuk mengimbas dan kedua, peta tersebut memerlukan ruang storan yang besar, yang juga adalah masalah, terutamanya kalau kita sendiri nak menghasilkan alat-alat tersebut, tanpa mengguna komponen-komponen dunia dulu.","","","","然後呢，這個磁力場是不均勻的。磁力場的變化性形成一種可以用來決定精確座標的方法。最棒的地方是，他不用額外的裝置。就只需要一個電子羅盤然後再加一點軟體。問題在於，在到達可以用的階段之前，我們必須掃描並儲存這個區域的磁力場地圖。如果這區域很小，那就小事一樁。但是這個裝置的用途是為了長距離旅行，所以記錄一個大型的磁力場地圖變成一個極度困難的工作。首先必須有人透過造訪每一個區域的每個據點紀錄地圖，然後第二，儲存這樣的地圖需要大量的空間。特別是我們打算不依賴舊時代科技的情形下做到這件事情。"
         ,"","Έτσι το μαγνητικό πεδίο δείχνει να είναι κάπως άνισο. Οι αυξομειώσεις του δημιουργούν ένα πλέγμα το οποίο μπορεί να χρησιμοποιηθεί για να καθορίσει τις ακριβείς συντεταγμένες σου. Το καλό αυτής της μεθόδου είναι ότι δε χρειάζεται καμία εξωτερική συσκευή. Θέλει μόνο μία πυξίδα και λογισμικό. Όμως το πρόβλημα είναι ότι, πριν χρησιμοποιηθεί, χρειάζεται να ερευνήσουμε και να αποθηκεύσουμε το μαγνητικό χάρτη της περιοχής που η συσκευή πρόκειται να λειτουργήσει. Δεν είναι δύσκολο αν η περιοχή είναι μικρή αλλά σκοπός της συσκευής είναι να βοηθήσει την πλοήγηση μεγάλων αποστάσεων, δημιουργώντας μεγάλους μαγνητικούς χάρτες είναι δύσκολο γιατί πρέπει πρώτα απ\'  όλα να επισκευτείς κάθε προορισμό προκειμένου να ερευνηθεί και δεύτερον, τέτοιος χάρτης θα χρειαζόταν μεγάλο αποθηκευτικό χώρο κάτι που θα μπορούσε να είναι επίσης πρόβλημα, κυρίως αν θέλουμε να φτιάξουμε τις συσκευές μόνοι μας χωρίς τη χρήση εξαρτημάτων που προέρχονται από τον παλιό κόσμο.","","","","","","","Ayun nga, ang magnetic field na ito ay medyo gansal . Ang pagkakaibang ito ay gumagawa ng pattern na maaaring gamitin upang matukoy ang iyong lokasyon. Ang kagandahan ng pamamaraang ito ay hindi na ito nangangailangan pa ng ibang kagamitan. Kailangan lamang nito ng electronic na bruhula o compass. Ang problema nga lang, bago pa ito magamit, kinakailangan pa nating suriin at makuha ang magnetikong mapa ng rehiyon kung saan pagaganahin ang kagamitan. Hindi problema kung maliit lang ang rehiyon, pero ang layunin ng compess ay makatulong sa malayuang nabigasyon, at ang paggawa ng malaking  magnetic map ay napakahirap, dahil una sa lahat kailangan ng isang taong puntahan ang bawat lokasyon sa mapa upang masuri ito at pangalawa, nangangailangan iyon ng malaking pagtataguan, na isa ring problema, lalo na kung nais nating yumari ng kagamitang ito ng tayo lang, nang hindi gumagamit ng lumang kagamitan dito sa mundo."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5693":["","OK.","","Ya veo.","","","","","Ok.","","","Okej.","Peki.","","","OK.","","","","好。","","ΟΚ","","","","","","","Sige.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5694":["","That\'s why I discarded this method too and went back to more primitive, pre-GPS methods that are based on communication with several fixed antennas.","","Por eso tuve que descartar este sistema y volver a sistemas más primitivos, anteriores al GPS y que se basan en la comunicación con una serie de antenas fijas.","","","","Por isso descartei esse método também e voltei a algo mais primitivo, métodos pré-GPS que se baseiam na comunicação com várias antenas fixas.","Das ist der Grund, warum ich auch diese Methode verworfen habe und zu einer noch primitiveren \"vor-GPS\"-Methode gegangen bin, die auf der Kommunikation zwischen einigen festinstallierten Antennen beruht.","","De aceea am eliminat această metodă și m-am întors la metode mai primitive, anterioare GPS-ului, care se bazează pe comunicarea cu mai multe antene fixe.","Dlatego porzuciłem również tą metodą i wróciłem do bardziej prymitywnych, przed GPS metod, które oparte są na komunikacji za pomocą kilku przytwierdzonych anten."
         ,"Bu yüzdendir ki bu metodu da bir kenara brakıp daha ilkele, birkaç sabit anten ile iletişime dayalı GPS öncesi metodlarına geri dönüş yaptım.","Dat is waarom ik deze methode ook uitgesloten heb en terug ben gegaan naar meer primitieve, methoden van voor GPS die gebaseerd zijn op communicatie met verschillende vaste antennes.","","Ini sebab saya telah henti mengguna kaedah ini dan kembali kepada kaedah yang lebih lama, kaedah-kaedah pra-GPS yang berasaskan komunikasi dengan beberapa antena yang tetap.","","","","這就是為甚麼我捨棄的這個方法，走回原本的老路，就是 GPS，它是基於定點的無線電波發送來溝通的。","","Γιαυτό εγκατέλειψα και αυτή τη μέθοδο και γύρισα σε πιο πρωτόγονες προ-GPS μεθόδους που βασίζονται σε αρκετές σταθερές κεραίες.","","","","","","","Kaya nga isinantabi ko na ang pamamaraang ito at bumalik sa mas makaluma, luma pa sa GPS, na pamamaraan na base sa komunikasyon ng ilang pirmihang mga antenna.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5695":["","And how is it going?","","¿Y cómo te va con este nuevo sistema?","","Et comment ça se passe?","","E como está indo?","Und wie kommst du voran?","","Și cum merge?","I jak to idzie?","Ve, nasıl gidiyor peki?","En hoe gaat het?","","Dan bagaimana perkembangan kamu?","","","","進展如何了？","","Και πως πάει;","","","","","","","At kamusta naman iyon?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5696":["","It generally works, but I\'m testing several different approaches to find out which of them would be more practical. I\'m quite sure that in a couple of months I\'ll have a working prototype.","","En general se puede decir que funciona bastante bien, pero estoy probando diferentes enfoques para ver cuál de ellos resulta más práctico. Calculo que en un par de meses o así ya podré estar trabajando en un primer prototipo.","","","","Geralmente funciona, mas estou testando várias abordagens diferentes para descobrir qual delas seria mais prática. Estou certo que em uns meses terei um protótipo funcional.","Im Groben funktioniert es schon, aber derzeit teste ich noch ein paar andere Ansätze, die vielleicht besser umzusätzen sind. Ich bin mir relativ sicher, dass in einigen Monaten einen funktionierenden Prototyp habe.","","În general, funcționează, dar testez mai multe abordări, pentru a afla care dintre ele ar fi mai practică. Sunt destul de sigur că în câteva luni, voi avea un prototip funcțional."
         ,"Generalnie to działa, ale testuje kilka różnych podejść, aby odkryć, które z nich byłoby bardziej praktyczne. Jestem dość pewny, że za parę miesięcy będę miał działający prototyp.","Genel olarak çalışıyor ama hangisinin daha kullanışlı olacağı ile ilgili farklı yaklaşımları test ediyorum. Bir kaç ay içerisinde elimde çalışan bir prototip olacağı konusunda az çok eminim.","Normaal werkt het, maar ik ben verschillende methoden aan het testen om uit te zoeken welke het meest practisch zou zijn. Ik ben er vrij zeker van dat ik binnen een paar maanden een werkend proto-type heb.","","Ia secara umumnya berfungsi, tapi saya sedang cuba beberapa kaedah yang berlainan untuk mencari yang paling praktikal antara mereka. Saya sangat pasti bahawa dalam beberapa bulan saya akan mempunyai prototaip yang berfungsi.","","","","就快好了，但是我正在實驗幾種不同的方法來找到哪一種是比較可行的。我確信在幾個月內我就可以建造出一個可用的原型。","","Γενικά δουλεύει, αλλά δοκιμάζω διάφορες προσεγγίσεις για να βρω ποιες θα μπορούσαν να είναι πιο πρακτικές. Είμαι σίγουρος ότι σε κανα δυό μήνες θα έχω ένα λειτουργικό πρωτότυπο."
         ,"","","","","","","Gumagana naman siya, pero sinusubukan ko ang iba\'t ibang paraan upang matukoy ko ang alin ang mas praktikal. May kasiguraduhan ako na sa ilang mga buwan ay makakagawa ako ng prototype na gumagana.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5697":["","Sounds great... but tell me one thing: Have you ever heard about a device called sextant? They told me that it can determine your coordinates too.","","Vaya, suena muy bien... Por cierto, ¿has oído hablar de un instrumento llamado sextante? Por lo que tengo entendido también sirve para calcular tus coordenadas.","","","","Parece ótimo... mas me diga mais uma coisa: Você alguma vez já ouviu falar de um aparato chamado sextante? Me disseram que ele também pode determinar suas coordenadas.","Klingt super ... aber sag mal: hast du jemals von einem Instrument namens Sextant gehört? Sie sagten mir man könne damit auch Koordinaten bestimmen.","","Sună grozav ... dar spune-mi, ai auzit vreodată de un dispozitiv numit sextant? Mi s-a spus că acesta îți poate determina coordonatele, de asemenea.","Brzmi świetnie... ale powiedz mi jedno: Czy słyszałeś kiedykolwiek o urządzeniu zwanym sekstant? Powiedziano mi, że również potrafi to określić twoje koordynaty.","Kulağa harika geliyor... Bir şey daha: Hiç sekstant isimli bir alet duydun mu? Bana, koordinatlarını belirleyebileceği söylendi."
         ,"Klinkt geweldig... Maar vertel eens: heb je ooit gehoord over een apparaat genaamd sextant? Ze hebben me verteld dat dat ook je coördinaten kan bepalen.","","Dengar macam hebat... tapi beritahu saya satu perkara: Pernahkah kamu dengar tentang sebuah alat yang dipanggil sextant? Saya diberitahu bahawa ia boleh mengukur koordinat kamu juga.","","","","聽起來不錯... 但是告訴我：你是否曾經聽過一個裝置叫做六分儀？人家說那也可以用來決定座標。","","Ακούγεται περίφημο... Αλλά πες μου κάτι ακόμη. Έχεις ακούσει ποτέ μία συσκευή που λέγεται εξάντας; Μου έχουν πει ότι μπορεί να καθορίσει τις συντεταγμένες σου επίσης.","","","","","","","Mukhang ayos yan... pero sabihin mo sa akin: narinig mo na ba ang kagamitang tinatawag na sextant? Sabi nila sa akin ay nakatutukoy rin iyo ng lokasyon.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5698":["","Have you ever heard about a thing called sextant? I\'ve been told that it does the same thing you are trying to achieve here.","","¿Has oído hablar sobre un instrumento llamado sextante? Me han dicho que con él puedes hacer lo mismo que lo que tú estás intentando hacer aquí.","","","","Você já ouviu falar sobre uma coisa chamada sextante? Me disseram que ele faz a mesma coisa que você está tentando alcançar aqui.","Hast Du schon mal von einen Ding names Sextant gehört? Man hat mir erzählt, es würde genau das machen, was Du versuchst zu erreichen.","","Ai auzit vreodată de un lucru numit sextant? Mi s-a spus că face același lucru pe care încerci să-l faci aici.","Czy słyszałeś kiedykolwiek o rzeczy zwanej sekstant? Powiedziano mi, że robi to samo, co próbujesz tutaj osiągnąć.","Hiç sekstant isimli bir şey duydun mu? Bana, burda başarmaya çalıştığın şeyi yapabildiği söylendi.","Heb je ooit gehoord over een ding genaamd sextant? Mij is verteld dat dat hetzelfde doet als jij hier probeert te bereiken."
         ,"","Pernahkah kamu dengar tentang sebuah alat yang dipanggil sextant? Saya telah diberitahu bahawa fungsinya adalah sama dengan apa yang kamu sedang cuba mencapai.","","","","你是否聽過一個東西叫做六分儀？有人曾告訴我那剛好可以做到你正在做到的事情。","","Έχεις ακούσει ποτέ σχετικά με μία συσκευή που λέγεται εξάντας; Μου έχουν πει ότι κάνει το ίδιο πράγμα μ\'  αυτό που προσπαθείς να πετύχεις εδώ.","","","","","","","Narinig mo na ba ang gamit na tinatawag na sextant? May mga nagsabi sa akin na parehas raw ito ng gusto mong magawa rito.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5699":["","What about a sextant? Is it true that it can tell you your location too?","","¿Y por qué no utilizar un sextante? Usándolo también se puede determinar tu posición, ¿o no?","","","","E um sextante? É verdade que ele pode dizer sua localização também?","Was ist mit einem Sextant? Stimmt es, dass ich auch damit die Position herausfinden kann?","","Dar un sextant? Este adevărat că-ți poate determina locația, de asemenea?","A co z sekstantem? Czy to prawda, że również on może stwierdzić, gdzie jest twoja lokalizacja?","Peki ya sekstant? Onun da, konumunu gösterebildiği doğru mu?","En een sextant? Is het waar dat dat ook je locatie kan vertellen?","","Bagaimana pula dengan sebuah sextant? Adakah ia benar bahawa ia boleh beritahu kamu lokasi kamu juga?","","","","六分儀如何？那應該也可以定位座標對吧？","","Τι λες για τον εξάντα; Είναι αλήθεια ότι μπορεί να βρεις το στίγμα σου με αυτόν;","","","","","","","Eh ang sextant? Totoo bang nakakapagtukoy rin ito ng iyong lokasyon?","","","","","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","","",""],
         "5700":["","Have you ever heard about a device called sextant? According to what I\'ve heard it can solve your problem without a need of any electronics.","","¿Y no has oído hablar de un instrumento llamado sextante? Según lo que me han contado, podría resolver el asunto de la navegación sin necesidad de usar la electrónica.","","","","Já ouviu falar sobre um dispositivo chamado sextante? De acordo com o que ouvi isso pode resolver seu problema sem o uso de qualquer dispositivo eletrônico.","Hast Du schon mal von einem Gerät mit dem Namen Sextant gehört? Nachdem was ich davon gehört habe, kann es Deine Probleme lösen, ohne das Du irgendwelche Elektronik brauchst.","","Ai auzit vreodată despre un dispozitiv numit sextant? După câte am auzit, poate rezolva problema fără a folosi electronice.","Czy słyszałeś kiedykolwiek o urządzeniu zwanym sekstant? Wedle tego co <usłyszałem/usłyszałam>, może on rozwiązać twój problem bez potrzeby jakichkolwiek elektronik.","Hiç, Sekstant adlı bir alet duydun mu? Duyduğuma göre elektrik ihtiyacı olmadan problemini çözebilirmiş."
         ,"Heb je ooit gehoord van een apparaat genaamd sextant? Volgens wat ik gehoord heb, kan het je probleem oplossen zonder de noodzaak van electronica.","","Adakah kamu pernah dengar tentang sebuah alat yang dipanggil sextant? Mengikut apa yang saya telah dengar, ia boleh menyelesaikan masalah kamu tanpa alat-alat elektronik.","","","","你是否聽過一個叫六分儀的裝置嗎？根據我所知道的，那可以不用任何電子儀器就解決你的問題。","","Έχεις ποτέ ακούσει σχετικά με μία συσκευή που αποκαλείται εξάντας; Σύμφωνα με ότι έχω ακούσει αυτός μπορεί να λύσει το πρόβλημά σου χωρίς τη βοήθεια ηλεκτρονικών.","","","","","","","Narinig mo naba ang gamit na sextant? Ayon sa aking mga narinig ay masusulusyunan nito ang iyong problema nang hindi gumagamit ng electronics.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5701":["","Sextant! Ha ha! Actually, I have it, and I use it quite often in my experiments, but it\'s not very practical for traveling. First of all, using the solar tables only, you basically can\'t measure your location more often than once a day. Second, it\'s somewhat hard to operate and it can be quite inexact until you get really proficient with it, but as for now, it seems to be the only working navigation device left in this world.","","¡Un sextante! ¡Ja, ja! De hecho, tengo uno. Lo fabriqué yo mismo. Y lo uso a menudo en mis experimentos. Pero sinceramente, no es muy práctico que digamos mientras estás viajando. Primero, porque al usar las tablas solares sólo se puede realizar una medición al día. Y segundo, porque es difícil de manejar y los cálculos pueden ser bastante imprecisos hasta que aprendes bien cómo funciona. Eso sí, me temo que es el único instrumento de navegación al que podemos tener acceso en la actualidad.","","","","Um sextante?! Ha, ha! Atualmente, eu tenho um, e o uso muito em meus experimentos, porem não é muito pratico para viajar. Primeiro de tudo, usa somente tabelas solares, você basicamente não pode medir sua localização mais que uma vez por dia. Segundo, ele é muito difícil de operar e pode não te dar a coordenada exata até você não aprender a opera-lo, mas por enquanto, é o único meio de navegação que temos neste mundo."
         ,"Ein Sextant! Ha ha! In der Tat habe ich einen und ich nutze ihn oft für meine Experimente, aber er ist für das Reisen nicht sehr praktisch. In erster Linie kannst Du nicht mehr als einmal am Tag deine Position bestimmen, wenn Du nur die Sonnentabellen nutzt. Als Zweites ist er sehr schwer zu bedienen und ist noch sehr ungenau bis du große Erfahrung damit hast. Aber für den Moment scheint es das einzige noch funktionierende Navigationsgerät auf dieser Welt zusein.","","Sextant! Ha, ha! De fapt, îl am, și-l folosesc destul de des în experimentele mele, dar nu este foarte practic pentru călătorit. Mai întâi de toate, folosind doar tabelele solare, nu-ți poți măsura locația, mai des decât o dată pe zi. În al doilea rând, este oarecum greu de folosit și poate fi destul de inexact până când devii cu adevărat competenț, dar deocamdată, se pare că e singurul aparat de navigare funcțional, din această lume.","Sekstant! Ha ha! Faktycznie, mam go i używam dość często w moich eksperymentach, ale nie jest on bardzo praktyczny dla podróżowania. Po pierwsze, używając wyłącznie tabel solarnych, zasadniczo nie możesz określić swojej lokalizacji częściej niż raz dziennie. Po drugie, jest on dość trudny w operowaniu i może być dość niedokładny, dopóki nie staniesz się bardzo umiejętny w tym zakresie, ale z tego co wiem, wydaje się być jedynym, działającym, nawigacyjnym urządzeniem na tym świecie."
         ,"Sekstant! Ha ha! Aslında, Bende var ve deneylerimde sıkça kullanıyorum ancak seyahat için pek de kullanışlı değil. Öncelikle, sadece güneş tablolarını kullanarak konumunu gün içerisinde birden fazla kez ölçemezsin. İkincisi, kullanımı görece olarak zor ve aşina olmadan kesinliği fazla olmayabilir, ancak şimdi, görünen o ki dünyada kalan çalışan tek yön bulma aracı.","Sextant! Ha ha! In feite heb ik er één, en ik gebruik hem vrij vaak in mijn experimenten, maar het is niet erg practisch om te reizen. Ten eerste, het gebruik van de zonnetabellen alleen, je kunt in principe niet vaker dan één keer per dag je locatie bepalen. Ten tweede is het vrij moeilijk om te bedienen en het kan vrij onnauwkeurig zijn totdat je er erg behendig mee wordt, maar voor nu lijkt het enige werkende navigatiesysteem in de wereld.","","Sextant! Ha ha! Sebenarnya, saya mempunyainya, dan saya juga selalu menggunakannya dalam eksperimen-eksperimen saya, tapi ia tidak berapa praktikal untuk pengembaraan. Pertama sekali, kalau guna jadual-jadual solar sahaja, kamu pada dasarnya tidak boleh mengukur lokasi kamu lebih daripada sekali sehari. Kedua, ia adalah agak sukar untuk diguna dan kalau kamu tidak mahir menggunakannya ia adalah tidak tepat, tapi buat untuk masa sekarang, nampaknya ia alat navigasi yang terakhir yang masih berfungsi di dunia ini."
         ,"","","","六分儀！哈哈！事實上，我有一個，而且我用它來做我的實驗，但是那對於旅行沒有多大幫助。首先，如果你使用表格，基本上測量座標無法少於表格上一天的準確性。第二，操作六分儀需要技術，對一般人學習的過程中結果很不準確。但是以現在這種狀況，這似乎是地球上唯一可靠的導航裝置。","","Εξάντας! Χα χα! Αλήθεια, έχω και τον χρησιμοποιώ συχνά στα πειράματά μου αλλά δεν είναι τόσο πρακτικός για ταξίδια. Πρώτα απ\'  όλα χρησιμοποιώντας μόνο ηλιακούς πίνακες δεν μπορείς να μετρήσεις τη θέση σου περισσότερο από μία φορά την ημέρα. Δεύτερον είναι κάπως δύσκολο να τον χειριστείς και μπορεί να είναι αρκετά ανακριβής μέχρι να γίνεις αληθινά καλός στο χειρισμό του, για την ώρα όμως, δείχνει να είναι η μόνη λειτουργική συσκευή πλοήγησης που απέμεινε στον κόσμο.","","","","","","","Sextant! Ha ha! Sa totoo lang, mayroon ako nito, at ginagamit ko ito nang madalas sa aking mga eksperimento, pero hindi ito praktikal sa paglalakbay. Una sa lahat, kung solar tables lang ang gagamitin, hindi mo matutukoy ang iyong lokasyon ng higit sa isang beses kada araw. Pangalawa, medyo mahirap itong gamitin at hindi rin ito masyadong eksakto hanggang sa mabihasa kang gumamit nito. Pero sa ngayon, mukhang ito lang ang gumaganang kagamitang pangnabigasyon dito sa mundo."
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5702":["","You need some tables to use it, right? Do you have them?","","Se necesitan unas tablas para poder usarlo, ¿verdad? ¿Las tienes?","","","","Eu preciso de algumas tabelas para usá-lo, certo? Tem elas?","Man braucht einige Tabellen um ihn zu benutzen, stimmt\'s? Hast Du welche?","","Ai nevoie de niște tabele ca să-l folosești, nu? Le ai?","Potrzeba pewnych tabel do stosowania go, prawda? Masz je?","Kullanmak için birkaç tabloya ihtiyacın var, değil mi? Sende var mı?","Je hebt wat tabellen nodig om het te gebruiken, toch? Heb je die?","","Kamu memerlukan beberapa jadual untuk menggunakannya, kan? Adakah kamu simpan mereka?","","","","使用六分儀需要一些表格對吧？你有嗎？","","Χρειάζεται να χρησιμοποιηθούν κάποιοι πίνακες σωστά; Τους έχεις;","","","","","","","May mga tabula ka para magamit ito, tama ba? Dala mo ba ang mga iyon?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5703":["","Yes, of course, but the problem is that they are not for this year. They stopped publishing them many years ago, and you can only use the solar data. I once tried to calculate moon and planet data too, but I couldn\'t do it because nobody seems to know for sure how the old calendar relates to the new one, so I don\'t know how many years to use in my calculations... One day I may build a telescope and try to compare the current locations of astronomical objects to these tables and answer all these questions, but I want to finish my current project first.","","Sí, claro. Pero el problema es que no son para este año. Dejaron de publicarse hace muchísimos años, por lo que sólo pueden usarse los datos que hacen referencia al Sol. en su día intenté calcular los datos referentes a la Luna y los planetas, pero me resultó imposible ya que nadie sabe cómo se relacionan el calendario antiguo con el actual, y no sé cuántos años tengo que usar en mis cálculos... Puede que un día fabrique un telescopio e intente comparar la posición actual de los cuerpos celestes con la de las tablas para responder a esas cuestiones... Pero por ahora, prefiero centrarme en este proyecto."
         ,"","","","Sim, claro, mas o problema é que não são para este ano. Eles pararam de publicar a muitos anos atrás, e você só pode usar os dados solares. Eu tentei uma vez calcular os dados da Lua e dos planetas também, porem não pude porque ninguém ao certo sabe como o velho calendário tem relação com o novo, assim eu não sei quantos anos posso usar nos cálculos... Um dia ainda construirei um telescópio e tentarei comparar a localização atual astronômica e as tabelas nos darão as respostas que queremos, mas eu tenho que terminar meu projeto primeiro.","Ja, natürlich, aber das Problem ist, sie sind nicht von diesem Jahr. Sie haben vor vielen Jahren damit aufgehört, die Tabellen abzudrucken. Und man kann nur noch die Sonnendaten nutzen. Ich habe es mal probiert mit Mond- und Planetendaten zu rechnen, aber es ging nicht, weil niemand mehr wusste, wie die alte Kalender mit unserem Neuen zusammenpasst. Also wusste ich nicht wieviele Jahre ich in meine Berechnungen einbeziehen muss... Eines Tages werde ich mir ein Teleskop bauen und versuchen die derzeitigen Sternenpositionen mit den Tabellen zu vergleichen und diese ganzen Fragen zu beantworten. Aber jetzt will ich erstmal mein jetziges Projekt beenden."
         ,"","Da, desigur, dar problema este că nu sunt pentru acest an. Au oprit publicarea cu mulți ani în urmă, și poți utiliza doar datele solare. Am încercat o dată să calculez datele Lunii și ale planetei de asemenea, dar nu am putut s-o fac, pentru că nimeni nu pare a ști sigur cum era calendarul vechi, așa că nu știu cât de mulți ani să utilizez în calculele mele. .. Într-o zi aș putea construi un telescop și să încerc să compar locațiile curente ale obiectelor astronomice cu aceste tabele și să rezolv aceste probleme, dar vreau să-mi termin proiectul mai întâi.","Tak, oczywiście, ale problem jest taki, że nie są na ten rok. Przestali je publikować wiele lat temu, a możesz używać tylko solarnych danych. Próbowałem raz kiedyś skalkulować także dane księżycowe i planetarne, ale nie potrafiłem tego zrobić, ponieważ nikt chyba nie jest pewien, jak stary kalendarz ma się do nowego, więc nie wiem, jak wiele lat użyć w moich kalkulacjach... Może pewnego dnia zbuduję teleskop i spróbuję porównać obecną lokalizację ciał niebieskich do tych tabel i odpowiem na te wszystkie pytania, ale najpierw chcę skończyć mój obecny projekt."
         ,"Evet, tabii, ancak sorun bu yılın olmamaları. Uzun yıllar önce yayımlamayı braktılar, sadece güneş verilerini kullanabilirsin. Önceden ay ve gezegen verilerini hesaplamayı denemiştim ancak başarılı olamadım nedeni ise kimsenin yeni takvimi eskisiyle nasıl ilişkilendireceğini bilememesi, böylece ben de hesaplamalarımda kaç yıl kullanacağımı bilemiyorum. Bir gün belki bir teleskop yapıp, astronomik objelerin güncel konumlarını bu tablolarla karşılaştırıp tüm bu sorulara cevap verebilirim, ancak önce üzerinde çalıştığım projemi bitirmek istiyorum.","Ja, natuurlijk, maar het probleem is dat ze niet voor dit jaar zijn. Ze zijn vele jaren geleden gestopt met het publiceren ervan, en je kunt alleen nog de data van de zon gebruiken. Ik heb ooit geprobeerd de data van de maan en de planeten de berekenen, maar dat kon ik niet omdat niemand zeker lijkt te weten hoe de oude kalenders gerelateerd zijn aan de nieuwe, dus ik weet niet hoeveel jaar ik moet gebruiken in mijn berekeningen... Op een dag bouw ik misschien een telescoop en probeer de huidige locaties van astronomische objecten te vergelijken met die tabellen en al die vragen te beantwoorden, maar ik wil eerst mijn huidige project afmaken."
         ,"","Ya, sudah tentu, tapi masalahnya adalah mereka bukan untuk tahun ini. Penerbitan mereka telah henti banyak tahun yang lalu, dan kamu hanya boleh guna data solar. Saya pernah cuba mengira data bulan dan planet juga, tapi saya tak dapat melakukannya kerana tiada orang yang tahu bagaimana kalendar lama dapat dikaitkan dengan yang baru, jadi saya tidak tahu berapa banyak tahun untuk guna dalam pengiraan saya... Saya mungkin akan cuba membina sebuah teleskop pada suatu hari dan cuba membandingkan lokasi objek-objek astronomi sementara dengan jadual-jadual ini dan jawab semua soalan ini, tapi saya nak menghabiskan projek saya dulu.","","","","當然有，但問題是，年份不對。很多年前表格就已經不再更新了，目前只有太陽表格是可以用的。我曾經用月亮及地球的數據，但是卻失敗了，因為沒人知道如何把舊資料轉為新的可用年份。有一天我可能可以建出一個望遠鏡來精確以天文資料計算座標，但是我得先完成目前的計畫。","","Ναι φυσικά, αλλά το πρόβλημα είναι ότι δεν είναι για αυτό το έτος. Σταμάτησαν να τους εκδίδουν πολλά χρόνια πριν και μπορείς να χρησιμοποιήσεις μόνο τα ηλιακά δεδομένα. Προσπάθησα κάποτε να υπολογίσω τα δεδομένα της Σελήνης και των πλανητών αλλά δεν μπορούσα να το κάνω επειδή κανείς δε ξέρει με σιγουριά πως το παλιό ημερολόγιο συσχετίζεται με το νέο, έτσι δε γνωρίζω πόσα έτη να χρησιμοποιήσω στους υπολογισμούς μου. Κάποια μέρα θα φτιάξω ένα τηλεσκόπιο και θα προσπαθήσω να συγκρίνω τις τρέχουσες τοποθεσίες των αστρονομικών αντικειμένων με τους πίνακες και να απαντήσω σε όλα αυτά τα ερωτήματα, όμως πρώτα πρέπει να τελειώσω την τρέχουσα εργασία μου."
         ,"","","","","","","Oo naman, pero ang problema ay hindi ito para sa taong ito. Tumigil na sila sa paglalathala nito maraming taon na ang nakalilipas, at ang tanging magagamit mo lang ay ang solar data. Sinubukan ko rin noong kalkulahin ang moon data at planet data, ngunit hindi ko kaya dahil mukhang walang nakakaalam kung ano ang ugnayan ng lumang kalendaryo sa bago, kaya naman hindi ko alam kung ilang taon ang gagamitin ko sa aking kalkulasyon... Osang araw ay maaaring gumawa ako ng teleskopyo at subukang ikumpara ang kasalukuyang lokasyon ng mga astronomical objects sa mga tabulang ito at sagutin ang aking mga katanungan, pero nais kong tapusin muna ang aking kasalukuyang proyekto.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5704":["","Do you think you could sell me these tables?","","¿Crees que podrías venderme esas tablas?","","","","Você acha que poderia me vender essas tabelas?","Kannst Du mir diese Tabellen verkaufen?","","Crezi că ai putea să-mi vinzi aceste tabele?","Jak sądzisz, mógłbyś sprzedać mi te tabele?","Bana şu tabloları satarmısın?","Denk je dat je me die tabellen kunt verkopen?","","Adakah kamu rasa kamu boleh menjualkan jadual-jadual tersebut kepada saya?","","","","你可以把你的表格賣給我嗎？","","Νομίζεις ότι μπορείς να μου πουλήσεις αυτούς τους πίνακες;","","","","","","","Sa tingin mo ay maaari mong maibenta sa akin ang mga tabulang ito?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5705":["","Sell you? No. I can give them to you for free. I have made three hard copies of them and stored them in electronic format as well... Here, you can have them.","","¿Vendértelas? No hace falta. Puedo regalarte unas. Hice tres copias en papel e hice varias copias en formato electrónico... Toma, puedes quedártelas.","","","","Vendê-las? Não. Eu posso dar para você de graça. Eu fiz três cópias físicas delas e cópias em formato eletrônico também... Aqui, você pode tê-las.","Dir verkaufen? Nein. Ich kann sie dir schenken. Ich habe 3 Kopien angefertigt und sie auch nochmal elektronisch abgespeichert... Hier, Du kannst sie haben.","","Să ți le vând? Nu, dar ți le pot da gratuit. Am făcut trei copii și le-am stocat în format electronic... Uite, poți să le iei.","Sprzedać ci? Nie. Mogę ci je dać za darmo. Zrobiłem trzy kopie tego w twardym formacie, a także zmagazynowałem je w elektronicznym formacie... Masz, możesz je mieć.","Satayım mı? Hayır. Sana bedavaya verebilirim. Üç tane basılı kopyasını alıp sonrada elektronik formatta ayrıca depoladım... İşte, alabilirsin."
         ,"Verkopen? Nee. Ik kan ze je voor niets geven. Ik heb er drie kopieën van en ik heb ze ook electronisch opgeslagen... Hier, je mag ze hebben.","","Jual kepada kamu? Tak. Saya boleh beri mereka kepada kamu secara percuma. Saya sudah buat tiga salinan dan juga telah simpan mereka dalam format elektronik.... Sini, kamu boleh ambil mereka.","","","","賣你？不。我可以免費送你。我已經複製了三份，而且是電子檔案... 這，給你。","","Να σου πουλήσω; Όχι μπορώ να σου τους δώσω δωρεάν. Έχω κάνει τρία αντίτυπα και τους αποθήκευσα επίσης σε ηλεκτρονική μορφή. Ορίστε μπορείς να τους πάρεις.","","","","","","","Ibenta? Hindi na. Ibibigay ko na ito sa iyo. Mayroon akong tatlong hard copy nito at may electronic format rin... Heto, sa iyo na.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5706":["","Oh! Thanks a lot!","","¡Oh, vaya! ¡Muchísimas gracias!","","Oh! Merci beaucoup!","","Oh! Muito <obrigado/obrigada>!","Oh! Vielen Dank!","","Oh! Mulțumesc mult!","Och! Dzięki bardzo!","Oh! Çok teşekkürler!","Oh! Heel erg bedantk!","","Oh! Ribuan terima kasih!","","","","噢！太感謝你了！","","Ω! Ευχαριστώ πολύ!","","","","","","","Maraming salamat!","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5707":["","Don\'t mention it. Read the annexes at the end to learn how to use your sextant. Remember that only the solar tables are valid.","","De nada. Léete los anexos del final para aprender a usar el sextante. Pero recuerda, que sólo puedes usar las tablas solares.","","","","De nada. Leia os anexos no final e aprenderá como usar o sextante. Lembre-se que somente as tabelas solares servem.","Keine Ursache. Lies dir die Anmerkungen am Ende durch, sie erklären dir, wie du deine Sextanten einsetzen musst. Und vergiss nicht, dass nur die Sonnentabellen stimmen.","","Pentru puțin. Citește anexele de la sfârșit, pentru a învăța cum să folosești sextantul. Ține minte că numai tabelele solare sunt valabile.","Proszę bardzo. Przeczytaj aneksy na końcu, aby nauczyć się, jak używać swój sekstant. Pamiętaj, że tylko tablice solarne są ważne(valid).","Lafı bile olmaz. Sondaki eklerini okuyup sekstantını nasıl kullanacağını öğren. Unutma ki geçerli olanlar sadece güneş tabloları.","Vergeet het. Lees de bijlagen aan het eind om te leren hoe je je sextant moet gebruiken. Denk eraan dat alleen de zonnetabellen geldig zijn."
         ,"","Sama-sama. Baca lampiran-lampiran di belakang untuk belajar bagaimana mengguna sextant kamu. Ingat bahawa hanya jadual solar adalah yang sah.","","","","不值一提。讀那後面的附件就知道怎麼跟六分儀搭配使用了。注意只有白天的表格是有用的。","","Δεν κάνει τίποτε. Διάβασε τα παραρτήματα στο τέλος για να μάθεις πως να χρησιμοποιείς τον εξάντα σου. Να θυμάσαι ότι μόνο οι ηλιακοί πίνακες είναι έγκυροι.","","","","","","","Walang anuman. Basahin mo ang mga annex sa dulo at aralin kung paano gumagana ang sextant. tandaan mo na ang solar tables lang ang tama.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5708":["","Great! I\'ll remember. I\'ll go try them now. Thanks again. See you later. [leave]","","¡Genial! Lo tendré en cuenta. Ahora mismo iré a probarlas, a ver qué tal. Muchas gracias de nuevo. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","","","Ótimo! Eu lembrarei. Agora eu tenho que partir. <Obrigado/Obrigada> novamente. Até mais. [sair]","Großartig! Ich werde es nicht vergessen. Jetzt probiere ich sie aus. Nochmals danke. Bis bald. [gehen]","","Grozav! Îmi voi aminti. Mă duc să le încerc acum. Mulțumesc din nou. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Cukierkowo! Będę <pamiętał/pamiętała>. Pójdę teraz je wypróbować. Jeszcze raz dzięki. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","Muazzam! Hatırlayacağım. Şimdi gidip deneyeyim. Tekrardan teşekkürler. Sonra görüşürüz. [Ayrıl]","Geweldig! Ik zal het onthouden. Ik ga ze nu uitproberen. Nogmaals bedankt. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Hebat! Saya akan ingat. Saya akan cuba mereka sekarang. Terima kasih. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","太好了！我會記住的。我現在就去試試。再次感謝。再見了。[離開]"
         ,"","Θαυμάσια! Θα το θυμάμαι. Θα πάω να τα δοκιμάσω τώρα. Και πάλι ευχαριστώ. Θα τα πούμε αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige! Tatandaan ko. Susubukan ko na ito ngayon. Salamat uli. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5709":["","Nautical Almanac","","Almanaque de Navegación","","","","Almanaque Náutico","Nautischer Almanach","","Almanah Nautic","Marynarskie Kalendarium","Deniz Almanak","Nautische almanak","","Almanac Nautikal","","","","航海曆","","Χάρτες πλοήγησης","","","","","","","Nautical Almanac","","","Almanacco nautico","","","","","","","","","","","","Almanac de Navegació","","Astronavigační tabulky"],
         "5710":["","A set of tables that show the positions of celestial objects in the sky for each day of the year. When used with a sextant, these tables allow you to calculate your approximate location. Accuracy of measurements and calculations depend on your experience of using the sextant and on the intelligence of your crew members.","","Conjunto de tablas que recogen las posiciones de los cuerpos celestes en el cielo para cada uno de los días del año. Usadas junto a un sextante, dichas tablas permiten calcular de forma aproximada las coordinadas de tu posición. La precisión de dichos cálculos dependerá de la experiencia en el uso del sextante y de la inteligencia de los miembros de la caravana.","","","","Um conjunto de tabelas que mostram as posições de corpos celestes no céu para cada dia do ano. Quando usadas com um sextante, essas tabelas o permitem calcular sua localização aproximada. A precisão das medidas e cálculos dependem de sua experiência com o uso do sextante e da inteligência dos membros de sua equipe."
         ,"Eine Zusammenstellung von Tabellen, die die Sternenkonstellationen für jeden Tag des Jahres zeigen. Bei Verwendung in Kombination mit einem Sextanten, ist dir die ungefähre Bestimmung deiner Position möglich. Die Genauigkeit der Messungen und Berechnungen hängen von deiner Erfahrung im Umgang mit dem Sextanten und der Intelligenz deiner Crew-Mitglieder ab.","","Un set de tabele care arată pozițiile obiectelor cerești, pentru fiecare zi a anului. Atunci când este utilizat cu un sextant, aceste tabele vă permit să vă calculați locația aproximativă. Acuratețea măsurătorilor și a calculelor, depinde de experiența voastră de a folosi sextantul și de inteligența membrilor echipajului.","Zestaw tabel pokazujących pozycję gwiezdnych obiektów na niebie dla każdego dnia roku. Kiedy użyty z sekstantem, te tabele pozwalają na skalkulowanie twojej przybliżonej lokacji. Celność pomiarów i kalkulacji zależy od twojego doświadczenia w posługiwaniu się sekstantem, a także inteligencji członków twojej drużyny."
         ,"Gök cisimlerinin bir yılın her günkü konumlarını gösteren tablolar seti. Sekstantla kullanıldığında, yaklaşık konumunu hesaplamada yardımcı olurlar. Ölçümlerin ve hesaplamaların doğrulukları sekstantı kullanmadaki tecrübene ve ekibindeki adamların zeka seviyelerine bağlıdır.","Een set tabellen die de positie toont van hemellichamen in de lucht voor elke dag van het jaar. Als ze gebruikt worden met een sextant, laten deze tabellen je geschatte positie berekenen. Nauwkeurigheid van metingen en berekeningen hangt af van je ervaring met het gebruik van een sextant en de intelligentie van je teamleden.","","Satu set jadual yang tunjuk posisi objek-objek angkasa di langit untuk setiap hari dalam setahun. Kalau diguna dengan sebuah sextant, jadual-jadual tersebut membolehkan anda untuk mengira anggaran lokasi anda. Ketepatan pengukuran dan pengiraan bergantung pada kemahiran anda mengguna sebuah sextant dan juga intelek ahli-ahli anda.","","","","一些表格顯示某年某月某日天體的座標。搭配六分儀，這些表格可以用來計算自己的精確位置。結果的準確性取決於使用六分儀的經驗與成員的計算能力。"
         ,"","Ένα σύνολο χαρτών που δείχνει τις θέσεις των ουράνιων αντικειμένων στο στερέωμα κάθε μέρα του χρόνου. Όταν χρησιμοποιούνται μαζί με εξάντα οι χάρτες αυτοί επιτρέπουν τον υπολογισμός της ακριβούς θέσης που βρίσκεται κανείς. Η ακρίβεια των μετρήσεων και των υπολογισμών εξαρτάται από την εμπειρία του χρήστη του εξάντα και από την εξυπνάδα των μελών της ομάδας.","","","","","","","mga table na nagpapakita ng posisyon ng mga bagay sa kalawakan sa bawat araw sa isang taon. Kapag ginamit kasabay ng sextant, hinanayaan ng mga table na kalkulahin ang iyong lokasyon. Ang kawastuhan ng mga sukat at ng mga kalkulasyon ay nakasalalay sa iyong kahusayan sa paggamit ng sextant at sa intelligence ng iyong mga kasamahan sa grupo.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Conjunt de taules que recullen la posició al cel dels diversos cossos celests per a cadascun dels dies de l\'any. Usades conjuntament amb un sextant, aquestes taules permeten el càlcul aproximat de les coordenades de la teva posició. La precisió d\'aquests càlculs dependrà de la experiència en l\'ús del sextant i la intel•ligència dels membres de la caravana."
         ,"","Sada tabulek, které ukazují pozici nebeských objektů na nebi pro každý den v roce. Pokud jsou použity se sextantem, tyto tabulky ti umožní vypočítat tvoji přibližnou lokaci. Přesnost měření a výpočtů záleží na tvých zkušenostech s používáním sextantu a na inteligenci členů tvojí skupiny."],
         "5711":["","Music Records","","Grabaciones musicales","","Enregistrements de musique","","Gravações de Música","Musikaufnahmen","","Casete audio cu muzică","Muzyczne Nagrania","Müzik Kasetleri","Muziekcassettes","","Rekod-rekod muzik.","","","","音樂唱片","","Κασέτες","","","","","","","teyp","","","","","","muusika kassetid","","","","","","","","","Gravacions de música","","Hudební záznamy"],
         "5712":["","The music records Kevin asked you to bring.","","Las grabaciones musicales que te pidió Kevin.","","","","As gravações de músicas que Kevin lhe pediu para trazer.","Die Musikaufnahmen, um die dich Kevin bat.","","Casetele audio cu muzică, pe care Kevin te-a rugat să i le aduci.","Muzyczne nagrania, o które Kevin cię prosił, abyś mu <przywiózł/przywiozła>.","Kevin\'ın getirmeni istediği müzik kasetleri.","De muziekcassetes die Kevin je vroeg om te brengen.","","Rekod-rekod muzik yang Kevin minta anda bawa.","","","","凱文要求你帶回去的音樂唱片。","","Οι κασέτες που ο Kevin σου ζήτησε να φέρεις.","","","","","","","Mga tugtugin sa teyp na ipinadadala sa iyo ni Kavin.","","","","","","muusika salvestised mille kalvin palus sinul tuua.","","","","","","","","","Les gravacions de música que et va demanar en Kevin.","","Hudební záznamy, které tě Kevin požádal přinést."],
         "5713":["","Your friend Kevin sends his regards.","","Tu amigo Kevin te manda recuerdos.","","","","Seu amigo Kevin manda lembranças.","Ich soll dich von deinem Freund Kevin grüßen.","","Prietenul tău Kevin îți transmite salutări.","Twój przyjaciel Kevin przesyła tobie pozdrowienia.","Arkadaşın Kevin, selamlarını gönderdi.","Je vriend Kevin doet je de groeten.","","Kawan kamu Kevin menghantar salam.","","","","你的朋友凱文叫我問候你。","","Ο φίλος σου ο Kevin στέλνει χαιρετίσματα.","","","","","","","Kinukumusta ka nga pala ni Kevin.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5714":["","He wants more music, right?","","Y quiere que le envíe más música, ¿verdad?","","","","Ele quer mais música, certo?","Er will mehr Musik, oder?","","Vrea mai multă muzică, nu?","Chce więcej muzyki, prawda?","Daha çok müzik istiyor, değil mi?","Hij wil meer muziek, zeker?","","Dia mahu muzik tambahan, kan?","","","","他想要音樂唱片，對吧？","","Θέλει κι άλλη μουσική, σωστά;","","","","","","","Gusto pa nya ng marami pang musika, tama ba ako?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5715":["","Yes. He asked me to ask you if you have any new records.","","Pues sí. Quería que te preguntara si tienes más grabaciones de música para él.","","","","Sim. Ele me disse para perguntar se você tem algumas novas gravações.","Ja, er hat mich gebeten, bei Dir nachzufragen, ob Du neue Aufnahmen hast.","","Da. Mi-a cerut să te întreb dacă ai înregistrări noi.","Tak. Poprosił mnie, bym <zapytał/zapytała> ciebie, czy masz jakiekolwiek nowe nagrania.","Evet. Benden, sana yeni kayıtlar varmı diye sormamı istedi.","Ja. Hij vroeg me om je te vragen of je nog nieuwe muziekcassettes hebt.","","Ya. Dia telah minta saya untuk tanya kamu kalau kamu ada rakaman-rakaman yang baru.","","","","沒錯。他要我問你是否你有新的唱片。","","Ναι. Μου ζήτησε να σε ρωτήσω αν έχεις τίποτε καινούργιους δίσκους.","","","","","","","Oo. Tanungin raw kita kung may mga bago kang records.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5716":["","Yes. Here they are. [hands you some cassettes]","","Pues sí. Toma, llévaselas. [te entrega varios cassettes]","","","","Sim. Aqui estão. [lhe dá algumas fitas cassetes]","Ja, hier sind ein paar. [er gibt dir ein paar Kassetten]","","Da. Iată-le. [îți dă casetele]","Tak. Oto one. [Przekazuje ci trochę kaset]","İşte. Buradalar. [Birkaç kaset uzatıyor.]","Ja. Hier zijn ze. [geeft je wat cassettes]","","Ya. Mereka di sini. [Beri anda beberapa kaset]","","","","有。就在這裡。[交給你一些卡帶]","","Ναι. Ορίστε. [σου παραδίδει κάμποσες κασέτες]","","","","","","","Oo. Heto. [iniabot sa iyo ang ilang mga casettes]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5717":["","Nice. I\'ll go give them to him. Thanks. [leave]","","Perfecto. Se las llevaré. Gracias. [marcharse]","","","","Legal. Eu darei a ele. <Obrigado/Obrigada>. [sair]","Super. Ich bringe sie ihm. Dankeschön. [gehen]","","Frumos. Mă duc să i le dau. Mulțumesc. [pleacă]","Milutko. Udam się mu je oddać. Dzięki. [odejdź]","Güzel. Bunları gidip ona vereyim. Teşekkürler. [Ayrıl]","Mooi. Ik ga ze aan hem geven. Bedankt. [vertrekken]","","Cantik. Saya akan hantar mereka kepada dia. Terima kasih. [Tinggal]","","","","太好了。我會把這些給他。感謝。[離開]","","Ωραία. Θα πάω να του τις δώσω. Ευχαριστώ [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Ayos. Ibibigay ko sa kanya ang mga ito. Salamat. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5718":["","What are these things?","","¿Qué son estas cosas?","","Que sont ces choses?","","O que são essas coisas?","Was sind das für Sachen?","","Ce-s acestea?","Czym są te rzeczy?","Bu şeyler de ne?","Wat zijn deze dingen?","","Apakah benda-benda ini?","","","","這些是甚麼？","","Τι είναι αυτά;","","","","","","","Ano ang mga ito?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5719":["","Audio cassettes. One of the many forms to store recorded audio. I use them because they are easy to record and easy to play back while compact and damage resistant at the same time. The sound quality is not very good, though. I prefer vinyl disks myself.","","Son cassettes o cintas de audio. Son uno de los diferentes métodos de grabación de audio. Yo los uso porque son fáciles de grabar y de reproducir. Además son compactos y resistentes. Sin embargo, la calidad del sonido se resiente un poco. Yo personalmente, prefiero los discos de vinilo.","","","","Fitas cassetes. Uma das muitas formas de gravar áudio. Eu uso porque são muito fáceis de gravar e fáceis de tocar e ao mesmo tempo são compactas e duram muito, embora a qualidade do som não seja muito boa. Eu prefiro discos de vinil.","Tonkassetten. Eines von vielen Formaten um Tonaufnahmen zu speichern. Ich nutze sie, weil man sie einfach aufnehmen und einfach abspielen kann. Dabei sind sie noch kompakt und wiederstandsfähig. Die Soundqualität ist aber nicht so gut, da bevorzugt ich ehr Schallplatten."
         ,"","Casete audio. Una dintre multele tipuri de înregistrări audio. Le folosesc, deoarece acestea sunt ușor de înregistrat și ușor de citit și în același timp compacte și rezistente la daune. Calitatea sunetului nu este foarte bună, d-aia prefer viniluri.","Audio kasetami. Jedną z wielu form przechowywania nagrań dźwiękowych. Używam ich, ponieważ są łatwe w zapisie i łatwo je przewinąć z powrotem, podczas gdy są jednocześnie kompaktowe i odporne na uszkodzenia. Jakość dźwięku nie jest jednak bardzo dobra. Preferuję osobiście winylowe dyski.","Ses kasetleri. Pek çoğu ses kaydetmek için. Bunları kullanıyorum çünkü hem kaydedip tekrardan dinlemesi kolay hem küçük hem de zarara dayanıklı. Ses kalitesi çok iyi değil, tabi. Ben, kendimce, vinil diskleri tercih ediyorum.","Audiocassettes. Een van de vele vormen om opgenomen audio op te slaan. Ik gebruik ze omdat ze makkelijk op te nemen en makkelijk terug te spelen zijn, en schadebestendig tegelijkertijd. De geluidskwaliteit is alleen niet zo goed. Ik heb zelf liever vynil platen."
         ,"","Kaset-kaset audio. Salah satu benda yang diguna untuk simpan rakaman audio. Saya guna mereka kerana mereka mudah untuk diguna dan dimainkan kembali manakala masih kecil dan tahan lasak. Walaubagaimanapun, kualiti rakaman tak berapa bagus. Saya lebih suka cakera vinil.","","","","音樂卡帶。用來儲存音樂的其中一種方式。我用這種方式是因為這很容易錄製與播放，同時還不容易損壞。可惜品質聽起來不是很好。我自己是比較喜歡黑膠唱片。","","Κασέτες ήχου. Μία από τις πολλές μορφές για να αποθηκεύσεις εγγεγραμμένο ήχο. Τις χρησιμοποιώ γιατί είναι εύκολες στην εγγραφή και την αναπαραγωγή ενώ ταυτόχρονα αντέχουν τις ζημιές. Όμως η ποιότητα του ήχου δεν είναι πολύ καλή, προσωπικά προτιμώ δίσκους βινυλίου.","","","","","","","Mga audio casettes. Isa sa maraming paraan upang magtago ng nai-record na audio. Ginagamit ko sila dahil madali lang i-record at patugtugin at hindi madaling kumupas at matibay pa. Hindi lang maganda ang kalidad ng tunog. Mas gusto ko ang mga plaka.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5720":["","Where do you get these things?","","¿Y dónde los consigues?","","","","Onde você pega essas coisas?","Woher bekommst Du das ganze Zeug?","","Unde le găsești?","Skąd bierzesz te rzeczy?","Bu şeyleri nereden buluyorsun?","Waar krijg je die dingen?","","Dari mana kamu dapat semua benda ini?","","","","你到哪裡去找到這些東西的？","","Που βρίσκεις τέτοια πράγματα;","","","","","","","Saan mo nakukuha ang mga bagay na ito?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5721":["","Mostly buy them from caravans that stop here in Northway. They already know that I\'m interested in the old world stuff and bring me everything they find.","","La mayoría se las compro a la gente de las caravanas que hacen escala aquí, en Northway. Ellos ya saben que me interesan las antigüedades y me traen todo lo que encuentran por ahí.","","","","A maioria eu compro das caravanas que param aqui em Northway. Eles sabem que me interesso por coisas antigas e me trazem tudo que encontram.","Meistens kaufe ich sie von Karawanen, die hier in Northway halten. Die wissen schon, dass mich der Kram aus der alten Zeit interessiert und bringen mir alles, was sie finden.","","Le cumpăr de la caravanele ce opresc aici, în Northway. Mă știu deja, că sunt interesat de lucrurile din lumea veche și-mi aduc tot ce găsesc.","Głównie kupuje je od karawan, które zatrzymują się w Northway. Oni już wiedzą, że jestem zainteresowany rzeczami ze starego świata i przynoszą mi wszystko, co znajdują."
         ,"Burada, Northway\'de duran karavanlardan alıyorum. Eski dünya eşyalarına ilgim olduğunu biliyorlar ve ne bulurlarsa bana getiriyorlar.","Meestal koop ik ze van karavanen die hier in Northway stoppen. Ze weten al dat ik geïnteresserd ben in spullen van de oude wereld en ze brengen me alles wat ze vinden.","","Kebanyakannya dibeli daripada karavan-karavan yang bersinggah di Northway. Mereka sudah tahu bahawa saya berminat dalam benda-benda dunia lama dan mereka selalu membawa kepada saya semua yang mereka dapat cari.","","","","大部分從停在 Northway 這裡的商旅那裏買的。他們知道我對這些舊時代的東西有興趣，所以他們找到甚麼就會帶來給我。","","Κυρίως αγοράζω από καραβάνια που σταματάνε εδώ στο Northway. Ήδη γνωρίζουν ότι ενδιαφέρομαι για πράγματα από τον παλιό κόσμο και μου φέρνουν ότι βρίσκουν.","","","","","","","Kadalasang nabibili ko ang mga ito sa mga caravan na tumitigil rito sa Northway. Alam na nilang interesado ako sa mga bagay na galing sa makalumang mundo at dinadala nila ang anumang mahanap nila.","","","","","","","","","",""
         ,"","","","","","",""],
         "5722":["","OK. I should go take these cassettes to Kevin. See you later. [leave]","","Muy bien. Bueno, debo irme y llevarle estos cassettes a Kevin. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","","","OK. Eu devo levar estas fitas cassetes para o Kevin. Nos vemos depois. [sair]","Ok. Ich sollte diese Kassetten zu Kevin bringen. Bis später. [gehen]","","OK. Ar trebui să merg să-i duc lui Kevin casetele. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. <Powinienem/Powinnam> zabrać te kasety do Kevina. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","Tamam. Şu kasetleri alıp Kevin\'a götürmeliyim. Sonra görüşürüz. [Ayrıl]","OK. Ik zou deze cassettes naar Kevin moeten gaan brengen. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya harus pergi hantar kaset-kaset ini kepada Kevin sekarang. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。我會把這些卡帶帶給凱文。再見了。[離開]","","ΟΚ. Πρέπει να πάω αυτές τις κασέτες στον Kevin. Θα τα πούμε αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Dapat sigurong dalhin ko na ang mga casettes na ito kay Kevin. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]"
         ,"","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5723":["","OK. If I find something of this kind I\'ll bring it to you too. Now I need to go take these records to Kevin. Bye. [leave]","","Muy bien. Bueno, si me topo con cosas antiguas de ese estilo también te las traeré. Pero ahora debo irme. Tengo que llevarle estas grabaciones a Kevin. Adiós. [marcharse]","","","","Tudo bem. Se eu encontrar algo do mesmo tipo eu trarei pra você também. Agora eu preciso levar essas gravações para o Kevin. Até mais. [sair]","Okay, wenn ich solche Sachen finde, bringe ich sie bei dir vorbei. Jetzt bringe ich diese Aufnahmen zu Kevin. Tschüss. [gehen]","","OK. Dacă găsesc ceva de acest fel ți-l voi aduce. Acum trebuie să merg să-i duc aceste înregistrări lui Kevin. Pa. [pleacă]","Okej. Jeśli znajdę coś tego rodzaju, to również ci przywiozę. Teraz jednak, potrzebuję zabrać te nagrania do Kevina. Pa. [odejdź]","Peki. Bunlara benzer türde birşey bulursam sana da getiririm. Şimdi şu kasetleri Kevin\'a götürmem lazım. Hoşcakal. [Ayrıl]","OK. Als ik zoiets vind, zal ik het je ook brengen. Nu moet ik deze muziekcassettes naar Kevin gaan brengen. Dag. [vertrekken]"
         ,"","OK. Kalau saya dapat cari benda-benda macam ini saya akan membawa mereka kepada kamu juga. Sekarang saya perlu menghantar rekod-rekod ini kepada Kevin. Selamat tinggal. [Tinggal]","","","","好。假如我找到這類型的東西我也會帶給你。現在我要把這些音樂帶給凱文了。再見。[離開]","","ΟΚ. θα βρώ κάτι τέτοιο να φέρω και σε σένα. Τώρα πρέπει να πάω αυτούς τους δίσκους στον Kevin. Γειά χαρά. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Kung may makita akong tulad nito ay dadalhin ko rin sa iyo. Sa ngayon ay kailangang dalhin ko ang mga ito kay Kevin. Paalam. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5724":["","I have the music records you wanted me to bring.","","Tengo las grabaciones musicales que me pediste.","","","","Eu tenho as gravações musicais que você queria.","Ich habe die Musikaufnahmen die ich dir bringen sollte.","","Am înregistrările de muzică pe care ai vrut să ți le aduc.","Mam muzyczne nagrania, które chciałeś, bym <przywiózł/przywiozła>.","Getirmemi istediğin müzik kasetleri, bende.","Ik heb de muziekcassettes die je wilde dat ik zou brengen.","У меня с собой кассеты, о которых ты говорил.","Saya ada rekod-rekod musik yang kamu minta saya bawa.","Jeg har musik optagelserne som du ville havde jeg tog med.","","","我拿到你要我去拿的音樂唱片了。","","Έχω τους δίσκους που μου ζήτησες να φέρω.","","","","","","","Dala ko na ang music records a ipinadadala mo.","","","","","","Mul on muusika plaadid mis sa tahtsid et ma tooks.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5725":["","Pim gave me the new records you wanted.","","Pim me dio las nuevas grabaciones que me pediste.","Pim me dió las nuevas grabaciones que querías.","","","Pim me deu as novas gravações para você.","Pim hat mir die neuen Aufnahmen gegeben die du wolltest.","","Pim mi-a dat noile înregistrări pe care le-ai vrut.","Pim dał mi nowe nagrania, które chciałeś.","Pim istediğin yeni kayıtları verdi.","Pim gaf me de nieuwe muziekcassettes die je wilde.","Пим мне дал кассеты, которые ты хотел.","Pim telah beri saya rekod-rekod baru yang kamu mahu.","Pim gav mig disse nye optagelser som du ville havde.","","","皮姆把你要的新唱片交給我了。","","Ο Pim μου έδωσε τους νέους δίσκους που ήθελες.","","","","","","","Binigay ni Pim ang mga bagong records na hinihingi mo.","","","","","","Pim andis mulle uued plaadid mis sa tahtsid.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5726":["","I\'ve got your records from Pim.","","Te traigo las grabaciones de parte de Pim.","","","","Eu tenho as gravações de Pim para você.","Ich habe deine Aufnahmen von Pim.","","Am înregistrările de la Pim.","Mam twoje nagrania od Pim.","Kayıtlarını Pim\'den aldım.","Ik heb je muziekcassettes van Pim.","У меня кассеты от Пима.","Saya telah mendapatkan semua rekod kamu daripada Pim.","Jeg har dine optagelser fra Pim.","","","我拿到皮姆要交給你的唱片了。","","Πήρα τους δίσκους από τον Pim","","","","","","","Dala ko na ang records mo galing kay Pim.","","","","","","Ma sain su plaadid Pim\'ilt.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5727":["","<Man/Babe>, it\'s just awesome! Give them to me! I want to hear them already!","","¡<Tío/Nena>! ¡De kryptonita madre! ¡Dámelas, anda! ¡Me muero de ganas de escucharlas!","¡<Hombre/Nena>, es simplemente asombroso! ¡Dámelas! ¡Ya quiero escucharlas!","","","<Cara/Gata>, isso é incrível! Me dá aqui elas! Eu quero escutar isso agora!","Junge, das ist großartig! Gib sie mir! Ich will sie mir gleich anhören!","","<Frate/Soro>, asta-i minunat! Dă-mi-le! Vreau să le aud deja!","<Stary/Babe>, no po prostu zajebiście! Dawaj mi je! Chcę już je usłyszeć!","<Dostum/Bebeğim>, mükemmel! Ver onları! Dinlemek için can atıyorum!","<Man/Meid>, het is fantastisch! Geef ze me! Ik wil ze nu al horen!","Супер, <братан/сестричка>! Давай их сюда! Я уже хочу их послушать!","<Amboi/Amboi>, ia sangat menakjubkan! Berikan mereka kepada saya! Saya tak sabar dah nak mendengar mereka!","<Mand/Babe>, Det er bare for sejt! Giv dem til mig! Jeg vil hører dem nu!","","","<老兄/寶貝>，這真是太驚人了！快拿來給我！我現在就想聽這些唱片！","","Απίθανα! Δώσε μου! Θέλω να τους ακούσω τώρα."
