         "5740":["","How is your navigation device project going?","","¿Cómo va tu proyecto de los dispositivos de navegación?","","","","Como o projeto do dispositivo de navegação está indo?","Wie läuft Dein Projekt mit dem Navigationsgerät?","","Cum merge cu dispozitivul tău de navigare?","Jak tam idzie twój projekt urządzenia nawigacyjnego?","Yön bulma aracı projen nasıl gidiyor?","Hoe gaat het met je project van het navigatieapparaat?","","Bagaimana status projek alat navigasi kamu?","","","","你導航裝置的專案進行得如何了？","","Πως πηγαίνει το σχέδιό σου για τη συσκευή πλοήγησης;","","","","","","","Kamusta na ang iyong navigation device project?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
