         "5747":["","OK. I\'ll come later then. See you. [leave]","","Muy bien, pues. Ya vendré más adelante a ver qué tal. Hasta luego. [marcharse]","","","","Tá bem. Eu venho mais tarde então. Até mais. [sair]","Ok. Dann komme ich später wieder. Bis dann. [gehen]","","OK. Revin mai târziu. Ne vedem. [pleacă]","Okej. Wrócę więc później. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","Peki. Ben daha sonra geleyim o zaman. Görüşürüz. [Ayrıl]","OK. Ik zal later terugkomen dan. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","","OK. Saya akan datang nanti kalau begitu. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。那麼我晚點再過來。再見。[離開]","","Εντάξει. Θα έρθω να σε δω αργότερα. Θα τα πούμε [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Babalik na lang ako. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
