         "5750":["","I\'d love to use such device. Could you sell one to me?","","Me encantaría tener uno de esos aparatos. ¿Me vendes uno?","","","","Eu adoraria usar um deles. Você poderia vender um pra mim?","Ich würde gerne so ein Gerät benutzen. Würdest Du mir eins verkaufen?","","Mi-ar plăcea să folosesc un astfel de dispozitiv. Ai putea să mi-l vinzi?","Z przyjemnością <używałbym/używałabym> takie urządzenie. Mógłbyś mi jedno sprzedać?","Bu aletten bir tane kullanmayı isterdim. Bana bir tane satabilirmisin?","Ik zou graag zo´n apparaat hebben. Zou je me er één kunnen verkopen?","","Saya berkenan untuk menggunakan alat sebegitu rupa. Bolehkah kamu jualkan satu kepada saya?","","","","我想要試用這個裝置。你能賣一個給我嗎？","","Θα ΄θελα να χρησιμοποιήσω μια τέτοια συσκευή. Θα μπορούσες να μου πουλήσεις μία;","","","","","","","Gusto kong gamitin iyan maaari mo ba akong bentahan ng isa?","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5751":["","Absolutely impossible. This product is now property of a governmental organization which I cannot name and it\'s strictly prohibited to distribute these devices or give out any information about the technologies involved in their production.","","Imposible. Este producto es ahora mismo propiedad de una organización gubernamental, que no puedo nombrar, y queda absolutamente prohibida su venta o distribución, así como dar ningún tipo de información acerca de la tecnologías empleadas en su desarrollo.","","","","Absolutamente impossível. Este produto agora é propriedade de uma organização governamental cujo nome eu não posso citar e é proibido distribuí-los ou dar qualquer informação sobre a tecnologia envolvida na sua produção.","Absolut unmöglich. Das Produkt ist jetz Eigentum einer Regierungsorgansation, die ich Dir nicht nennen kann und es ist streng verboten diese Geräte zu verteilen oder irgendwelche Informationen über die genutzte Technologie herauszugeben.","","Este absolut imposibil. Acest produs este acum proprietatea unei organizații guvernamentale, pe care nu o pot numi și este strict interzis de a distribui aceste dispozitive sau a dezvălui orice informații despre tehnologiile implicate în producția lor."
         ,"Absolutnie niemożliwe. Ten produkt jest teraz własnością organizacji rządowej, której nie mogę nazwać i jest ściśle zabronione rozprowadzanie tych urządzeń lub wydawanie jakichkolwiek informacji o technologiach związanych z jej produkcją.","Kesinlikle imkansız. Bu ürün ismini söylemeyeceğim bir hükümet organına aittir ve bu aletlerin dağıtımı ve üretimleri sırasındaki bilgilerin açıklanması kattiyen yasaktır.","Absoluut onmogelijk. Dit product is nu eigendom van een regeringsorganisatie die ik niet kan noemen en het is streng verboden deze apparaten te distribueren of informatie te geven over de technologie die gebruikt wordt in hun productie.","","Tak boleh. Produk ini adalah milik sebuah organisasi kerajaan yang saya tidak boleh menamakan, dan pengedaran alat-alat ini atau penyebaran info tentang teknologi-teknologi yang diguna dalam produksi mereka adalah dilarang.","","","","不可能。這產品現在屬於一個我不能講的國家組織，而且這裝置或這種科技的製作情報是嚴禁流出的。","","Απολύτως αδύνατον. Αυτό το προϊόν είναι τώρα ιδιοκτησία ενός Κυβερνητικού Οργανισμού που δεν μπορώ να κατονομάσω και απαγορεύεται αυστηρά η διανομή των συσκευών ή η διάδοση κάθε πληροφορίας αναφορικά με τις τεχνολογίες που σχετίζονται με την κατασκευή τους."
         ,"","","","","","","Hindi talaga maaari. Ang produktong ito ay pag-aari na ng pamahalaan na hindi ko maaaring pangalanan at hindi maaaring ipagbenta ang kagamitang ito o magbigay ng impormasyon ukol sa teknolohiyang kaugnay ng pagyayari nito.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5752":["","Gee. Sounds serious.","","¡Eeeeh! Tío, parece que lo digas en serio.","¡Oyeee! Bro, parece que lo digas en serio.","","","Nossa. Parece sério.","Uhh. Hört sich ernst an.","","Gee. Sună grav.","Ojoj. Brzmi serio.","Uuu. Kulağa ciddi geliyor.","Jeetje. Klinkt serieus.","","Gee. Dengarnya macam serius.","Wow. Lyder seriøst.","","","好吧，聽起來很嚴重的樣子。","","Αμαν! Δείχνει σοβαρό.","","","","","","","Wow. Mukhang seryosong bagay iyan.","","","","","","Vau. Kõlab tõsiselt","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5753":["","It is serious.","","Lo digo totalmente en serio.","","C\'est sérieux.","","Isto é serio.","Es ist ernst.","","Este grav.","Bo jest serio.","Ciddi bir durum.","Het is serieus.","","Ia memang serius.","Det er seriøst","","","確實是很嚴肅的事情。","","Είναι σοβαρό.","","","","","","","Seryosong bagay talaga ito.","","","","","","See on tõsine.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5754":["","It\'s a shame. I could totally use one of them. Well. I guess I\'ll stick to other navigation methods them. See you later. [leave]","","¿Ah, sí? ¡Pues vaya! ¡Qué lástima! Me iría de perlas algo así. En fin, supongo que tendré que conformarme con otros métodos más tradicionales para orientarme. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","","","É uma pena. Eu poderia usar um deles. Bem... Acho que eu terei de usar outros métodos de navegação. Até logo. [sair]","Was für eine Schande. Ich hätte so eines wirklich gut brauchen können. Gut. Ich schätze ich muss bei anderen Navigationsmethoden bleiben. Bis später. [gehen]","","Ce păcat. As fi vrut să fi putut utiliza dispozitivele. Bine. Cred că voi găsi alte metode de navigare. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Szkoda. Totalnie <mógłbym/mogłabym> używać jednego. No nic. Zgaduję, że będę <musiał/musiała> pozostać z innymi metodami nawigacji. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","Şansa bak. Bir tanesi gerçekten işime yarayabilirdi. Peki. Diğer yön bulma metodlarını kullanırım ben de. Görüşmek üzere. [Ayrıl]"
         ,"Dat is jammer. Ik zou er goed één kunnen gebruiken. Wel. Ik geloof dat ik me bij andere navigatiemethodes moet houden dan. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Ah, malangnya. Memang bagus kalau saya boleh dapatkan satu. Mmm. Kalau begitu saya akan guna kaedah navigasi yang lain. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","Det er en skam. Jeg kunne virkelig godt bruge en af dem. Nåh ja, jeg tror vel bare jeg nøjes med de andre navigerings metoder så. Vi ses senere [Forlad]","","","真可惜。我真的可以用上它們。這個嘛。我只好試試看其他的導航方法了。再見。[離開]","","Κρίμα. Θα μπορούσα να χρησιμοποιήσω ένα από αυτά. Τέλος πάντων θα μείνω σε άλλες μεθόδους πλοήγησης. Τα λέμε αργότερα [αποχώρηση].","","","","","","","Sayang naman. Magagamit ko talagang maigi ang bagay na iyan. Siguro ay patuloy ko na lang gagamitin ang ibang pamamaraang nabigasyon. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5755":["","Hmm... I was planning to work on this project with Qubba government, but they do everything so very slowly! You are Kevin\'s friend and you delivered those records as you promised. I suppose that Qubba government won\'t mind if you participate in this project.","","Hmmm... Tenía planeado trabajar en este proyecto junto con el gobierno de Qubba... ¡Pero lo hacen todo tan lento! Tú eres amigo de Kevin y le entregaste esas cintas de música como me prometiste... Supongo que a los qubbanos no les importará si te involucro en el proyecto.","","","","Hmm... Eu estava planejando trabalhar neste projeto com o governo de Qubba, mas eles fazem tudo tão devagar! Você é amigo de Kevin e lhe entregou todos os arquivos de gravação como prometeu. Eu suponho que o governo de Qubba não vai se importar com a sua participação no projeto.","Hmm... Ich hatte geplant mit der Qubba Regierung an diesem Projekt zu arbeiten, aber die machen alles so wirklich langsam. Du bist Kevins Freund und hast die Aufnahmen wie versprochen geliefert. Ich schätze, dass die Qubba Regierung nichts dagegen hat, wenn du bei diesem Projekt mitmachst."
         ,"","Hmm ... Aveam de gând să lucrez la acest proiect cu guvernul Qubba, dar ei fac totul atât de încet! Ești <prietenul/prietena> lui Kevin și ai livrat înregistrările așa cum ai promis. Presupun că guvernul Qubba nu se va supăra dacă participi în acest proiect.","Hmm... Planowałem pracować nad tym projektem z rządem Qubby, ale oni robią wszystko tak bardzo wolno! Jesteś <przyjacielem/przyjaciółką> Kevina i <dostarczyłeś/dostarczyłaś> te nagrania jak <obiecałeś/obiecałaś>. Wydaje mi się, że rząd Qubby nie będzie miał nic przeciwko, jeśli włączysz się w ten projekt.","Hmm... Bu projede Qubba yönetimi ile çalışmayı planlıyordum, ancak herşeyi çok ama çok yavaş gerçekleştiriyorlar! Sen Kevin\'ın arkadaşısın ve söz verdiğin gibi o kayıtları teslim ettin. Tahminimce Qubba yönetimi bu projede yer almana ses çıkarmayacaktır.","Hmmm... Ik was van plan om met de regering van Qubba te werken aan dit project, maar ze doen alles zo langzaam. Jij bent Kevin´s <vriend/vriendin> en je hebt die muziekcassettes bezorgd zoals beloofd. Ik geloof niet dat de regering van Qubba het erg vindt als je meedoet in dit project."
         ,"","Hmm... Saya sudah bercadang untuk melaksanakan projek ini dengan kerajaan Qubba, tapi mereka adalah sangat lambat dalam semua perkara! Kamu adalah kawan Kevin dan kamu telah menghantar semua rekod itu seperti yang kamu berjanji. Saya rasa bahawa kerajaan Qubba takkan marah kalau kamu menyertai projek ini.","Hmm... Jeg havde planlagt at arbejde med Qubba regeringen til det her projekt, men de gør alting så pokkers langsomt! Du er Kevin\'s ven og du har leveret alle de optagelser som du lovede. Jeg tror ikke Qubba regeringen har noget imod at du deltager i dette projekt.","","","恩... 我計畫跟庫巴政府在這個案子上合作，但他們進展實在很緩慢！你是凱文的朋友，你如你所承諾的把那些唱片交給他。我想庫巴政府不會介意你參與這個計畫的。","","Χμμμ... Σχεδίαζα να δουλέψω σε αυτό το σχέδιο με την κυβέρνηση της Qubba, αλλά κάνουν τα πάντα τόσο αργά! Είσαι φίλος του Kevin και παρέδωσες αυτούς τους δίσκους όπως υποσχέθηκες. Υποθέτω ότι η κυβέρνηση της Qubba δεν θα είχε αντίρρηση αν συμμετείχες στο σχέδιο.","","","","","","","Hmm.. Pinaplano kong gawin ang proyektong ito para sa pamahalaan ng Qubba, pero ambabagal nila! Kaibigan ka ni Kevin at dinala mo ang mga records tulad ng pangako mo. Siguro naman ay hindi papansinin ng Qubba kung sumali ka sa proyektong ito."
