         "5760":["","It\'s nice, but I need to solve a very urgent problem right now. Can I do it a bit later?","","Suena genial... Pero me temo que ahora mismo tengo que encargarme de solucionar unos asuntos personales. ¿Te importa si lo hago más adelante?","","","","Está bem, mas eu preciso resolver uns problemas urgentes agora. Pode ser mais tarde?","Das ist schön, aber ich habe jetzt noch ein sehr dringendes Problem. Kann ich es auch ein bisschen später machen?","","Frumos, dar trebuie să rezolv o problemă foarte urgentă acum. Pot să o fac un pic mai târziu?","To miłe, ale potrzebuję rozwiązać najpierw bardzo pilne problemy. Czy mogę zrobić to trochę później?","Hoş, ancak çok acil bazı problemleri halletmem gerekiyor. Daha sonra yapabilirmiyim?","Het is mooi, maar ik moet een heel dringend probleem oplossen nu. Kan ik het later doen?","","Ia elok, tapi saya perlu menguruskan beberapa masalah yang penting sekarang. Bolehkah saya menguruskannya nanti?","Det er rart, men jeg har brug for at løse nogle vigtige problemer først. Kan jeg gøre det lidt senere?"
         ,"","","聽起來不錯，但是我必須要去解決一個緊急的問題。我可以晚點再進行嗎？","","Είναι εντάξει, αλλά χρειάζομαι να λύσω πολύ επείγοντα προβλήματα τώρα. Μπορώ να το κάνω λίγο αργότερα;","","","","","","","Mabuti iyan, pero kailangan ko pang lumutas ng ilang mga problema. Pwede mamaya na?","","","","","","See on kena, aga ma pean praegu väga kiire probleemi lahendama. Kas ma saan seda natuke hiljem teha?","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5761":["","Kay. But don\'t make me wait too much.","","Está bien. Pero no tardes mucho.","","","","OK. Mas não me faça esperar demais.","Gut. Aber lass mich nicht zu lange warten.","","Kay. Dar nu mă face să aștept prea mult.","Kej. Ale nie pozwalaj mi zbyt długo czekać.","Tamam. Ama beni, çok da fazla bekletme.","OK. Maar laat me niet te lang wachten.","","Kay. Tapi jangan buat saya tunggu untuk terlalu lama.","K. Men få mig nu ikke til at vente for længe.","","","可以，但是不要讓我等太久。","","\'Ντάξει. Αλλά μη με κάνεις να περιμένω για πολύ.","","","","","","","Sige. Pero \'wag mo kong masyadong paghintayin.","","","","","","OK. Aga ära pane mind liiga palju ootama.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5762":["","I won\'t. See you when I\'m ready to help you. [leave]","","Tranquilo, volveré pronto y estaré <listo/lista> para ayudarte. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","","Eu não vou. Te vejo quando estiver <pronto/pronta> para lhe ajudar. [sair]","Werde ich nicht. Seh dich wenn ich bereit bin dir zu helfen. [gehen]","","Nicidecum. Ne vedem când sunt gata să te ajut. [pleacă]","Nie będę. Do zobaczenia, kiedy będę <gotów/gotowa> tobie pomóc. [odejdź]","Bekletmem. Sana yardım etmeye hazır olduğumda, görüşürüz. [Ayrıl]","Dat zal ik niet doen. Ik zie ja als ik klaar ben om je te helpen. [vertrekken]","","Saya tidak akan. Saya akan balik ke sini apabila saya sudah bersedia untuk tolong kamu. [Tinggal]","Det gør jeg ikke. Vi ses når jeg er parat til at hjælpe dig [Forlad]","","","不會的。我準備好幫你的時候再見。[離開]","","Αρνητικό. Θα σε δω μόλις είμαι έτοιμος να σε βοηθήσω. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Hindi ko gagawin iyon. Babalik ako pag handa na akong tulungan ka. [alis]","","","","","","Ei pane. Näeme kui olen valmis sind aitama. [lahku]"
