         "5763":["","OK. I can help you with those transmitters now.","","Perfecto. Ya estoy <preparado/preparada> para ayudarte con esos transmisores.","","","","OK. Eu posso te ajudar com os transmissores agora.","Ok. Ich kann dir jetzt mit diesen Transmittern helfen.","","OK. Te pot ajuta cu transmițătoarele acum.","Okej. Mogę ci już pomóc z tymi nadajnikami.","Tamam. Şimdi sana o vericiler için yardım edebilirim.","OK. Ik kan je nu met die zenders helpen.","","OK. Saya boleh bantu kamu dengan pemasangan pemancar-pemancar itu sekarang.","Ok. Jeg kan hjælpe dig med de transmittere nu.","","","好。我現在可以幫你弄這些發射機了。","","ΟΚ. Μπορώ να σε βοηθήσω μ\' αυτούς τους αναμεταδότες τώρα","","","","","","","OK. Maaaari na kitang tulungan sa mga transmitters ngayon.","","","","","","OK. Ma saan nüüd sind saatjatega aidata.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5764":["","OK.","","","","","","","Ok.","","","Okej.","Tamam.","","","OK.","","","","好。","","ΟΚ.","","","","","","","Sige.","","","","","","OK.","","","","","","","","","D\'acord.","",""],
         "5765":["","Here are the coordinates of the five towns you need to install the transmitters in. I\'ll also give you some storage in this town, just in case you don\'t have enough space for all five transmitters.","","Aquí están las coordenadas de las cinco ciudades en las que hay que instalar los transmisores. También te he guardado algo de espacio en aquí en el almacén de Northway por si no tienes espacio suficiente en tu caravana para los cinco transmisores.","Aquí están las coordenadas de los cinco pueblos en que debes instalar los transmisores. También te daré algo de espacio de almacén en este pueblo, en caso de que no tengas suficiente espacio en tu caravana para los cinco transmisores.","","","Aqui estão as coordenadas das cinco cidades que você precisa instalar os transmissores. Alem disso lhe darei algum deposito na cidade, no caso de não ter espaço suficiente em sua caravana para os transmissores.","Hier sind die Koordinaten der fünf Städte in denen du die Transmitter platzieren musst. Ich gebe dir auch ein wenig Lagerkapazität in dieser Stadt, nur für den Fall, dass du nicht genug Platz für alle fünf Transmitter hast."
         ,"","Aici sunt coordonatele celor cinci orașe unde trebuie să instalezi transmițătoarele, de asemenea, o să-ți dau spațiu de stocare în acest oraș, în cazul în care nu ai suficient loc pentru toate cele cinci transmițătoare.","Oto koordynaty pięciu osiedli, gdzie potrzebujesz zainstalować nadajniki. Dam ci trochę przestrzeni magazynowej w tej osadzie, tak na wszelki wypadek, jeśli nie masz wystarczająco miejsca na wszystkie 5 nadajników.","Vericileri kurman gereken beş kasabanın da koordinatları burada. Beş verici için de yerin olmazsa eğer, sana bu kasabada depolama hakkı da veriyorum.","Hier zijn de coördinaten van de vijf steden waar je de zenders moet installeren. Ik zal je ook wat opslagruimte geven hier in de stad, voor het geval dat je niet genoeg plaats hebt voor alle vijf zenders.","","Inilah koordinat-koordinat kelima-lima kota yang kamu perlu pasang pemancar. Saya juga akan beri kamu beberapa ruang simpanan di kota sini sekiranya kamu tiada ruang yang mencukipi untuk kesemua lima pemancar."
         ,"Her er koordinatorne over de fem byer du skal installere transmitterne i. Jeg giver dig også noget lagerplads i denne by her, bare for en sikkerhedsskyld i tilfælde at du ikke har plads til alle fem transmittere.","","","這裡是你必須安裝發射機的五個城鎮的座標。我也劃分一些鎮上的倉庫給你，避免你的商旅沒有足夠的空間放發報機。","","Εδώ είναι οι συντεταγμένες των πέντε πόλεων που χρειάζεται να εγκαταστήσεις τους αναμεταδότες. Επίσης θα σου διαθέσω αποθηκευτικό χώρο σε αυτή την πόλη για την περίπτωση που δεν έχεις αρκετό χώρο και για τους πέντε αναμεταδότες.","","","","","","","Heto ang mga coordinates ng limang mga bayan na kailangan mong kabitan ng mga transmitters. Bibigyan din kita ng ilang storage sa bayang ito, kung sakaling wala kang espasyo para sa limang transmitters.","","","","","","Siin on viie linna kordinaadid kus sa pead installima saatjad. Ma annan sulle ka ladu siin linnas, lihtsalt  selle jaoks kui sul pole piisavalt ruumi kõigi viie saatjate jaoks.","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "5766":["","OK. Thanks. I\'ll go deal with it now. See you later. [leave]","","Muy bien, gracias. ¡Vamos allá! Nos vemos. [marcharse]","De acuerdo. Gracias. Voy a trabajar en eso. Nos vemos. [marcharse]","","","OK. <Obrigado/Obrigada>. Eu cuidarei disso agora. Até mais. [sair]","Ok. Danke. Ich werde mich jetzt darum kümmern. Bis später. [gehen]","","OK. Mulțumesc. Mă duc să mă ocup de asta acum. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Okej. Dzięki. Pójdę się teraz tym zająć. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","Tamam. Teşekkürler. Gidip halledeyim. Sonra görüşürüz. [ayrıl]","OK. Bedankt. Ik ga er nu aan beginnen. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","OK. Terima kasih. Saya akan menguruskannya sekarang. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","OK. Tak. Jeg tager mig af det nu. Vi ses senere [Forlad]","","","好。感謝。我現在就開始進行。再見了。[離開]","","ΟΚ. Ευχαριστώ. Θα το αντιμετωπίσω τώρα. Τα λέμε αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","Sige. Salamat. Gagawin ko na ito ngayon. Sa muling pagkikita. [alis]","","","","","","OK. Aitäh. Ma lähen tegelen sellega nüüd. Näeme hilem. [lahku]"
