         "6116":["","I\'ve heard that Fafnir\'s brother wants to attack you.","","He oído que el hermano de Fafnir está preparando un ataque a vuestro campamento.","","J\'ai entendu dire que le frère de Fafnir veut vous attaquer.","","Eu ouvi dizer que o irmão de Fafnir quer atacar vocês.","Ich habe gehört, dass Fafnir\'s Bruder dich angreifen will.","","Am auzit că fratele lui Fafnir vrea să vă atace.","<Dowiedziałem/Dowiedziałam> się, że brat Fafnira chce was zaatakować.","","Ik heb gehoord dat Fafnirs broer jullie wil aanvallen.","","Saya telah dengar bahawa adik Fafnir hendak menyerang kamu.","","","","我聽說法夫納的大哥打算要攻擊你們。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "6117":["","According to what I\'ve heard, Fafnir\'s brother is planning to attack you.","","Según me han dicho, el hermano de Fafnir está preparando un ataque a vuestro campamento.","","D\'après ce que j\'ai entendu dire. Le frère de Fafnir compte vous attaquer.","","De acordo com o que eu ouvi, o irmão de Fafnir está planejando atacar vocês.","Nachdem, was ich gehört habe, plant Fafnir\'s Bruder dich anzugreifen.","","După câte am auzit, fratele lui Fafnir intenționează să vă atace.","Wedle tego co się <dowiedziałem/dowiedziałam>, brat Fafnira planuje was zaatakować.","","Volgens wat ik gehoord heb, is Fafnirs broer van plan jullie aan te vallen.","","Mengikut apa yang saya telah dengar, adik Fafnir merancang untuk menyerang kamu.","","","","根據我的情報，法夫納的大哥打算攻擊你們。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "6118":["","What?!! Really?!!","","¡¿Lo cuálo?! ¡¿En serio?!","¡¡¿Qué?!! ¡¡¿De veras?!!","Quoi?!! Vraiment?!!","","O quê?! Sério?!","Was?!! Wirklich?!!","","Ce?! Serios?!","Co?!! Poważnie?!!","","Wat?!! Echt?!!","","Apa?!! Betul?!!","","","","甚麼？！真的嗎？！","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
