         "6356":["","Hello. See you later. [leave]","","Hola. Hasta luego. [marcharse]","","Salut. A bientôt. [quitter]","","Olá, te vejo mais tarde. [sair]","Hallo und bis später. [gehen]","","Bună. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Witaj. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","","Hallo. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","Привет. Увидимся позже. [уйти]","Hello. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","你好。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "6357":["","Sorry, but your men died on our way to the Pullid camp.","","Lo siento, pero tus hombres murieron de camino al campamento Pullid.","","","","Desculpe, mas seus homens morreram a caminho do acampamento Pullid.","Es tut mir leid, aber deine Leute sind auf dem Weg in das Pullid-Lager gestorben.","","Îmi pare rău, dar oamenii tăi au murit în drum spre tabăra Pullid.","Przykro mi, ale twoi ludzie zmarli w drodze do obozu Pullid.","","Sorry, maar je mannen zijn overleden onderweg naar het Pullid kamp.","Прости, но твои люди погибли по пути в лагерь Пуллидов.","Minta maaf, tapi orang-orang kamu telah mati dalam perjalanan kami ke kem Pullid.","","","","抱歉，你的人馬死在去普力得營地的路途上。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "6358":["","What?!! No! They were the only ones I could trust with this. Krypt!!! Consider your mission aborted. I will send somebody else there.","","¡¡¿Lo cuálo?!! ¡No puée ser! Eran los únicos en los que podía confiar pa\' llevar a cabo esta misión. ¡¡Cagoen Luthor!! Déjalo. Tú ya no me sirves. Ya buscaré a otro que s\'encargue de cumplir la misión.","¡¡¿Cómo?!! ¡No puede ser! Eran los únicos en los que podía confiar para llevar a cabo esta misión. ¡¡Por la calva de Luthor!! Déjalo. Tú ya no me sirves. Ya buscaré a otra persona que se encargue de cumplir la misión.","","","O quê?! Não! Eles foram os únicos que eu poderia confiar com isso. Kripta! Considere a sua missão abortada. Vou mandar outra pessoa lá.","Was?!! Nein! Das waren die einizgen Zwei, denen ich in dieser Sache trauen konnte, verdammt!!! Sie den Auftrag als abgebrochen an. Ich muss jetzt jemand anderes dorthin schicken.","","Ce?! Nu! Erau singurii în care aveam încredere. Krypt! Consideră misiunea eșuată. Voi trimite pe altcineva acolo."
         ,"Co?!! Nie! To byli jedyni, którym mogłem z tym zaufać . Krypta!!! Uważaj swoje misję za porzuconą. Wyślę tam kogoś innego.","","Wat?!!! Nee! Zij waren de enigen aan wie ik dit kon toevertrouwen. Krypt!!! Beschouw je missie als geannuleerd. Ik zal iemand anders daar naartoe sturen.","ЧТО?! Нет!! Они были единственными, кому я мог доверить это. Крипт!!! Что ж, твоя миссия прервана. Я пошлю кого-нибудь еще.","Apa?!! Tidak! Mereka hanya orang yang aku dapat percaya menguruskan perkara ini. Krypt!!! Anggaplah ko telah gagal. Aku akan hantar seseorang yang lain ke sana.","","","","甚麼？！不！他們是我能信任的唯一人選了。該死！那麼你的任務取消了。我會派其他人去那裏。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
