         "6361":["","Hey! You did it. Thanks a lot. Here\'s your money.","","¡Hey! Lo has conseguío. Muchas gracias, <tronco/tronca>. Ten, toma tu pasta.","¡Hey! Lo conseguiste. Muchas gracias, <amigo/amiga>. Ten, toma tu plata.","","","Hey! Você fez isso. Muito obrigado. Aqui está o seu dinheiro.","Hey! Du hast es geschafft. Vielen Dank. Hier ist den Geld.","","Hei! Ai făcut-o. Mulțumesc mult. Uite banii.","Hej! <Dokonałeś/Dokonałaś> tego. Dzięki bardzo. Oto twoje pieniądze.","","He! Het is je gelukt. Heel erg bedankt. Hier is je geld.","Хей! Ты <сделал/сделала> это! Большое спасибо, вот твои деньги!","Hey! Ko telah berjaya. Terima kasih. Nah, wang ko di sini.","","","","嘿！你做到了。非常感謝。這是你的酬金。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
