         "6369":["","Is it true that there\'s a large underground warehouse in this camp?","","¿Es verdad que hay un gran refugio subterráneo en vuestro campamento?","","C\'est vrai qu\'il y a un grand entrepôt souterrain dans ce camp?","","É verdade que há um armazém subterrâneo enorme nesse acampamento?","Stimmt es, dass es in diesem Lager ein großes unterirdisches Warenhaus gibt?","","Este adevărat că există un mare depozit subteran în această tabără?","Czy to prawda, że jest spory, podziemny magazyn w tym obozie?","","Is het waar dat er een groot ondergronds pakhuis in dit kamp is?","Это правда, что в этом лагере есть большой подземный склад?","Adakah ia benar bahawa terdapat satu gudang besar yang terletak di bawah tanah di kem ini?","","","","在這個營地內有一座大型的地下倉庫，是真的嗎？","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Je pravda, že je v tomhle táboře velké podzemní skladiště?"],
         "6370":["","Yes, but I don\'t know much about it. I wasn\'t here when it was built and I never even entered it myself. Whatever is the reason you ask about it, you should speak with Apis. He\'s in charge of these things.","Yes, but I don\'t know much about it. I wasn\'t here when it was built and I\'ve never even entered it myself. Whatever is the reason you ask about it, you should speak with Apis. He\'s in charge of these things.","Pos sí, pero no sé demasiao sobre eso. Yo no taba\' p\'aquí cuando lo construyeron y ni siquiera he entrao adentro. No sé porque t\'interesa ese refugio, pero si quieres saber algo más tendrás q\'hablar con el Apis. Él s\'encarga d\'estas cosas.","Pues sí, pero no sé demasiado sobre él. Yo no estaba aquí cuando lo construyeron y ni siquiera he entrado a su interior. No sé porque te interesa ese refugio, pero si quieres saber algo más sobre él, tendrás que hablar con Apis. Él se encarga de esos asuntos.","Oui, mais je ne connais pas grand chose à propos de ça. Je n\'était pas là quand cela a été construit et je ne suis jamais entrée par moi-même. Peu importe la raison pour laquelle vous me demandez ça, vous devriez en parler avec Apis. Il s\'occupe de ce genre de choses."
         ,"","Sim, mas eu não sei muito sobre isso. Eu não estava aqui quando isso foi construído e nunca sequer entrei sozinha. Qualquer que seja a razão da pergunta, você deveria falar com Apis. Ele está encarregado dessas coisas.","Ja, aber ich weiß nicht viel darüber. Ich war nicht dabei als es gebaut wurde und habe es selbst nie betreten. Was auch immer dein Grund ist dich danach zu erkundigen, du solltest mit Apis darüber sprechen. Er regelt diese Sachen.","","Da, dar nu știu prea multe despre asta. Eu nu eram aici când a fost construit și n-am intrat niciodată. Oricare ar fi motivul pentru care întrebi despre asta, trebuie să discuți cu Apis. El se ocupa de aceste lucruri.","Tak, ale nie wiele wiem o nim. Nie było mnie tu, kiedy został zbudowany i nigdy nawet do niego nie weszłam. Jakikolwiek byłby powód dla którego o to pytasz, to <powinieneś/powinnaś> porozmawiać z Apisem.","","Ja, maar ik weet er niet veel over. Ik was hier niet toen het gebouwd werd en ik ben er zelfs nooit binnen geweest. Wat ook de reden is dat je erom vraagt, je zou moeten met Apis moeten praten. Hij is verantwoordelijk voor die dingen."
         ,"Да, но я о нём ничего не знаю. Я не был здесь, когда он был построен и никогда не был внутри. Какой бы ни была причина ваших вопросов, вы должны говорить с Аписом. Он отвечает за эти вещи.","Ya, tapi saya tidak tahu banyak tentangnya. Saya tiada di sini ketika ia dibina dan saya tidak pernah masuk ke dalam. Apatah sebab anda tanya tentangnya, anda harus bercakap dengan Apis. Dia bertanggungjawab terhadap benda-benda ini.","","","","對，但我並不清楚細節。當建造的時候我並不在這裡，我也從未親自進去過。不管你是甚麼令你好奇，你都該去問阿庇斯。他才負責這些事情。","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Ano, ale moc toho o něm nevím. Nebyla jsem tu, když bylo postaveno a nikdy jsem do něho nevstoupila. Jakýkoliv je tvůj důvod se na to ptát, <měl/měla> bys si promluvit s Apisem. On je ve vedení takových věcí."],
         "6371":["","OK. I\'ll talk to Apis then. See you. [leave]","","Muy bien. Iré a hablar con Apis, entonces. [marcharse]","","OK. J\'en parlerai à Apis alors. A bientôt. [quitter]","","OK. Então eu falarei com Apis. Até mais. [sair]","Ok. Dann spreche ich mit Apis. Bis bald. [gehen]","","Bine. O să vorbesc cu Apis atunci. [pleacă]","Okej. Pogadam więc z Apisem. Do widzenia. [odejdź]","","OK. Dan ga ik met Apis praten. Ik zie je. [vertrekken]","Ок. Я тогда поговорю с Аписом. Увидимся. [уйти]","OK. Saya akan bercakap dengan Apis kalau begitu. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","好。那麼我會去跟阿庇斯談談。再見。[離開]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Dobře, pak si tedy promluvím s Apisem. Uvidíme se. [Odejít.]"],
         "6372":["","I have the book that we talked about, but I can\'t give it to you yet. I need to use it first.","","Tengo el libro del que habíamos hablado. Pero todavía no puedo dártelo. Lo necesito.","","","","Eu tenho o livro sobre o qual nós falamos, mas eu não posso lhe entregar ainda. Eu preciso usá-lo primeiro.","Ich habe das Buch über das wir geredet haben, aber ich kann es dir noch nicht geben. Ich muss es zuerst noch selber lesen.","","Am cartea despre care am vorbit, dar nu ți-o pot da încă. Trebuie s-o foloseasc mai întâi.","Mam książkę o której rozmawialiśmy, ale nie mogę ci jej jeszcze dać. Potrzebuję ją najpierw przeczytać.","Konuştuğumuz kitap bende var, ancak şu anda sana veremem. Önce benim kullanmam gerekiyor.","Ik heb het boek waar we over gepraat hebben, maar ik kan het je nog niet geven. Ik moet het eerst gebruiken.","","Saya mempunyai buku yang kita telah bincang tentang, tapi saya masih tidak boleh memberinya kepada kamu sebab saya perlukannya.","","","","我拿到我們談過的那本書了，但是我還不能給你。我還需要它。"
         ,"","\'Εχω το βιβιλίο για το οποίο μιλήσαμε αλλά δεν μπορώ να στο δώσω ακόμη. Χρειάζομαι να το χρησιμοποιήσω πρώτα.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "6373":["","Sure. Take your time, just don\'t forget about me when you\'re done with it.","","Por supuesto. Tómate el tiempo que necesites. Pero acuérdate de traérmelo cuando ya no lo necesites.","","","","Claro. Não tenha pressa, só não se esqueça de mim quando terminar.","Sicher. Lass dir Zeit, aber vergiss mich nicht, wenn du damit fertig bist.","","Sigur, doar să nu uiți de mine, atunci când ai terminat cu ea.","Jasne. Nie spiesz się, tylko nie zapomnij o mnie, kiedy z nią skończysz.","Tabii. Ne zaman istersen, işin bittiğinde bana getirmeyi unutma sadece.","Zeker. Neem je tijd, vergeet me alleen niet als je er klaar mee bent.","","Boleh. Ambillah masa kamu. Jangan lupa tentang saya saja selepas kamu sudah habis dengannya.","","","","好。慢慢來，用完的時候別忘記我就好。","","Σίγουρα. Με την ησυχία σου, απλά μη με ξεχάσεις όταν τελειώσεις μ\' αυτό.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
         "6374":["","I won\'t. See you later. [leave]","","Por supuesto. Ya nos veremos. [marcharse]","","","","Eu não vou. Até mais. [sair]","Werde ich nicht. Bis später. [gehen]","","Nicidecum. Ne vedem mai târziu. [pleacă]","Nie zapomnę. Do zobaczenia później. [odejdź]","Unutmam. Sonra görüşürüz. [Ayrıl]","Dat zal ik niet doen. Ik zie je later. [vertrekken]","","Saya tidak akan. Jumpa lagi. [Tinggal]","","","","我不會的，再見了。[離開]","","Δε θα σε ξεχάσω. Θα σε δω αργότερα. [αποχώρηση]","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],
