         "6660":["","You are too late. All members of the damaged caravan have died.","","Has llegado demasiado tarde. Todos los miembros de la caravana atacada han muerto.","","Vous arrivez trop tard. Tous les membres de la caravane endommagée sont morts.","","Você chegou tarde demais. Todos os membros da caravana avariada morreram.","Du kommst zu spät. Alle Mitglieder der erschöpften Karawane sind gestorben.","","E prea târziu. Toți membrii caravanei avariate au murit.","Jesteś zbyt późno. Wszyscy członkowie poranionej karawany umarli.","","Je bent te laat. Alle leden van de beschadigde karavaan zijn gestorven.","","Anda terlalu lewat. Semua ahli karavan yang rosak telah mati.","","","","你動作太慢。需要拯救的商旅成員全部都已經死了。","","Άργησες. Όλα τα μέλη του καραβανιού έχουν πεθάνει.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Has arribat massa tard. Tots els membres de la caravana són morts.","","Příliš pozdě. Všichni členové poškozené karavany zemřeli."],
